#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventContent_SkillCheck.EventContent_SkillCheck_C:GetToolTipWidget_0 [Script Bytecode]
#. Key:	DF6166B14E7C4A66BF9A72BB9F8AD2A5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/Buttons/WB_StateButton.Default__WB_StateButton_C.HelperTextDesc
#: /Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/Buttons/WB_StateButton.Default__WB_StateButton_C.HelperTextDesc
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventContent_SkillCheck.EventContent_SkillCheck_C:GetToolTipWidget_0
#: [Script Bytecode]
msgid ""
"You may choose to collect the Room's rewards, but you then must roll a 20-sided die to determine the severity of the cost. You can preview the costs in the bar on the right, grouped by the roll range that will result in that cost.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Each room will have more powerful rewards than the last. You can leave before any roll (including the first one) to collect any earned rewards and penalties.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Each Skill Check can grant some extra 6-sided die to add to the roll if your character has particular attributes."
msgstr ""
"可选择领取奖励，但必须投掷一颗20面骰来决定代价，右侧可预览不同的代价。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"每轮投掷的奖励都比上一轮更好，可以随时离开并拿取奖励。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"每项技能判定可以根据你的角色的特性来提供额外的6面骰，帮助取得更高点数。"

