#: /Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/Options/WB_Options_Gameplay.WB_Options_Gameplay_C:WidgetTree.Option_FastMode.HelperTextName
#: /Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/Content/Child_Widgets/WB_Child_GeneralSettings.WB_Child_GeneralSettings_C:WidgetTree.Button_FastMode.Text_Button_Text
msgid "Ultrafast Mode"
msgstr "极速模式"

#. Key:	3A248ECC4E8F799D20CB24B00EF9AADF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/Options/WB_Options_Gameplay.WB_Options_Gameplay_C:WidgetTree.Option_FastMode.HelperTextDesc
#: /Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/Options/WB_Options_Gameplay.WB_Options_Gameplay_C:WidgetTree.Option_FastMode.HelperTextDesc
msgid ""
"Speeds up the game significantly. NOT RECOMMENDED for players new to the game. Ultrafast Mode affects the following:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Post-combat animations are skipped entirely except when the run ends.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Enemies spawn instantly at their final locations instead of being dragged into place, and spawn with Tier and Items already instead of them being equipped via animations.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"'Tray' UI appears and disappears faster.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"All Event Text is nearly instant.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rarity Unlock and Army Size increases have no animation.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Combat Speed is: Slow = 100% game speed, Normal = 150% game speed, Fast = 200% game speed."
msgstr ""
"这个功能会大幅提高游戏速度，不建议新手使用。极速模式会对游戏产生以下影响：\n"
" \n"
" 除了游戏结束动画外，所有的战后动画会自动跳过。\n"
" \n"
" 相比之前会拖入战场，敌人现在会直接出现在战斗位置上。它们的星级和装备也会立刻显示出来，而不再是像之前一样有动画效果。\n"
" \n"
" 指示界面出现和消失得更快。\n"
" \n"
" 所有的事件文本会瞬间显示出来。\n"
" \n"
" 不再播放稀有度及人口提升动画。\n"
" \n"
" 战斗速度：慢=100% 游戏速度，正常=150% 游戏速度，快=200% 游戏速度。"

