msgstr "战斗统计：棋叨建议"

#. Key:	C168C58846160D9DA76947AE44C5B056
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/Content/Child_Widgets/WB_Child_GeneralSettings.WB_Child_GeneralSettings_C:WidgetTree.Button_RecapDMAdvice.Text_Button_Description
