#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/Options/WB_Options_Gameplay.WB_Options_Gameplay_C:WidgetTree.Option_RecapDMAdvice.HelperTextDesc
#: /Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/Options/WB_Options_Gameplay.WB_Options_Gameplay_C:WidgetTree.Option_RecapDMAdvice.HelperTextDesc
#: /Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/Content/Child_Widgets/WB_Child_GeneralSettings.WB_Child_GeneralSettings_C:WidgetTree.Button_RecapDMAdvice.Text_Button_Description
msgid ""
"Adds advice from the DM to the Combat Recap that can help understand why a fight is lost, or how to improve yourself for future fights.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Enabling this will also pulse the Combat Recap button whenever you lose a fight, indicating you should take a look at the advice to try to figure out what you can improve."
msgstr ""
"在战斗统计界面附加棋叨的建议，帮助你了解战斗失败可能的原因以及相应的对策。\n"
"\n"
"开启后每当你战斗失败时，战斗统计图标会闪烁以提示你查看建议并尝试改进策略。"

