#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/WB_MainMenu.WB_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_WB_MainMenu [Script Bytecode]
#. Key:	F9D16F564AEB57D5B20B4381FD3D89DE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/WB_ProMainMenu.WB_ProMainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_WB_ProMainMenu [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/WB_ProMainMenu.WB_ProMainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_WB_ProMainMenu
#: [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/WB_MainMenu.WB_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_WB_MainMenu
msgid ""
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>Oh no! We've detected an outdated or invalid save file. As this is the Tales & Tactics Demo, and no save data is needed, the proper fix is to click to the right to delete your save file. The game will automatically restart and you'll be able to play once more.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>If you believe you have reached this screen incorrectly and want to preserve what save file you might have, click the top button to Exit and reach out to us on Discord.</>"
msgstr ""
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>糟糕！检测到一个过时或无效的存档文件。由于游戏的试玩版并不需要存档文件，请点击右侧的按钮删除该文件。游戏将自动重启以供正常游玩。</>\n"
"\n"
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>若你认为是误测，并想要保留该存档文件，请点击顶部的按钮退出，并在Discord上联系我们。</>"

