#. Key:	3E9A7B984ADBD820637BE387B99CB5FC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/WB_MainMenu.WB_MainMenu_C:WidgetTree.ExplanationBlockMain.Text
#. Key:	3ED526934840C80578D00F85E9EA4F1B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/WB_ProMainMenu.WB_ProMainMenu_C:WidgetTree.ExplanationBlockMain.Text
#: /Game/ProMainMenu/Widgets/WB_ProMainMenu.WB_ProMainMenu_C:WidgetTree.ExplanationBlockMain.Text
#: /Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/WB_MainMenu.WB_MainMenu_C:WidgetTree.ExplanationBlockMain.Text
msgid ""
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>Oh no! We've detected an outdated or invalid save file. We are working on a solution, but in the mean time, there are two options available to you:</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>In Steam, switch to the \"fixmysave\" branch, launch the game, and then exit it from the main menu. Switch back to the default branch and your save will be fixed!</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>To switch branches: Right click on the game in your library, and click Properties. Select the Betas tab, and select the 'fixmysave' branch. </>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>Alternatively, we can delete your save and start fresh.</>\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>糟糕！检测到一个过时或无效的存档文件。我们正在努力解决此问题。您有以下两种选项：</>\n"
"\n"
"<DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>在Steam中，右键游戏并在测试分支中切换至“fixmysave”分支，然后启动游戏进入主界面后退出。随后切回默认分支，这样您的存档应该能被修复。</>\n"
"\n"
"</><DefaultTanExtraLargePrint>或者现在直接删除该存档并重新开始游戏。</>"

