msgid ""
"Allows you to gain camera controls during combat.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"WARNING: This feature is experimental and may reveal certain environment mistakes hidden by the fixed camera, such as objects clipping into each other, or the 'room' being undecorated where the camera normally cannot see."
