#: /Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/Sub_DiffSelect.Sub_DiffSelect_C:WidgetTree.DiffSelect_Custom.ManualSectionTextBody
msgid ""
"While this setting is chosen, you can raise and lower each of the displayed Difficulty Modifiers listed in the row below.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Available Difficulty Modifier ranks are still limited to the ones you have unlocked in the Challenge Climb. Beat more Challenge Climb stages to be able to use their modifiers in Custom Mode."
msgstr ""
"在本难度下，可自行在底部调整各难度项的强度。\n"
"\n"
"可用的难度项受限于已解锁的天梯等级。登上更高的天梯来获得自定义模式下的更高自由度。"

#. Key:	668E1C9A49D7FD6FE7B2E9A1FCF02054
