msgstr "随心畅游"

#. Key:	8FBB5FEB4DC99F3A73302CBAC8B297DA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/Sub_DiffSelect.Sub_DiffSelect_C:WidgetTree.DiffSelect_Recommended.ManualSectionTextBody
#: /Game/ProMainMenuV3/Widgets/Sub_DiffSelect.Sub_DiffSelect_C:WidgetTree.DiffSelect_Recommended.ManualSectionTextBody
msgid ""
"Play the game without any additional difficulty modifiers.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Since some Unlocks can help your run, playing Vanilla with them enabled will make the game slightly easier."
msgstr ""
"在不开启任何额外难度项的情况下进行游戏。\n"
"\n"
"由于某些可解锁的游戏功能会为游戏提供助力，在此难度下开启它们会让游戏比默认难度还要更轻松一些，请自行选择是否在解锁界面开启。"

