msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Hexatec Labs, making the impossible and unethical - possible!"
msgstr "六元实验室，化不可能为可能！"

#. Key:	HigherRegard_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Gera the Gnome, head of Hexatec Labs, holds progress in much higher regard than silly things like the law."
msgstr "六元实验室的负责人矮地灵吉拉，比起愚蠢的法律，她更重视文明的进步。"

#. Key:	ProgressatAllCosts_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Progress at all costs is the governing principle of Hexatec.  It's responsible for as terrific as terrifying things."
msgstr "六元实验室的宗旨是为了科技进步不惜一切代价。这既带来了惊喜，又带来了惊慌。"

#. Key:	Thermodynamics_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "In Hexatec Labs they're trying very hard to pass amendments to the laws of thermodynamics."
msgstr "六元实验室的科学家们非常努力地试图通过热力学定律的修正案。"

#. Key:	SkysTheLimit_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
