msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "If you told a scientist from Hexatec Labs the sky's the limit, they'd ask how to raise it."
msgstr "要是你告诉六元实验室的科学家们蓝天的高度即是极限，他们也还是会问你如何将蓝天继续撑高。"

#. Key:	PushingBoundaries_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
