msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "At Hexatec Labs they're constantly pushing the boundaries of what should be possible."
msgstr "在六元实验室，他们会不断突破极限。"

#. Key:	WhetherTheyCould_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
