msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The scientists of Hexatec don't concern themselves with whether they should do something, only whether they could."
msgstr "六元实验室的科学家们从不管一件事该不该做，只管能不能做。"

#. Key:	BrighterTomorrow_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Hexatac Labs; a brighter tomorrow.  Tomorrow!"
msgstr "六元实验室：让美好的明天就在明天！"

#. Key:	BrainsInJars_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.AlchemyLabIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
