msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The more dedicated scientists of Hexatec turn themselves into brain jars to save time on brushing their teeth."
msgstr "六元实验室里较敬业的科学家们把自己变成了罐装大脑，以节省刷牙的时间。"

#. Key:	NotGonnaDoIt_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.BadRange.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
