msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Tch, that's not gonna do it."
msgstr "啧，这样不太行。"

#. Key:	NotWhatYouWantToSee_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.BadRange.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
