msgid "The starved Beasts arrive to the field already in a feeding frenzy."
msgstr "饥肠辘辘的野兽们已经在进食狂潮中到达战场。"

#. Key:	TheseBeastsBite_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Beast.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
