msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Keep your limbs away from their jaws.  These Beasts bite."
msgstr "离它们远点。这些野兽会咬人。"

#. Key:	MoreFrenzied_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Beast.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
