msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "As your team dwindles, my Beasts will only become stronger and more frenzied."
msgstr "随着你的队伍减少，我的野兽只会变得更强更狂暴。"

#. Key:	UpForAGoodBrawl_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Brawler.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
