msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "This team's always up for a good brawl."
msgstr "这个队伍随时准备好大战一场。"

#. Key:	InForAStomp_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Brawler.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
