msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "One way or another, we're in for a stomp!"
msgstr "无论如何，我们都要大干一场！"

#. Key:	BigAndBeefy_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Brawler.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
