msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "They're big, they're beefy, they're B-B-B-BRAWLERS!"
msgstr "他们的块头很大，他们的肌肉很壮，他们是斗士！"

#. Key:	KillTheSwarm_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Bug.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
