msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You might kill a bug or two, but can you kill the Swarm?"
msgstr "你可能会杀死一两只虫子，但你能杀死整个虫群吗？"

#. Key:	AfraidOfBugs_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Bug.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
