msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You're not afraid of bugs, are you?"
msgstr "你不怕虫子吧？"

#. Key:	HardShells_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Bug.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
