msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Hard shells and chitin protect my Bugs in battle."
msgstr "坚硬的外壳可以在战斗中保护我的虫子们。"

#. Key:	NotLeavingEmptyHanded_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Busted.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
