msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Aw heck. But at least you're not going away empty-handed."
msgstr "唉，不过至少你不是空手而归。"

#. Key:	PayThePrice_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Busted.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
