msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Oof.  You're gonna pay a price for those winnings."
msgstr "哎呀，你要为这些奖励付出代价了。"

#. Key:	RiskItForTheBiscuit_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Busted.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
