msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Sometimes you've just gotta risk it for the biscuit."
msgstr "有时候你得冒险一试。"

#. Key:	LucksRunOut_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Busted.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
