msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Your luck might have run out, but the treasure is yours to keep."
msgstr "虽然你的运气用完了，但这宝藏还是归你。"

#. Key:	ThatsABust_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Busted.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
