msgid "That's a bust, but the prizes are yours to keep!"
msgstr "虽然你失败了，但奖品还是归你！"

#. Key:	ClockwerkAndHexatech_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
