msgid "Both Clockwerk and Hexatec all run on the crystals mined here."
msgstr "发条工厂和六元实验室都依靠这里开採的晶体运作。"

#. Key:	DyingStar_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
