msgid "It's said that the Bana'al Caverns were forge by the fragmeent of a dying star striking the mountains base."
msgstr "据说巴纳尔洞穴是由一颗死星的碎片撞击山脚形成的。"

#. Key:	MagicDeepWithin_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
