msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "All magic branches from deep within the Bana'al Caverns.  Or so the stories go."
msgstr "所有魔法都来自巴纳尔洞穴深处。大概是这样吧。"

#. Key:	PicksAndShovels_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Picks and shovels litter the ground, remnants of the goblin workforce that once lived here."
msgstr "地上散落着镐子和铲子，这是地精劳工曾在这里居住的迹象。"

#. Key:	PowerfulWizard_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "They say that long ago, a powerful wizard brought the very mountain itself to life."
msgstr "他们说，很久以前，一位强大的巫师让这座山焕发了生机。"

#. Key:	YawningCavern_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CavernsIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Ahead of you, the mountain range yawns open to a faint cavern, faintly lit with gemstones."
msgstr "在你面前，山脉展现出一个不起眼的洞穴，里面闪烁着宝石的微光。"

#. Key:	BustlingBazaar_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Hexad City.  A bustling bazaar to cater to all creatures comforts, both legal and...otherwise."
msgstr "六边城。一个繁忙的商业中心，满足所有生物的需求，无论是合法的还是...一些其他的。"

#. Key:	BelowTheTable_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Founded by giants, Hexad City now serves as a hub for commerce both above and below the table."
msgstr "由巨人建立的六边城，现在是一个繁荣昌盛的商业中心。"

#. Key:	FirstRule_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "First rule of the black market?  Always check your pockets."
msgstr "黑市第一准则？常掏口袋检查一下。"

#. Key:	GoblinsGettingRicher_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "If you listen closely, you can hear the sound of goblins getting richer."
msgstr "仔细听，这是那些暴富地精晃金币的声音。"

#. Key:	HereThereBeGiants_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Here, there be giants.  At least, there used to be."
msgstr "这里，有巨人。至少，曾经有过。"

#. Key:	MassiveCityscape_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "This massive cityscape has a way of keeping ones ego in check."
msgstr "这座巨大的城市拥有让最自大的人都自觉渺小的魔力。"

#. Key:	ScholarsToScoundrels_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Everyone from scholar to scoundrel can be found in this ancient city."
msgstr "无论学者或恶棍，在这座古城里都能找到。"

#. Key:	GiantsBell_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CityIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The giant's may be gone, but you can still hear their bell ringing in the distance."
msgstr "巨人虽然已经离开，但你仍然可以听到他们的钟声在远处响起。"

#. Key:	AlmostHadMe_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Phew.  You almost had me on that one."
msgstr "哼。你还不错，不过还差点意思。"

#. Key:	NeckAndNeck_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "It was neck and neck for a bit there."
msgstr "那里的情况一度并驾齐驱。"

#. Key:	NoCigar_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Close! But no cigar."
msgstr "好险！只差一点。"

#. Key:	JustAFewChanges_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "With just a few changes you might've beaten me there!"
msgstr "只要稍作改变，你也许就能打败我了！"

#. Key:	LadyLuck_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Seems like Lady Luck was on my side this time."
msgstr "看来这次幸运女神站在我这边。"

#. Key:	WasntQuiteEnough_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "It just wasn't quite enough this time"
msgstr "这次还不够好。"

#. Key:	RunForMyMoney_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Gave me a real run for my money there."
msgstr "在那里我真的很有竞争力。"

#. Key:	UpInTheAir_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseDefeat.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "That was up the the air for a lot long than I'd have liked."
msgstr "这悬而未决的时间比我想象的要长。"

#. Key:	Icarus_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseToBust.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
