msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Flying a little high there, Icarus?"
msgstr "飞得有点高了，伊卡洛斯？"

#. Key:	HappyWithThat_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseToBust.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseToBust.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You've *gotta* be happy with that! ... right?"
msgstr "你一定很满意！...对吧？"

#. Key:	FeelTheTension_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseToBust.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
