msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You can almost feel the tension in this room."
msgstr "你几乎能感觉到这个房间里的紧张气氛。"

#. Key:	GoneAgain_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseToBust.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseToBust.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "If it were me, I'd have gone again."
msgstr "要是我，我会再试一次。"

#. Key:	StopWhileYoureAhead_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseToBust.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseToBust.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Good on you.  Stop while you're ahead."
msgstr "干得好。见好就收。"

#. Key:	CuttingClose_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseVictory.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseVictory.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Cut that a little close, don't you think?"
msgstr "真够险的啊，你不觉得吗？"

#. Key:	DidntThinkYoudMakeIt_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseVictory.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseVictory.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Alright, I'll be honest.  I didn't think you were going to make it.  Well done."
msgstr "好吧，说实话。我没想到你能赢。真有你的。"

#. Key:	DownToTheWire_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.CloseVictory.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
