msgstr "仙人掌和破碎的雕像是你在沙漠阳光下唯一的庇护所。"

#. Key:	CruelAndUnforgiving_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Golden Desert.  The sun here is cruel and unforgiving...like so many ancient gods."
msgstr "黄金沙漠。这里的太阳暴虐无度...正如许多古老的神灵一般。"

#. Key:	SlitheringSnakes_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Nothing here but shifting sands and slithering snakes."
msgstr "这里只有流动的沙子和滑溜的蛇。"

#. Key:	Mirage_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Sometimes, it will just be a mirage.  Other times, you won't be so lucky."
msgstr "有时，那只是一个幻象。不过其他时候，你可就要糟糕了。"

#. Key:	Sunstone_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Sunstone, a gift of the Sun God, protects his temple from would-be raiders."
msgstr "太阳石是太阳神的礼物，可以保护他的神庙免受潜在袭击者的侵害。"

#. Key:	BurningSands_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Wiping the sweat from your brow, you forge onwards into the burning sands."
msgstr "擦去额头上的汗水，你继续前行，走进了燃烧沙漠。"

#. Key:	TragicTale_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DesertIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Let's hope you won't end up and just a tragic tale in the Djinn's storybook."
msgstr "希望你不要成为巨灵故事书里又一个悲剧故事。"

#. Key:	SweetenThePot_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I can sweeten the pot...if you can pay the price."
msgstr "我可以让赌注再高一点...如果你能付得起的话。"

#. Key:	FirstRodeo_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Well, now.  Since this isn't your first rodeo, do you want to make things a bit more...interesting?"
msgstr "现在既然你也不是新手了，想不想让事情变得更...刺激些？"

#. Key:	NoPainNoGain_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You know what they say.  No pain, no gain.  And this one might hurt."
msgstr "你知道的，没有失败哪来成功。不过这次可能败的有点惨。"

#. Key:	OfferYouCanRefuse_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Before we start, let me make you an offer you absolutely can refuse."
msgstr "在我们开始之前，我一定要给你提一个你肯定会拒绝的条件。"

#. Key:	RaiseTheStakes_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Care to raise the stakes?  You'll be properly rewarded, don't worry."
msgstr "想要加码吗？别担心，有险必有得。"

#. Key:	SavingTheseAside_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I've been saving these aside for the one who can meet my challenge."
msgstr "我一直把这些留给能接受我挑战的人。"

#. Key:	ForgotAboutThose_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Oh I'd almost forgotten I had these... Care to play for them?"
msgstr "哦，我差点忘了我还有这些...想要来一局吗？"

#. Key:	DevilToPay_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "If you're seek unlimited power, you'll have the Devil to pay."
msgstr "如果你寻求无限的力量就将付出代价。"

#. Key:	HandleTheHeat_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "If you can handle the heat, I can spice this fight up a little."
msgstr "如果你能承受得住的话，我可以让这场战斗更刺激一点。"

#. Key:	DanceWIthTheDevil_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DevilsDeal.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Care to take a dance with the Devil?"
msgstr "想和恶魔跳一支舞吗？"

#. Key:	HardlyJudge_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Couldn't resist, eh? I can hardly judge."
msgstr "耐不住了吧？我也不好说什么。"

#. Key:	YouGotta_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You gotta, right? I mean, you gotta!"
msgstr "不这么干你浑身都不自在，对吧！"

#. Key:	CouldAlsoWin_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Sure you could lose...but you could also win!"
msgstr "当然你可能会输...但你也可能会赢！"

#. Key:	BraveOrFoolhardy_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Was that brave or foolhardy? Only one way to find out now..."
msgstr "那到底是勇敢还是鲁莽呢？现在只有一种方法可以知道..."

#. Key:	ALittleRisk_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DidGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "There's no reward without a little risk."
msgstr "没有一点风险就没有回报。"

#. Key:	StaresYouDown_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CavernBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CavernBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The gem-encrusted cyclops stares you down... you think. It's a little hard to tell."
msgstr "你觉得镶满宝石的独眼巨人在盯着你看...但又不太确定，因为很难分辨。"

#. Key:	FlashRoyalRed_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CavernBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CavernBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Gemclops' gems briefly flash royal red with fury at your challenge."
msgstr "宝石巨人的宝石在你挑战时短暂地闪烁着皇家红色的愤怒。"

#. Key:	TrembleBeneathYourFeet_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CavernBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CavernBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You feel the earth beneath your feet tremble as the Gemclops draws nearer."
msgstr "当宝石巨人靠近时，你感觉脚下的地面在颤抖。"

#. Key:	TussleWith_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CityBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CityBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "He's the Martial Master, and he's the last person you'd want to tussle with."
msgstr "他是武术大师，是你最不想与之交手的人。"

#. Key:	InFrontOfStudents_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CityBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CityBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Martial Master always fights in front of his students."
msgstr "这位宗师总是在他的学生面前示教。"

#. Key:	ThreeHits_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CityBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_CityBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "There's gonna be three hits. He hits you, you hit the floor, and then new game."
msgstr "会有三个步骤。他打你，你倒地，然后就可以开启新游戏了。"

#. Key:	IntimidatingArmor_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_DesertBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_DesertBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Priest of Adalon arrives, decked head to toe in his intimidating dragonbone armour."
msgstr "操控凛冬龙的祭司来了，他全身穿着令人畏惧的龙骨盔甲。"

#. Key:	SinnerOfAdalon_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_DesertBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_DesertBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "If -this- is what their priests look like, you'd hate to see a Sinner of Adalon."
msgstr "如果这就是他们的牧师的样子，你肯定不想看到阿达隆的罪人。"

#. Key:	WideToothyGrin_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_DesertBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_DesertBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Priest smiles a wide, toothy, malicious grin that has your hairs standing on end."
msgstr "牧师龇牙咧嘴，露出一个满是恶意的笑容，让你毛骨悚然。"

#. Key:	ShutItDown_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_FactoryBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_FactoryBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Someone left one of the older model Rustbots on.  Shut it down!"
msgstr "有人留下了一台旧型号的机器人。干掉它！"

#. Key:	AllThignsAreTrees_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_FactoryBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_FactoryBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Limited by programing to only cut down trees, the Rogue Rustbot now considers all things to be trees."
msgstr "由于编程限制只能砍树，流浪机器人现在认为所有东西都是树。"

#. Key:	Buzzsaws_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_FactoryBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_FactoryBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "His buzzsaws are as sharp and deadly as his body is rusted."
msgstr "他的圆锯片就像他本人一样锋利致命。"

#. Key:	BodyMayHaveDied_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_GraveyardBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_GraveyardBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "His body may have died, but his faith never will."
msgstr "他的肉体已经死去，但他的信仰永远不会。"

#. Key:	SkullPhysicallyCan_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_GraveyardBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_GraveyardBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Fallen Fanatic looks as mad as a skull physically can."
msgstr "堕落狂热者看起来像一个疯狂的骷髅。"

#. Key:	MatchedByHisMalice_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_GraveyardBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_GraveyardBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "His fanatacism is matched only by his malice."
msgstr "他的狂热与他的恶意相当匹配。"

#. Key:	OozesFootByFoot_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_LabBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_LabBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Sludge Captain oozes foot by foot from the grates beneath your feet until he towers over you."
msgstr "泥魁长从你脚下的排液口渐渐渗出，最后高高耸立在你面前。"

#. Key:	EarnedHisTitle_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_LabBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_LabBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Captain of the Sludges earned his title... by absorbing all the other candidates."
msgstr "泥魁长这个头衔...是通过吞噬其他竞争者获得的。"

#. Key:	HesTheCaptainNow_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_LabBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DMPrep_LabBoss.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Look at him. He is the captain now...of sludge."
msgstr "看这位，他就是泥沼之魁长。"

#. Key:	HouseAlwaysWins_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Good idea.  The house always wins in the end, anyway."
msgstr "好主意。反正最后总是庄家赢。"

#. Key:	AdmirableTemperance_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Your temperance is quite admirable! I could never resist, myself."
msgstr "真佩服你能这么节制！我可忍不住。"

#. Key:	CouldWin_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Sure, you could win...but you could also lose!"
msgstr "你当然可能会赢...但也可能会输！"

#. Key:	ShrewdMove_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Shrewd move.  Better a bird in the hand than two in the bush, I say."
msgstr "精明的选择。毕竟一鸟在手胜过双鸟在林。"

#. Key:	WhyGamble_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.DontGamble.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Why gamble if you don't know you'll win, right?"
msgstr "如果你明知自己不会赢，为什么还要赌呢，对吧？"

#. Key:	DoBreathFire_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dragon.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dragon.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "These Dragons are the type that breathe fire."
msgstr "这些龙是会喷火的那种。"

#. Key:	ReducedToAsh_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dragon.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dragon.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Your team will be reduced to mere ash before my mighty Dragons!"
msgstr "你的队伍将在我强大的龙面前化为灰烬！"

#. Key:	FangAndClaw_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dragon.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dragon.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "By scale, by claw, by flame and by wing! Fear the Dragons."
msgstr "鳞片、爪子、火焰和翅膀！这就是你所恐惧的龙。"

#. Key:	ChallengeToADuel_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Duelist.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Duelist.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I challenge you to a duel! These'll do as my champions."
msgstr "我向你提出决斗挑战！这些将是我的冠军们。"

#. Key:	RinseAndRepeat_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Duelist.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Duelist.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "En garde! Parry! Riposte! Rinse and repeat."
msgstr "准备战斗！格挡！反击！再来一次。"

#. Key:	RealSwords_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Duelist.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Duelist.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Careful!  I may have given them real swords..."
msgstr "小心！我可能把真的剑给他们了..."

#. Key:	WonderFromDownUnder_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dweller.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dweller.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Say hello to the wonders from down under... the ground, that is."
msgstr "向地下的奇迹问好...是的，地下。"

#. Key:	DeepBelowTheSurface_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dweller.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dweller.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "This team channels that which dwells deep below the surface."
msgstr "这个队伍引导了深埋地表下的力量。"

#. Key:	ExtraUnit_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dweller.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Dweller.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "What's this extra unit?  Don't worry.  You'll find out."
msgstr "这个额外的单位是什么呢？没事，你马上就知道了。"

#. Key:	WeatherTheElements_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Elemental.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Elemental.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Are you sure that your team is built to weather the elements?"
msgstr "你确定你的队伍能经得起风雨吗？"

#. Key:	ForcesOfNature_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Elemental.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Elemental.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The very forces of nature themselves stand against you now."
msgstr "大自然的力量正在对抗你。"

#. Key:	OutOfTheirElement_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Elemental.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Elemental.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I love using this team.  They're never out of their element."
msgstr "我喜欢用这个队伍。他们一直都占上风。"

