msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Glad to see you again.  Let's see how you can break the game this time."
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你。来看看你这次要怎么主宰比赛吧。"

#. Key:	GetARefill_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The board's all laid out, so we're ready to go.  Just as soon as I get a refill."
msgstr "董事会已经全部准备好了，我们准备出发了。就在我得到补充的时候。"

#. Key:	GrabAPint_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Alright, we're all ready.  Did you want to grab a pint before we get started?"
msgstr "好了，咱们准备就绪了。在开始之前你想喝一杯吗？"

#. Key:	WelcomeWelcome_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Welcome, welcome.  Grab a seat and we can get started."
msgstr "欢迎欢迎。找个座位，然后我们就可以开始了。"

#. Key:	BardsFinishedTheirSet_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "All ready? Great!  We can start the game now the bard's finished their set."
msgstr "都准备好了？太好了！既然吟客们刚刚结束了表演，我们可以开始游戏了。"

#. Key:	GameOrTwo_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "If you're keen to play, I've always got time for a game or two!"
msgstr "你要是真的很想玩，我一直都有时间陪你来一两局！"

#. Key:	SitByTheHearth_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Sit by the hearth and warm yourself through, we've a story to tell!"
msgstr "坐在炉边，暖暖身子，我们要开始讲故事了！"

#. Key:	StoryAboutToBegin_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Make sure you're sitting comfortably for the story is just about to begin."
msgstr "坐舒服点，因为故事才刚刚开始。"

#. Key:	AddictiveGame_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GameIntro.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Couldn't stay away, huh? I'll admit, it -is- a pretty addictive game."
msgstr "停不下来了是吧？我承认，这游戏确实很令人上瘾。"

#. Key:	HugeBoon_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GeraAlly.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
