msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Gera's ingenuity is sure to be a huge boon to your adventure."
msgstr "吉拉的创造力肯定会对你的冒险大有帮助。"

#. Key:	FriendshipLikeScience_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GeraAlly.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
