msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Gera's friendship is kind of like her science. Highly unstable but very productive!"
msgstr "吉拉的友谊就像她的科学研究一样——极不稳定但非常有效！"

#. Key:	LabRat_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GeraRival.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
