msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Hopefully Gera's not looking for a new lab rat any time soon."
msgstr "希望吉拉别太快找到新的实验对象。"

#. Key:	LetThisSlightGo_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GeraRival.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GeraRival.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You get the feeling Gera's not just going to let this slight go."
msgstr "你意识到吉拉不会轻易放下这件事。"

#. Key:	BitingChunks_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Ghoul.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Ghoul.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Ghouls heal themselves by biting chunks right off of their opponents."
msgstr "食尸鬼通过咬下对手的肉块来治愈自己。"

#. Key:	GhoulishAppetites_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Ghoul.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
