msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "This team will horrify you with their ghoulish appetites."
msgstr "这个队伍会用他们的食尸鬼把你的胆子吓破。"

#. Key:	TakeYourTeamsLives_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Ghoul.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Ghoul.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Ghouls will take your teams lives and add it to their own."
msgstr "食尸鬼会夺取你的队伍的生命并增加到他们自己身上。"

#. Key:	ThatsAGoodRoll_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GoodRange.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
