msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Wa-hey, that's a good roll!"
msgstr "这点数可真不错！"

#. Key:	HappyWithThatOne_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GoodRange.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
