msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Oh, you gotta be happy with that one."
msgstr "这下你很爽吧。"

#. Key:	NiceRoll1_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.GoodRange.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
