#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightClosePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Sadly it looks like Lady Luck was on their side this time."
msgstr "可惜这次幸运女神站在了对方那边。"

#. Key:	TryNotToDwell_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Try not to dwell on this fight.  There's time enough to make up for it."
msgstr "尽量不要纠结于这场战斗。还有时间补救。"

#. Key:	SeenYouComeBack_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Don't worry, I've seen you come back from much worse than this."
msgstr "别担心，我知道你在更糟的情况下都重新振作起来过。"

#. Key:	HaventGotYouOut_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "They may have gotten you down, but they haven't gotten you out."
msgstr "你确实是倒下了，但你还没有出局。"

#. Key:	WinEveryFightPVP_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "It's okay, you don't have to win every fight to win the run."
msgstr "没关系，你不需要每场战斗都赢才能赢得这次冒险。"

#. Key:	WasntYourBestMatchup_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "That wasn't your best matchup but you can come back from this."
msgstr "这不是你最好的表现，但你会振作起来的。"

#. Key:	FoundYoursFirst_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Every army has a weakness  They just found yours first."
msgstr "每支队伍都有弱点，只是这次对方先发现了你的。"

#. Key:	AchievementInItself_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Don't worry.  Simply making it this far is an achievement in itself."
msgstr "别担心，能走到这一步已经很了不起了。"

#. Key:	CongratsOnLearning_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "They say in battle you either win...or you learn. Congrats on Learning!"
msgstr "他们说在战斗中就算没赢，也学到了东西。恭喜你学到了！"

#. Key:	EndOfSession_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "And unfortunately that's all we have for today's session.  Better luck next time."
msgstr "很不幸，今天就到此结束了。祝你下次好运。"

#. Key:	ExperienceToBeGained_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "No matter how long the jouney is, there's always useful experience to be gained."
msgstr "行万里路，总能学到新东西。"

#. Key:	GameOver_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "And unfortunately that's game over."
msgstr "很不幸，游戏结束了。"

#. Key:	ValiantEffort_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You may not have won, but that was still a valiant effort.  Your mastery grows."
msgstr "你虽然未取胜，但仍英勇作战，一点熟练度算是小小的补偿。"

#. Key:	WhereYourStoryEnds_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I'm afraid to say that's where your story ends. For now."
msgstr "以现在来看，恐怕这就是你的故事的结局。"

#. Key:	HearANewTale_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "That'll be the end of your brave quest, but you can hear a new tale whenever you'd like."
msgstr "这将是你勇敢探险的终点，但你随时可以创造新故事。"

#. Key:	WinTheNextOne_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "You've lost this game, but with all you've learned I'm sure you'll win the next one."
msgstr "你输了这场比赛，但凭你学到的一切，我相信你会赢得下一场。"

#. Key:	LearnAndGrow_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Sadly you've lost, but I'm eager to see how you learn and grow from this."
msgstr "可惜你输了，但我期待看到你如何学习和成长。"

#. Key:	NextTimeChamp_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Let's just call this a practice run.  You'll get 'em next time champ!"
msgstr "就当这是一次练习。下次你会赢的！"

#. Key:	ClearYourHead_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Take a moment, clear your head, and plan how you'll beat them twice as badly next run."
msgstr "花点时间，清理思绪，计划下一次如何加倍奉还击败他们。"

#. Key:	ArmiesOfOthers_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The armies of others differ greatly from my own. I'm not even sure how -I'd- have beaten those."
msgstr "其他人的队伍与我的大不相同。我甚至不确定我自己要怎么赢。"

#. Key:	ThoseArmiesWereWild_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Don't take this loss too hard.  Those armies were wild."
msgstr "别太在意这次的失败。是对方太强了。"

#. Key:	DoesntWantYouToWin_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.LoseRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Unfortunately it's much harder when you're up against someone who doesn't want you to win."
msgstr "不幸的是，当你面对一个不想让你赢的人时，就困难得多了。"

#. Key:	AlwaysFireball_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Mage.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Mage.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "It's fireball.  It's usually fireball.  Yeah, it's probably fireball."
msgstr "是火球。一般都是火球。对，可能是火球。"

#. Key:	TwoFireballs_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Mage.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Mage.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The only thing better than a fireball is two fireballs."
msgstr "唯一比一个火球更好的东西是两个火球。"

#. Key:	Manabomb_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Mage.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Mage.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Ooh, Mages!  You might want to watch out for the manabomb.  It's pretty strong."
msgstr "哦，术士们！你可能要小心魔法炸弹。它很强的。"

#. Key:	NeverMissTheMark_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Marksman.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Marksman.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Ooh.  This team never misses the mark."
msgstr "哦，这个阵容从不失手。"

#. Key:	LivelyTrainingDummies_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Marksman.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Marksman.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "As far my team is concerned, yours are just lively training dummies."
msgstr "在我看来，你的队伍跟活跃一点的训练假人没什么区别。"

#. Key:	FireAtWill_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Marksman.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Marksman.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "In a few seconds, aim!  Fire at will!"
msgstr "几秒钟后，瞄准！随意开火！"

