msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "These Orcs channel pain into power."
msgstr "这些兽人能将痛苦转化为力量。"

#. Key:	HitYouBack_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Orc.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
