msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Careful with these ones! The harder you hit them, the harder they'll hit you back."
msgstr "小心他们！你打得越狠，他们反击得越凶。"

#. Key:	LiterallyMoveMountains_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.OttoAlly.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
