msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Otto's a perfect ally.  One who would literally move mountains for you."
msgstr "奥托是完美的盟友。他会为你移山倒海。"

#. Key:	FeelOttosPride_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.OttoAlly.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
