msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "He doesn't say anything because he can't, but you can feel Otto's pride."
msgstr "他什么都不说，因为他不能，但你能感受到奥托的骄傲。"

#. Key:	NotOneToHoldAGrudge_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.OttoRival.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
