msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Otto's not usually one to hold a grudge.  But he does make exceptions."
msgstr "奥托通常不会记仇。但他也有例外。"

#. Key:	GeologicalTimescale_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.OttoRival.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
