msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Hopefully Otto's revenge comes on a geological timescale."
msgstr "希望奥托的复仇在地质学的时间量程上进行。"

#. Key:	PoisonHimToo_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Poisoner.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
