msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "By spore or by fang, you'll taste their venom."
msgstr "通过孢子或毒牙，你会尝到他们的毒液。"

#. Key:	WinBeforeYouRealize_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Poisoner.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
