msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Ah, the Poisoners.  They'll win long before you've realized it."
msgstr "啊，毒师。他们会在你意识到之前就赢了。"

#. Key:	DiamondRank_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpDiamond.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
