msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I have to admit, I was rooting for you. Not just anyone can make it to Diamond rank!"
msgstr "我得承认，我是支持你的。不是每个人都能达到钻石段位！"

#. Key:	GoldRank_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpGold.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpGold.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Great job on making it to Gold!  An impressive feat of strategy."
msgstr "恭喜你达到黄金段位！真是一个令人印象深刻的战略成就。"

#. Key:	MasterRank_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpMaster.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpMaster.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Few can call themselves a Master at this game, but now you're among them! Well done!"
msgstr "很少有人能自称精通这游戏，但现在你是其中之一了！干得好！"

#. Key:	PlatinumRank_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpPlatinum.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpPlatinum.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Incredible work climbing all the way to Platinum! An honour well-deserved."
msgstr "爬到白金段位的出色表现！实至名归的荣誉。"

#. Key:	SilverRank_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpSilver.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpSilver.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Officially taking up the climb, eh? Congratulations on earning your Silver rank!"
msgstr "正式开始往上爬了，对吧？恭喜你到白银了！"

#. Key:	TacticianRank_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpTactician.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.PVPRankUpTactician.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I wouldn't have believed it if I weren't here to see it.  We have a new Tactician!"
msgstr "如果不是亲眼所见，我不会相信。我们有了一个新的战术家！"

#. Key:	VersitaleTeam_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Reptile.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
