msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Ah, Reptiles.  Versatile team, this one. Make sure you check out which ones I'm using!"
msgstr "啊，爬行类。这个队伍很灵活。记得看看我用的是哪些！"

#. Key:	BestOfEach_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Reptile.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
