msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The Reptiles blend into one another, taking the best of each."
msgstr "爬行类生物相互融合，取其精华。"

#. Key:	SharpFangs_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Reptile.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
