msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Now, careful moving these guys, I filed their fangs down to be real sharp!"
msgstr "移动它们的时候记得要小心点，我把他们的牙齿磨得很锋利！"

#. Key:	PowerFriend_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.RiverAlly.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
