msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Good choice, River is a powerful friend to have."
msgstr "选得不错，里弗会是你强大的队友。"

#. Key:	RiversWrongSide_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.RiverAlly.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
