msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I wouldn't want to get on River's wrong side either."
msgstr "我也不想惹里弗生气。"

#. Key:	SettleWithViolence_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.RiverRival.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
