msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Thankfully for you, River usually doesn't settle things with violence."
msgstr "幸好里弗通常不会用暴力解决问题。"

#. Key:	RiverLooksMad_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.RiverRival.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
