msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "River looks mad.  I'd stay out of her way from now on if I were you"
msgstr "里弗看起来很生气。要是我我会躲着点她。"

#. Key:	UpForAGoodScrap_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Scrapper.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
