msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "This team'll throw yours right on the scrap heap!"
msgstr "这个队伍会把你的队伍扔到废料堆上！"

#. Key:	CatchYouOut_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Scrapper.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
