msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Ooh, the Scrappers,  If you're not careful, they'll catch you out with their combo."
msgstr "哦，莽夫们。如果你不小心一点，他们会用连击抓住你。"

#. Key:	OutlivedItsPurpose_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.SellUnit.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
