msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Yeah, that unit had outlived it's purpose."
msgstr "是的，那名单位已经完成了它的使命。"

#. Key:	BetterOffAsStarPoints_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.SellUnit.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
