msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Better off as Star Points that one."
msgstr "那个更适合星点。"

#. Key:	ForTheBest_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.SellUnit.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(10).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
