#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.TrainingYard.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.TrainingYard.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Nothing better to train a novice adventurer than a simple goblin, right?"
msgstr "没有比单单地精更适合作为新手训练的对手了，对吧？"

#. Key:	TimeForTheRealGame_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.TrainingYard.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.TrainingYard.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Get some confidence beating these chumps and then it's time for the real game."
msgstr "打败这些小喽啰获得一些信心，然后就是真正的游戏时间了。"

#. Key:	JustYouWait_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Treefolk.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Treefolk.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "If you think the Treefolk are big now... just you wait."
msgstr "要是你觉得树妖现在就很大了...那你再等等。"

#. Key:	CutYouDown_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Treefolk.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Treefolk.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Ah, the Treefolk have arrived to cut you down to size."
msgstr "啊，树人来了，要把你削成碎片。"

#. Key:	GrowOnYou_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Treefolk.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.Treefolk.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Now, you might not like the treefolk just yet.  But they'll grow on you."
msgstr "现在，你可能还不喜欢树人。但只会你会慢慢喜欢上的。"

#. Key:	PrevailNoneTheLess_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightClosePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightClosePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Can't say they made it easy on you, but you prevail nonetheless!"
msgstr "对方可没放水，但你还是赢了！"

#. Key:	WasntSureYoudBeatThem_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightClosePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightClosePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "I wasn't sure you'd beat them there, well done!"
msgstr "我还挺担心你能不能赢，值得嘉许！"

#. Key:	GotEmInTheEnd_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightClosePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightClosePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "They may have held out for a while but you got them in the end."
msgstr "对方虽然坚持了一会，但还是你赢了。"

#. Key:	GiveYouAChallenge_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Hah! They'll have to try harder to give you a challenge."
msgstr "哈哈！他们得再努把力才能让你赢得不那么轻松。"

#. Key:	MoppedTheFloorPVP_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Absolutely mopped the floor with them.  Well done!"
msgstr "彻底把他们打趴下了。漂亮！"

#. Key:	DidntStandAChancePVP_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightDecisivePVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "*laughing*  They didn't even stand a chance that time!"
msgstr "*大笑* 这次他们连一点机会都没有。 "

#. Key:	BetterArmy_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "The better player with the better army won this day."
msgstr "今天，更厉害的玩家和更厉害的队伍赢了。"

#. Key:	RueTheDay_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Well fought! They'll rue the day they faced you."
msgstr "战斗得很好！他们想到面对你的这一天会后悔的。"

#. Key:	LossTheWontSoonForget_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinFightNormalPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Welp, that's a loss they won't soon forget!"
msgstr "这次失败对方肯定耿耿于怀！"

#. Key:	BestedMe_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Well earned, you bested me this time.  But now I know your strategies for the next session"
msgstr "打得不错，这次算你赢了。不过我已经了解了你的战术，下次等着瞧吧。"

#. Key:	ChampionArisen_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "And with that, the Grand Tournament has ended and a new victor has arisen.  Same time next week?"
msgstr "大赛到此结束，新的胜利者诞生了。下周同一时间，不见不散？"

#. Key:	GoAgain_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Incredible!  Amazing!  Truly wonderous!  Want to go again?"
msgstr "太棒了！太牛了！太惊人了！还想继续吗？"

#. Key:	SingSongs_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "A new champion!  The bards will sing songs of this day."
msgstr "一位新冠军！游吟诗人将会称颂这一天的。"

#. Key:	ChampionOfTheGrandTournament_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(4).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Well played! You've climbed the ranks and now stand as champion of the Grand Tournament!"
msgstr "太棒了！你已经攀升到大赛的顶峰，成为了冠军！"

#. Key:	YoureAmongThem_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(5).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Very few can say they've bested me at my own game but now, you're among them."
msgstr "很少有人能在我的游戏中完败我，但现在，你是其中一者。"

#. Key:	PlayAnotherOne_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(6).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Congratulations on your victory! Care to play another one?"
msgstr "恭喜你胜利了！想再来一局吗？"

#. Key:	HappyEnding_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(7).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Now that this story has come to a happy ending, care to hear another?"
msgstr "既然这个故事有了一个圆满的结局，想听另一个故事吗？"

#. Key:	TallAndProud_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(8).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Your hero stands tall and proud, holding aloft the cup of the Grand Tournament."
msgstr "你的英雄高高站起，骄傲地举起大赛的奖杯。"

#. Key:	CrownedVictor_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRun.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(9).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Well done!  You've bested every challenge set before you and been crowned victor!"
msgstr "干得好！你已经通过了所有的挑战，并被加冕为胜利者！"

#. Key:	RanAwayWithThatOne_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(0).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Absolutely ran away with that one, well done!"
msgstr "完全碾压了他们，太赞了！"

#. Key:	PracticeAgainstMe_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(1).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "All that practice against me is really paying off.  Congrats!"
msgstr "和我的训练都很有效果。恭喜！"

#. Key:	NothingCanStandUpToIt_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(2).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Just goes to show that when you build an army as strong as yours, nothing can really stand up to it."
msgstr "事实证明，当你建立了一支像你这样的强大队伍时，没有什么能真正与之抗衡。"

#. Key:	MasterfulStrategy_VOLines
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Audio/VOTable.VOTable.WinRunPVP.VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96(3).VOLines_29_90CB93774357BC45CBD51BB2E25FCC96.Subtitle_29_34E87B914A96442F0F0B738F6540A623
msgctxt "VOTable"
msgid "Masterful strategy! I dare say you even taught me a thing or two."
