#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/BuffHexTable_PVP.BuffHexTable_PVP.Ritual.EffectDescription_123_B3A61D5A4E02813A148234B7CFA96067
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/BuffHexTable_PVP.BuffHexTable_PVP.Ritual.EffectDescription_123_B3A61D5A4E02813A148234B7CFA96067
msgid "A Unit placed here dies at the start of combat, granting the other Units 50% of its Max HP."
msgstr "战斗开始时此处的单位阵亡，为其他单位提供牺牲者 50% 的最大生命。"

#. Key:	F32697764D7F7763ABF1509A242CD6A1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/BuffHexTable_PVP.BuffHexTable_PVP.Shrinkomagic.DisplayName_125_DDA342DC4D3BA29ED17D60B793DD09F9
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/BuffHexTable_PVP.BuffHexTable_PVP.Shrinkomagic.DisplayName_125_DDA342DC4D3BA29ED17D60B793DD09F9
msgid "Shrinkomagic"
msgstr "速速变小"

#. Key:	4A96C8DE4FB7C7620039CDBB449AEF41
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/BuffHexTable_PVP.BuffHexTable_PVP.Shrinkomagic.EffectDescription_123_B3A61D5A4E02813A148234B7CFA96067
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/BuffHexTable_PVP.BuffHexTable_PVP.Shrinkomagic.EffectDescription_123_B3A61D5A4E02813A148234B7CFA96067
msgid "A Unit placed here is Shrunk."
msgstr "此处的单位被缩小。"

#. Key:	8DF45B3A4EF3CA9559DDB0BD83373C63
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/BuffHexTable_PVP.BuffHexTable_PVP.StarExtractor.EffectDescription_123_B3A61D5A4E02813A148234B7CFA96067
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/BuffHexTable_PVP.BuffHexTable_PVP.StarExtractor.EffectDescription_123_B3A61D5A4E02813A148234B7CFA96067
msgid "A Unit placed here loses 50% HP at the start of combat, but grants 1 SP per Tier."
msgstr "战斗开始时，此处的单位失去 50% 生命值，但每有 1 星级提供 1 星点。"

#. Key:	C8D232AF4D5E7D572BCB0F9EB3D43EF2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
msgid "\"After this, I have a new experiment to test on you...I mean I need your help with.\""
msgstr "“在这之后，我要在你身上做个新实验...不我是说我需要你的帮助。”"

#. Key:	14DF4DBA4DFD57CAD2032AA92C5B60DF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.Gera.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#. Key:	2CF298CE48C714CB5D334C89F038ABAF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PVP/PVPLevelUpTable.PVPLevelUpTable.Gera.TextHeader_7_51E5D67C4A0FE2DDC359E99CFE2B6E96
#. Key:	463BE921447A5D13194490B6B5FCA95A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.Gera.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PVP/PVPLevelUpTable.PVPLevelUpTable.Gera.TextHeader_7_51E5D67C4A0FE2DDC359E99CFE2B6E96
msgid "Gera"
msgstr "吉拉"

#. Key:	9BB276604DAB10FB52F24AB4C6BA52F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
msgid "\"Good day.  My name is Gera, the most brilliant scientist around.  Just ask me.\""
msgstr "“你好啊，我叫吉拉，是这里最棒的科学家。有什么事问我就行。”"

#. Key:	D258AD6C410344961B6B2EBD52307B0A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
msgid ""
"The sound of glass bottles </><text s=\"colorpink\">clinking</><text> together can only mean one thing.  There's </><text s=\"colorgera\">Gera</><text>, pushing her way through the </><text s=\"colororange\">crowd</><text>, then coming to a halt when she sees you.  She narrows her eyes for a moment before the </><text s=\"coloryellow\">flash</><text> of recognition strikes her.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Oh, it's you.  I had calculated a 78% chance of you surviv...I mean successfully making it this far.  As such, I have a new creation that I'm sure you would be willing to try.  You know...for science!</><text>\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>玻璃瓶</><text s=\"colorpink\">碰撞</><text>在一起的声音只意味着一件事。</><text s=\"colorgera\">吉拉</><text>推开</><text s=\"colororange\">人群</><text>走来，看到你之后停顿了一下。她眯了眯眼睛，然后露出</><text s=\"coloryellow\">记起</><text>了你是谁的表情。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“哦，是你啊。我之前估计你有78%的几率生还...我的意思是到达大赛的概率。既然如此，我有一项新发明你肯定想试试。你懂的...都是为了科学进步！”</>"

#. Key:	09B17FDC48873ED08E2249B72BEC3580
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
msgid ""
"A </><text s=\"colorpink\">shrill cry</><text> resonated from the arena entrance, followed by several </><text s=\"colorpurple\">digusted</><text> huffs and scoffs.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">You!  Of all the people I have had the most unfortunate displeasure of meeting with, you are the worst.  Normally, I don't take pleasure in these competitions, but for you, I am going to make an exception.</><text>\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorgera\">One of Gera's Legends will have a Boss Heart.</><text>"
msgstr ""
"</><text>竞技场入口传来一阵</><text s=\"colorpink\">尖锐的声音</><text>，接着是几声</><text s=\"colorpurple\">厌恶</><text>的哼唧和嘲笑。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“是你！在我遇到的所有不幸的家伙中，你是最糟糕的。通常我不喜欢参加这种比赛，但这次为了你，我要破例。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorgera\">吉拉的一名传说单位获得领袖雄心。</><text>"

#. Key:	ECFC7F264978CFE2432129B02B71D9C3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Gera.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
msgid "\"By my calculations, this is the end for you.\""
msgstr "“根据我的计算，你的结局到了。”"

#. Key:	A47376454DE9E8BE4DF66A85C375AC66
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
msgid "\"I will speak of your legend for centuries.\""
msgstr "“我将会传播你的故事。”"

#. Key:	7FDD0D9646E8D0D3B76927920F0DBB68
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.KiOdini.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#. Key:	CA7E5052472E79CE8A744D9994D0754E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.KiOdini.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
msgid "Ki O'Dini"
msgstr "奇欧迪尼"

#. Key:	CDC8B5B54A1C8E6E809E84845C8A0EDB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
msgid "\"Well, this should make for an interesting story.\""
msgstr "“这应该是一个有趣的故事。”"

#. Key:	7DB7272B4518B0FA4169D8A2B4A10D5A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
msgid ""
"Before you can turn around, one of your</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">companions</> <text>is already off to greet its former master.  A familiar</> <text s=\"kiodini\">hearty chuckle</> <text>echoes from the entrance hall and you step to the side to catch up.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">I see you two are getting along well.  Look how you've grown.\"</>  <text>They turn to you and produce bottle filled with some sort of cosmic something.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"And for you, my friend, something special.  It might help you come out on top, and trust me...that kind of story doesn't get told very often.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"你还没转身离开，一位雕像</><text s=\"colorcyan\">伙伴</><text>已经迎上前去和它的前主人打招呼了。大厅入口传来了熟悉的</><text s=\"kiodini\">爽朗笑声</><text>，你赶紧追上了他们。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“看来你们相处得不错，也成长了许多。”</><text>他拿出了一个装满某种物质的瓶子给你。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“这是专门为你准备的礼物，我的朋友。相信我，它会帮你登上顶峰的，一举成名一鸣惊人的事现实里可不常见呀。”</>"

#. Key:	444BF334438358F70F780AB4710E962B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription-ChoseOptionDeprecated_85_943E3F4A4FBA53956F64928BF9CEF810
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription-ChoseOptionDeprecated_85_943E3F4A4FBA53956F64928BF9CEF810
msgid "You chose the Rival's 3rd option."
msgstr "你选择了第三个选项。"

#. Key:	3B64EBAC4627BEFBD72AFF8F429B4064
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
msgid ""
"Sand whirls around your feet, a hallmark feature of the </><text s=\"desert\">Djinn of the Golden Sands</> <text>.  Nearby, several patrons have come to listen to one of their stories.  Even the legendary bard, Rhapsody, can be seen hanging on the</> <text s=\"kiodini\">storyteller's</> <text>words.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As they close up their tome, they invite you to join them.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"I was hoping I would see you again.  You've done well to make it this far, and doing battle with such a worthy foe is sure to make for a killer story.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"kiodini\">Ki O'Dini's army will have an additional Item Slot with an extra Rune.</>"
msgstr ""
"你的脚下涌起了沙尘，这是</><text s=\"desert\">沙漠灯魂</><text>的标志性特征。附近有几位顾客前来聆听他的故事，就连狂想吟奏师也在聚精会神地聆听那位</><text s=\"kiodini\">叙事师</><text>的话。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当他重重合上世籍后，开始邀请你加入谈话。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“我就想着能再见到你。你能来到这相比很有实力，能击败你简直是我谱写下个复仇故事的完美灵感...”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"kiodini\">奇欧迪尼的队伍将会拥有额外装备槽并佩戴一枚额外的符文。</>"

#. Key:	184DF77241A0C4C179EB1CABC52740B7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.KiOdini.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
msgid "\"Time to write your final chapter.\""
msgstr "“是时候进行最后一步了。”"

#. Key:	C12C7BB245CA4CD7C8CE298B993F2C49
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
msgid "\"Hey!  Wanna grab lunch after this?  Loser pays.\""
msgstr "“嘿！干完正事了去吃午饭吗？ 输的人付钱。”"

#. Key:	40F6A20341078A7588255988964D4039
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.Kova.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#. Key:	D30B9B0F4AE0A7EC65C6AF86E782F58A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PVP/PVPLevelUpTable.PVPLevelUpTable.Skye.TextHeader_7_51E5D67C4A0FE2DDC359E99CFE2B6E96
#. Key:	DED3E55643965F25126F4AA4DEBDD56B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.Kova.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PVP/PVPLevelUpTable.PVPLevelUpTable.Skye.TextHeader_7_51E5D67C4A0FE2DDC359E99CFE2B6E96
msgid "Skye"
msgstr "丝凯"

#. Key:	C3EFD9284854056EBCFA6881F7AB134D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
msgid "\"Hi there.  Names Skye.  Don't mind the mess.  It's just pasta sauce...or bug guts.\""
msgstr "“你好呀，我叫斯凯。希望你不要介意这里乱糟糟的，那只是意大利面酱...好吧其实是虫子的内脏。”"

#. Key:	A9062C5C49F75BC2E8976C816CAA70A8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
msgid ""
"That pleasant, metallic melody of clockwork armor precludes</> {skye}<text s=\"skye\">'s</> <text>arrival is like music to your ears.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Hey, you made it this far.  Guess nothing blew up.  Not that I thought it would, of course.  Anyways, I cooked up a new toy, thought you'd be a pal and try it out.  No need to thank me.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你的耳边响起发条盔甲那如旋律般的愉悦金属敲撞声，</>{skye}<text s=\"skye\"></><text>到来后才静下来。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“嘿，你到这里啦。看来我给你的东西都没爆炸，哦我的意思也不是想让它们爆炸。额...我做了一个新玩具，我想咱们是朋友，所以给你试试吧。不用谢我。”</>"

#. Key:	F2D240CC4C52DB3033640D994B358777
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
msgid ""
"The grinding of </><text s=\"colorpurple\">gears</><text> and heavy </><text s=\"colorbrown\">thudding</><text> catches your attention.  There stands </>{skye}<text>, next to a massive mechanical wonder.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Look at this fella, huh?  Been workin' day and night to get 'im ready for the Tournament.  And before ya ask, no...I won't tell ya what he can do.  You'll just have to find out when I mop the floor with ya.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"skye\">Skye will force some of your Units to start combat Stunned.</><text>"
msgstr ""
"{purple}齿轮{text}的摩擦声和沉重的撞击声引起了你的注意。矗立在</>{skye}<text>旁边的是一个巨大的机械奇迹。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“看看这家伙，嗯？我日夜不停地工作，为大赛做准备。抢在你问我之前，不...我不会告诉你这东西是做什么的。等咱们开打的时候你就知道了。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"skye\">丝凯为她的队伍制造了两名特殊单位弩炮。</>"

#. Key:	D337ECFF4138810BF02FAB8EB5402D38
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Kova.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
msgid "\"Time to take this out fella out for a test drive.\""
msgstr "“是时候带出去试驾一下了。”"

#. Key:	B1E092944CFA18B7CFD37990414EDB0F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
msgid "\"Need a hand?  You can borrow mine.\""
msgstr "“需要帮手吗？ 你可以找我帮忙。”"

#. Key:	A3F42B2D4A5ED35775C2DBA16E0BAF77
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.Lelthas.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#. Key:	F63A46ED4D73087A32F152B26EEE9088
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.Lelthas.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
msgid "Lel'thas"
msgstr "莱尔萨斯"

#. Key:	E22FC8904908D6136D62E58AC84F89BD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
msgid "\"Prince Lel'Thas, at your service.  Mors Vincit Omnia.\""
msgstr "“莱尔萨斯王子，随时为您效劳。胜利征服一切。”"

#. Key:	56F500C34AF9C739C5647589B0A1CE7B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
msgid ""
"The ever </><text s=\"colorpink\">charismatic</><text> bone prince offers a toothy grin.  As you step forward, </><text s=\"colorlelthas\">Lel'thas</><text> removes one arm and uses it to pat your shoulder, then </><text s=\"colorblue\">socketing</><text> it back in place.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Glad to see you made it this far.  To be honest, it gets a little lackluster going up against the same bunch year after year.  It would be nice for some new blood to win for once.  Take this...its brought my family luck for years...just don't lose it.  I'm going to want that back.</><text>\"\r\n"
msgstr ""
"</><text s=\"colorpink\">魅力十足</><text>的骷髅王子笑出了一口大白牙。你迎了上去，</><text s=\"colorlelthas\">莱尔萨斯</><text>摘下一只骨臂，并用它拍了拍你的肩膀，然后再把它</><text s=\"colorblue\">插</><text>回原位。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“很高兴你能一路来到这里。说实话，年复一年地与同一群人比赛可真有点无聊。要是有新血液能获胜给大赛注入点新活力可太好了。拿着这个...它为我的家族续了多年的好运...别弄丢了，比赛完我还会要回来的。”</>\n"

#. Key:	33F6AA4E487EB2ECB1D37BAAC5FBE02B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
msgid ""
"The unnerving sound of bone striking bone makes you cringe as you turn around to see the </><text s=\"colorgray\">skeletal</> <text s=\"colorlelthas\">Prince Lel'thas</><text> standing behind you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Well done..I was hoping you'd make it here.  You stole something from me and I'm here to take it back.  Don't try to apologize.  You have insulted my family name, and now I will have my retribution.  See you in the games, peasant.</><text>\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorlelthas\">Lel'thas' Skeleton army will revive twice.</><text>"
msgstr ""
"你转过身，看到</><text s=\"colorgray\">骷髅王子</><text s=\"colorlelthas\">莱尔萨斯{text}站在你身后时，骨头碰撞的不安怪声让你感到畏缩。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“着实有趣...吾候汝多时矣。汝所窃之宝，将完璧而归。既辱吾族，勿再谈谢罪之言，大赛即为汝之受戮日，贱民。{text}”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorlelthas\">莱尔萨斯的骷髅单位将复活两次。</>"

#. Key:	3B18464B42C6F181F62E11B38DA90C78
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Lelthas.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
msgid "\"My bones will grind yours to dust.\""
msgstr "“我会用我的骨头把你挫骨扬灰。”"

#. Key:	AFCEE68F4D947582A404C4AD036578F0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
msgid "\"After Tournament, friend come play game with Otto?\""
msgstr "“比赛结束后，要来和奥托玩游戏吗？”"

#. Key:	32D2638D4E0FE580445032B71419B320
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#. Key:	5596D720475AE23A37E58FA8B530E308
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PVP/PVPLevelUpTable.PVPLevelUpTable.Otto.TextHeader_7_51E5D67C4A0FE2DDC359E99CFE2B6E96
#. Key:	A52A79CC4486E1AF4E25F59ABB2BC60D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.Otto.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.Otto.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PVP/PVPLevelUpTable.PVPLevelUpTable.Otto.TextHeader_7_51E5D67C4A0FE2DDC359E99CFE2B6E96
msgid "Otto"
msgstr "奥托"

#. Key:	1D6891A24844C3A1337A45BEC029A8E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
msgid "\"Hello.  Let's play a game.\""
msgstr "“你好。我们来玩个游戏吧。”"

#. Key:	09E910084E1248B5804F62A242BAE9EF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
msgid ""
"The great </><text s=\"otto\">stone golem</><text> wraps you in two mighty </><text s=\"colorgray\">granite</><text> arms in a warm embrace with surprising </><text s=\"colorcyan\">gentleness</><text> for such a large creature.  After a moment, it lowers itself to sit on the </><text s=\"colorpurple\">floor</><text>, yet still remains about eye level with you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Otto hoped to see friend in Tournament.  Otto practice since Otto lost.  Get better.  Learn tactic.  Otto teach friend.  Help friend win Tournament.  Then friend come play with Otto again.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"高大的</><text s=\"otto\">巨石偶</><text>将你用他强大的</><text s=\"colorgray\">花岗岩</><text>手臂温暖地怀抱起来。考虑到你们的体型差，这个拥抱超出寻常地</><text s=\"colorcyan\">温柔</><text>。过了一会儿，它靠下来坐在</><text s=\"colorpurple\">地上</><text>，但双眼仍与你的视线保持在同一水平线上，以示善意。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“奥托希望在大赛中见到朋友。奥托输了之后就开始练习。学习战术。变得更强。奥托教朋友。帮助朋友赢得大赛。然后朋友再来和奥托一起玩。”</>"

#. Key:	7BB20F90471CB91D4186F59718D01EB4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
msgid ""
"The heavy stone footsteps can only mean one thing.  The granite golem,</> {otto}<text>, with his calm demeanor, waves at you from the doorway.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Hello friend.  Otto want to come see friend.  Hope friend do well in Tournament.  Maybe Otto see friend in Tournament, get to play game this time.  Good luck!\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"otto\">Otto's Chess Units will be immune to Crowd Control.</>"
msgstr ""
"沉重的石块脚步声只能说明一件事，那位巨石偶来了。</>{otto}<text>看起来举止平静，正从门口向你招手。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“你好朋友。奥托想来看朋友。希望朋友在大赛中取得好成绩。也许奥托在大赛中能见到朋友，这次能一起玩。祝你好运！”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"otto\">奥托的【雕像】单位将免疫控制效果。</>"

#. Key:	FCA400D3493AB1EF6C24A883692742EA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.Otto.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
msgid "\"Otto crush enemy!  Otto also learn new word for not friend.\""
msgstr "“奥托打败了敌人！奥托学会了一个新的关于敌人的词语。”"

#. Key:	1426417B44E9CB4148DD5A8B4028CDA5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.AllyTravelPanelDescription_77_71315E38482EA5F86C36089DA6E8DA76
msgid "\"May the Skalds sing of your glory for eternity.\""
msgstr "“愿斯卡尔德人永远歌唱你的荣耀”。"

#. Key:	DAEE474B4F021746A6FC18A375172C12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#. Key:	E1F11DA74F7F8252010C11A07E24A1B8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PVP/PVPLevelUpTable.PVPLevelUpTable.River.TextHeader_7_51E5D67C4A0FE2DDC359E99CFE2B6E96
#. Key:	E656FEE84F5B8193DEEEAA8BAA795011
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.River.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.Name_7_E9A7661D444F8E4BCF46BFB714009688
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/CombatModifierTable.CombatModifierTable.River.Name_4_207932DF4B453CE544D2C8B0C58F221E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PVP/PVPLevelUpTable.PVPLevelUpTable.River.TextHeader_7_51E5D67C4A0FE2DDC359E99CFE2B6E96
msgid "River"
msgstr "里弗"

#. Key:	96508D404502AAF327AAA19016A3D636
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.Non-RivalAllyTravelPanelDescription_79_BD21E960428F3CF2FF2D51A65DFA76B6
msgid "\"I am River, finest craftsman in all...oh, right.  First we fight, then we browse.\""
msgstr "“我是里弗，这世上最好的工匠。先打一架再谈吧。”"

#. Key:	A568C85447513306C1A9C7B914610AAA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.RegistrarAlly-TextPhaseDescription_64_5C9DB24C4766A293FDB212B0D025A2B9
msgid ""
"</><text s=\"river\">River's</> <text>gentle countenance brings a smile to your face.  You recall the time you spent with her, watching the</> <text s=\"colorgold\">saga</> <text>of her people unfold through the fabric of her</> <text s=\"colorbless\">banners</><text>.  She places a large hand on your shoulder in greeting, then produces the most beautiful</> <text s=\"colorbless\">tapestry</> <text>you've ever seen.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>After a few moments of sheer</> <text s=\"colorpink\">adoration</><text>, she folds the banner and offers it to you and a token of your patronage.  You thank her as she heads towards the </>{tournament}<text> grounds, wondering if you will see her on the other side of the field.</>"
msgstr ""
"</><text s=\"river\">里弗</><text>的温和面庞让你心里放松下来。你想起了和她在一起的时光，那时你聆听着她的</><text s=\"colorgold\">故事</><text>，看着她将记录在</><text s=\"colorbless\">战旗</><text>上的家族传说娓娓道来。她轻轻拍了拍你的肩膀，又拿出来一面最为美观的</><text s=\"colorbless\">战旗</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>对它进行短暂的</><text s=\"colorpink\">旗礼</><text>后，她叠起战旗将它送给了你，以感谢你的支持。与你道别后，她朝着</>{tournament}<text>场地走去，你们都互相很期待在战场上见到对方。</>"

#. Key:	60DAE41842B844CA7634579951D2A88F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.RegistrarRival-TextPhaseDescription_65_267831404D4816C4515B0BBCF7FE449C
msgid ""
"The</> <text s=\"river\">silent giant</> <text>ducks low to pass the entryway into the</> <text s=\"goblin\">Registrar's</> <text>tent, smiling softly when she sees you.  She lays out several beautifully crafted banners, each telling an</> <text s=\"colorbless\">epic saga</><text>.  You reach out to take one, when she stops you, shaking her head.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The smile on the</> <text s=\"river\">old girl's</> <text>face could almost be considered mischevious.  After allowing you to admire her artwork, she points in the direction of the </>{tournament}<text> grounds.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"river\">River's units will all gain an extra Trait.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>那位</><text s=\"river\">沉默的巨人{text}低头通过</><text s=\"goblin\">登记处{text}的帐篷入口。当她看到你时，微笑着向你展示了几面精美制作的战旗，每面都记有一段</><text s=\"colorbless\">传奇故事{text}。你伸手要拿起来一面，但她制止了你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>这个</><text s=\"river\">老女孩{text}脸上的笑容调皮又渗人。允许你观摩了她的战旗后，她转身径直指向了</>{tournament}<text>场地。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"river\">里弗的所有单位会额外获得一个阵营。</>"

#. Key:	8E226C1642A442F7AE5A7794033C4683
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/ChampionTable.ChampionTable.River.RivalTravelPanelDescription_76_3E1014B4447EC72313B87DB99D165945
msgid "\"I've made something special...just for you.\""
msgstr "“我专门为你做了一些特别的东西...”"

#. Key:	71AA80C048870D7B1ED6FFA3A3E901FF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/ActModifierTable.ActModifierTable.CavernMod.Description_5_CE96FECF40D9A68B64BE978E224ADBA7
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/ActModifierTable.ActModifierTable.CavernMod.Description_5_CE96FECF40D9A68B64BE978E224ADBA7
msgid "Every 5 seconds, the Crystal Heart pulses, granting all units 25 Mana. The first pulse also grants 15 Armor."
msgstr "每 5 秒水晶之心跳动一次，为所有单位提供 25 点法力值。首次跳动时还提供 15 点护甲。"

#. Key:	9BD27696479FC6DD974580BC5661E6C3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/CombatModifier/StatusEffectTable_CombatMods.StatusEffectTable_CombatMods.ManaCrystalArmor.DisplayTextforStatBreakoutBonusDisplay_195_599B3B3B463E8E09BD7C86A06780319B
#. Key:	D3360223464FF33C7AC91680442FE068
