msgstr "在实验室里愉快地调配特殊药剂。"

#. Key:	D77084FC404AA838C33094AD52C47CFE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find yourself in what appears to be an {cyan}abandoned{text} lecture hall.  Amid the {green}stacked chairs{text} and {brown}dust{text}, a cauldron sits front and center of the class, catching your attention.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you approach, the {gray}vessel{text} begins to {wavingpurple}bubble and gurgle{text}, emitting a {shakingred}red mist{text} that vaguely looks like...a face?  Soon, the crack in the cauldron begins to move and a {magenta}disembodied voice{text} seems to fill the room.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Where did everyone go?  No matter, time for your final exam.  Throw something in me and show me what you've learned.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现自己身处一个似乎被{cyan}废弃{text}的讲演厅。在一堆{green}叠椅{text}与{brown}积尘{text}间的屋子前中央，有一口大锅，十分引人注目。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你靠近时，{gray}容器{text}开始{wavingpurple}冒泡{text}并发出{wavingpurple}咕噜声{text}，旁边还散发着{shakingred}红雾{text}，隐约看起来像...一张脸？不久，锅上的裂缝如嘴般开始变动，一阵{magenta}无形的声音{text}似乎充满了整个房间。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“大家都去哪儿了？不管了，你们的期末考试时期到了。嗯？别傻站着。扔点什么进来，让我看看你们都学到了什么。”</>"

#. Key:	DC9DB83B4C1F1B8BA965308F845C49A2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{replacement@LeftSide}\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{replacement@RightSide}\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Were you even paying attention?  This will never...wait...\"  {text}\"The cauldron coughs and hacks before spitting something out.  {speech}\"You got lucky, this time.  B+.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"{replacement@LeftSide}\n"
"\n"
"{replacement@RightSide}\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“你到底有没有认真学习？这可不行...等等...”{text}大锅咳嗽作响了一阵，然后吐出了什么东西。{speech}“你这次很走运。成绩：B+。”</>"

#. Key:	4120EE2C409BD8523C0A9A9A5C406E1C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You grab the first thing you can find, and toss it into the impatient cauldron.  Its eyes narrow at you.  {shakingspeech}Is that a hat?!{speech}  I'm a cauldron, not a washing machine.</>"
msgstr "<text>你抓住你随手拿起的第一个东西，把它扔进不耐烦的大锅里。它眯起眼睛看着你。{shakingspeech}这是一顶帽子吗？！{speech}我是锅，不是洗衣机。</>"

#. Key:	508B459640500BB996F12696971F21A1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You notice something {wavingwhite}shiny{text} {gold}gold coin{text} laying on the ground.  Picking it up with a shrug, you toss the it into the {gray}pot{text}.  {speech}\"A coin?  Seriously?  Do I look like a wishing well to you?</>"
msgstr "<text>你注意到地上有一些{wavingwhite}闪亮的{gold}金币{text}。你耸耸肩，捡起它，然后把它扔进了{gray}锅{text}里。{speech}“一枚金币？你来真的？我看着很像许愿池吗？”</>"

#. Key:	7C6E802545094BF4080899A06C16E045
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You accidentally place your hand in some {wavinggreen}slimy substance{text}.  When you shake it off, some lands inside the {gray}kettle{text}.  {speech}Oh, that's disgusting.  Why is it {shakinggreen}wiggling{speech} like that?</>"
msgstr "<text>你不小心将手放进了某种{wavinggreen}粘糊糊{text}的物质中。尝试甩掉它时，有些掉进了{gray}锅{text}内。{speech}哦，太恶心了。这鬼东西为什么会{shakinggreen}蠕动{speech}？</>"

#. Key:	BF6823E145DD2C48A8619A9CE0CA7001
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Fishing around your {pink}bag{text}, you find a {red}potion{text} you don't recall being there and pour it in next.  {speech}Oh, that's nice.  Sweet and savory.  It makes your first choice almost palatable.</>"
msgstr "<text>你搜了搜自己的{pink}包{text}，发现了一瓶你不曾记得放进去过的{red}药水{text}，随手就倒了进去。{speech}哦，真棒。香甜可口。与你的第一个食材真是绝配。</>"

#. Key:	808828844EDAEFCE5C079685251C72D0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You next grab a dusty {blue}potion{text} from a nearby shelf and {cyan}pour{text} the contents inside.  {speech}Earthy.  Aged beautifully.  Exquisitely, utterly ruined by your initial ingredient.</>"
msgstr "<text>紧接着你从附近的架子上拿起一瓶沾满灰尘的{blue}药水{text}，将里面的内容物{cyan}倒了{text}进去。{speech}土味很浓，一种老酒的醇香，但却精妙地被你之前放入的原料毁了。</>"

#. Key:	B3DB83A949674E91ECDB2D9A926BB364
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>The only other {cyan}ingredient{text} here is a {wavingyellow}questionable brew{text}.  It smells {green}funny{text}, but you decide to toss it in anyway.  {speech}\"{speech}Bland.  Tasteless.  Somehow worse than the first.</>"
msgstr "<text>这里唯一的其他{cyan}原料{text}是一种质量存疑的{wavingyellow}酿造物{text}。这东西的味道蛮{green}奇特{text}的，但你还是决定把它加进去。{speech}“平淡，又无味。比你的第一个选项还要糟糕。</>"

#. Key:	65A936E142532718DB9D8B8E9288E1DC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(6 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(6
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{hasTag$Health:Health} {hasTag$Mana:Mana} {hasTag$Berserk:Berserk}"
msgstr "{hasTag$Health:Health} {hasTag$Mana:Mana} {hasTag$Berserk:Berserk}"

#. Key:	5789401347D046AB177570BC349576D2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(7 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
