msgid "{hasTag$Equipment:Equipment} {hasTag$Blessing:Blessing} {hasTag$Unit:Unit}"
msgstr "{hasTag$Equipment:Equipment} {hasTag$Blessing:Blessing} {hasTag$Unit:Unit}"

#. Key:	9118AEDF49A80FC9957D08B3FBE1394F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_BuildPotion.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Talking Cauldron"
msgstr "锅言锅语"

#. Key:	298513FA495ECE13D8F992BD6EC840E0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Meet the Alchemist Lab's head scientist - and her lack of ethics."
msgstr "遇见炼金实验室的首席科学家，然而她好像并不在乎道德。"

#. Key:	1BF6FBAA4CBA4B9C98689F9988079BFD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>An </><text s=\"colorred\">explosion</><text> echoes from a nearby room, and soon after a </><text s=\"colorpurple\">purple smoke</><text> seeps from under the door.  Concerned, you hurry inside to find a </><text s=\"colorbrown\">dwarven</><text> woman excitedly holding up a </><text s=\"colorblue\">vial</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Eureka!  I've done it.  At least, I think I've done it.  Now, if only I could...Ohh!  Perfect timing.  My name is</> <text s=\"colorgera\">Professor Gera</> <text s=\"colorspeech\">and you are my new assistant.  Your first task...drink this.</><text>\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一声</><text s=\"colorred\">爆炸</><text>从附近的房间传来，不久后一簇</><text s=\"colorpurple\">紫烟</><text>从它的门缝底下冒了出来。你有点担心，立即赶至房间内，发现一位</><text s=\"colorbrown\">矮人</><text>女性正兴奋地手持一</><text s=\"colorblue\">剂瓶</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“哈哈，我成功了！至少看上去像这么回事...现在只剩...哦，你来的正好！我是</><text s=\"colorgera\">吉拉教授</><text s=\"colorspeech\">。而你，你现在正式成为我的助手了。你的第一项任务是...把这个喝了。”</>"

#. Key:	41F4F6A64AA66D760081FAB17833592B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"As my assistant, you will be required to aid in the conducting of experiments.  Your first task...eat this.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Without a moment of hesitation, you down the {rainbow}odd-looking mushroom{text}.  It only takes a second for you to {red}question{text} you life decisions as immediately the {wavingpurple}fungus{text} goes to war in your {green}stomach{text}.  Sinking to your knees in pain, </>{gera}<text> immediately begins to examine you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Oh...oh my.  How very interesting.  Very good.  And it didn't kill you.  There was a seventeen percent chance that it might.  Now, shoo.  I have to get back to my work.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“作为我的助手，你需要协助我进行实验。你的第一个任务是...吃下这个。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>没有片刻的犹豫，你就吞下了外形奇异的{rainbow}蘑菇{text}，但不到一秒钟，你就开始{red}动摇{text}。因为{wavingpurple}蘑菇{text}在你的{green}胃{text}里开始翻江倒海。你疼得满地打滚，而</>{gera}<text>立即开始对你进行检查。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“哦...天哪。真有趣。太棒了。你居然没死，预计死亡率可是高达17%呢。折腾地稍微小点声，我得回到工位了。”</>"

#. Key:	1049895A4630170F057D43BB7D2AE234
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Your gift will be perfect for my next creation.  Give this to some random min...'combatant'...and report the results.  There may be insignificant side effects.  Ignore those.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{gera} <text>thrusts a bottle of {wavingpink}questionable liquid{text} in your hands.  It {cyan}bubbles{text} and {purple}gurgles{text}, making you wonder just how safe the {rainbow}elixer{text} really is.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You don't have much time to question your new job before </>{gera}<text> rushes you out the door.  {speech}\"Well, go on now.  I have work to do, and that won't drink itself.  Off you go.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“你的天赋将非常适合我的下一个发明。把这个随便用在什么...‘战斗人员’...身上吧，记得向我报告实验结果。这玩意可能会有一丢丢的副作用，无视就好。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{gera}<text>将一瓶{wavingpink}可疑的液体{text}塞到你手中。它不停地{cyan}冒泡{text}并发出{purple}咯咯声{text}，让你不禁开始思考这瓶{rainbow}药剂{text}的安全性究竟如何。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在你还没来得及质疑之前，</>{gera}<text>就把你赶了出去。{speech}“行了，现在走人吧。我还有工作要做，那瓶药水可不会自己写出研究报告。快上路吧。”</>"

#. Key:	278B5BD646C369628497F0BEE37B5944
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You notice an odd belt around </>{gera's}<text> waist that {wavingwhite}flashes{text} on occasion.  Catching on, her eyes and smile grow wide.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Why yes, you can help me.  I'm glad you asked.  This device should allow me to transfer materials from my lab wherever I am.  But, it needs testing.  I'll check in on you at the {colortournament}Tournament {smallspeech}if you aren't a frog or something...\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You fasten the {green}belt{text} around your waist, which somehow fits perfectly, and </>{gera}<text> hurries you off.  {speech}\"Results may vary, something something four hours...you know the drill\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你的目光扫到</>{gera}<text>腰间系着的一条奇怪腰带，它不时地{wavingwhite}闪烁{text}。而她的目光扫在你的目光之上，眼睛与笑容渐渐狰狞。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“啊当然，我非常乐意接受你的帮助。这个设备应该可以从我的实验室传输东西到任意位置，无论使用者身处何处。不过，它还需要测试。我希望你在{colortournament}大赛</><text s=\"colorspeech\">上测试一下它。{smallspeech}只要你不乱用的话...”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你把{green}腰带{text}系在腰上，不知怎么的它非常合身。</>{gera}<text>催促着你离开。{speech}“实验结果还是不好预料，得要大约四个小时...反正你都轻车熟路了。”</>"

#. Key:	F5AB4BCE4939A3491F0213BD5027032C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_Champion.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Very Normal Science!"
msgstr "非常科学"

#. Key:	5D9395AC4DB917BBF81C16B5CE2314EA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_ImprisonedCreature.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_ImprisonedCreature.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Rescue an alien test subject."
msgstr "解救一名外星实验对象。"

#. Key:	86A56DAD494AC5C6FF5CE9BC924431F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_ImprisonedCreature.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_ImprisonedCreature.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Taking a wrong turn, you find yourself in an empty lab.  It looks like someone is in the middle of an {blue}experiment{text}, with the focus being some sort of {rainbow}alien creature{text} in a jar.  Stepping closer, you examine the strange {green}creature{text} who appears to be asleep.  Or dead.  It's hard to tell.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You soon learn it was definitely just {purple}sleeping{text} as its one big {orange}eye{text} suddenly opens and it begins {shakingyellow}frantically{text} swimming around the {blue}container{text} its trapped in.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You decide to search for some way to free the poor thing from its {purple}captivity{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你转错了方向，发现自己来到了一个空荡荡的实验室。看起来有人正在进行{blue}实验{text}，对象是玻璃罐中的某种{rainbow}外星生物{text}。你走近一些，观察着这个似乎睡着了的奇怪{green}生物{text}。它也可能是死了，不好分辨。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你很快发现，它确实只是在{purple}休眠{text}，因为它的大{orange}眼睛{text}突然睁开了。它开始{shakingyellow}疯狂{text}地在被困的{blue}容器{text}里四处游动。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你决定寻找一种方法将这个可怜的家伙从{purple}囚禁{text}中解救出来。</>"

#. Key:	A54BDA9D41C7B54560A5C5B0AB7DF3A6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_ImprisonedCreature.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_ImprisonedCreature.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Seeing no other option, you grab a metal rod and {shakingred}smash{text} the glass cage, spilling a {wavingpurple}strange fluid{text} all over the floor.  The {rainbow}creature{text} carefully slithers onto the desk, that big eye darting back and forth.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You reach out, and soon the {rainbow}creature{text} scampers up your arm and settles on your shoulder, {pink}nuzzling{text} your cheek.  As you make your exit, it reaches out with a {purple}tentacle{text} and snatches something from a nearby shelf.  What an {wavingcyan}adorable{text} little thief.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>眼看别无选择，你只好抓起一根金属棒，{shakingred}砸碎{text}了玻璃罐，{wavingpurple}奇怪的液体{text}洒了一地。那个{rainbow}生物{text}小心翼翼地滑到桌子上，大眼睛来回转动。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你伸出手，很快那个{rainbow}生物{text}就爬上你的手臂，停在肩膀上{pink}蹭{text}着你的脸颊。当你离开时，它伸出{purple}触手{text}，从附近的架子上拿走了什么东西。多么可爱的{wavingcyan}小偷{text}啊。</>"

#. Key:	BEC1A9E34EAE533D666652908AE5CC13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_ImprisonedCreature.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.AlchemistLab_ImprisonedCreature.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "The Breach"
msgstr "出逃"

#. Key:	57A5B69B48F338D4BFC1C8A67AF9AAFF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ApologySlime.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ApologySlime.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Aw, something went wrong... please let the devs know!"
msgstr "好像出了点问题...你可以向开发者报告这个错误！"

#. Key:	2C20794040DFF4F29E7596B6DCEFD539
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ApologySlime.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
