#. Key:	97F613B0463D76FD8B6BC398552CA81A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_Hieroglyphics.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_Hieroglyphics.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Discover the secrets of a beastly statue."
msgstr "探寻野兽雕像的秘密。"

#. Key:	C27D87234DFD82D658EC989667B5CBE1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_Hieroglyphics.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_Hieroglyphics.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The hairs on the back of your neck rise as you feel something {red}watching{text} you.  As you turn around, you find yourself face to face with the statue of a {gray}hideous{text} beast.  Fanged lips curl in a coy grin, one {yellow}gemmed{text} eye seemingly following you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>A number of gems glitter on the ground, along with a single {wavingblue}sapphire{text} sitting in its cupped hands.  As you investigate closer, you swear you could see one of its fingers twitch.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你感到汗毛倒竖，似乎有什么东西在{red}看着{text}你。转过头去，一个{gray}可怕{text}的野兽雕像猛然与你四目对视。它长着獠牙的嘴唇弯成腼腆的笑容，一只{yellow}宝石般{text}的独眼似乎在紧盯着你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>地面上有许多闪光的宝石，还有一颗{wavingblue}蓝宝石{text}在雕像的掌中。当你仔细观察时，它的一根手指铁定抽搐了一下。</>"

#. Key:	8F25992D4D4073A853B2FA90241CA852
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_Hieroglyphics.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_Hieroglyphics.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>It certainly appears that the {wavingblue}gemstone{text} must be its other eye.  You aren't sure why, but you decide to put it where you think it belongs.  Suddenly, the {gray}statue{text} shudders and steps from its platform.  It looks at you, raised one large {red}clawed{text} hand and...</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>...places it on your shoulder.  {speech}\"Hey there, boyo, thanks a lot.  I was afraid I was gonna be stuck there for another thousand years.  So, you help me, I help you.  Come on, I ain't gonna stand here all day.  Oh, and take this.  Sure them greenskins won't miss it.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>看样子那颗{wavingblue}宝石{text}肯定就是它的另一只眼睛，你下意识地决定把宝石放回它该在的位置。突然间，{gray}雕像{text}从台上始动，踱步而下。它看着你，举起了它巨大的{red}爪子{text}，然后...</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>放到了你的肩膀上。{speech}“多谢了，朋友，我还以为得在这再被困上一千年呢。你帮了我，现在轮到我了。走吧，我可不想继续呆在这里了。哦对了，拿着这个，那些绿皮的家伙看了眼睛肯定放光。”</>"

#. Key:	14373ACC43BF275AB5F496A9BF6B2586
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_Hieroglyphics.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_Hieroglyphics.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Gemstone Gargoyle"
msgstr "宝石妖像"

#. Key:	B6AF2A994267707D4100C29E29D1EB18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_RockLobsters.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_RockLobsters.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Meet adorable crabs that adapted to the Caverns."
msgstr "遇见可爱的螃蟹，它们已经适应了洞穴环境。"

#. Key:	953D17D640DB8C9BA55299B89BC99A48
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_RockLobsters.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_RockLobsters.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Down one remarkably unremarkable tunnel, you find a room full of small {brown}stalagmites{text}.  You decide to stop to rest when you sense {blue}movement{text} from behind you...then to the side.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Before long, you realize they aren't simple stone formations, but {orange}crabs of all sizes{text} scuttling back and forth {purple}curiously{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>These {wavingturquoise}little critters{text} are so cute, you just {bi}have{text} to take one with you.  Question is, which one?</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>沿着一条极其不起眼的隧道，你发现了一处充满{brown}石笋{text}的空间。  你决定停下来休息...却感觉到身后有{blue}东西在动{text}，好像又跑到身侧。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>没过多久，你就发现这些不是普通的石头，而是大小不一的{orange}螃蟹{text}在{purple}好奇{text}地来回移动。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>这些{wavingturquoise}小动物{text}实在太可爱了，你{bi}忍不住{text}要带上一只。问题是，带哪一只呢？</>"

#. Key:	0757E077485B080AD05EE8AE83691A6E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_RockLobsters.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Cavern_RockLobsters.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You crouch down, offering your hand out to the {turquoise}creatures{text} who all look at you with curiousity.  Only one, however, gets close enough for you to {pink}pet{text}.  As you caress its {red}shell{text}, it lets out a little coo.  It could be the {cyan_i}most adorable{text} thing you've ever seen.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You decide to name {randomreplacement|1} {replacement@LeftSide}...{replacement@RightSide}.  You pick up little {replacement@LeftSide} and put {randomreplacement|1} in your satchel.  Instantly, two tiny eyes peek from the bag, bringing a {white}smile{text} to your face.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你蹲了下来，向那些{turquoise}生物{text}伸出手，它们全都好奇地看着你。只有一只靠近到了你可以{pink}抚摸{text}的距离。当你抚摸它的{red}壳{text}时，它咕咕地叫了一声。这绝对是你见过的{cyan_i}最可爱{text}的东西。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>你决定将{randomreplacement|1}命名为{replacement@RightSide}小{replacement@LeftSide}。你拿起小{replacement@LeftSide}，放入挎包中。两只小眼睛从包里探出头来，{white}笑容{text}不知不觉转移到你脸上。</>"

