msgid "A huge race track surrounded with spectators - an interesting betting sport."
msgstr "一个巨大的赛马场，场地周围站满了赌马客。"

#. Key:	10CD28B14961203B7F79AA9CF34ED5B8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.CentaurDerby.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.CentaurDerby.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colorgreen\">The Three Circlets</><text>.  A world-renowned event where the finest </><text s=\"colorbrown\">centaurs</><text> from the four corners compete for the title of </><text s=\"colorblue_b\">Chiron</><text>.  The crowd is bustling with excitement, meeting the competitors, </><text s=\"colorgold\">placing bets</><text>, and all around enjoying the event.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>To the right, a </><text s=\"colorbrown\">gnome</><text> is standing on a stack of crates, collecting betting slips before the race.  To the left, an area where people can get </><text s=\"colorred\">autographs</><text> from their favorite competitor.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorgreen\">“三环会”</><text>，一个举世闻名的活动，来自各地最优秀的</><text s=\"colorbrown\">半人马</><text>们将角逐</><text s=\"colorblue_b\">“飒骑”{text}这个称号。观众也兴奋不已，他们在场边欢呼，不断</><text s=\"colorgold\">下注</><text>，尽情享受比赛。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>右侧有一位</><text s=\"colorbrown\">小矮人</><text>站在一堆箱子上，在赛前收集投注表。而左侧，人们可以问自己喜爱的选手要</><text s=\"colorred\">签名</><text>。</>"

