#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>An </><text s=\"lelthas\">ornately-clad skeleton{text} is admiring a number of {rainbow}potions{text} of all shapes and colors.  One, in particular, the </><text s=\"gera\">Director{text} seems proud of.  {speech}\"Just for you, Your Highness.  This should put some meat on your bones...quite literally.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>一位</><text s=\"lelthas\">衣着华丽的骷髅{text}正在欣赏许多奇形异状颜色缤纷的{rainbow}药水{text}。</><text s=\"gera\">研究主管{text}似乎对其中一瓶感到特别自豪。{speech}“专为您而做的，殿下。这瓶药水应该能让您的骨头上长肉...我可没有夸张。”</>"

#. Key:	C027411C48D06C6789DF0A873F693C47
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>As you step into the room, </>{gera's}<text> eyes light up, summoning you close.  {speech}\"What do you think?  Wouldn't this face look better with a real face?\"</>"
msgstr "<text>当你走进房间时，</>{gera}<text>的眼睛亮了起来，默示你靠近。{speech}“你觉得怎么样？这张面孔要是有真脸是不是更好看？”</>"

#. Key:	38773B72436C1D91F2C5CA85CF6920B4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Kneeling in front of a small gnome in a white lab coat, </><text s=\"lelthas\">Prince Lel'Thas{text} is listening to the </><text s=\"gera\">Director{text} of </>{alchemylab} <text>as she explain her latest {rainbow}concoction{text}.  {speech}\"With this, you'll be back to your pale-skinned self.  None of this...whatever this is.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>你看到有人跪在一个穿白实验服的小矮子面前，好像是</><text s=\"lelthas\">莱尔萨斯王子{text}。他正在听</>{alchemylab}<text>的</><text s=\"gera\">研究主管{text}说话，对方正在解释她最新研发的{rainbow}合剂{text}。{speech}“有了这个，你本该重获那个长着苍白皮肤的肉体的，但现在这个效果是啥？奇怪...”</>"

#. Key:	1C1E6D1B4932104E866D38835817662A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Seeing you approach, </>{lelthas}<text> rises to greet you.  {speech}\"Well met, friend.  Dost my appearance cause thee dread?  Is beauty more than skin deep?\"  {text}As he speaks, his {wavingwhite}bone-white teeth{text} seem to sparkle.</>"
msgstr "<text>看到你靠近，</>{lelthas}<text>在一把巨大刀刃的帮扶下站起来欢迎你。{speech}“幸会。吾貌虽厉，然美岂独皮相？亦可彻入骨髓乎？”{text}王子的{wavingwhite}白齿{text}随着交谈在{cyan}皎月{text}下闪闪发光。</>"

#. Key:	3BD7697749B4ACE6F2CF599C403866E8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Let's give you life!"
msgstr "赋死新生！"

#. Key:	2B7463114501CF5437689795323A9C65
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "Let the dead stay...dead?"
msgstr "勿扰亡者。"

#. Key:	E0249F0B45FC463FCC52E4B8397F21FD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{lelthas} <text>lifts the {rainbow}vial{text} in his bony fingers, examines it, and shakes his skull  {speech}\"Thou hurt me, truly.  My dear </>{gera}<text s=\"colorspeech\">, I wouldst not have things any other way.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>With that, the Prince turns and walks off,  leaving you along with the </><text s=\"gera\">Director</>.  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Huh?  How odd.  This isn't the lifeblood elixer...this is newt juice.  That would be an interesting experiment...\"  {text}Leaving her thoughts, she seems to finally notice you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{geraend}"
msgstr ""
"{lelthas}<text>用他只有骨头的手指举起了{rainbow}小瓶{text}，检查着它，然后摇了摇他的骷髅头。{speech}“汝伤吾甚深。</>{gera}<text>，</><text s=\" colorspeech\">吾意已决，不欲有丝毫更易{speech}。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>说完，王子转身走开，只留下你和</><text s=\"gera\">研究主管</>。<text s=\"colorspeech\">“咦？真奇怪。怎么这不是血骨药...怎么是蝾螈汁？不过这样也会是一场有趣的实验呢...”{text}思考一阵过后，她似乎终于注意到了你。</>\n"
"\n"
"{geraend}"

#. Key:	3F0A5EC2425E7E56ED32498ACD8641E2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{lelthas} <text>looks warily at the {wavingturquoise}bubbling brew{text}, and you find yourself curious that just a skull can display emotion.  {speech}\"My dearest Director, thy kindness is appreciated, but this {playerrace} is right.  Perhaps thy tincture can find use elsewhere\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It seems that </>{gera}<text> did not appreciate the refusal, and {shakingpurple}storms off{text} in a very tiny fit.  </>{lelthas}<text> turns to you, tapping that massive {cyan}bejeweled{text} blade against his shoulder.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{lelthasend}"
msgstr ""
"{lelthas}<text>警惕地看着{wavingturquoise}冒泡的药剂{text}，你十分好奇他是如何用单单的头骨弄出表情的。{speech}“主管，好意吾心领，然过客所言极是。此药何不另寻它用？”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>看来</>{gera}<text>并不接纳这般拒绝，她{shakingpurple}气愤地离开了{text}。</>{lelthas}<text>看向你，一边用那把巨大的{cyan}镶宝刀{text}敲着肩膀。</>\n"
"\n"
"{lelthasend}"

#. Key:	CDDE54DC446B99C81981C4852D95C24C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Gera_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "It's alive!  Almost..."
msgstr "朽骸凝肌"

#. Key:	9295A65441E5BB2AA89B37ABE6736A01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Standing next to a fruit-bearing cactus twice her size, a gnome in a white lab coat is going on and on about the benefits of enhanced flora. ”Gera, while I appreciate your…enthusiasm, I cannot accept this.”</>"
msgstr "<text>一位矮地灵身着白色实验室外套，站在一株比她高两倍的开花仙人掌旁，滔滔不绝地讲着基因增强型植物的好处。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“</><text s=\"gera\">吉拉</><text s=\"colorspeech\">，虽然我很欣赏你的...热情，但是我实在不能接受。”</>"

#. Key:	80DD9DF648D8336B65484388E0E6C32D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You find yourself staring at the agricultural marvel when Ki O' Dini speaks up.  “Excellent.  An unbiased party.  I implore you to share your thoughts.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>正当你观摩着这片农业奇迹时，</>{kiodini}<text>开口了。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“太棒了。来了个中立的家伙。来吧，说说你的想法。”</>"

#. Key:	550B42784705D8EF8E190FA1D15118C6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>There, a mighty</> <text s=\"kiodini\">Djinn{text} is rubbing their temple and shaking their head, while</> {gera} <text>explains the benefits of the massive {green}modified cacti{text} towering over them.  {speech}“And so, you see…in a few months that entire boring </><text s=\"desert\">desert{speech} will be a lush oasis.”</>"
msgstr "<text>一位强大的</><text s=\"kiodini\">灯魂{text}正在那里揉着自己的太阳穴，摇着头，而</>{gera}<text>则在解释着周遭屹立的巨大的{green}变种仙人掌{text}的好处。{speech}“所以我说...几个月后，整个无聊的</><text s=\"desert\">沙漠{speech}都将成为一片郁郁葱葱的绿洲。”</>"

#. Key:	41EC99F04D691E6E1C0E6E9D140EF34F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{gera} <text>turns to you, {purple}eavesdropping{text} in the doorway.  {speech}“You there?  Who are you?  It doesn’t matter, just tell them I’m right.”</>"
msgstr "{gera}<text>转向在门口{purple}偷听{text}的你。{speech}“哈喽？你是哪位？没关系的，快站出来告诉他，我才是对的。”</>"

#. Key:	BAB2690D47947D1E6A7F66991FD513EA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Conservation is key."
msgstr "顺其自然才是关键。"

#. Key:	670E80EB40BE585160969FB0C1750991
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "For science!"
msgstr "为了科学！"

#. Key:	6E61CA914E694E2B513CE3B48E69ECC7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{gera} <text>climbs down from her pedastal with a {gray}huff{text} and starts to walk off.  Pausing, she looks back at the two of you, {gray}huffs{text} again, then pulls out a {rainbow}strange-looking device{text} and vanishes in a {gold}beam{text} of light.  {speech}\"Don't worry about her.  She'll cool off...eventually.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{kiodiniend}"
msgstr ""
"{gera}<text>带着{gray}怒气{text}从她的座位上爬下来，然后迈步离开。她停下来，回头看了一眼你们两个，狠狠地{gray}哼{text}了一声，然后拿出一个外观奇特的{rainbow}装置{text}，消失在了一阵{gold}光束{text}中。{speech}“别担心她。她早晚会冷静下来的。”</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{kiodiniend}"

#. Key:	D4FAE47E4B6A14D5E104D99E5FBD2C7A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{kiodini} <text>narrows their eyes at you for a moment before sighing, fading away in a cloud of sand and disappointment.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{gera} <text> waves her hands frantically as the cloud of dust where the djinn once stood.  {speech}\"Wait, you forgot your...I swear, some people just do not appreciate my genius.\"  {text}She then turns to you, looking you over from atop her pedastal.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{geraend}"
msgstr ""
"{kiodini}<text>眯起眼睛看了你一会儿，然后叹了口气，消失在沙尘之中，留下的唯有失望。</>\n"
"\n"
"{gera}<text>对着灯魂刚才所站处那一片尘云疯狂地挥动着双手。{speech}“等等，你忘了你的...哎，有些人就是无法欣赏我的天才。”{text}她端正地调整坐姿，看向了你。</>\n"
"\n"
"{geraend}"

#. Key:	5EC23A274F57188C87BF5A98B4B38DD6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Gera.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Genes and Genies"
msgstr "基因与魔法"

#. Key:	9CB1EDE74557B6E50AA76692BF826D52
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>There you see</> {kiodini}<text>, the</> <text s=\"kiodini\">Teller of Tales{text}, shaking their head in frustration at the “young”</> <text s=\"lelthas\">Bone Prince</> {lelthas}<text>.  {speech}“I’m telling you, your highness…all stories must have an end.  This includes your subjects.  ‘Tis the cycle of life.”</>"
msgstr "<text>你看到</>{kiodini}<text>，那位熟悉的</><text s=\"kiodini\">逸事叙述者{text}，正在对“年轻的”</><text s=\"lelthas\">骨王子</>{lelthas}<text>摇头表达失望。{speech}“陛下，您也明白...每个故事均有结局，这也包括您的臣民，此乃大千世界生循之理。”</>"

#. Key:	FDD8B738458B07BD7BFB11B4F42A29F2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Once you are close enough, </>{kiodini} <text>turns to you. {speech} “You there, young one…a question.  How do you feel about immortality?”</>"
msgstr "<text>你一靠近，</>{kiodini}<text>就朝你倾身。{speech}“年轻人，你如何看待永生？”</>"

#. Key:	21AA8B0D41FACCE6F0E8D686C6F363AB
