#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{lelthas}<text>, also known as the</> <text s=\"graveyard\">Pale Prince{text}, is gesturing broadly at the {brown}hamlet{text} under his rule.  Alongside him, </>{kiodini}<text>, the</> <text s=\"desert\">Orator{text} of the </><text s=\"desert\">Oasis{text}, is listening intently.  {speech}“I hear thee, truly.  But ‘tis not a lord’s duty to ensure the longevity of his subjects?”</>"
msgstr "{lelthas}<text>，又被称为</><text s=\"graveyard\">苍白王子{text}，正大肆挥手指挥着他治下的{brown}小村落{text}。在他身边，</><text s=\"desert\">绿洲叙事师</>{kiodini}<text>正在全神贯注地倾听着。{speech}“吾知君意。然，护佑臣民安危，非领主之责乎？”</>"

#. Key:	F1642ADD4FA170AFD7653A980F66390C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Hearing your footsteps against the gravel road, the two beckon you over.  {speech}“Well met, traveler.  Wouldst thou consider a life free of pain and hunger abhorrent?”</>"
msgstr "<text>听到你在碎石路上的脚步声，这两人招呼你过去。{speech}“安好，旅者。岂不闻，无饥无苦之生，反为可憎耶？”</>"

#. Key:	7D3F6F2042AB1455A1B44C87B7B7462C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "All things end."
msgstr "万物均亡。"

#. Key:	653FA0CB422446DFD4255C87B44D57C4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "Eternity is divine."
msgstr "永恒至圣。"

#. Key:	49375CD341E82C9117E385AFB2E62633
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"You see, </><text s=\"lelthas\">Prince Lel'Thas{speech}...even our new friend here know that every good story must come to an end.\"  </>{lelthas}<text> says nothing, leaving you and the djinn alone.  {speech}\"Don't worry.  I'm sure he won't hold it against you.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{kiodiniend}"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“您也听到了，</><text s=\"lelthas\">王子陛下{speech}...即使我们的新朋友也知道，每个好故事都有个结局。”</>{lelthas}<text>一言不发，留下你和灯魂单独相处。{speech}“别担心，我相信他不会怪你的。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{kiodiniend}"

#. Key:	6004ACC047D3C7AEF441459EF21AB6A6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{lelthas} <text>places a hand on the djinn's shoulder, as if to reassure them.{speech}  \"I can assure you, my friend...it is the will of my people.  Life is a gift, and I only wish to enjoy it as long as possible.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The great genie returns home, kicking up sand all around the prince.{speech}  \"I just had this washed.  Now then...\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{lelthasend}"
msgstr ""
"{lelthas}<text>将一只手放在灯魂的肩膀上，像是在再次提醒他。{speech}“吾可向君保证，吾友...此皆民心所向。命乃天赐之礼，吾唯愿尽享其长久耳。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>强大的灯魂回家了，在王子周围卷起一阵沙子。{speech}“吾新浣之衣！罢了...”</>\n"
"\n"
"{lelthasend}"

#. Key:	10E28B47471BB522D177028E2CC977BB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
