msgid "{kiodini} <text>, the most renowned storyteller, is attempting to explain something to a great granite golem,</> {otto}<text>.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"No, no, no...it's not lying, persay.  It's...enhancing the story.  Sometimes, you just have to...exaggerate.  Embellish.\"</>"
msgstr "{kiodini}<text>，这位最著名的叙事师，正在试图向巨石偶</>{otto}<text>解释某件事情。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“我没有在说谎，这是为了增强故事效果。有时候，你需要夸张一点。”</>"

