msgid "<text>The</> <text s=\"elitefour\">two</> <text>look up at you as you draw near, with</> {otto}<text> speaking slowly.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"New friend not lie about eggs and relish, right?\"</>"
msgstr "<text>当你走近时，</><text s=\"elitefour\">两人</><text>抬头看着你，</>{otto}<text>缓慢地说道。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“你不是来扯这扯那的吧，朋友？”</>"

