msgid "Honesty is the best policy."
msgstr "诚实才是最佳品格。"

#. Key:	8B2FDAAB4333CA48B54CE8A5D1371F7F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{otto}<text> doesn't seem to understand.  He lifts one of his game pieces, speaking softly.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Father told Otto lying is cheating with words, and cheating always bad.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{kiodini}<text> puts a gentle hand on your shoulder, leading you away.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"He's a good kid.  He's just...stubborn in his ways.  We're working on that.  However...\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{kiodiniend}"
msgstr ""
"{otto}<text>似乎不理解。他举起其中一个游戏棋子，轻声说道。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“父亲告诉过奥托，说谎是用言语欺骗，欺骗总是不好的。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{kiodini}<text>温和地把手放在你的肩上，将你支走。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“他是个好孩子，就是...在个人方式上有点固执。我在尽力让他转变，不过说起来...”</>\n"
"\n"
"{kiodiniend}"

#. Key:	16690843478EC8C0354074A6A29D0C0F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{kiodini} <text>just rolls their eyes and scratches their head.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Oh, not you, too.  You understand what a story is, right?  We...nevermind.  See you later, kid.\"</>  <text>With a snap of their fingers, the</> <text s=\"kiodini\">genie</> <text>vanishes, leaving nothing but the</> <text s=\"desert\">scent of the desert</> <text>in their wake.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{ottoend}"
msgstr ""
"{kiodini}<text>翻了个白眼，挠着头。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“怎么你也一样。你知不知道故事这个词是什么意思？我们...哎算了。再见，小子。”</><text s=\"kiodini\">灯魂</><text>响指一弹，消失得只剩下身后漂散的</><text s=\"desert\">沙漠气息</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"{ottoend}"

#. Key:	1EE7C7DD4EC65946530D40B6288FEFEE
