msgid "{kiodini} <text>,a jovial djinn gesticulates towards the calm, elderly giantess known as</> {river}<text> as they explain the superiority of narration.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Believe me, young lady.  Words are worth a thousand pictures.\"</>"
msgstr "{kiodini}<text>，这位乐天的灯魂在向</>{river}<text>这位平静老巨人做手势，解释着自己说的话。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“请相信我，文字拥有抵过万图的能力。”</>"

#. Key:	1BAE0BE543ADE70A6440FEB2B0B1AB64
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_River.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
