#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>As you approach, the two look at you, the djinn beaming brightly.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Perhaps you'd like to help settle a friendly dispute between us.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>当你走近时，这两位看着你，灯魂欣喜地发出耀芒。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“你愿意来给我们友好的分歧评评理吗？”</>"

#. Key:	0FB2E45D466B0057B3217EA13E7B47DF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_River.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
