#. Key:	662609B94C17A39DFAA99A998F219058
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{skye}<text>, a young</> {elitefour} <text>technomancer, appears to be on the receiving end of a</><text s=\"shakingyellow\">lengthy lecture</> <text> from the long-winded orator</> {kiodini}<text>.  Judging by her</> <text s=\"colorgreen\">body language</><text>, she doesn't seem to be listening too much.</>"
msgstr "{skye}<text>，一位年轻的</>{elitefour}<text>科技法师，似乎正在接受长篇大论的</>{kiodini}<text></><text s=\"shakingyellow\">演说</><text>。从她的</><text s=\"colorgreen\">肢体语言</><text>来看，她似乎并不怎么在听。</>"

#. Key:	933332B14EFDD2746FFC2ABCB1A2D32B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{skye} <text>pipes up when she sees you approach.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"You there.  Yeah, you.  Would you tell grandy here there's nothing wrong with a little exploitation?\"</>"
msgstr "{skye}<text>看到你走过来时开口说话。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“那边那个，对，就是你。能不能告诉这老头，一点点开发能出什么错呢？”</>"

#. Key:	97A83C924E797C3A0A966AAA144FBC01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Nature should be preserved."
msgstr "自然应被留存。"

#. Key:	19030BB64A5B5876FE188C8158D4F658
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "Tech is the future."
msgstr "科技才是未来。"

#. Key:	2E387E7A4AB88D3F07163D84087D0CA5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{skye} <text>throws her hands up and grumbles, her suit making a series of angry huffs and whirs as if it was annoyed too.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Whatever.  I'm going back to my workshop.  At least they appreciate me.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As she stomps off,</> {kiodini} <text>shakes their head.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"She's young.  She'll cool down eventually.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{kiodiniend}"
msgstr ""
"{skye}<text>举起双手，嘟囔着，她的机械服也似乎在发出不满的噪音。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“随便吧。我要回我的造坊了，至少我的造物们欣赏我。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>她大步离去，</>{kiodini}<text>摇了摇头。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“她还年轻，肯定会冷静下来的。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{kiodiniend}"

#. Key:	2875D5664CB2076AD7468DBF0A22921D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{kiodini} <text>shakes their head as a</> <text s=\"desert\">desert wind</> <text>surrounds them.  As they vanish, their voice rings out.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Kids these days...\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{skye}<text s=\"skye\">'s</> <text>armor make a sound that could be mistaken for laughter if it wasn't inanimate.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Oh yeah...you know what I think about that?\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{skyeend}"
msgstr ""
"{kiodini}<text>在</><text s=\"desert\">沙漠风</><text>的环绕下摇了摇头。在消失之际，他的声音响起。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“现在的孩子们...”</>\n"
"\n"
"{skye}<text>的盔甲响了一下，貌似在笑一样。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“哦对了...你知道我对此有何看法吗？”</>\n"
"\n"
"{skyeend}"

#. Key:	BD0AA14043D91D059A9F2FAA3FE9E11C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Kiodini_Vs_Skye.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Paving Paradise"
msgstr "共筑乐土"

#. Key:	FC1C4B1047258C9CD00031BAD7BBF6DF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You see a </><text s=\"gera\">gnomish woman{text} teetering on a tall ladder, peering at what appears to be the </><text s=\"otto\">cavern wall{text}when it suddenly blinks.  {speech}\"It won't hurt you, I promise.  I took it right before our game and I feel fine.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>你看到一个</><text s=\"gera\">女矮地灵{text}在高高的梯子上摇摇欲坠，似乎正盯着</><text s=\"otto\">洞穴墙壁{text}，然后这栋“墙”眨了眨眼。{speech}“我保证它无害，因为我在游戏前服用了，现在感觉很好。”</>"

#. Key:	C646BF1B46D5A94CA1F99FB8087DF58C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{otto}<text> gently lifts the </><text s=\"gera\">Director{text} up by her lab coat and sets her on a table.  {speech}\"Otto not need enhancing.  Otto just want to bo Otto.\"  {text}Those big, gray eyes fall on you, inviting you to weigh in.</>"
msgstr "{otto}<text>轻轻地拽住</><text s=\"gera\">研究主管{text}的实验服，将她放在桌子上。{speech}“奥托不需要增强。奥托只想做奥托。”{text}说罢那双灰色的大眼睛落在了你身上，暗示你参与讨论。</>"

#. Key:	C668208B4908FD5F74E56BBB956B5E89
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You see a large </><text s=\"otto\">living statue{text} hunched down, trying to listen to </>{gera}<text> as she speaks excitedly.  {speech}\"So, you see, I can't test it on myself because the effects would be unnoticable.  That's why you're here.  Are you paying attention?\"</>"
msgstr "<text>你看到一位庞大的</><text s=\"otto\">活雕像{text}弯下腰，尝试聆听</>{gera}<text>的兴奋谈话。{speech}“所以是这样，这个药我没法自己测试，因为效果不够明显。这就是叫你来的原因，明白了吗？”</>"

#. Key:	502EE94C41DA2F49069E84BB9D2A9100
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Your {black}shadow{text} draws her attention, and she calls you inside.  {speech}\"You look almost as bright as this big boulder, maybe you can explain it to him in words you both understand?</>"
msgstr "<text>你的{black}影子{text}引起了她的注意，她叫你也进去。{speech}“你的聪明劲看起来和这个大块头差不多，你应该能用你们的共通语言向他解释一下？</>"

#. Key:	90B910D34F636E02FE90F8A7B439137D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Cracks make us unique."
msgstr "瑕玉独一无二。"

#. Key:	F81D2EF74CC5DD4B3CC6AEB0227D873F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "Think of it like polish."
msgstr "瑕玉亦可雕琢。"

#. Key:	7ABDF7074C2A949B63107C91807EC14A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The</> <text s=\"gera\">maniacal gnome{text} fumes and scowls.  {speech}\"Why should I expect a buffoon to appreciate my genius?  Otto, at least, I can explain.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Without another word, </>{gera}<text> pulls out a {rainbow}strange device{text} from her jacket and vanishes in a flash, leaving only {shakingorange}disdain{text} in her wake.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{ottoend}"
msgstr ""
"<text></><text s=\"gera\">发狂的矮子{text}恼怒地阴沉着脸。{speech}“我果然不该期待一个小丑能欣赏我的天才。对于奥托，至少我还可以谅解。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text></>{gera}<text>二话不说，从大衣里掏出一个{rainbow}奇怪装置{text}一闪消失，仅留下她赤裸裸的{shakingorange}蔑视{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{ottoend}"

#. Key:	9577147A49F144FDB468D9A9FCE6DA29
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The great </><text s=\"otto\">golem's{text} maw opens, but before he can speak, </>{gera}<text> dumps the contents of the {wavingcyan}vial{text} into his mouth.  After a few moments, she sighs, climbing down from her ladder.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Subject unresponsive.  Further invesitgation required.  Did you get...right, they're still miniaturized...\"  {text}Her eyes then fall on you and she shrugs, {pink}beckoning{text} you closer.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{geraend}"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"otto\">巨石偶{text}张开了一道口，但他还没说一句话，</>{gera}<text>就把{wavingcyan}小瓶{text}中的内容物都倒进了他嘴里。过了一会儿，她叹了口气，从梯子上爬了下来。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“实验对象无反应，需要后续调查。我是不是弄...哦！那些成份还是浓缩的...”{text}接着她的目光落在了你身上，她耸耸肩，{pink}示意{text}你靠近。</>\n"
"\n"
"{geraend}"

#. Key:	22323CDA41FA6EEFF52751877222D162
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Gera.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Rocky Road to Perfection"
msgstr "求全艰途"

#. Key:	37DE14BC487F776E7A66B78950C5ADA7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{otto}<text>, the</> <text s=\"caverns\">granite tactician{text}, is sitting across from</> <text s=\"lelthas\">Prince Lel'Thas{text}, both concentrating on a game of chess.  Seeing danger imminent, </>{otto}<text> moves his king behind his rook.</>"
msgstr "{otto}<text>, 这位</><text s=\"caverns\">岩石策士{text}，正坐着与</><text s=\"lelthas\">莱尔萨斯王子{text}一同专心下棋。感受到形势危急，</>{otto}<text>将国王移到战车后方。</>"

#. Key:	D6E39B764B25295C402AFEAA2C100A1B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{otto}<text>, noticing you watching the game, speaks up.  {speech}\"Otto always protect friends.  Keep friends safe.  Then every friend is winner.  Right, friend?\"</>"
msgstr "{otto}<text>注意到你在观棋，便开口说道：{speech}“奥托总是保护朋友。让朋友安全。然后所有朋友都是赢家。对吗，朋友？”</>"

#. Key:	C803495B4986F23605225AA7B5DCBA6D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You approach an intense game of chess, with the </><text s=\"graveyard\">bloodless royal{text}, </>{lelthas}<text> on white and </>{otto}<text>, a</> <text s=\"caverns\">childlike strategist{text} on black.</>"
msgstr "<text>你靠近他们，开始观摩一盘激烈的棋局。</><text s=\"graveyard\">无血贵族</>{lelthas}<text>执白，而童心未泯的策略家</>{otto}<text>执黑。</>"

#. Key:	8B73A6E04CF2F98B3880E1909D12758B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{lelthas}<text> thinks, then slides his queen right into the open.  {speech}\"Sometimes, thy victory can only come at great cost.  Thou must be willing to make sacrifices, or thou may lose everything.  Wouldst thou agree?\"</>"
msgstr "{lelthas}<text>思考片刻，然后将皇后移至旷地。{speech}“夫胜者，有时必以巨偿易之。舍而不为，则万事休矣。君以为然否？”</>"

#. Key:	2D0E69754620178606E50C987AB1ACAC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "The best defense."
msgstr "严防死守。"

#. Key:	60AF984642ADEFAAAD399A9C15D33E97
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "A good offense."
msgstr "破敌制胜。"

#. Key:	6FAE97B54857FBB4820FCBA80F9715F1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The game continues for several moments, with </>{lelthas}<text> taking riskier moves.  In the end, </>{otto}<text> proves his tenacity for strategy, end in the white king's surrender.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Beaten, the </><text s=\"lelthas\">prince{text} leaves you with a piece of advice.  {speech}\"When I see thee on the battlefield, I shall show thee true strategy.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{otto}<text> looks looks up at you, motioning to the newly vacant seat.  {speech}\"New friend know how to play Otto's favorite game?  Otto teach.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>棋局持续了一段时间，</>{lelthas}<text>走了几步险着。结果</>{otto}<text>展现了他顽强的战略，导致白方国王投降。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>被击败后，</><text s=\"lelthas\">王子{text}给你们撂下话：{speech}“战场之日，定当示汝等以真方略。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{otto}<text>看着你，向刚空出的座位动了动。{speech}“新朋友知道怎么玩奥托最喜欢的游戏？奥托教。”</>"

#. Key:	7C50AA8F4B9E2E348945E7843B386076
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>It was a bold move, and it seemed to have paid off.  The game seemed to snowball from there, finally ending in </>{lelthas}<text s=\"lelthas\">'{text} victory.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{otto}<text> rises from his seat, retreating to his home to contemplate the game's strategy.  The</> <text s=\"lelthas\">prince{text} turns to you, smiling those pearly white teeth.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{lelthasend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>那歩棋颇为大胆，但却有奇效。棋局走向自此清晰起来，最后的赢家是</>{lelthas}<text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"{otto}<text>站了起来，反思着刚才的策略回家去了。</><text s=\"lelthas\">王子{text}面向你，笑出了一口大白牙。</>\n"
"\n"
"{lelthasend}"

#. Key:	CC8A90404F19F710EC45F0B11D8CF75A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Otto_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Tactical Advantage"
msgstr "战术优势"

#. Key:	A9A2D92745FDE86B66DA8390C8016E99
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>It's an odd sight to be sure, a gnome and a giant side by side, yet </>{gera}<text> doesn't seem phased in the slightest.  {speech}\"It's called {rainbow}Rainbow Dye {speech}, sourced from...well, it doesn't matter where it comes from.  The important thing is that it will leave you more time to do...whatever it is your people do.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>确是一处奇怪的景象，一位矮地灵与一位巨人正对着交谈，但</>{gera}<text>似乎没有一点不适感。{speech}“这就是{rainbow}彩虹染料{speech}，源自...额，它源自哪不重要。重要的是它能给你更多的时间做...你想做的事。”</>"

#. Key:	A6A0347740C46264A2C437BBBFD551EC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{river} <text>looks unimpressed, and beckons you over to intervene, preferably on her behalf.</>"
msgstr "{river}<text>看起来不为所动，她示意你过去插一句，最好是站在她那一边。</>"

#. Key:	D51BF43F407B564DD86B88925B8DC572
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{river} <text>shakes her head at the fablist and turns to you.  She says nothing, but her eyes impore you to offer your</> <text s=\"colorgreen\">opinion</> <text>on the subject.</>"
msgstr "{river}<text>对那位讲故事的人摇了摇头，然后转向你。她没有说话，但她的眼神示意你关于这个话题提出自己的</><text s=\"colorgreen\">意见</><text>。</>"

#. Key:	EA098CB9476A1A995C7E6287CF021470
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Art can't be rushed."
msgstr "艺术无法速成。"

#. Key:	303F38DF45D5510E10466388659C9A1B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "All work and no play..."
msgstr "只干不休怎么活..."

#. Key:	6555D4F1413612E40B0F4E9A38259733
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{gera} <text>gets a rather indignant look on her face, stuffing the {rainbow}multicolored{text} vial in pocket and putting her hands on her hips.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Well, I never.  You big...big...Humph.\"  {text}Seemingly at a loss for words, </>{gera} <text>fishes a device from another pocket, {gray}scowls{text} once more, and vanishes in a {gold}beam{text} of light.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{riverend}"
msgstr ""
"{gera}<text>露出相当愤懑的表情，将{rainbow}多彩{text}小瓶塞进了口袋，将双手放在自己的臀部上。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“行，反正我不在乎。你这个大...大笨...哼！”{text}她似乎一时失语，</>{gera}<text>从另一个口袋里掏出一个设备，再次{gray}皱起眉头{text}，然后消失在一阵{gold}光束{text}中。</>\n"
"\n"
"{riverend}"

#. Key:	81C3D4D649C8BA4E2A0EF9B4BD20E930
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Rather pleased with herself,</> {gera} <text>slips the vial into the giant's palm.  {speech}\"And don't worry.  I can acquire more whenever necessary.  Just not too often.  I'm very busy.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Turning towards you, </>{gera}<text> adjusts her glasses and peers up at you.  Looking over the</> <text s=\"gera\">gnome{text}, however, you notice </>{river} {blue}frown{text} a little, pouring the contents of the {rainbow}vial{text} into a nearby {actname+1}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{geraend}"
msgstr ""
"<text></>{gera}<text>心满意足地将小瓶塞进巨人的掌中。{speech}“别担心，有需要我可以搞更多。不过别太频繁了，我还是很忙的。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text></>{gera}<text>扶了扶眼镜，转过头看着你。然而，越过这位</><text s=\"gera\">矮地灵{text}，你注意到</>{river}<text></>{blue}皱了皱眉{text}，把{rainbow}小瓶{text}中的东西洒在了附近的{actname+1}里。</>\n"
"\n"
"{geraend}"

#. Key:	95A3B6384474706CCCF57B9AD4CAFF38
