#. Key:	E3459C5844C9D98A82917197C7FBB779
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{river}<text>, a</> <text s=\"city\">skald{text} and </><text s=\"city\">seamstress{text}, appears to be quite annoyed judging by her countenance.  The </><text s=\"graveyard\">skeletal sovereign{text},</> {lelthas}<text>, has apparently commissioned a new piece of art, and is demanding his grim visage be the main focus.</>"
msgstr "{river}<text>这位</><text s=\"city\">旗艺师{text}从脸色来看十分难堪。那位</><text s=\"graveyard\">骷髅君主</>{lelthas}<text>，下达了一件新艺术品的制作指示，并要求他可怖的面容作为主要关注点。</>"

#. Key:	F9EFDC7F488FE75D6FC8899676F6FB5E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Rubbing her temples, she silently pleads to talk some sense into what she no doubt deems a </><text s=\"lelthas\">royal{text} pain.</>"
msgstr "<text>她揉着脑侧，默默地恳求你能对耍</><text s=\"lelthas\">王威{text}的对方讲讲理。</>"

#. Key:	5D4D339E4FEBAEA832B02E9170763274
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Posing in his most {cyan}regal{text} fashion,</> {lelthas}<text>, </><text s=\"graveyard\">lord{text} of these </><text s=\"graveyard\">lands{text}, rests against his blade.  Sitting nearby,</> {river}<text>, a</> <text s=\"city\">weaver{text} of</> <text s=\"city\">sagas{text}, is doing her best to tune out the {cyan}prince’s{text} demands.</>"
msgstr "<text>这片</><text s=\"graveyard\">地区{text}的</><text s=\"graveyard\">领主</>{lelthas}<text>倚靠着他的剑，摆出最{cyan}威严{text}的姿态。而就在他身旁，</><text s=\"city\">史旗编织者</>{river}<text>正在尽力拒绝{cyan}王子{text}的无理要求。</>"

#. Key:	EE7F8EF44F9F24312A453096ABFE8C5E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>As you wander over to see what the fuss is about, </>{lelthas}<text> addresses you.  {speech}“Greetings, friend.  Wouldst thou be so kind as to remind this fair maiden that a king is a symbol to be seen by all his subjects, not some background set piece?”</>"
msgstr "<text>当你走近查看究竟发生了什么，</>{lelthas}<text>向你搭话。{speech}“且住，良友。敢烦卿雅言转喻：帝王者，万民景仰如日月悬天，非可没于众星之列也。愿彼之佳人慎思之？”</>"

#. Key:	918188FD4E88B26BF9EDC787A0F4653D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Trust the artist."
msgstr "无匠则无市。"

#. Key:	9D59D4854EABEDB76461739866045B31
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "The customer's always right."
msgstr "顾客是上帝。"

#. Key:	B3EED402479D74DC7CA48CBE0F8F3338
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>It's hard to tell the</> <text s=\"lelthas\">Prince's{text} expression from just a skull, but something tells you he isn't amused.  Hoisting his </><text s=\"wavingturquoise\">massive blade{text} over his shoulder, he struts off, cape billowing in the wind.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{riverend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你很难从</><text s=\"lelthas\">王子{text}的骨面判断他的表情，但显然他不太欣喜。将他的</><text s=\"wavingturquoise\">巨刃{text}扛在肩上后，他阔步离开，留下风中的披风鼓噪声。</>\n"
"\n"
"{riverend}"

#. Key:	D4FDA47F43D69ACA1C4559B256F225E8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{lelthas}<text> reaches up to put a bony hand on </>{river}<text s=\"river\">'s{text} shoulder.  {speech}\"Perhaps it would be best to continue this another time, my lady.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>With grace, </>{river}<text> rises to her feet, gathering her banners and heading deeper into the city as </>{lelthas}<text> turns to you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{lelthasend}"
msgstr ""
"{lelthas}<text>伸出一只骨感十足的手放到</>{river}<text>的肩膀上。{speech}“此事容后再议，尊意何如？”</>\n"
"\n"
"{river}<text>优雅地站了起来，卷起了战旗向城里走去。而</>{lelthas}<text>则看向了你。</>\n"
"\n"
"{lelthasend}"

#. Key:	F7A6C1734CB550BE150FE79C90947841
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "You're So Vain"
msgstr "嶙峋傲气"

#. Key:	88899BC247F33DF670A7069527E171DB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{otto}<text>, a child-like construct, is sitting across from the silent skald known as</> {river}<text>, at some sort of game.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Otto not understand.  How Otto know what color lie is?  Words use ears, not eyes.\"</>"
msgstr "{otto}<text>，一名心智如孩童般的巨构体，坐在默不作声的旗艺师</>{river}<text>对面，进行某种游戏。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“奥托不明白。奥托怎么知道谎言是什么颜色？话语用耳朵，不用眼睛。”</>"

#. Key:	3ACB1181461F7006B3BC4BA9882667C8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#. Key:	64F7EF4B48BCBD6CDEE63FA4C600F45A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
msgid "{otto} <text>looks up as you get closer, speaking slowly.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"New friend.  Lies bad in all colors, yes?  White and blue and red and...\"</>"
msgstr "{otto}<text>在你走近时抬起头，慢慢地说道，</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“新朋友，谎言在所有颜色中都是坏，是吗？白色和蓝色和红色和...”</>"

#. Key:	C715D4C64EE135F802C153B1C753F150
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{otto}<text>, a child-like construct, is sitting across from the silent skald known as</> {river}<text>, at some sort of game.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Otto not understand.  How Otto know what color lie is?  Words use ears, not eyes.  Silly friend lady.\"</>"
msgstr "{otto}<text>，一名心智如孩童般的巨构体，坐在默不作声的旗艺师</>{river}<text>对面，进行某种游戏。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“奥托不明白。奥托怎么知道谎言是什么颜色？话语用耳朵，不用眼睛。傻女士朋友。”</>"

#. Key:	EA2D2F774C45533B5836A2968290777E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Sometimes truth hurts."
msgstr "真相才是快刀。"

#. Key:	89B936D644D80232F4A0E3A9AD95D14B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "Lies always hurt."
msgstr "谎言总是伤人。"

#. Key:	0BA7C13A44026DC9928CE8AA6988F082
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{otto}<text> puts his chin in his hand, thinking deeply.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Is like...friend strategy?  Lie make friend feel good...feel like winner.  Not hurt anyone.  Otto should practice new strategy.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The two of you leave the</> <text s=\"otto\">golem</> <text>to work on his</> <text s=\"colororange\">social skills</> <text>in private.  You can hear him in the distance,</> <text s=\"colorpink\">complimenting</> <text>his game pieces.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>To thank you for your assistance in such a delicate matter, </>{river}<text> presents a variety of</> <text s=\"rainbow\">beautifully crafted banners</> <text>for you to pick from.</>"
msgstr ""
"{otto}<text>用手撑着下巴，认真地思考着。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“就像...朋友的策略？谎言让朋友感觉好...感觉赢。不伤害人。我觉得应该练习新技巧。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你们二位离开</><text s=\"otto\">巨偶</><text>，好让他私下练习</><text s=\"colororange\">社交技巧</><text>。你可以听到他在远处</><text s=\"colorpink\">称赞</><text>他的棋子们。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>为了感谢你的帮助，</>{river}<text>为你提供了各种</><text s=\"rainbow\">精美的战旗</><text>供挑选。</>"

#. Key:	40CE1EBE4F1696275F3DF987F846C265
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{river} <text>snickers a little, shaking her head and putting a hand on each of your shoulders.  She</> <text s=\"colorpink\">pauses</> <text>for a moment, then</> <text s=\"colorpurple\">smirks</> <text>before departing, leaving the two of you alone.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{otto} <text>looks a bit confused at what just happened, but his</> <text s=\"rainbow\">mood</> <text>changes when he offers you a seat.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Otto just wanted to play favorite game.  New friend know how to play?  Otto teach.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"{river}<text>咯咯地笑了笑，摇着头，双手放在你的双肩上。</><text>她</><text s=\"colorpink\">停顿</><text>了一下，然后</><text s=\"colorpurple\">苦苦一笑</><text>并离开，让你们两人单独在一起。</>\n"
"\n"
"{otto}<text>对此感到困惑，但他的</><text s=\"rainbow\">情绪</><text>在你就座时立刻转变。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“奥托只是想玩最喜欢的游戏。新朋友你会玩吗？奥托教。”</>"

#. Key:	976CB2144B5DCC545BA6D1B04F6117ED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Otto.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Little White Lies"
msgstr "白色谎言"

#. Key:	508E9B624977375EF7AC05B3254959EA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{river}<text>, the silent yet stoic</> {elitefour}<text> is giving a very disapproving look at the artificer</> {skye}<text>, surrounded by a number of machinations.  It seems that</> {skye}<text> is trying to convince her to use machines to improve productivity.</>"
msgstr "{river}<text>，这位沉默但坚韧的</>{elitefour}<text>对着身边一堆机械的工艺师</>{skye}<text>投以非常不满的目光。看起来</>{skye}<text>正在尝试说服对方使用机器来提高生产力。</>"

#. Key:	B1A7C6934A58DC457EE0BFBBF0544623
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Moving closer, the two turn towards you.  It seems that they need an unbiased opinion to settle the matter.</>"
msgstr "<text>你靠近一点，两人转向你。看起来她们需要一个不偏袒任何一方的意见来解决这个争论。</>"

#. Key:	19D89B9D4609561E976BBB90D326BEA7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{skye}<text>, a talented machinist, has invited the titanic seamstress</> {river}<text> to her workshop.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"I'm tellin' ya, ol' girl...A couple of these bad boys and you can put out twice as many of those picture things.  You know you want to.\"</>"
msgstr "{skye}<text>是一位天才机械师，她邀请了巨匠</>{river}<text>来她的工作坊。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“老姐...试试这几个玩意吧，它们可以把你的编织效率提高两倍以上。你不想来一个吗？”</>"

#. Key:	AB3021DC491A28D004BCCD9B194304CF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{skye}<text s=\"skye\">'s</> <text>words seem lost on the giant, so she turns to you, as though you might be able to be more convincing.</>"
msgstr "{skye}<text>的话似乎对那位巨人无济于事，所以她寄望你可以说点什么。</>"

#. Key:	CB7C72B247A787A74D1C28BE21FD7C9F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Less is more."
msgstr "精可胜多。"

#. Key:	E687393941D6A85265271FB848CC6E86
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "More is more."
msgstr "多多益善。"

#. Key:	FDD418634712624485C0D3A7D50D92A8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Much to</> {river}<text s=\"river\">'s</> <text>delight, you agree that</> <text s=\"colorblue\">automation</> <text>would lose the</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">uniqueness</> <text>of each banner.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Defeated,</> {skye}<text> makes a motion to her</> <text s=\"colorgray\">robotic companions</><text>.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Come on boys.  Let's get outta here.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{riverend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你同意</>{river}<text>的观点，而她乐于见之。</><text s=\"colorblue\">流水线</><text>的确会剥夺每面战旗的</><text s=\"colorcyan\">独特性</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"{skye}<text>愤愤而羞，示意她的</><text s=\"colorgray\">机器伙伴们</><text>：</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“走吧，伙计们。我们离开这里。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{riverend}"

#. Key:	882DBE724FEBEC353D1DB18C054B017E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{river} <text>lets out a</> <text s=\"colorpurple\">long, disappointed sigh</><text>.  Shaking her head, she simply turns and walks away.  You can't help feel like you've</> <text s=\"shakingcyan\">upset</> <text>her.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{skye} <text>chimes in, seeing the</> <text s=\"colorblue\">guilt</> <text>on your face.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"I wouldn't worry about her too much.  She's as stubborn as she is old.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{skyeend}"
msgstr ""
"{river}<text>发出一声</><text s=\"colorpurple\">长叹</><text>，摇了摇头单纯地转身离开。你不禁觉得自己已经</><text s=\"shakingcyan\">惹恼</><text>了她。</>\n"
"\n"
"{skye}<text>掺杂进来，察觉了你脸上的</><text s=\"colorblue\">歉意</><text>。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“不用太担心她，她和她的年纪一样固执。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{skyeend}"

#. Key:	9079AD2E444538FBE6FA5588DD0221F5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_River_Vs_Skye.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Honest Work"
msgstr "匠心效械"

#. Key:	52CBAD3543A777FB67322398F8A8C646
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Standing on a small ladder, </>{gera}<text> peers intently at </>{skye's}<text> latest creation.  A miniature, mechanical</> <text s=\"gera\">Director{text}, staring back at her.  {speech}\"Few more o' these little fellas and you can give your researchers a vacation, eh?\"</>"
msgstr "<text></>{gera}<text>站在小梯子上，专注地观察</>{skye}<text>的最新创造物——微型</><text s=\"gera\">主管{text}机器人。{speech}“再多几个这样的家伙，你们的研究人员不就能休个长假了，是不？”</>"

#. Key:	3935DC3E407E2722964A2597203D1183
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{gera}<text> furrows a brow, scoffing.  {speech}\"My people are the best and brightest.  They can't be replaced by some paperweight.  Isn't that right, person standing in the door\"?</>"
msgstr "{gera}<text>皱起眉头，嘲笑道。{speech}“我们的人最优秀最聪慧，一堆破铜烂铁可无法取代他们。站在门口的人，你说是吧？”</>"

#. Key:	8B1068A649D48B82758AE4B7D10AE277
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"I call it {wavingturquoise}Lightspeed{speech}.  With this, your workers will have an increase efficiency of at least 67%.  I recommend adding it directly to the water source for rapid distribution.\"  </>{skye} <text>rolls her eyes, turning to the doorway to see you standing there.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“这就是我说的{wavingturquoise}光速{speech}。有了它，你的工人们将至少提高 67% 的效率。我建议将其直接添加到水源中，这样就能快速散播了。”</>{skye}<text>翻了翻白眼，把头转向门口，看到了站在那的你。</>"

#. Key:	BD3682424FFA8801C0A2BD8272B4C61D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Oh, thank Hedra.  Hey you!  Tell her ain't no sense in makin' folk do more work when machines can do it without putting who knows what in their body, yeah?\"</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“哦谢天谢地。嘿！那边那位，麻烦你告诉她，既然机器已经可以干更多活，往人身体里打些不清不楚的东西完全没有意义，不是吗？”</>"

#. Key:	EF41BCF04F29DD77C52282884D3F4635
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Work smarter, not harder."
msgstr "算力胜过脑力。"

#. Key:	96A49D8C4DD4F650386D99A74010D991
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "Teamwork makes dreamwork."
msgstr "众志才能筑梦。"

#. Key:	07A84971414402D218DCDF998C1F9853
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{skye} <text>gives you a wink from behind her visor.  {speech}\"See, G?  I mean, what'dya think is gonna happen?  They rise up and start a robot revolution?  I assure you, that hasn't happened in like...weeks.\"</>"
msgstr "{skye}<text>透过她的面罩向你眨了眨眼。{speech}“你看吧，阿吉？你不会在想它们奋起反抗掀起一场智械危机吧？我明确地告诉你这种事没发生过...至少几个星期内是这样。”</>"

#. Key:	FF2C5F64465D942F3F29A58D3446628D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Rolling her eyes, </>{gera}<text> produces a small remote, presses a button, and disappears in a flash.  On the workbench, the mini-gnome sits and sighs.  You can't help but reach over and pet it.</>"
msgstr "{gera}<text>翻了个白眼，拿出一个小遥控器按下按钮，然后瞬间消失。那架微型机器人不禁叹了口气，你也忍不住抚摸它以表同情。</>"

#. Key:	6D8AF3DF4E29FF5078AB209A183404CB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{skye} <text>lifts off her welding mask to smile at you, putting a hand on your shoulder.  {speech}\"I guess some {playerRacePlural} got some common sense after all.  Tryin' to poison my employees with some...\"</>"
msgstr "{skye}<text>摘下了她的面罩，对你微笑着，将一只手放在你的肩膀上。{speech}“我想有些{playerRacePlural}还是有一些常识的。还敢用这玩意毒害我的员工...”</>"

#. Key:	4B528C274C536DD8E759D4BFD072EA1A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Looking back at </>{gera}<text>, you could swear you see {gray}steam{text} coming from her ears.  {speech}\"Well, I never...\"</>  {skye} <text>gives you a little wink, waving at the Director as she fumed.  {speech}\"Uh huh.  Okay, buh-bye now.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>你回头看向</>{gera}<text>，她的耳朵里貌似冒出了{gray}蒸汽{text}。{speech}“哎，反正我也没...”</>{skye}<text>对你眨了眨眼，又向一阵阵冒烟的研究主管挥了挥手。{speech}“呃哦，成了，回见。”</>"

#. Key:	14772C764355F56908A106B2BA27CF80
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{gera} <text>picks up the little {gray}machine{text}, inspects it again, then sets it back down.  {speech}\"</>{skye}<text s=\"colorspeech\">, please...do not waste my time with toys.  I have much to do, and now less time to do it in.\"</>"
msgstr "{gera}<text>拿起那个{gray}小机器{text}，复察了一下它，然后放回原处。{speech}“</>{skye}<text s=\"colorspeech\">，拜托...别用玩具浪费我的生命。我有很多的事情，以及很少的时间。”</>"

#. Key:	528390884B56FA6E43B11AB514EDA928
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">And as for you...\"  </>{gera} <text>turns to you with the same scrutiny.  Behind her, you see the {gray}micro-clone{text} sticking its tongue out and making a {wavingpink}silly face{text}.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“至于你...”</>{gera}<text>用同样的审视目光转过头看向你，同时你注意到她后面那个{gray}微型克隆体{text}吐舌做了一个{wavingpink}鬼脸{text}。</>"

#. Key:	DDE7F5F14A3D6F424B7B92B5C057267B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{gera} <text>nods at the mech-gineer, motioning towards you.  {speech}\"See that?  Even they can recognize brilliance when they see it.\"  </>{skye} <text>just rolls her eyes, shakes her head, and walks off.</>"
msgstr "{gera}<text>向机械师点点头，向你示意。{speech}“看到了吗？就算这种人都能看出来谁才是天才。”</>{skye}<text>只是翻了翻白眼，摇了摇头，然后走开了。</>"

#. Key:	112CE71C41F69BBED222D688B0DC17FA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Don't worry...I'll send my assistant to deliver it to you.  Now...where to find an assistant...?\"  {text}Tapping her chin, </>{gera}<text> looks off for a moment before settling her eyes on you once more.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“别担心...我会派我的助理给你送来的。现在...我是不是还得先找个助理...？”{text}轻拍几下下巴后，</>{gera}<text>四处张望了一会儿，然后再次将目光落在了你身上。</>"

#. Key:	C9AB80484DEC9405521187905F386623
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Gera.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Man Versus Machine"
msgstr "人与机器"

#. Key:	120F88414569B99FAB68ECBB0B4FBA90
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“They don’t got no feelings, dude.  They're machines.  Metal for brains.  Mindless, soulless automatons.”{text}  It would seem</> {skye}<text>, the </><text s=\"factory\">genius machinist{text}, is arguing with the </><text s=\"graveyard\">fleshless nobleman{text}, </>{lelthas}<text>, on which eternal servitude is more ethical.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“他们没有感情，伙计。他们是机器，脑袋装铁、没有思想、没有灵魂的自动体。”{text}看起来</><text s=\"factory\">天才机械师</>{skye}<text>，正在与</><text s=\"graveyard\">无肉贵族</>{lelthas}<text>，争论哪种永久奴役更加人道。</>"

#. Key:	0AFBE3EC42B3E33472C5519BD892A42D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{skye} <text>removes her hood as you draw near.  {speech}“Oiy, you there.  Need an opinion.  I know you been listening in, so might as well get involved.”</>"
msgstr "<text>在你靠近时，</>{skye}<text>揭开她兜帽的挡风罩。{speech}“哟，那边的你。我需要个意见。知道你一直在听，所以也干脆参与进来吧。”</>"

#. Key:	B6C8AB8C409F0F2199A7659ACBAD0E9F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(4
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“My dear girl, doth thou not giveth thy subjects a choice of how to spendeth their immortal lives?  One does not need flesh to have rights.”{text}  You find it odd that</> {lelthas}<text>, the </><text s=\"graveyard\">Saunek Monarch{text}, is giving the</> <text s=\"factory\">technomancer</> {skye}<text> a lecture on morality.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“客卿，岂不容汝之臣民长生之道耶？行权无关肉身与否。”{text}你感到很诧异，</><text s=\"graveyard\">墓园君主</>{lelthas}<text>居然在对</><text s=\"factory\">机械师</>{skye}<text>大谈特谈仁义道德。</>"

#. Key:	FE154A774F05190123C96198A2C881AD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Noticing you eavesdropping, he calls on you.  {speech}“As an unaffiliated third party…what dost thou think of forcing one’s servants to do thy bidding?”</>"
msgstr "<text>他注意到你在偷听，于是把你叫住。{speech}“卿乃陌路之人...试问强令仆役效命于己用，当如何耶？”</>"

#. Key:	099B91F14D37636394FA399BE74C015F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextLeft_67_437043ED494B6BCFF886D7B797E6057C
msgid "Tools, not jewels."
msgstr "役器如己臂。"

#. Key:	2B9AE4204716D63C6DD39D9B0F025566
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.ChoicePhaseUseTwoArtMode-SubtextRight_69_3F36DDE74F9C94222FB62CBF461E6FCE
msgid "Autonomy for all!"
msgstr "予众以自由。"

#. Key:	8EEA431A42D20C5DCAE22D86DF06891A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">Now that's what I'm talkin' about.  By the way, I'm totally going to steal that line.  Now why don't you get back on your high horse and let me get back to what I was doing.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{lelthas} <text>huffs, looking rather indignant, and returns toward his palace.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{skyeend}\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“说到我心头上了，顺便你这个金句我得好好借鉴一下。那么君主先生，请您重回高位，我得回去作业了。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{lelthas}<text>神色颇为愤慨，嗤笑转身朝自己的宫殿去了。</>\n"
"\n"
"{skyeend}\n"

#. Key:	4950B8984DB689DCB6D17FB49A7379A4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{skye}<text> furrows her brow, her annoyed look accented by a series or unamused chirps from a small minibot perched on her shoulder.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"You know what.  I don't have to take this anymore.  We're going home.\"{text}  As she heads toward her workshop, </>{lelthas}<text> extends a bony hand.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{lelthasend}"
msgstr ""
"{skye}<text>皱起眉头，她肩上的小型机器人发出连串不满的机器鸣叫，让她恼怒的表情尤为突出。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“我真是受够了，待在这简直折磨人。我们回去了。”{text}当她踏向工坊时，</>{lelthas}<text>伸出一只骨感的手。</>\n"
"\n"
"{lelthasend}"

#. Key:	61B1030F4BDB06009684A39CB5F3B311
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Lelthas.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "A Problem of Ethics"
msgstr "道德难题"

#. Key:	176B304C428402B3C1C1EDA4ED20DF85
