msgid "<text>The young mechanist,</> {skye}<text>, seems to be pleading with</> {otto}<text>, the golden-hearted golem.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Come on.  Please?  It'll be awesome.  You won't even miss it.  Promise.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>年轻的机械师，</>{skye}<text>，似乎在恳求</>{otto}<text>，也就是那位赤心的巨石偶。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“求求你了，行不行？我保证你甚至不会注意到少了什么。”</>"

#. Key:	6A59895346A523038BA3E3840268F33C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(5 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
