msgstr "诡胜无终。"

#. Key:	2F859942403C626FE34418B04B8F0855
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The walls of the</> <text s=\"caverns\">cavern</> <text>shake as</> {otto}<text> stomps a heavy foot on the ground.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Otto said no.  Otto play fair or not play at all.  You go.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{otto}<text> turns away from you, and every piece on the board spins as if</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">shunning</> <text>you too.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{skyeend}"
msgstr ""
"{otto}<text>用沉重的脚跺地，整个</><text s=\"caverns\">洞穴</><text>都随之震动。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“奥托说了不。奥托公正地玩，要么不玩。你走。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{otto}<text>转身离你而去，棋盘上的每枚棋子好似都在转着</><text s=\"colorcurse\">避开</><text>你。</>\n"
"\n"
"{skyeend}"

#. Key:	4A48E7EE4BA4E12F4809F1868DC68936
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Otto.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A miniature Wanderbot pops up from over</> {skye}<text s=\"skye\">'s</> <text>shoulder,</> <text s=\"shakingorange\">chittering angrily</><text>.  On the board, one of the</> <text s=\"colorblue\">pawns</> <text>moves forward, causing the</> <text s=\"colorpink\">little bot</> <text>to duck behind its master.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{skye}<text> reaches back, petting her companion.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"You're right.  We don't have to take this.  We're going home.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{ottoend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>一架迷你游荡机器人从</>{skye}<text>的肩膀上跳了出来，愤怒地</><text s=\"shakingorange\">啾叫</><text>。棋盘上一枚</><text s=\"colorblue\">卒</><text>向前移动，让</><text s=\"colorpink\">小机器人</><text>躲回了主人后面。</>\n"
"\n"
"{skye}<text>手伸向后方，抚摸着她的伙伴。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“你说得对。我们没必要在这遭罪，回去吧。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{ottoend}"

#. Key:	1806DE934A6D348996929B8B2C9C9365
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Otto.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Champion_Skye_Vs_Otto.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Bigger.  Better.  Boulder."
msgstr "择道逐胜"

#. Key:	6D7B9FA54FBE6AD0C101ABB3B57760C8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.City_GuildHall.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.City_GuildHall.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Pick up some new skills in the City."
msgstr "在六边城内学习一些新的技能。"

#. Key:	B18649974E79B70CD52E88B031142E3C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.City_GuildHall.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.City_GuildHall.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Sounds of a {orange}crowd{text} draw your attention to a large building, full of people coming and going.  {yellow}Curiously{text}, you step inside to see all the city {purple}guilds{text} gathered here, each one seeking to recruit new members.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorgray\">Smiths{text} and {pink}bards{text}, {blue}monks{text} and {green}hunters{text}, all demonstrating their skills to entice eager young apprentices.  Looking around, everything is so {turquoise}fascinating{text}, but one in particular catches your attention.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你听到熙熙攘攘的{orange}人群声{text}，放眼望去，一栋建筑前人山人海。出于{yellow}好奇{text}，你走了过去，发现整个城市的{purple}工会{text}都聚集于此，似乎都想要招新。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorgray\">铁匠{text}、{pink}吟客{text}、{blue}苦修者{text}，以及{green}猎人{text}都在卖弄自己的技艺，希望吸引新人。四周{turquoise}万头攒动{text}，但有一个特别的人吸引了你的注意力。</>"

#. Key:	CDC1ADBB4DA1EA469CE48FB1AC3CEC48
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.City_GuildHall.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.City_GuildHall.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You step up to the {replacement@LeftSideGuild} and are greeted by {replacement@LeftSidePatron}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">{replacement@LeftSideSpeech}</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You sign your name and are handed a {brown}gift basket{text} with everything you need to teach one of your {cyan}companions{text} a new trick.  As well as some {randomcolor}fruit snacks{text}, which you quickly devour.  Delicious.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你走进{replacement@LeftSideGuild}，受到{replacement@LeftSidePatron}的欢迎。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">{replacement@LeftSideSpeech}</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你签名加入，然后收到了一个{brown}礼品篮{text}，里面有教一位{cyan}同伴{text}新技巧所需的所有事项。还有一些你很快就吃光了的{randomcolor}水果零食{text}，美味极了。</>"

