#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "\"Come, come.  Sit down.  It's not often we get a {playerprofession} here.  Now, if you want {replacement@RightSide}, I think I can help you.  All we ask is that you help spread the seeds of happiness.\""
msgstr "“请进请进，坐下吧。{playerprofession}可是我们这儿的稀客。想了解{replacement@RightSide}的话就包在我身上吧。我们只希望你能将幸福传递下去。”"

#. Key:	1F78292F4FF296F11ACC7DAC22AEDA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.City_GuildHall.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.City_GuildHall.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Guild Recruitment"
msgstr "公会招募"

#. Key:	790888904034176C9A025D921E0050F1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.DynamicBackstoryEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.DynamicBackstoryEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The </>{tournament}<text>.  A</> <text s=\"rainbow\">prestigious event</> <text>hosted every year by a group of powerful callers known as the </>{elitefour}<text>.  Each year, young callers from all over are invited to challenge the </>{elitefour}<text> themselves.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You have been selected to partake in this year's event.  Will your tale be one of</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">triumph</><text>...or</> <text s=\"shakingred\">defeat</><text>?  Will your tactics earn you</> <text s=\"colorgold\">fame</> <text>and</> <text s=\"colorgold\">glory</><text>, or find you </><text s=\"colorcurse\">wanting</><text>?</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Now, tell us about the character you'll be playing today.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text></>{tournament}<text>——由一群被称为</>{elitefour}<text>的强大策士们主办的年度</><text s=\"rainbow\">崇高盛会</><text>。每年，来自各地的年轻策士们都会受邀来挑战</>{elitefour}<text>们。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>今年你被选中参会。你的旅途会以</><text s=\"colorcyan\">凯旋</><text>，还是</><text s=\"shakingred\">遗憾</><text>收场？你的策略若如利刃出鞘，自当斩获</><text s=\"colorgold\">名望</><text>。若仅是草草落子，便只决</><text s=\"colorcurse\">叹息</><text>。胜负不靠运气，而在你手中。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>现在，向我们介绍一下你自己。</>"

#. Key:	CC5F1FEA4B8919EFAA19CDA74BA62F79
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.DynamicBackstoryEvent.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.DynamicBackstoryEvent.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "The Journey Begins"
msgstr "旅程开始"

#. Key:	B98CA18341C4D1CAFC798FBE8CC02504
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.Author_38_7B0CF51F461F5101661182B797619771
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.Author_38_7B0CF51F461F5101661182B797619771
msgid "Dan"
msgstr "丹"

#. Key:	EB7E442C4360F3DA52672A88B29DB817
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Help out the Factory's frazzled Champion, an engineering master."
msgstr "帮助工厂里焦头烂额的冠军，他是一位工程大师。"

#. Key:	F2F7904243ADE4DDDAC76798D15DB6DB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Collecting</> <text s=\"colorbrown\">dust</><text>, surrounded by an assortment of</> <text s=\"colorpurple\">half-finished projects</><text>, lies a machine similar to those you've seen around the</> <text s=\"factory\">factory</><text>.  </>{skye}<text> pipes up as you get a closer look.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"She was one of my first prototypes.  Helped me a bunch when I first got here.  Shame she's been just sittin' there\"</>.  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"You know, you could take 'er if ya want.  Sure beats her sittin' 'round here all day, ya know?\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>有一个被各种</><text s=\"colorpurple\">半工项目</><text>包围着，堆积着</><text s=\"colorbrown\">灰尘</><text>的机器，与你在</><text s=\"factory\">工厂</><text>周围看到的类似。</>{skye}<text>一边介绍着，你一边仔细地观察。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“她是我最早的原型之一，在这初期对我帮助很大，可惜后来就一直这么闲置着。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“要不你把她带走吧，只要愿意的话。肯定比她整天闲坐在这里强，是不？”</>"

#. Key:	1E0534A642580DA52FEBA086509B6A10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Something on a nearby table catches your eye.  A</> <text s=\"rainbow\">prismatic gem</> <text>surrounded by tools and equipment all made of</> <text s=\"colorgold\">gold</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"I wouldn't touch that if I were you.  Blasted thing...keeps suckin' up all the celestial mojo and turning everything to gold.  Pretty useless if you ask me.  Thought about pawnin' it off to one of them gobbo's.  You want it, you can have it.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{skye} <text>looks longingly at the table for a moment.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"That was my favorite wrench...\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你的目光被附近的一张桌子上的东西吸引住了。一颗</><text s=\"rainbow\">五彩宝石</><text>被一些</><text s=\"colorgold\">金制</><text>工具与设备包裹着。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“建议你别碰那玩意儿。该死的东西...一直在吸收所有的天界能量，把一切都变成黄金，对我没一点用处。我还想把它卖给那些地精，你要的话就送你了。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{skye}<text>对着桌子惋惜地看了一会儿。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“那可是我最喜欢的扳手啊...”</>"

#. Key:	3731A2BA459244AD5D654784CBA5BE6B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find yourself drawn to a</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">single tool</> <text>sitting all alone on a work table.  As you get closer, it</> <text s=\"shakingorange\">springs</> <text>open to reveal an</> <text s=\"rainbow\">amalgamation</> <text>of every kind of tool you can think of.  And a few you couldn't.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"I knew you were a tinkerer at heart.  What d'ya think?  I call it the Thing-o-Maker...name needs work.  It turns anything into anything.  Or makes them explode.\"</>  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"I got an idea.  You take it out for a spin, see how it works, and I'll think of a way to pay ya back.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你被一个</><text s=\"colorcyan\">单件</><text>迷住，它被孤零零地放在一张工作桌上。当你走近时，它</><text s=\"shakingorange\">弹开</><text>，显露出内部包含了所有你能想到的</><text s=\"rainbow\">工具融合体</><text>，加上你闻所未闻的。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“我看得出你其实是个爱动手的人。怎么样？这玩意我叫它万物造机...名字还有改进空间。它可以把任何东西变成另外的任何东西，就是偶尔会爆炸。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“要不你试试看它的效果吧，我再想想其他办法回报你。”</>"

#. Key:	DAA6D18A47B469474F3E719AAE066316
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factorio.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Bugs in the System"
msgstr "系统错误"

#. Key:	72B84AA645BA73806BC6129354833480
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_NewAssemblyLine.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_NewAssemblyLine.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Craft an Equipment of your own using Factory tech."
msgstr "借助工厂的技术自行生产一件装备。"

#. Key:	7A779FFF4E09BB7334773D870BED6A2E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_NewAssemblyLine.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_NewAssemblyLine.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>An {blue}odd{text} beeping in a side room catches your attention.  Stepping inside, you find a series of {orange}machines{text} lining the wall, and a {purple}strange device{text} at the center which appears to be the cause of the sound.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Approaching the console, you see three buttons showing ingredients and a display on the screen.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"wavingyellow\">PROGRAM READY.  PLEASE MAKE A SELECTION.</><text>"
msgstr ""
"<text>旁边房间里的{blue}古怪{text}嘟嘟声引起了你的注意。走进去后，你发现墙壁上排列着一系列{orange}机器{text}，中央有一个{purple}奇怪的装置{text}，似乎就是声音的来源。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>走近控制台，你在屏幕上看到三个表示成分的按钮，以及一份样品表。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"wavingyellow\">程序准备就绪，请选择。</><text>"

#. Key:	F6E4E45245E4E936BC9F61A9C99A7CA4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_NewAssemblyLine.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_NewAssemblyLine.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You press a couple buttons, and immediately the {gray}machine{text} comes alive.  Sounds of {shakingyellow}whirring and clanking{text} fill the space, and you watch as mechanical arms of {blue}blue{text} and {yellow}yellow{text} spin around.  It truly is a technological marvel.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Every time the {orange}conveyor{text} pauses, a new piece is added or {white}polished{text} or fused together.  Finally, it reached the end, and you retrieve a pristine {replacement@LeftSide}.  As you leave with your new {cyan}equipment{text}, you look back and smile and a feeling that you will be {wavingwhite}dreaming{text} about this tonight.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你按下几个按钮，{gray}机器{text}当即启动。{shakingyellow}轰鸣声和叮当声{text}充斥着整个空间，你看着{blue}蓝色{text}和{yellow}黄色{text}的机械臂转来转去。真是一个科技奇迹。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>每次{orange}传送带{text}停下时，机器都会添加、{white}打磨{text}，或者融合新部件。最后，流程终于结束，产出了一个崭新的{replacement@LeftSide}。当你带着新的{cyan}装备{text}离开时，你回头看了看。今晚肯定还会{wavingwhite}梦到{text}这次奇遇的。</>"

