msgid "Meet a mysterious construct that tells the future..."
msgstr "遇见一个神秘造物，其可预测未来..."

#. Key:	4AC2618C4C7986A01F313DBC60B0356F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_Zolton.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_Zolton.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A {yellow}faint glow{text} coming from under the door of a {orange}maintance{text} room catches your attention.  Stepping inside, it looks like a normal broom closet, except for a {wavingpurple}strange{text} machine which seems to be the source of the light.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you aproach, the animated {gray}machine{text} jerks to life.  {speech}\"Fortune and favor.  One gold piece.\"{text}  As if on cue, another {yellow}light{text} illuminates a slot that would fit exactly one {gold}gold piece.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>{orange}维护间{text}门缝下发出的{yellow}微弱光芒{text}引起了你的注意。你走了进去，它看着就像一个普通的扫帚间，除了一台{wavingpurple}奇怪的{text}机器，这似乎就是光源。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你走近时，{gray}机器{text}突然活动起来。{speech}“幸运与恩惠，只需一枚金币。”{text}仿佛在暗示你一样，另一道{yellow}光{text}照亮了一个恰好可容纳一枚{gold}金币{text}的插槽。</>"

#. Key:	E56FB90C45BB21B6DCE581BAA5E468E7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_Zolton.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Factory_Zolton.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As soon as you insert the {gold}coin{text}, the machine inside the booth begins to {shakingyellow}animate{text}.  Smoke fills its space, {rainbow}lights{text} blink on and off, and soon the entire front panel swings open like a door.  The {gray}animatron{text} steps out and begins to follow you.  It also presents a tiny {white}slip of paper{text} with your fortune written on it:</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{randomreplacement|5}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你刚一插入{gold}金币{text}，机器就开始{shakingyellow}运作起来{text}。烟雾充满了整个房间，期间{rainbow}光芒{text}闪烁，很快机器的整个前面板像门一样打开。一名会动的{gray}机器人{text}走了出来，并开始跟着你。它还给了你一张小{white}纸条{text}，上面记有你的时运：</>\n"
"\n"
"{randomreplacement|5}"

#. Key:	2114FF704ACC07358EC7DFA570429490
