msgstr "大赛不止有战斗，还有大吃特吃时间！"

#. Key:	84712313415014BF338C30A6B829BD0C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Feast.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Feast.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>No one who comes to the {colortournament}fairgrounds{text} leaves without stopping at the most famous {orange}traveling chef{text} in the world.  {guido}Guido's Fiery Feast{text} is well known for having the strangest, yet most tantalizing delicacies.  {gray}Stone crab{text} soup, {purple}gravebloom{text} salad with {green}snake oil{text} dressing.  Even the </>{elitefour}<text> can be seen waiting in line.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>When your turn finally comes, the {orange}master chef{text} himself is waiting to take your order.  You peruse the menu as the scent of sweet spices fill your senses, making your mouth {wavingcyan}water{text}.</> \r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>来到{colortournament}赛场{text}的人在离开时都不会错过世界上最著名的{orange}游厨{text}。{guido}吉多的火热盛宴{text}以其最奇怪但最诱人的美味佳肴而闻名。{gray}石蟹{text}汤，{purple}坟墓花{text}沙拉配{green}蛇油{text}料。你甚至看到</>{elitefour}<text>们也在排队等候。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>终于轮到你了，{orange}主厨{text}本人亲自侍候你点餐。当你细读菜单时，甜味香料的气味充满了你的感官，让你{wavingcyan}直流口水{text}。</>"

#. Key:	802E6EB442AA748AE31682B1D5AD0214
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Feast.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Feast.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>It only takes a few moments before you are presented with your order... {replacement@LeftSide} {replacement@RightSide}  It is an unusual order to be sure, but the {wavingpink}aroma{text} warms your very soul.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You are so {cyan}enraptured{text} by the idea of savoring something so {purple}exquisite{text} that you don't even notice that </>{randomelitefour}<text> was standing right behind you until you hear them also order {replacement@LeftSide} {replacement@RightSide}  Maybe you've started a new {orange}culinary{text} trend.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>只过了几分钟，就送来了你点的{replacement@LeftSide}{replacement@RightSide}。食物确实不太寻常，但它的{wavingpink}气味{text}温暖着你的灵魂。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>能品尝到如此{purple}佳肴{text}，你感到{cyan}欣喜若狂{text}，以至于根本没注意到</>{randomelitefour}<text>就站在你身后。你听见对方也点了相同的菜品，或许你开启了一波新的{orange}美食风潮{text}。</>"

