#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Forest_TheTwoTravelers.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Meet two underhanded criminals and potentially learn from them."
msgstr "遇见两个阴险的罪犯，去看看能不能从他们那学点什么。"

#. Key:	A0AAA3DD478B087A2E5FB7980CFF5238
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Forest_TheTwoTravelers.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Forest_TheTwoTravelers.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A {white}low whisper{text} comes from a side alley, beckoning your attention.  Curious, you duck into the {gray}shadows{text} to be met by a pair of unusual merchants.  A small, {ruxxtin}purple-robed figure{text} alongside someone decked head to toe is {shovelknight}glinting blue armor{text}, holding a shovel with what looks like {brown}fresh dirt{text} on it.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"ruxxtin\">\"Welcome, traveler.  Come to see our wares?  We have many fine, exotic goods.  All, umm...locally sourced.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"shovelknight\">\"And since you are {playerracearticle}, the first one is free.  Just don't tell the prince.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一阵{white}低沉的耳语{text}从一条小巷里传来，引起了你的注意。出于好奇，你钻进了{gray}阴影{text}中，遇到了一对不寻常的商人。一个身材矮小的{ruxxtin}紫袍人{text}旁边站着一位从头到脚都打扮精致的{shovelknight}闪光蓝甲人{text}，他的手里拿着一把铲子，上面看起来像是{brown}新鲜的泥土{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"ruxxtin\">“欢迎，旅行者。来看看我们的货吗？我们有许多异美的商品。额...都是本地采购的。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"shovelknight\">“既然你是{playerracearticle}，那第一件免费。就是别告诉王子。”</>"

#. Key:	F3C0E0B0423ED287DD571CB672AA7834
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Forest_TheTwoTravelers.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Forest_TheTwoTravelers.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Grave Robbers"
msgstr "盗墓者"

#. Key:	5D1CE6254D67E6B5F859DBA40B92EFBC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TestEvent.Author_38_7B0CF51F461F5101661182B797619771
#. Key:	AFE126EA42C777A8735E50B962AAAB29
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.Author_38_7B0CF51F461F5101661182B797619771
#. Key:	DE8934194B148DF3A264AEAD12AA73A6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.Author_38_7B0CF51F461F5101661182B797619771
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.Author_38_7B0CF51F461F5101661182B797619771
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.Author_38_7B0CF51F461F5101661182B797619771
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TestEvent.Author_38_7B0CF51F461F5101661182B797619771
msgid "Mike"
msgstr "麦克"

#. Key:	6F9931234D51E91B459B63989A84FD17
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "A demonstration of both force and grace - come see the Goblin Toss!"
msgstr "力量与雅量的结合，快来观看地精投掷比赛吧！"

#. Key:	37DBF159451D783AB785A8BFE6D274BE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A {blue}high-pitched{text} voice carries throughout the {colortournament}Tournament grounds{text}, drawing in a small crowd.  Naturally, you go to see what the commotion is about to see a cadre of {goblin}goblins{text} standing around a field.  Some are dressed in {red}capes{text}, some in {orange}goggles{text}, one wearing some kind of flying {pink}contraption{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Step right up and try your luck.  Choose a contestant and see how far they fly.  These fine athletes have trained all year for this event.  Don't disappoint them.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>{blue}高亢{text}的声音传遍整个{colortournament}大赛场地{text}，吸引了一群人。你也很自然的去看热闹了，是一群{goblin}地精{text}站在田径场周围。有的穿着{red}斗篷{text}，有的戴着{orange}护目镜{text}，还有的身着某种飞行{pink}装置{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“来试试你的运气。选择一名参赛者，看看他们能飞多远。这些优秀的运动员为了这次比赛已经训练了一整年，不要让他们失望。”</>"

#. Key:	F333D99E4F7BFB303C8E1485FE18C47E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Folks of all creeds and colors take their mark, armed with an {shakingyellow}overly-enthusiastic {goblin}goblin{text}.  You choose a particularly small {goblin}goblin{text} wearing a {red}rocket-fueled wingsuit{text}.  She jabbers at you excitedly, adjusted her {orange}goggles{text}, and commands you to fire.  You hurl the girl into the air, then watch as the {red}rockets{text} fire and she soars into the sky.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>She flies like a {cyan}bird{text} until crashing in a distant {yellow}haystack{text} far off course.  You wince, but she leaps from the stack, arms held high as the other {goblin}goblins{text} cheer.  It seems that the event is more a {wavingcyan}spectacle{text} than a competition.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>各种信仰和肤色的人们带着{shakingyellow}状态火热{text}的{goblin}地精{text}们整装待发，准备开始比赛。你选择了一名特别娇小的{goblin}地精{text}，穿着{red}火箭燃料飞行器{text}。她兴奋地对你喋喋不休，调整着她的{orange}护目镜{text}，并请求你“开火”。你把女孩扔至空中，然后看着{red}火箭{text}启动，她升向了天空。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>她像一只{cyan}鸟{text}一样飞翔，最终坠落在远离航线的一处{yellow}干草堆{text}上。你略微担心，但她从草堆里跳了出来，高举双臂，其他{goblin}地精{text}欢呼雀跃。看来这次活动与其说是一场比赛，不如说是一场{wavingcyan}表演{text}。</>"

#. Key:	DFD2D41D45856F7E8D813DB2FEC8CEB9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.GoblinToss.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Goblin Toss"
msgstr "地精投掷"

#. Key:	CAAC7BDA423D304AD75C82B31E60DB10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Meet with the Graveyard's strongest competitor, a member of Undead royalty."
msgstr "遇见墓园的最强选手，他是死灵王族成员。"

#. Key:	CE9509F840AB1866C6B3DCAB7EFEFA49
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You see a tall skeleton clad in </><text s=\"colorblue\">deep blue</><text> armor. and wielding a large, </><text s=\"colorcyan\">bejeweled</><text> sword. It plants the sword in the ground and jauntily waves at you.  \"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Hello, stranger!  Haven't seen you before.</><text> \" He extends a bony hand. </>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">I'm </></><text s=\"colorlelthas\">Prince Lel'thas</></><text s=\"colorspeech\">. Pleased to make your acquaintance.</><text>\"  The prince grins, teeth remarkable </><text s=\"b\">white</><text> for being set in a hollow skull.. \"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">How about a little friendly competiton between </></><text s=\"colortournament\">Tournament</></><text s=\"colorspeech\"> fighters?</><text>\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你看到一个高大的骷髅，穿着</><text s=\"colorblue\">深蓝色</><text>的盔甲，手持一把</><text s=\"colorcyan\">镶满宝石</><text>的大剑。他把剑插在地上，向你挥手致意。{colorspeech}“你好，陌生人！以前没见过你。”{text}他伸出一只骨手。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>“</><text s=\"colorspeech\">我是</><text s=\"colorlelthas\">莱尔塔斯王子</><text s=\"colorspeech\">很高兴认识你。</><text>”王子露出一个笑容，牙齿在空洞的头骨中显得异常</><text s=\"b\">洁白</><text>“</><text s=\"colorspeech\">来一场友好的</><text s=\"colortournament\">比赛</><text s=\"colorspeech\">怎么样？</><text>”</>"

#. Key:	TextGraveyardChamp_Ally
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgctxt "EventTable"
msgid ""
"<text>Without warning, </>{lelthas}<text> lunges at you, pointy end first.  You {cyan}guard{text}, turn, {magenta}parry{text}, dodge, and spin out of the {shakingpurple}flurry{text} of attacks the prince makes.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You thrust your blade the second the {blue}opportunity{text} presents itself, lodging firmly in his ribcage. It slides between two {gray}ribs{text} and juts out the other side.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>After a moment, that bony jaw opens and he begins to laugh.  {speech}“Well, well, well…thou art full of surprises.  I like thee.  Let me show thee a technique I hath devised some years ago.”</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>突然间，</>{lelthas}<text>向你猛扑过来，剑尖向着你。你先是{cyan}防御{text}、转身，然后{magenta}格挡{text}、闪避，并从王子的一连串{shakingpurple}攻击{text}中旋转脱身。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你抓住对方第二次失误的{blue}机会{text}，将剑刺入他的肋骨间，剑锋从两根{gray}肋骨{text}之间穿过，从另一侧露出。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>片刻后，他那仅剩骨头的下巴咧开，开始大笑。{speech}“好好好...汝可真让吾欢喜！试观吾昔年独创之法。”</>"

#. Key:	66CED70941BC6384D9F27792D62BB480
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>With a quick double step, the prince {shakingpurple}thrusts{text} forward.  Surely he would have pierced your tender flesh had you not slipped through the {wavingcyan}aether{text} to appear behind him.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>He moves left, you appear to the right.  He steps right, you {blue}teleport{text} to the left.  You aren’t sure how a walking pile of {gray}bones{text} can get winded, but it seems you’ve bested him somehow.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“I did not take thee for a scholar.  Perhaps this will be of more use to thee.”</>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<text>王子两个跨步{shakingpurple}迅速前刺{text}。要不是你以{wavingcyan}迅雷不及掩耳{text}之势出现在他身后，你的柔嫩肌肤早已被刺穿。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>敌左你右，敌右你则左。你神奇地将对面的这堆不呼气的{gray}骨头{text}弄得气喘吁吁，似乎你已经击败了他。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“未料汝乃行家，此物或可相助。”</>"

#. Key:	TextGraveyardChamp_Neutral
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgctxt "EventTable"
msgid ""
"<text>Following in the footsteps of the vanguards, you square off with the prince.  After a few moments, you feint right and strike left, ducking behind him with a smirk on your face.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>He looks to his side, then back at you, realizing that you are waving at him with his own dislodged arm.  Then, much to your surprise, a smile crosses his bony countenance.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>“Well fought!  And with my own arm, no less.  Thou shalt surely be victorious in the coming tournament.”</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>紧随对方先行，你与王子对峙。几秒钟后，你假意向右攻击，实则向左出击，脸上带着得意的笑容绕到他身后。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>他看了看身侧，然后回头看你，发现你正用他已被你拽脱落的手臂向他挥手。令你惊讶的是，他那骨瘦如柴的脸上露出了笑容。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>“妙哉！假吾臂而击。汝于后赛必捷。”</>"

#. Key:	4DFAE30F4019BE6CD2E1748D20DCC104
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Graveyard_ChampEvent.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Skeleton Prince's Request"
msgstr "骷髅王子之请"

#. Key:	F418C8B043C16A393871D6994C5ED3EA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Visit the Kelpie Oracle, a mysterious woman who lives in an enchanted bog."
msgstr "探访凯尔皮神谕，一位生活在魔法沼泽中的神秘女子。"

#. Key:	D50CEDCF4910EB94B90493AD4F13DDC1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Making your way through the </><text s=\"graveyard\">undead city{text}, you stop when you hear the sound of {wavinggreen}singing{text} coming from a {purple}swamp{text} nearby.  As you step closer, something in the murky water emerges.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>There, in the {gray}bog and bones{text}, lies a {cyan}beautiful maiden{text} who offers a gift from the depths of the murky mire.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You gaze over the {green}bubbling{text} muck, fearful of what rejection might bring, and to your surprise, the {brown}swamp{text} gazes back.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>穿过</><text s=\"graveyard\">亡灵之城{text}，你听到附近一片{purple}沼泽{text}中传来{wavinggreen}歌唱{text}的声音，于是你停了下来。当你走近时，浑浊的水中出现了什么东西。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在{gray}沼泽与骨头{text}间，躺着一位{cyan}美丽的少女{text}，她从浑浊的泥沼深处献上了一份礼物。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你凝视着{green}冒泡{text}的淤泥，害怕拒绝可能会招致什么可怕的后果，令你惊讶的是，{brown}沼泽{text}也在凝视着你。</>"

#. Key:	D6B4847841276DB6D8D3B9B279464A35
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You make your request, and at first nothing happens.  For a moment, you think you may have {shakingred}angered{text} the spirit until you notice the {gray}swamp{text} itself creeping toward you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Soon, part of the {gray}bog{text} breaks away and you realize it's some sort of...{green}creature{text}?  Whatever it is, it seems to have brought {gold}\"gifts\"{text} dredged up from the mucky floor.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>None of it seems valuable, but maybe whatever this oddly adorable {purple}abomination{text} can use it.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你提出了请求，但起初什么也没发生。有那么一瞬间，你以为自己已经{shakingred}惹恼{text}了那个幽灵，直到你注意到{gray}沼泽{text}本身向你蔓延而来。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>不久，{gray}泥沼{text}的一部分分离出来，你发现这似乎是某种...{green}生物{text}？这淤泥深处幽幽泛出之物似乎还从泥泞中带来了{gold}“礼物”{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>这些礼物似乎都没什么价值，但也许这个奇怪而可爱的{purple}畸形物{text}能用得上。</>"

#. Key:	6AFEE46E4EC15E4300EFC5BEA99FBEF6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Before you can say anything, you feel a tug at your {gold}coin purse{text}.  Looking down, you see some sort of {green}green blob{text} gnawing at your wallet as though looking for a {pink}treat{text}.  Confused, but curious, you reach in and feed it one gold piece.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>With a {wavingyellow}cheerful{text} burp, it shivers, then splits in two, only to merge back together and spit the {gold}gold{text} back at you.  Taking your leave of the {gray}mire{text}, the creature bounces behind you.  It looks like you've made a {wavingpink}friend{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>还没等你说话，你就感觉到你的{gold}钱袋{text}被拉了一下。低头一看，一个{green}绿色黏液团{text}正在啃食它，似乎要问你施舍点{pink}吃的{text}。困惑但又好奇，你拿出一枚金币喂给它。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>随着一声{wavingyellow}愉快的{text}打嗝声，它颤抖了一下，然后分裂成两个，然后又重新合并在一起，把{gold}金币{text}吐还给了你。离开{gray}泥潭{text}时，这个生物在你身后弹跳着。看起来你交了一个{wavingpink}新朋友{text}。</>"

#. Key:	0EAB51E945771F3B379C4DB0E3BFAF68
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.KelpieEvent_Redo.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Maiden of the Mire"
msgstr "泥沼少女"

#. Key:	67C7F5064F0490B4BBB967B099CEACBE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ManualOptionLoader.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ManualOptionLoader.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Unused Event"
msgstr "未使用的事件"

#. Key:	00AEDAB9496A9A72398C8A821FD08964
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ManualOptionLoader.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ManualOptionLoader.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "This is a debug tool."
msgstr "这是一个调试工具。"

#. Key:	172B5D684637F947D2BD21BAB96F3427
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewBlackMarket.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewBlackMarket.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Peruse the City's curios."
msgstr "细览黑市里的奇货。"

#. Key:	D04D444D4D97C6225E8313A927C5C7E7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewBlackMarket.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewBlackMarket.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You come to an secluded {purple}bazaar{text}, full of oddities and antiquities.  A {blue}well-dressed{text} man approaches you, though the only facial feature you can make out is his {wavingwhite}impossibly white{text} grin.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">We have the most wonderous wonders from across the Hexad Realms.  Snake Eggs from the {colordesert}Golden Desert{speech}.  Enchanted gemstones from {colorcaverns}Bana'al Caverns{speech}.  And no goblin market taxes.</><text>\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你来到一个僻静的{purple}集市{text}，里面满是奇珍古玩。一位{blue}衣冠楚楚{text}的男子向你走来，但你唯一能辨认出的面部特征是他笑着露出的一口{wavingwhite}大白牙{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“我们拥有六边城辖内最耀人的奇货——{colordesert}黄金沙漠{speech}的蛇蛋、{colorcaverns}巴纳尔洞穴{speech}的附魔宝石等，而且我们不收地精市税。”</>"

#. Key:	661F7D6B4717627307AA36AFD3E72641
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewBlackMarket.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewBlackMarket.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Black Market"
msgstr "黑市"

#. Key:	ECCCD0DC4480FFAAD676FB90CA6EC60F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Break into a restricted area of the facility."
msgstr "闯入禁区"

#. Key:	DAC4C86044E8BF1DAF27289F48FE1C58
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>While wandering through the impressive facility, you duck down a {black}darkened{text} corridor.  Tile floor gives way to {pink}carpet{text} and {yellow}florescent lights{text} are replaced with chandeliers.  If you didn't know better, you'd say you were in some {wavingwhite}grand hotel{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>At the end of the hall stands a set of sliding doors, a single {red}button{text}, and a warning - {cyan}AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you move closer, you look from the door to the button, {blue}pondering{text} whether or not to push it.  It's a {wavingred}big red button{text}, just begging to be pressed.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>在这座奇伟的设施中漫步时，你钻进了一条{black}黑暗{text}走廊。瓷砖地板变成了{pink}地毯{text}，{yellow}荧光灯{text}则变成了枝形吊灯。如果你不知道情况，可能还以为自己进入了什么{wavingwhite}豪华酒店{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>大厅的尽头有一套侧拉门、一个{red}按钮{text}和一条警告：{cyan}仅限相关人员{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你靠了过去，看了看门和按钮，{blue}思考{text}是否要按下这诱惑着你的{wavingred}大红按钮{text}。</>"

#. Key:	E253B2834A8FF58AFE154180E9893BD7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You step out into a corridor so clean it {wavingwhite}sparkles{text}.  You are too busy {pink}admiring{text} the place that you don't notice something {red}wrap{text} around your leg until it's {cyan}too late{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>By then, you can't move.  The {green}creature{text} completely {purple}engulfs{text} you.  You fear this may be your{gray} end{text} when is mostly detaches itself from you.  {shakingtextbold}Every inch{text} of you, however, is coated in a {rainbow}slimy{text} parting gift.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你走进走廊，这里干净得{wavingwhite}闪闪发光{text}。你忙着{pink}欣赏{text}这个地方，以至于没有注意到有东西{red}缠绕{text}在了你的腿上，直到一切{cyan}为时已晚{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你已经完全动不了了。那个{green}生物{text}完全{purple}吞没{text}了你。好像这就要是你人生的{gray}终点{text}了，但它却突然与你分离。不过你身上的{shakingtextbold}每一寸肌肤{text}都覆盖上了{rainbow}黏糊糊{text}的离别礼物。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	EE3923FE4349970B5DDC5FB68E244494
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You lean forward to inspect the {green}oddity{text} when something {wavingyellow}wafts{text} into your nostrils.  You try to fight it, but you {shakingtextbold}sneeze{text} all over the {purple}creature{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Instantly, it begins to take shape.  The {pink}mass{text} {wavingtext}ripples and shifts{text} into a perfect, albeit {rainbow}colorful{text}, copy of you.  It mimics your movement, then seems to {orange}smile{text} before shuddering again.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你向前倾身检查{green}情况{text}，但有东西{wavingyellow}飘入{text}了你的鼻孔。你尝试着对抗它，但{shakingtextbold}喷嚏{text}全喷到了那个{purple}生物{text}身上。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>瞬间，它开始成形。{pink}那物质{wavingtext}扩散变形{text}，成了一个与你形状毫无差异、却为{rainbow}彩色{text}的克隆体。它完全模仿你的动作，似乎不经意间{orange}微笑{text}了一下，然后再次颤抖了起来。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabend}"

#. Key:	EF6AD8AC43180902F81487A17F07438E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Your {blue}curiousity{text}, along with its unusual {pink}cuteness{text}, overtakes your common sense.  You reach out, {orange}tentatively{text}, and gently touch the {green}creature's{text} outstretched limb.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As soon as you do, you feel a {wavingturquoise}little dizzy{text}.  The tendril coils around your finger and it begins to change, taking on more {yellow}definition{text}, until it looks like a {rainbow}prismatic copy{text} of yourself.  That could be useful.</>  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你的{blue}好奇心{text}，加上它不同寻常的{pink}可爱{text}让你冲昏了头脑。你{orange}试探{text}着伸出手，轻轻触摸这个{green}生物{text}伸出的肢体。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>刚一这么做，你就感到有点{wavingturquoise}头晕{text}。卷须盘绕在你的手指上，并开始发生变化，呈现出更多的{yellow}特征{text}，直到它看起来像你的一个{rainbow}多色复制品{text}。它估计能发挥点用处。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabend}"

#. Key:	0D76B5C5486ED4F80238CEBB7F8D7CFD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You aren't entirely sure what the {rainbow}creature{text} wants, and it doesn't seem to be {cyan}talkative{text}.  Which means you make your best guess, and opt for a {wavingyellow}handshake{text}. </>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Before you know it, the {shakinggreen}slimy tendril{text} curls around your arm like a {gray}vice{text}.  When it releases you, it {wavingwhite}morphs{text} into a near perfect replica of your {orange}charming{text} self.  If you didn't feel {green}sick{text}, you'd be impressed.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你无法确定这个{rainbow}生物{text}的意图，而它看上去也不会{cyan}说话{text}。你只好按可能性来猜测，首选为尝试与它{wavingyellow}握手{text}。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>还没反应过来，那个{shakinggreen}黏糊糊的触手{text}就卷住了你的手臂，活像个{gray}钳子{text}。当它松开你的时候，它{wavingwhite}变化{text}成了你{orange}近乎完美{text}的复制品。要不是感到一阵{green}恶心{text}，你一定会非常惊叹。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabend}"

#. Key:	40EF5B074D89E7C5E8B20585A86EEABE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>To you, it somewhat {blue}resembles{text} another {playerrace}.  And it seems to want a hug.  With great {wavingpink}pleasure{text}, you wrap your arms around the {green}creature{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It returns the hug, holding you close.  Instantly, you feel your {shakingblue}energy{text} drain from you, causing you to reel back.  There, you see a {rainbow}shimmering facsimile{text} of your gorgeous face.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你感到它{blue}就像{text}另一个{playerrace}，而且似乎想要一个拥抱。你怀着极大的{wavingpink}喜悦{text}，用双臂搂住了这个{green}生物{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>它也回以紧抱。霎那间，你感觉{shakingblue}能量{text}从你身上流失，让你向后踉跄了几步。抬头，你看到了一个{rainbow}闪闪发光的脸庞{text}，正是你的脸庞的绝妙复刻。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabend}"

#. Key:	010458394510D558680EB1B5D2B4CF5C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Something about this place {wavingwhite}feels off{text}.  It doesn't look like a {gray}lab{text}.  Or a {cyan}classroom{text}.  You are neither {pink}authorized{text} nor {purple}personnel{text}.  Obviously, you are not meant to be here.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You slowly back away from the ominous looking {wavingred}red button{text} and make your way back the way you came.  You aren't certain what's down there, but you have a feeling it {bold}can't{text} be good.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Erring on the side of {blue}caution{text}, you return to the main hall and continue on your way, putting the strange {gray}elevator{text} out of your mind.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>这个地方感觉有些{wavingwhite}不对劲{text}。它看起来不像{gray}实验室{text}，也不像{cyan}教室{text}。你既没有{pink}授权{text}，也不是{purple}相关人员{text}。显然，你不适合待在这里。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你慢慢地从不太吉利的{wavingred}红色按钮{text}那后退，沿着来时的路返回。你无法预知前方有什么，但情况{bold}不太可能{text}讨喜。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>出于{blue}谨慎{text}的考虑，你返回了主厅并继续前行，将这个奇怪的{gray}电梯{text}抛在了脑后。</>"

#. Key:	AF1319AF40509AB3CD3046908AED8F28
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>That sound catches your {pink}attention{text}.  First, you check your {blue}stomach{text} to make sure it isn't you.  Sure enough, the {shakinggreen}gurgling{text} grows louder as you descend, but {wavingpurple}suspiciously{text} vanishes when you reach the bottom.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You quickly push the {gray}button{text} back to the main floor.  {cyan}Whatever{text} is being {wavingtext}kept down here{text} is probably here for a reason, and you want {red}no part{text} of it.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>When the {gray}elevator{text} returns, you make a hasty exit back to the main {blue}corridor{text} and proceed on your way, {shakingorange}shivering{text} at whatever might have been waiting for you.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>这个声音难以{pink}忽略{text}。首先你检查了自己的{blue}肚子{text}，确保嫌疑人不是它。当电梯下降时{shakinggreen}咕噜声{text}自然是越来越响，但在你到达最底部时反而{wavingpurple}诡异{text}地消失了。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你慌乱地赶紧按下{gray}按钮{text}回到了主楼层。{cyan}不管{text}这藏了什么东西，被处心{wavingtext}放在这{text}肯定事发有因，你可不想{red}惹上麻烦{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当{gray}电梯{text}返回时，你匆忙退回{blue}走廊{text}并继续旅途，{shakingorange}颤抖{text}地观察着前方的危险。</>"

#. Key:	5B13D6684EC7C7AF7B739EAD956D60C2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You watch the {rainbow}strange blob{text} standing there, arms {pink}outstretched{text}, waiting for something.  Pressing yourself close the {gray}wall{text}, to inch your way past it and back towards the {red}elevator{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It turns, {wavingcyan}silently watching{text} you with its {green}tendril{text} extended.  You back up all the way to the {red}elevator doors{text}, ducking inside the second they open.  As the doors close, you wave {pink}goodbye{text} to the creature.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You decide it best to forget the whole {cyan}experience{text}, and hope your dreams won't be filled with {rainbow}rainbow jelly{text} looking for a friend.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>{rainbow}奇怪黏液体{text}就站在那，双臂{pink}伸出{text}，似乎在等待着什么。你贴着{gray}墙壁{text}，慢慢地绕过它并向着{red}电梯{text}逃去。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>它转过来，{wavingcyan}静静看着{text}你，伸出它的{green}卷须{text}。你一路退到{red}梯门{text}前，门一打开就躲了进去。当门关闭时，你向那个生物挥手{pink}再见{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你决定最好忘记这整个{cyan}经历{text}，祈祷你的梦中不会充满寻找朋友的{rainbow}彩虹果冻{text}。</>"

#. Key:	2CD1ED794DC46FED6B789FBB1332A89F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Examining the panel, you notice a small depression in the {gray}metal plate{text}.  Closer {orange}examination{text} reveals a hidden button that has been well worn.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Curious, you press the secret {green}switch{text}, and soon the elevator {magenta}hums{text} to life and you can hear the lift begin to rise. </>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>检查操作面板时，你注意到这块{gray}金属板{text}上有一个小凹陷。仔细{orange}检查{text}后确认是一个已经严重磨损的隐藏按钮。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你按下了这个秘密{green}开关{text}，很快电梯{magenta}嗡嗡{text}地启动了，很容易辨别电梯是在从下方上升。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	249ED5CC42A1B766CF2F02A0F988D6EA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Curious, you press the {wavingred}inviting button{text} and within seconds, a {yellow}beam of light{text} envelops you.  It seems to be {pink}scanning{text} you, though you aren't sure what for.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As the {yellow}lights{text} around you fade,  you hear the {gray}elevator{text} come to a stop at your floor.  You aren't sure what happened, other than you feel a little {curse}off{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>忍不住诱惑，你按下了{wavingred}按钮{text}。几秒钟之内，一束{yellow}光束{text}包围了你。它似乎在{pink}扫描{text}你，但你不确定其目的。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>随着周围的{yellow}光束{text}消失，你听到{gray}电梯{text}已经停在了你所在的楼层。你不确定发生了什么，只是感觉有点{curse}难受{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	55BEEBB34CCD83BA2F8B4191C777C36F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Without {orange}hestation{text}, you push the {wavingred}big red button{text}.  As soon as you do, a beam of {yellow}light{text} begins to engulf you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You try to avoid it, but it tracks your every movement, moving {magenta}faster{text} until it catches up with you.  It only covers you for a {cyan}moment{text}, but it leaves you with a {curse}sickly feeling{text} in your stomach.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>毫无{orange}犹豫{text}，你就按下了{wavingred}按钮{text}，一束{yellow}光芒{text}瞬间就吞没了你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你试图避开它，但它跟踪着你的每一个动作，{magenta}越跟越快{text}使得你无法逃脱。它只覆盖了你{cyan}片刻{text}，但却让你的胃里产生了阵阵{curse}恶心感{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	192A0778452A91CE94370FB8C8A46D15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As you brace yourself to examine the {red}switch{text},  your arm slips in some kind of crevice with a clamp around your wrist.  Soon, a {curse}sharp pain{text} runs through your arm.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Your body grows {yellow}warm{text}, then {orange}hot{text}, before returning to normal.  Soon, a display lights up.  {wavingcyan}-Welcome, subject #1.  Please proceed to the test chamber.-</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你准备检查{red}开关{text}时，你的手臂误滑入了某个缝隙中，一个夹子夹到了你的手腕上。很快，你的手臂传来一阵{curse}剧痛{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你的身体先是感到{yellow}温暖{text}，然后{orange}发烫{text}，最后恢复了正常。很快，显示屏亮起。{wavingcyan}-欢迎，测试对象#1。请前往测试室。-</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	06DB336B46A05471B489F7BFFD07E882
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As soon as you exit the {gray}elevator{text}, something begins {wavinggreen}seeping{text} from a grate beneath you.  Soon, a wave of {rainbow}colorful slime{text} begins barreling down the empty hall, {shakingtext}right towards you{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It {pink}chases{text} you into a nearby room, empty except for an {gold}ornate mirror{text} in the center.  To your surprise, the {rainbow}blob{text} comes to a halt inches away from you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你走出{gray}电梯{text}时，脚下的排液口开始有东西{wavinggreen}渗出{text}。以这为先头预兆，一波{rainbow}彩色黏液{text}开始沿着空荡荡的大厅{shakingtext}向你袭来{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>它{pink}追着{text}你到了附近的一个房间，中间除了有一面{gold}华丽的镜子{text}之外，空无一物。令你惊讶的是，{rainbow}黏液{text}在距离你极进的地方停了下来。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	A2C2F453481DC8C1AAB95396F39DC578
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The {green}gurgle{text} turns to a rumble as a massive, {rainbow}multicolored ooze{text} pours out from a nearby {gray}grate{text} and {wavingtext}shambles{text} toward you.  You aren't sure what to do, but running seems a {cyan}good{text} option.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>With the end of the {magenta}hallway{text} drawing near, you jump up and grab a {yellow}light fixture{text}.  You aren't quite fast enough, however, and one leg gets coated in {wavinggreen}slime.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>{green}咕噜声{text}变成了隆隆声，巨大的{rainbow}彩黏液{text}从附近的{gray}排液口{text}涌出，并{wavingtext}铺天盖地{text}般朝你冲来。你不确定该怎么做，逃跑应该是一个{cyan}不错的{text}选择。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>随着你临近{magenta}走廊{text}的尽头，你跳起来并抓住了一个{yellow}灯具{text}。然而你的速度还是不够快，一条腿上沾满了{wavinggreen}黏液{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	63AEEC084F754B0A1E1E12AB60EE821B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A few seconds after you exit the lift, you hear a {green}sickening plop{text}.  Turning back towards the elevator, that's when you see it.  A hulking mass of {rainbow}rainbow sludge{text}, {wavingtext}crawling{text} towards you at a good pace.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Your first {pink}instinct{text} is to press yourself flat against a wall.  The {green}slime{text} brushes past you, leaving your back covered in something you aren't sure will clean off.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>退出电梯几秒钟后，你听到了{green}令人作呕的扑通声{text}。你转身回看了电梯方一眼，是一大团{rainbow}彩黏液{text}正在{wavingtext}快速拖行{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你的{pink}本能{text}反应是将自己平贴在墙上。{green}黏液{text}从你身边擦过，让你的背部沾满了疑似无法清理干净的东西。</>\n"
"\n"
"{alchemylabdungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	24E0DC15423E6D2A94FA219BADF5A9D3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_AlchemyLab.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Secret Lab"
msgstr "秘密实验室"

#. Key:	CCBDB7EC424AD4081E9885976E3A3D79
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Explore ancient tunnels to find the secret hidden deep within."
msgstr "探索古老的隧道，寻找隐藏在深处的秘密。"

#. Key:	D60A3D6D498ADC9A7CF6BC96747263B1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Traveling through the</> {caverns}<text> you feel an unseen force guiding you to a series of winding shafts that seem to branch off the main tunnel.  As you peer inside, you notice the</> <text s=\"colorgray\">stone walls</> <text>glowing with some sort of</> <text s=\"colorturquoise\">celestial force</><text>.  This is likely where much of the</> <text s=\"colorturquoise\">cosmic energy</> <text>that </>{factory}<text> uses to power their reactors.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You've heard that it takes a special touch to harvest the energy, but you are a caller.</>  <text s=\"colorturquoise\">Astral energy</> <text>flows though you.  Surely, you should be able to</> <text s=\"colorred\">harness</> <text>some of it for yourself.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>在穿越</>{caverns}<text>时，你感觉到一股无形的力量引导你前往一系列蜿蜒的洞穴，似乎是从主通道分支出来的。当你向内凝视时，你注意到一堵闪耀着某种</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">天界力量</><text>的</><text s=\"colorgray\">石墙</><text>。这很可能是</>{factory}<text>用于供能反应堆的许多</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">宇宙能量</><text>来源之一。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你听说采集这种能量需要一种特殊的方法，但你本身也是个策士。</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">星界能量</><text>在你身体中流淌着，所以应该能够</><text s=\"colorred\">利用</><text>其中的一部分。</>"

#. Key:	221B675541E64CAD00C950BBB12311F1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As you survey the room full of sharp spiked stones along the floor, you think to yourself.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech_i\">\"I'm a nimble {playerrace}.  Surely it won't be that bad.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You aren't sure how you managed to step on</> <text s=\"i\">every</> <text s=\"colorbrown\">sharp spike</> <text>between here and the next room, but somehow you did.</>  <text s=\"smalltext\">Perhaps nimble wasn't the right word...</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor2\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你审视着地板上布满尖锐尖刺的房间时，心里想着。</><text s=\"colorspeech_i\">“我是个灵活的{playerrace}。应该不会那么糟糕吧。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你不确定自己是怎么在这里和下一个房间之间踩到</><text s=\"i\">每一根</><text s=\"colorbrown\">尖锐尖刺</><text>的，但你确实做到了。</><text s=\"smalltext\">也许灵活用在这并不合适...</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor2"

#. Key:	ED3A0B5F494B343E3FF67F97E6AFBD1E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The</> <text s=\"shakingcyan\">rhythmic thumping</> <text>of the crystal structure is almost calming.  As you draw closer, you can practically</> <text s=\"colorbless\">feel</> <text>it calling to you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As if ordained by</> <text s=\"colorpink\">Hedra</> <text>herself, a piece of the</> <text s=\"colorblue\">crystal</> <text>chips away and lands at your feet.  You take the gift, stashing it away for later.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>那水晶结构的</><text s=\"shakingcyan\">节奏性跳动</><text>几乎让人感到宁静。当你越来越接近，几乎可以</><text s=\"colorbless\">感受</><text>到它在向你呼唤。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>仿佛是被赋予了</><text s=\"colorpink\">神圣之力</><text>，一块</><text s=\"colorblue\">水晶</><text>碎片从中脱落，落在你的脚下。你接受了这份礼物，并将其收藏起来，留待日后之用。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"

#. Key:	920356104CD63C15E86A118307D157B1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>There it is.  The gemstone heart of </>{caverns}<text>.  A </><text s=\"rainbow\">powerful artifact</> <text>to be sure.  Which, you figure, is so well guarded that no one will notice if you take a piece.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You grip what appears to be a</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">loose fragment</> <text>and pull with all your might.  As it breaks free, the heart begins to glow a</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">deep purple</><text>.  Which you take as your cue to leave.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>这就是</>{caverns}<text>的宝石之心。它无疑是一件</><text s=\"rainbow\">强大造物</><text>。这地方被如此严密地守护着，如果你拿一块应该没人会注意到。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你抓住了一个看起来有些松动的</><text s=\"colorcyan\">碎片</><text>，用尽全力拉扯。随着它脱离，水晶之心开始发出深紫色的</><text s=\"colorcurse\">光芒</><text>。根据之前的经验是时候离开了。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"

#. Key:	02392A1743AD2C7136992E9FA3AF84FF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The crystal heart of</> {caverns}<text>.  Somehow, you were hoping it was less</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">crystal</><text> and more</> <text s=\"colorcrimson\">heart</><text>.  Still, this is why you risked so much coming here, so you decide to take a</> <text s=\"colormagenta\">souvinir</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you loose a</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">shard</> <text>from the monument, the</> <text s=\"coloryellow\">light</> <text>inside shifts to a</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">deep</><text>,</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">unnerving purple</><text>.  It gives you a</> <text s=\"colorturquoise\">tingling</> <text>feeling that says you've overstayed your welcome.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>这就是</>{caverns}<text>的水晶之心。你原本希望它更接近</><text s=\"colorcrimson\">心</><text>而非</><text s=\"colorcyan\">晶体</><text>，但已经冒着巨大风险来到这里，所以你决定带一个</><text s=\"colormagenta\">纪念品</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你从中取下一块</><text s=\"colorcyan\">碎片</><text>时，内部的</><text s=\"coloryellow\">光芒</><text>变成了</><text s=\"colorcurse\">深紫色</><text>，让你产生了一种</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">刺痛</><text>的感觉，似乎在告诉你该离开了。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"

#. Key:	3DDB3D2F493BCB02FFAF83849BB4AFFF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A giant</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">glowing</> <text>rock.  All this way for a giant</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">glowing</> <text>rock.  You can't help but feel a bit disappointed.  However, you</> <text s=\"coloryellow\">refuse</><text> to leave empty-handed.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You look for a large</> <text s=\"colorpink\">shard</> <text>that you can break off and begin to pull and twist and hammer at.  You don't even notice the</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">gentle blue glow</> <text>has become an almost</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">violent violet</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>一个巨大的</><text s=\"colorcyan\">发光</><text>石头。一路冒险前行就发现这么个玩意，你不禁感到有点失望。然而，你</><text s=\"coloryellow\">拒绝</><text>空手而回。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你找到一大块可剥下的水晶</><text s=\"colorpink\">碎片</><text>，开始拉扯、扭曲、敲打。你甚至没有注意到轻柔的</><text s=\"colorcyan\">蓝光</><text>已经变成了近乎暴力的</><text s=\"colorcurse\">紫色</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"

#. Key:	9EB90960462CAC5EECAA67B80D448185
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>There is a lot of</> <text s=\"colorturquoise\">energy</> <text>in that room.  Far more than you want, need, or are comfortable being around.  You decide that</> <text s=\"colorgreen\">venturing</> <text>forward would be like swimming during a</> <text s=\"coloryellow\">lightning storm</><text>, and opt against risking anything.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Instead, you choose the straight path.  After all, the sooner you get past the</> <text s=\"colororange\">challenger</> <text>waiting for you, the sooner you can get to the </>{tournament}<text>.  Which means the sooner you get to fame, fortune, and</> <text s=\"colorpink\">funnel cakes</><text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>这片空间里充满了</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">能量</><text>，比你想要、需要，或能承受的要多得多。此时此刻前进就如在</><text s=\"coloryellow\">雷暴</><text>中游泳一样，风险十足。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你返回了笔直的主路。毕竟，越快通过等待你的</><text s=\"colororange\">挑战者</><text>们，就能越快进入</>{tournament}<text>，即越快获得名声、财富和</><text s=\"colorpink\">煎饼</><text>。</>"

#. Key:	66D45AD14F5B7E76B6847EA0C979FEFA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>It's been said that</> <text s=\"i\">the only way out is through</><text>.  Gazing out into the tunnel of</> <text s=\"shakingred\">pain and sadness</><text>, you realize whoever said that is</> <text s=\"b\">completely</> <text>wrong.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The only way out that you can see is back the way you came.  Down the second path...the</> <text s=\"colorblue\">boring path</><text>...the path of no sharp objects.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You decide that you've already gathered a fair bit of</> <text s=\"colororange\">energy</><text>.  It's time to cut your losses and face the last big</> <text s=\"colorcrimson\">challenge</> <text>before you arrive at the</> {tournament}<text>.</>\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>人们常说唯一的出路就是前路。凝视着通向</><text s=\"shakingred\">痛苦与悲伤</><text>的隧道，你意识到这话也不全对。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>目前唯一的出路貌似只剩来路，这第二条</><text s=\"colorblue\">无趣的路</><text>...这第二条无锐之路。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你觉得已经收集了足够多的</><text s=\"colororange\">能量</><text>，是时候止损来面对</>{tournament}<text>前的</><text s=\"colorcrimson\">大挑战</><text>了。</>"

#. Key:	F41942D34146D244CC0FE1A87034E769
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Leaving the room of dangerous </> <text s=\"colorbrown\">stalagtite spears</><text>, you find yourself face to face with a</> <text s=\"rainbow\">massive crystal</><text>.  It is an impressive sight to be sure, full of</> <text s=\"coloryellow\">radiant energy</> <text>and looking...somewhat imposing.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You decide to</> <text s=\"colorblue\">err</> <text>on the side of caution.  This is</> <text s=\"colorgreen\">well-hidden</> <text>for a reason, and you think better than to tempt fate.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>离开危险的</><text s=\"colorbrown\">石笋地</><text>，这次你又要面对一颗</><text s=\"rainbow\">巨大水晶</><text>。它确实很壮观，满满向外</><text s=\"coloryellow\">辐射能量</><text>，看起来很威严。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你决定</><text s=\"colorblue\">谨慎行事</><text>。这里被</><text s=\"colorgreen\">刻意隐藏</><text>一定有原因，赌命不是什么明智的选择。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonend}"

#. Key:	5F0713EB43C54597577E48B6EE988C0E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You place your hands on the</> <text s=\"colorturquoise\">gem-filled</> <text>wall and focus.  Soon, you can feel the</> <text s=\"colorblue\">energy</> <text>flow through the stones and into you.  After a moment, you pull away, knowing better than take too much.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You take a moment to let your new found</> <text s=\"colorpink\">vitality</> <text>surge through you, revitalizing you.  Feeling refreshed, you look into the next tunnel.</>  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor1}\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>你将双手放在</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">镶满宝石</><text>的墙上，集中注意力。很快，你感受到</><text s=\"colorblue\">能量</><text>通过石墙流入你体内。片刻之后，你抽回手，知道不能贪得无厌。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你花了一些时间让新获的</><text s=\"colorpink\">活力</><text>在体内激发，重振精神。你感觉到焕然一新，于是看向下一个通道口。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	0A1780E24B35A3A116F776A7A03825A3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You place your hands on the</> <text s=\"colorturquoise\">gem-filled</> <text>wall and focus.  Soon, you can feel the</> <text s=\"colorblue\">energy</> <text>flow through the stones and into you.  After a moment, you pull away, knowing better than take too much.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You take a moment to let your new found</> <text s=\"colorpink\">vitality</> <text>surge through you, revitalizing you.  Feeling refreshed, you look into the next tunnel.</>  \r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>你将双手放在</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">镶满宝石</><text>的墙上，集中注意力。很快，你感受到</><text s=\"colorblue\">能量</><text>通过石墙流入你体内。片刻之后，你抽回手，知道不能贪得无厌。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你花了一些时间让新获的</><text s=\"colorpink\">活力</><text>在体内激发，重振精神。你感觉到焕然一新，于是看向下一个通道口。</>"

#. Key:	252198804EAF7A45800572B187DCB527
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>What an incredible feeling.  So much</> <text s=\"colororange\">cosmic power</><text>, ripe for the taking.  And take, you do.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>They say you can have too much of a good thing, and the</> <text s=\"shakingpink\">feeling of nausea</> <text>you soon feel tells you they may be right.  You step away and collect yourself, though it takes several moments for that</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">feeling</> <text>to subside.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor1}\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>真是一种难以置信的感觉。如此多的</><text s=\"colororange\">宇宙之力</><text>，等待着被掌握，你的出手很果断。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>人们常说物极必反，而你很快感到的</><text s=\"shakingpink\">恶心感</><text>在向你验证这句话的正确性。你赶紧走开，花了几分钟才让那种</><text s=\"colorcurse\">感觉</><text>消散。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	B6AD5E964AED7F05EBE04B85E212EABB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As soon as you touch the</> <text s=\"colorturquoise\">gem-studded</><text> stone, you feel a warmth wash over you, like a great big</> <text s=\"colorpink\">cosmic hug</><text>.  You press your body against the wall, basking in the energy.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Before long, you feel a</> <text s=\"rainbow\">tingling</> <text>pain, but you don't pull away.  It must be some</> <text s=\"colororange\">secret special</> <text>cosmic power.  And it definitely won't come back to</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">haunt</> <text>you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor1}\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>你一触摸那颗被镶嵌的</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">宝石</><text>，就感到一股温流洗涤全身，像是整个宇宙在</><text s=\"colorpink\">环抱</><text>你一般。你紧贴着墙壁，沐浴在这股能量中。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>不久后，你感到一阵</><text s=\"rainbow\">刺痛</><text>，但你并未移开手。这肯定是某种</><text s=\"colororange\">神秘特殊</><text>的宇宙力量，而且绝不会在事后一直</><text s=\"colorcurse\">侵扰</><text>你。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	93A2B806470731DEE53D08A5F4F05711
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You</> <text s=\"colorgray\">steel</> <text>yourself and press forward, undettered by pointy things.  It's as if you are one with the</> <text s=\"caverns\">cavern</><text>, commanding the</> <text s=\"colorbrown\">stones</> <text>to bend from your path.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Either that, or you are</> <text s=\"colormagenta\">incredibly</> <text>lucky.  Whether it be skill or lucky, you cross the chasm</> <text s=\"colororange\">unscathed</><text>, and peer into the next room.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你</><text s=\"colorgray\">坚定</><text>地前进，无视脚底那些尖锐的物体。仿佛</><text s=\"caverns\">洞穴</><text>是你的私物一般，命令着那些</><text s=\"colorbrown\">石头</><text>从你所踏之路弯开。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>不管事情是否确实如此，还是只是走运，你</><text s=\"colororange\">毫发无损</><text>地穿过了这个深渊，并看向了下一片房间。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	BEFAE243450FC1C0EC4A72A1D5E5A913
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You pause for a moment, charting out your</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">best course</> <text>before carefully picking your way through the</> <text s=\"colorgray\">pointed stones</><text>.  Each step methodically planned out to avoided any</> <text s=\"shakingred\">unfortunate</> <text>accidents.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The large rocks you are able to avoid easily enough, but the smaller ones are</> <text s=\"colorblue\">trickier</><text>.  Still, you manage mostly unharmed, minus a</> <text s=\"colororange\">few bruises</><text>, and peer into the next room.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你停顿了片刻，仔细规划出</><text s=\"colorcyan\">最佳路线</><text>，然后小心翼翼地穿过</><text s=\"colorgray\">锐石群</><text>。每一步都经过深思熟虑，以避免任何</><text s=\"shakingred\">事端</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>较大的部分你可以轻松避开，但较小者则极为</><text s=\"colorblue\">棘手</><text>。尽管如此，你还是大体安全无恙，只是身上有些</><text s=\"colororange\">淤青</><text>。你朝下一片空间望去。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	BC7EFD904C5011B9DC62978684884447
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You don't think it looks too dangerous.  After all, you've handled</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">far worse</> <text>than a few spear-like</> <text s=\"colorbrown\">stone</> <text>formations.  You will be on the other side in no time.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Unfortunately, you seem to have overestimated your</> <text s=\"colorgreen\">agility</><text>. You take some</> <text s=\"colororange\">bumps</> <text>and</> <text s=\"colororange\">bruises</> <text>as you traverse the treacherous path, but nothing hurts as much as your</> <text s=\"colorpink\">ego</><text>. </>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你感觉情况并不危险。毕竟你经历过</><text s=\"colorcyan\">更糟糕</><text>的事。区区一些尖尖的</><text s=\"colorbrown\">石刺</><text>而已，你很快就能穿越到另一边。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>然而，你高估了自己的</><text s=\"colorgreen\">敏捷性</><text>。你</><text s=\"colororange\">跌跌撞撞</><text>地慢步前行，伴随着各处</><text s=\"colororange\">擦伤</><text>，但最让你受伤的还是</><text s=\"colorpink\">自尊</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"{caverndungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	6AFDE7AC41C875ED07814581A9FE565C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Caverns.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Path of Power"
msgstr "力量迷径"

#. Key:	B3D66BA44E492A6425F62792E6663A51
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Enter an abandoned manor - there is much to be found in forgotten places."
msgstr "进入一个废弃的庄园，这类地方通常可以发现很多东西。"

#. Key:	5A10CD1742C82F1E869BF7A3CF7D5D10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>On the outskirts of the city, you gaze upon a massive manor, seemingly no longer inhabited.  Surely there must be some </><text s=\"colorgold\">valuables</><text> left behind here. It's worth a detour to investigate the place.  As you approach the grand estate entrance, only two words come to mind to describe this venerable house: </>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorcrimson_b\">Opulent, and Imperial</><text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>在城市郊区，你凝视着一座巨大的庄园，似乎已经无人居住。这里肯定还有一些</><text s=\"colorgold\">贵重物品</><text>留下来，值得你绕道来调查一下。当你接近入口时，脑海中只有两个词可以形容这个庄园：</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorcrimson_b\">华丽</><text>、</><text s=\"colorcrimson_b\">庄严</><text>。</>"

#. Key:	03D5410649EC74463D48CEAA33D2529F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find yourself in some sort of reception room with a woman with soft lavender skin, deep orange eyes, and two small horns, filing her nails at a desk.  She looks up at you, then checks a clipboard of names.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">Mr. Krev, there is {playerracearticle} here to see you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You hear a growl from behind you and turn just as a massive three headed hellhound knocks you to the floor, perches on your chest, and mercilessly assaults you with face licks and tail wags.  Despite the pain in your ribs, you still can't help but pet the beast.  He is a good boy, after all.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现自己身处一个接待室，一位地狱裔女性正在桌前修剪指甲。她抬起头看着你，然后查看起一个名单。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">克瑞夫先生，这里有一位{playerrace}来找你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你听到身后传来一声低吼，转身时一只庞大的三头地狱犬将你击倒在地，压在胸口舔着你的脸。尽管肋骨疼痛，你还是忍不住抚摸着这只巨兽，毕竟它只是个孩子。</>"

#. Key:	0C64C6EB430017CFE72F62A4EBE3AC2A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Sitting behind a beautifully crafted mahogany desk sits a creature that would inspire awe if not for the tentacles.  He invites you to sit down, indicating that he is interested in making a deal with the newest future champion.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You sit across from him and listen to his offer, then counter with an offer of your own.  You aren't sure he is impressed by your charm or your gall, but he agrees to aid you in exchange for exposure.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一个生物坐在红木桌后，要不是长着触手的缘故你可能还想道一声惊奇。他邀请你坐下，说想和未来的冠军做一笔交易。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你坐在他对面，听完他的提议后开始拉扯，提出自己的意见。不知道是对你满意还是屈服于你的胆量，对方最终同意了你的条件。</>"

#. Key:	3FF3EA854B5DE4914A2280B26BF5219F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Sitting behind a beautifully crafted mahogany desk sits a creature that would inspire awe if not for the tentacles.  He invites you to sit down, indicating that he is interested in making a deal with the newest future champion.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>He slides a contract across the desk and invites you to read it over.  The two of you go back and forth for a several minutes, making changes here and there, until you both reach a satisfying conclusion.  As you shake on it, a slimy tendril wraps around your wrist, leaving a small mark on your palm.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一个长着触手的生物坐在红木桌后，看起来非常可怕。它邀请你坐下，说想和未来的冠军做一笔交易。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>对方递给你一份契约，示意你阅读。你们进行了几分钟的讨论和修订，直到双方都满意。当你们握手时，一根黏滑的触须缠绕着你的手腕，在你的手掌上留下了一个小印记。</>"

#. Key:	A8C812D64D7F193FFFDFA2A753BF2E2B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Sitting behind a beautifully crafted mahogany desk sits a creature that would inspire awe if not for the tentacles.  He invites you to sit down, indicating that he is interested in making a deal with the newest future champion.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Sitting on the desk is a contract.  An exchange of goods and services.  You read over the document, doing your best to understand the very intricate legalese littered on the pages.  What you don't read, however, is the fine print.  Not until after you've sealed the deal, that is.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一个长着触手的生物坐在红木桌后，看起来非常可怕。它邀请你坐下，说想和未来的冠军做一笔交易。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>桌上放着一份契约，用商品来交换服务。你仔细阅读文件，尽力理解页面上散布的非常复杂的法律术语。然而，你却犯了一个低级错误，直到交易定下后你才发现完全没注意到附加细则的存在。</>"

#. Key:	9221D63746A30290F709909D2C2716D5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Sitting behind a beautifully crafted mahogany desk sits a creature that would inspire awe if not for the tentacles.  He invites you to sit down, indicating that he is interested in making a deal with the newest future champion.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You settle yourself what could only be described as a throne across from the business squid as he begins to explain the details of the contract.  He begins by explaining what you will receive, which is all you need to hear.  You leap from the chair, grasp the wiggly appendage and tell him you'll take it.  This can't possible go wrong.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一个长着触手的生物坐在红木桌后，看起来非常可怕。它邀请你坐下，说想和未来的冠军做一笔交易。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你找了一个只能用王座来形容的椅子坐下，面对着那名八爪商人。他开始解释契约的细节，首先从你的获利开始，而这也是你感兴趣的全部内容。你迫不及待地从椅子上跳起，抓住对方那条摇摆的触手，直接告诉他交易完成，这绝对没什么问题。</>"

#. Key:	B2B9501A48674CCE4396ED896DEB217F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Blood moon in the sky...creepy castle in the middle of the woods...that unsettling feeling in the pit of your stomach.  All the tell tale signs that you are somewhere you definitely don't want to be.  You don't know what dangers may lurk inside the abandoned estate, but one thing you know for certain.  Nothing within those walls are part of a sane world.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Soon, the manor fades from your view like a bad dream, returning to the city to do something safer.  Like juggle knives, or sucker punch an Orc.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>天空中的一轮血月、树林中的阴森城堡，以及你心里的一种不安感。所有这些明显迹象表明这不是个适合人待的地方。你不确定这座废弃庄园内可能隐藏着什么危险，但很确定那墙内的一切都不属于正常世界。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>很快，庄园像一个恶梦般从你的视线中消失。你只能返回城市来做一些更安全的事，比如玩刀法，或者偷袭兽人。</>"

#. Key:	456443CD4D4DC65D5965A2965A462F99
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You never would have set foot inside the manor if you knew other feet would be in there with you.  You decide to take your trinket and slip back out into the night before whoever or whatever is here finds you tresspassing.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You race back to the comforting city lights, stopping at a local antiquarian to offload your ill-gotten gains and put the dreadful hamlet out of your mind.  Perhaps next time you will knock before barging into random homes.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>要是早知道庄园还有其他人涉足，那你也肯定不会踏足。你决定拿着掠夺品悄悄溜出去，以免被人发现侵入。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你赶紧跑回城市里，在当地的古董店里处理掉你的赃物并强迫自己忘掉这段回忆。也许下次在闯入别人家之前，应该先敲门。</>"

#. Key:	59C123334CBC302388C85B9BDA14E3E9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You don't remember making any appointments in creepy, dark, probably haunted houses.  And certainly with not any fiendish individuals.  You are sure you would remember.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Not wanting to offend whoever Mr. Krev is, you politely inform the secretary that you will have to reschedule as you back towards the door you came in.  Before she can raise a voice in protest, you spin around and bolt out of the manor in record speed.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你完全不记得有约过人在一个黑暗渗人还可能闹鬼的房子里见面，尤其是和与恶魔沾染的人。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>为了避免冒犯这位克瑞夫先生，你礼貌地告知秘书你需要重新安排会约时间，转身向门口走去。在她反应过来前，你已经以迅雷不及掩耳之势冲出了庄园。</>"

#. Key:	A5021A774368C8A8C45633B3C94B8040
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find a room full of curios and curiousities, each of them sure to fetch a good price at any market.  You spend some time examining the antiquities, and soon realize that they all seem warded by some abyssal script.  Not wanting to risk the wrath of the void, you begin to leave the baubles as they are when you notice something gleaming on the ground.  A pristine gem, almost begging you to take it.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the next room, you hear the sound of demonic murmuring and cackling.  You aren't sure what lies beyond, but you are certain it won't be pleasant.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现了一间充满奇珍异宝的房间，任意一件都可以说是价值连城。你花了好一阵检视这些珍宝，发现这些东西都被某种深渊魔法保护着。你不想和虚空惹上麻烦，准备要放弃这些宝物，但此时突然注意到地上有东西在闪闪发光。那是一颗崭新的宝石，它似乎在恳求着你带走它。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>从隔壁房间能听到恶魔低语与咯咯笑声。你暂时无从分辨内容，但绝非什么可庆贺之物。</>"

#. Key:	9E56E70E408E673E03810F9536ABFCD7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You notice a tapestry, blowing with an unseen force.  On further inspection, you discover a secret room which contains an ornate urn resting on a pedestal.  Looking around the room to be sure no one is watching, you pick up the urn and examine it.  As you do, the lid opens a little and a deep purple mist begins to seep out.  You quickly seal it back up, but not before some of the vapor clings to your skin.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the next room, you hear the sound of demonic murmuring and cackling.  You aren't sure what lies beyond, but you are certain it won't be pleasant.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你看到了一幅由神秘力量操控着飘动的挂毯。仔细查看后，你发现了一个秘密房间，里面一个底座上放置着一个华丽的瓮。环顾四周未发现有人后，你拿起瓮来详查。这时盖子突然打开，一股深紫色的雾气从里面渗出来。你迅速将其重新封好，但一些气体已经附着在你的皮肤上。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>从隔壁房间能听到恶魔低语与咯咯笑声。你暂时无从分辨内容，但绝非什么可庆贺之物。</>"

#. Key:	094F1D2C44EFF9B8274EB58020BBBAC2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Exploring the mansion, you stumble on a curio sitting in the middle of an otherwise empty hallway, filled with a number of objects that you are sure would fetch a good price at the market you passed by earlier.  As you grab an elegant jewelry box, shard of wood lodges itself in your skin.  It isn't until you remove the shard that you notice an engraved plaque.  \"Beware the splinter of discontent.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the next room, you hear the sound of demonic murmuring and cackling.  You aren't sure what lies beyond, but you are certain it won't be pleasant.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你在庄园里闲逛，偶然发现了一个宝贝。它摆在一条空旷走廊中央，里面放着一些好玩意，看样子就能卖个好价钱。当你拿起一只优雅的珠宝盒时，一些木刺扎进了你的皮肤。取出木刺后你才注意到附近写有“提防怨刺”这么句话。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>从隔壁房间能听到恶魔低语与咯咯笑声。你暂时无从分辨内容，但绝非什么可庆贺之物。</>"

#. Key:	06FC387B491AB67366DCB497DD5A9F36
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text> Wandering through the mansion, you somehow find your way into the kitchen.  You decide that, since you're here, you might as well see if there is anything to quench your thirst.  As if destined, you find an aged barrel of wine, along with a silver goblet to drink from.  You savor the wine slowly...gently.  As you finish the wine, you feel dizzy and light-headed.  Hopefully it is the wine, and nothing more.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the next room, you hear the sound of demonic murmuring and cackling.  You aren't sure what lies beyond, but you are certain it won't be pleasant.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你在庄园里闲逛，不知不觉到了厨房。既然来了，你打算看看有什么可解渴的。注定发生一般，你找到了一桶陈年葡萄酒和一个银质高脚杯。你慢慢享受着葡萄酒，喝完后感到头晕目眩。希望只是醉意吧。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>从隔壁房间能听到恶魔低语与咯咯笑声。你暂时无从分辨内容，但绝非什么可庆贺之物。</>"

#. Key:	5B7C602F4CF9E11E14B7BEA29FB92F26
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find yourself in some sort of reception room with a Hellborn woman filing her nails at a desk.  She looks up at you, then checks a clipboard of names.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">Mr. Krev, there is {playerracearticle} here to see you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Before you cross the threshhold into the lord of the manor's office, you notice a number of abyssal symbols around the door frame and the floor.  You recognize these symbols as a demonic trap, and say a few words to counteract the charm.  As you enter the office, you find yourself glad you read up on devilish deals and how to avoid them.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现自己身处一个接待室，一位地狱裔女性正在桌前修剪指甲。她抬起头看着你，然后查看起一个名单。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">克瑞夫先生，这里有一位{playerrace}来找你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>进入庄园领主的公室前，你注意到门框和地板周围有一些深渊符文。你认出这些符文是恶魔陷阱，于是念叨了几句来反制它。你很庆幸曾经读过一些关于恶魔交易以及如何避免的书籍。</>"

