#. Key:	3DE25A374E38378379D8B0B140D47116
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find yourself in some sort of reception room with a woman with soft lavender skin, deep orange eyes, and two small horns, filing her nails at a desk.  She looks up at you, then checks a clipboard of names.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">Mr. Krev, there is {playerracearticle} here to see you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>While you wait for this meeting you didn't know you had scheduled, you decide to chat up the receptionist.  You decide to impress her by speaking her native language.  All of the sudden she stands and slaps you hard across the face, then turns away.  Perhaps you aren't as fluent in her native tongue as you thought.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现自己身处一个接待室，一位地狱裔女性正在桌前修剪指甲。她抬起头看着你，然后查看起一个名单。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">克瑞夫先生，这里有一位{playerrace}来找你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在等待这名未约之客的预约时，你决定与接待员聊聊，用她的母语来留下一个好印象。聊的途中她突然站起来，狠狠地打了你一巴掌，然后转身离开。也许你并不像自以为的那样精通她的母语。</>"

#. Key:	05551C854A61EF4C979940A81078CA0A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
