#. Key:	732CCCA741C08585E4B93C9782B7CA43
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find yourself in some sort of reception room with a woman with soft lavender skin, deep orange eyes, and two small horns, filing her nails at a desk.  She looks up at you, then checks a clipboard of names.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">Mr. Krev, there is {playerracearticle} here to see you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You pull a book off the a nearby shelf and start reading through it to pass the time, not aware that  you opted for the Beginner's Guide to Incantations.  As you read the words aloud, you don't realize that you've unwittingly cast a spell.  At least, not until a desk plant explodes violently right next to you.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现自己身处一个接待室，一位地狱裔女性正在桌前修剪指甲。她抬起头看着你，然后查看起一个名单。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">克瑞夫先生，这里有一位{playerrace}来找你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你从附近的书架上抽出一本书，开始打发时间，但没注意到标题是《咒语入门指南》。当你小声朗读内容时，不小心念出了一个咒语，至少，桌旁的一株植物直接爆开了。</>"

#. Key:	6D02155F4D55BB65373FF1A33FE24BF5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_City.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Estate Manor"
msgstr "大庄园"

#. Key:	80ABA2D140D0A4BE171285AD93CA2379
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Delve into a massive, sandy tomb."
msgstr "潜入一个巨大的沙漠墓穴。"

#. Key:	8089CB4F48BDD371C5470D934BF21778
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid "<text>Far past the Oasis' </><text s=\"colorgreen_b\">palms</><text> and </><text s=\"colorcyan_b\">pools</><text>, you see a </><text s=\"colororange_bl\">monument.</><text> Lying on the horizon, it bears the image of some </><text s=\"colorturquoise_bl\">skeletal serpent</><text>, its form extruding from </><text s=\"colororange\">desert stone.</><text>   Stepping inside, you find nearly empty corridor, the walls lined with a number of stone</> <text s=\"colorturquoise\">serpentine</> <text>soldiers, standing ready to guard against any would-be pillager.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>向绿洲的</><text s=\"colorgreen_b\">棕榈树</><text>和</><text s=\"colorcyan_b\">水池</><text>方向远远望去，你看到一座</><text s=\"colororange_bl\">遗迹。</><text>它躺在地平线上，雕刻有一只</><text s=\"colorturquoise_bl\">骨蛇</><text>的形象，从</><text s=\"colororange\">沙石</><text>向外突出。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>踏入内部，你发现几乎空无一物的走廊，墙上排列着许多</><text s=\"colorturquoise\">石蛇</><text>士兵，准备随时防范任何潜在的掠夺者。</>"

#. Key:	08E432B24B3A052086C712B7FD424E73
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You watch as the massive boulder charges toward you, fear and panic quickly settling into your legs and freezing them in place.  You close your eyes, hold out your hands, and manage to grip onto the rocky surface as it passes.  Luckily, the rail the stone rolls on is deep enough that you don't turn to paste, and you roll with the stone all the way down the hallway, jumping off right at the end.  </>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the next room, you see an</> <text s=\"colorophid\">Ophid</> <text>shaman praying in front of a great stone depiction of the Lunar Serpent.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你眼睁睁看着巨石朝你冲来，吓得一动不动。你闭紧眼睛，张开双臂，所幸抓住了巨石的表面，跟着它一起滚动。万幸，你抓住的地方刚好属于整个类球体的凹面，因此与地面接触时没有被直接压成肉饼，并在最后时刻及时摆脱了它。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在下一个房间里，你看到一位</><text s=\"colorophid\">拜蛇萨满</><text>在一座描绘着月蛇神的巨大石像前祈祷。</>"

#. Key:	9B2A9A284650733CE75C8A9CEC82722A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The shaman turns towards you, but instead of attacking, she welcomes you inside.  She tells you that she is impressed that you have passed the test, and now all you must do is drink the Moon Venom.  She says that by doing so, you will be granted the blessing of the lunar serpent.  However...there may be side effects.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You swallow the liquid in one shot.  It burns as it travels down your throat, but its not entirely unpleasant.  As a matter of fact, it's better than the ale at many taverns you've been to.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>萨满转身面向你，但她并没有发动攻击，而是迎接你入内。她对你通过考验感到很欣慰，示意你只需再服下月蛇毒即可。按她的意思，服下后就能获得月蛇神的祝福，只是可能会有副作用。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你一口气将液体咽下，它在喉咙中燃烧而过，但没有到无法忍受的地步。实际上可能比你在许多酒馆试过的麦酒都更温和。</>"

#. Key:	D821BF5A4153C859E005519DEF2FB05F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The shaman turns towards you, but instead of attacking, she welcomes you inside.  She tells you that she is impressed that you have passed the test, and now all you must do is drink the Moon Venom.  She says that by doing so, you will be granted the blessing of the lunar serpent.  However...there may be side effects.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You shiver as the tonic snakes down your gullet.  It's certainly an interesting taste to say the least.  Your vision blurs, your head swims, and you realize that while it could have been better, it also could probably be a lot worse.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>萨满转身面向你，但她并没有发动攻击，而是迎接你入内。她对你通过考验感到很欣慰，示意你只需再服下月蛇毒即可。按她的意思，服下后就能获得月蛇神的祝福，只是可能会有副作用。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你打了个寒颤，调制品如流蛇般顺着喉咙滑下，不过至少它的味道有点意思。你的视线一时模糊，头昏脑涨。情况虽然可能更好，但更可能更糟。</>"

#. Key:	E94918D647A31965C65E6AA221D2AC2D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The shaman turns towards you, but instead of attacking, she welcomes you inside.  She tells you that she is impressed that you have passed the test, and now all you must do is drink the Moon Venom.  She says that by doing so, you will be granted the blessing of the lunar serpent.  However...there may be side effects.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You smell the tincture, then close your eyes and swallow it down. It crawls through your body like a serpent, before finally settling.  Few things are worse than what you just experienced.  Like {randomreplacement|3}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>萨满转身面向你，但她并没有发动攻击，而是迎接你入内。她对你通过考验感到很欣慰，示意你只需再服下月蛇毒即可。按她的意思，服下后就能获得月蛇神的祝福，只是可能会有副作用。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你闻了闻这剂品的味道，闭上眼睛将其吞下。它像一条蛇一样在你的身体中蔓延，在你的胃中舞动，最后安定下来。你列举不出能比这个更糟糕的东西了，就像{randomreplacement|3}一样。</>"

