#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
