#. Key:	8C560AC14A810C3965011785AAC562C3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The shaman turns towards you, but instead of attacking, she welcomes you inside.  She tells you that she is impressed that you have passed the test, and now all you must do is drink the Moon Venom.  She says that by doing so, you will be granted the blessing of the lunar serpent.  However...there may be side effects.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It's foul.  It's disgusting.  It makes you regret all your life decisions.  You don't know what it's made of, but anything must be better than this.  As you stagger your way outside, you can only hope the nausea is worth it.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>萨满转身面向你，但她并没有发动攻击，而是迎接你入内。她对你通过考验感到很欣慰，示意你只需再服下月蛇毒即可。按她的意思，服下后就能获得月蛇神的祝福，只是可能会有副作用。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>这真是难以下咽，令人极度恶心。它让你后悔起人生做过的所有决定。你不知道它是由什么制成的，甚至怀疑屎都比这个香。当你摇摇晃晃地走出去时，只能希望这种反胃感是值得的。</>"

#. Key:	E2EE67BB4AEAE333B3CE89B19DA24797
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You've read about temples like this.  You've heard of the dangers.  Of how no one who ever ventures into these sorts of tombs recounts the wonderful experience they have inside.  You don't know what sort of treasures may be hiding inside such a beautiful structure, but they are probably better off left inside.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you continue on your quest to the Tournament, you can't help but wonder if there is anything inside that could give you an edge.  Perhaps another time...</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你对这样的神庙可能蕴含的危险早有耳闻。没有任何亲历者在讲述他们的故事时过程很美妙。如此精美的建筑内可能隐藏着什么宝藏暂且不管，它们可能还是更适合就待在那。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你继续前往大赛的旅途时，你不禁想知道里面是否有任何可以给你带来优势的东西。也许下次吧...</>"

#. Key:	B84DEAF943D9F0A91A4DF1A6D81CCEBD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You realize that the best way to avoid becoming a pancake is to go in the other direction.  The noxious vapors that filled the entrance have already dissipated, you've learned a little bit about the temple...time to go.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The door to the next room closes in front of you, preventing you from bypassing the temple's rolling challenge.  Though, judging by the sound of pebbles grinding into dust, you think you've made the right decision.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你意识到避免成为肉饼的最保险方法是立即掉头离开。弥漫在入口处的毒雾已经消散，你也对这座神庙有了一些了解...是时候离开了。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>刚才房间的门再次紧闭，以防你用这种方式逃过滚石挑战。不过，根据石子研磨成尘土的声音，你认为估计做出了正确的决定。</>"

#. Key:	9435902F424ABA0941E3D48199F1BCF8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Nothing good has ever come from a lone priestess deep in an ancient temple surrounded by deadly traps.  The chanting, the ominous atmostphere, and the giant feathered snake statue all add up to what is most likely a bad time.  You opt for caution and retrace your steps back to the entrance to the pyramid.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you look back at the great temple through the haze of the desert heat, you think to yourself 'Snakes.  Why did it have to be snakes?'</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>只身一位女祭司深入古老的神庙，周围还布满了致命陷阱，这怎么可能会是什么好事。咏唱声、不祥的氛围，和巨大的羽蛇雕像都预示着即将到来的糟糕时刻。你选择谨慎起见，原路返回遗迹的入口。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你透过沙漠热浪回望那座扭曲的大神庙时，你心中默念着：“为什么偏偏要是蛇呢？”</>"

#. Key:	F6400CEA4019E06701774BBC4339A963
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Just before you take your first step, you notice a number of outlines along the floor, a sure sign of pressure plates to trigger some sort of horrible trap.  You carefully pick your way through, avoiding each nearly imperceptible snare, until you reach the end of the hall unscathed and ready to take on the next challenge.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As soon as you step into the next room, you step on a switch, followed by the sight of a massive boulder heading your way.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>就在你迈出第一步之前，你注意到地板上有许多浅突起，很明显这是某种可怕陷阱的触发方式。你小心翼翼地穿过，避开几乎每一个极难察觉的陷阱，直到安全地到达走廊的尽头，准备迎接下一个挑战。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你踏入下个房间的瞬间，踩到了一个开关，随后一个巨石向你滚来。</>"

#. Key:	942170334DBA5BB56AC9D1A8373B1A6D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Wisdom warns you that these tombs are not without their threats.  Just as you suspect, you find several pressure plates, which you deftly avoid.  Unfortunately, you don't see all of them, and before you reach the end of the corridor, you hear a dreaded *CLICK* followed by the sound of hissing coming from the stone warriors.  They each release a</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">deep purple mist</><text>, and though you race towards the end of the hall, you take a breath of that unholy fog.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As soon as you step into the next room, you step on a switch, followed by the sight of a massive boulder heading your way.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>直觉告诉你这些墓穴并非毫无威胁。正如所怀疑的那样，你发现了几个按压板，于是巧妙地避开了它们。不幸的是，你只发现了它们的一部分。在你到达走廊尽头之前，听见可怕的一声“咔嚓”，紧接着石制士兵们发出嘶嘶声。每只都释放出一股</><text s=\"colorcurse\">紫雾</><text>。纵使你用尽力气向着走廊尽头奔去，还是吸入了不少那股邪恶的雾气。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你踏入下个房间的瞬间，踩到了一个开关，随后一个巨石向你滚来。</>"

#. Key:	338AE9FD4C51914D9F1C8BB41DEBAC0B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The long rows of imposing snake-like soldiers give you the feeling that the less time you spend in this room, the better.  Wasting no time, you begin to sprint through the corridor, carelessly triggering a trap hidden the floor.  By the time you are halfway through, the room is full in a dense cloud of purple smoke.  You pick up the pace, reaching the next room, but not before taking in a few deep breaths of that foul fog.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As soon as you step into the next room, you step on a switch, followed by the sight of a massive boulder heading your way.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>那两排威风凛凛蛇形士兵让你非常害怕。于是没有任何犹豫，你开始顺着走廊跑起来，中途不小心触发了地板上的陷阱。跑到一半你就发现整个房间被一团紫色烟雾笼罩。你赶紧加快速度，冲进下一个房间，虽然还是吸进去几口。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你踏入下个房间的瞬间，踩到了一个开关，随后一个巨石向你滚来。</>"

#. Key:	BC72CD734DF36596779E42BDE57F64CD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>There is something about those sculptures that draws your attention.  The detail is so accurate, you could swear you can hear it hiss.  By the time you realize that it isn't your imagination, the door back to the sand and sun is closed off, and you find yourself trapped in a vile haze.  Coughing and sputtering, you manage to make you way to the next room.  The door outside opens again, clearing out the smoke for the next poor soul.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As soon as you step into the next room, you step on a switch, followed by the sight of a massive boulder heading your way.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>那些雕塑莫名使你十分着迷，它们的细节栩栩如生，甚至能听见嘶嘶作响的呼吸声。当你意识到这不是你的想象时，通往沙滩和阳光的门已被关闭，你发现自己被困在一堵恶臭的雾气之中。在剧烈的咳嗽中，你艰难地走进下个房间。外面的门再次打开，烟雾尽散，准备迎接下一个可怜人。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你踏入当前房间的瞬间，踩到了一个开关，随后一个巨石向你滚来。</>"

#. Key:	3C1B3F8F489D5BAC83A300BE0CFDB903
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Looking about the space, you notice several stones jutting from the wall which you can use as foothold to scale up near the ceiling.  In a feat of either daring or desperation, you leap from the wall onto the boulder, dancing atop the massive stone to keep your balance.  As you reach the end, you leap from the boulder in a spectacular dismount.  If only you had an audience... </>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the next room, you see an</> <text s=\"colorophid\">Ophid</> <text>shaman praying in front of a great stone depiction of the Lunar Serpent.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>环顾四周，你注意到了墙壁上几处凸出，它们可以用来攀爬至天花板附近。不知是胆大还是已经无路可逃，你直接跳到滚动巨石的上方，一边保持平衡一边自由舞动。当巨石到达房间的尽头时，你纵身一跃，壮观收尾。要是有观众在场就好了...</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在下一个房间里，你看到一位</><text s=\"colorophid\">拜蛇萨满</><text>在一座描绘着月蛇神的巨大石像前祈祷。</>"

#. Key:	572303E44212594F06C036856C42CC49
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You take off in a dead sprint, the rolling boulder hot on your heels.  You don't have time to look back, and the growing sound of stone against stone doesn't give you much cause to slow down.  As you reach the end of the hallway, you leap through the air to safety just before the boulder reaches you, turning a corner and disappearing into darkness.  Unfortunately, you didn't quite stick the landing,...</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the next room, you see an</> <text s=\"colorophid\">Ophid</> <text>shaman praying in front of a great stone depiction of the Lunar Serpent.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你全速奔跑，身后的巨石紧追不舍。你没有时间回头看，因为身后石头相撞的声音越来越大。当到达走廊尽头时，你纵身一跃，刚好及时到达安全之处。而巨石下一秒抵达，转弯消失在黑暗中。不幸的是，你的着地方式有瑕疵，导致手受伤了。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在下一个房间里，你看到一位</><text s=\"colorophid\">拜蛇萨满</><text>在一座描绘着月蛇神的巨大石像前祈祷。</>"

#. Key:	CF29870248691E93872E4590A5760324
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You know you can't outrun the big and bouldy, so you frantically scan the walls for an alternative.  You spy a small crevice and wedge yourself into it...almost.  You can't entirely fit inside the hole, which you realize as the boulder rushes past, scraping along the soft exposed bits as it does.  Not great, but it could be worse.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the next room, you see an</> <text s=\"colorophid\">Ophid</> <text>shaman praying in front of a great stone depiction of the Lunar Serpent.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你深知自己跑不过那巨大的滚石，所以疯狂地扫视着墙壁，寻找另一个避险方案。你发现了一个小裂缝，勉勉强强挤了进去...当巨石滚过时，你才发现无法完全将身体挤入，于是暴露在外的柔软部位被碾过。虽然不太理想，但至少保住了小命。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在下一个房间里，你看到一位</><text s=\"colorophid\">拜蛇萨满</><text>在一座描绘着月蛇神的巨大石像前祈祷。</>"

#. Key:	F3AFD84E4ED26184D18E2990EE75138C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Desert.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Mystery of the Tomb"
msgstr "墓穴之谜"

#. Key:	F6398B9C423FA1127FD3D4AA792FAF29
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Help stop a group of renegade machines from wrecking havoc."
msgstr "帮忙阻止一堆反叛的机器人制造混乱。"

#. Key:	0755683946A417DBF37CD2B5D3957676
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You pause at an intersection at the sound of</> <text s=\"shakingyellow\">yelling</> <text>and</> <text s=\"shakingyellow\">screaming</> <text>coming from the main</> <text s=\"factory\">factory</> <text>floor.  You watch as someone races down the hallway, followed by another...and then another.  Soon, a</> <text s=\"colororange\">mob</> <text>of people are fleeing some unseen force.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It only takes a moment to find the cause.  It seems a number of</> {factory}<text> machines have gone haywire and are</> <text s=\"shakingturquoise\">terrorizing</> <text>the employees.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>That can't be safe for work.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你在一个十字路口停下，听到</><text s=\"factory\">工厂</><text>车间传来的</><text s=\"shakingyellow\">喊叫声</><text>与</><text s=\"shakingyellow\">尖叫声。</><text>你看到有人在走廊上狂奔，紧接着又一个人...然后又一个。很快，</><text s=\"colororange\">一群人</><text>都像在逃离某种你还没发现的事物。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>只需片刻，你就找到了原因。似乎有几台</>{factory}<text>的机器失控了，正在</><text s=\"shakingturquoise\">恐吓</><text>员工 。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>这下他们怎么安心工作？</>"

#. Key:	8697906A4C77E47AEE36BAA8E6749DFB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find yourself face to face with a massive terminal gone haywire.  A {shakingpurple}frazzled{text} engineer pulls you in, telling you its your problem now, then disappears outside.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You don't know the first thing about {green}machines{text}, though.  What you do know, however, is how to smash things. In your recklessness, {shakingyellow}electricity{text} flies everywhere, but mostly through you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现自己面对着一个失控的巨大终端。一名{shakingpurple}焦头烂额{text}的工程师把你拉进去，告诉你现在这是你的问题了，然后就消失到外面。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你对{green}机械{text}一窍不通，但你略懂拳脚维修术。在你的莽撞之下，{shakingyellow}电流{text}四处飞溅，但主要目标还是你。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	E68FDA5F4C3B2342C895468894F9E68E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You've worked with {orange}engineers{text} before, and it seems some of their skills rubbed off on you.  It doesn't take too long before the suit {rainbow}sparkles{text} like new.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You take it for a {yellow}spin{text}, and afterward, it compacts into a little briefcase.  Sometimes, you even {pink}impress{text} yourself.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>之前你曾与{orange}工程师{text}们共事过，自然耳濡目染了一些实用技能。很快，这件外骨骼的功能就{rainbow}恢复如初{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你{yellow}试穿{text}了一下，没发现什么问题。随后它竟然自行压缩成了一个公文包大小，有时候你自己都不知道自己{pink}这么厉害{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"

#. Key:	FD6AF9614F08CB96474DD28BDDA4AFCE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>After some examination, you realize that with a little {brown}elbow grease{text}, this thing will be good as new.  That, and a few {gold}gold{text} conductors.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You lose yourself in your work, enjoying {wavingyellow}tinkering{text} with the suit.  Finally, it {pink}whirs{text} to life, giving you a deep sense of {cyan}satisfaction{text}.  This is surely money well spent.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>经过一番检查，你发现只要稍微出点{brown}力气{text}，就能复原功能，只差一些{gold}金制导线{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你沉浸在修复工作中，享受着{wavingyellow}小修小补{text}的过程。最终，它{pink}嗡嗡{text}地启动了，给你带来了深深的{cyan}满足感{text}。这汗水绝对物超所值。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"

#. Key:	714FF9934A9F3ADFFF7A73954CB40F99
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>She is a {pink}beauty{text}...if you can look past the {brown}rust{text} and loose wires.  It would take some effort, and you would need the right tools.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>A noise behind you catches your attention as a {goblin}goblin{text} is setting up shop, selling all manner of {orange}tools{text} and equipment perfect for {yellow}engineering{text} work.  They really never do miss an opportunity for {gold}capitalism{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>她是一件{pink}美妙之物{text}...只要能忽略{brown}锈迹{text}以及松散导线的话。想修复需要些工夫，还有合适的工具。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你身后传来一阵声音，一只{goblin}地精{text}已经开始摆摊，出售各种{orange}工具{text}和设备，恰恰匹配你{yellow}需求{text}。他们确实从不错过任何一个{gold}发财{text}的机会。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"

#. Key:	243022874C4E68D255343F863A182690
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>It takes a little bit of work, but you manage to get the old girl {pink}purring{text} agian.  You decide, however, that it needs to be {cyan}alluring{text}.  Elegant.  And most of all, {rainbow}sparkly{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Gems...{gold}gold{text}...priceless family heirlooms.  If it's valuable, it's on display.  It was either that, or buy something {blue}useful{text}.  Now, you aren't rich, but at least you've got {wavingyellow}style{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>经过一番捣鼓，你还是让这位老姑娘再次{pink}哼唧{text}起来。然而，它还不够{cyan}诱人{text}、不够优雅，最重要的是不够{rainbow}耀人{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>宝石{text}、{gold}黄金{text}，以及无价的传家宝。有价值或有用处的东西全给你用上换装饰品了。你牺牲的只是金钱，可不能让她牺牲{wavingyellow}风度{text}！</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"

#. Key:	5DAAA65E40EEA1009CFD3F9A4E2C3FB3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You recall a great many stories about {shakingorange}robot uprising{text}, mostly told by </>{kiodini}<text>, and they always end badly.  You opt to avoid seeing if any of those {blue}stories{text} come to true.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Before long, a</> <text s=\"factory\">factory</><text> wide announcement informs you that it was a giant prank, and those who are responsible have been {pink}sacked{text}.  Or are in a {pink}sack{text}.  You aren't sure which.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你回忆起许多关于{shakingorange}机器人造反{text}的故事，大多是</>{kiodini}<text>告诉你的，结局一般都不太好。你决定最好还是避免亲眼见证那些{blue}故事{text}变成现实。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>不久之后，</><text s=\"factory\">厂间</><text>新闻表示这只是一个大规模恶作剧。那些参与者已经{pink}卷了铺盖{text}，或者被卷在{pink}铺盖{text}里，你不确定是哪个意思。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"

#. Key:	2FD7A54B4C841898E165108EEE2D7B38
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You peer into the room to see a {orange}specialist{text} banging at a massive console with a hammer.  Then a {gray}wrench{text}.  Then a baseball bat.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It is clear that whoever is in there is an expert {yellow}engineer{text}, and decide it best to let the man work.  As you turn away, you hear the distinct {shakingorange}buzz{text} of a chainsaw.  He'll be fine...{smalltext}probably{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你向房间内张望，看到一名{orange}专家{text}正在用锤子敲打一个巨大的控制台，然后用{gray}扳手{text}，再用球棒。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>很明显，这是位熟练的{yellow}工程师{text}，你决定最好不要打扰他作业。当你转身离开时，听到了清晰的{shakingorange}链锯声{text}。他应该会没事的...{smalltext}大概{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"

#. Key:	E25566DA42D9189DD5A23D94F169B653
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>What are you going to do with something like that?  It's big, it's bulky, and doesn't go with any of your {rainbow}outfits{text}.  No one is going to tell {wavingpink}flattering{text} stories about anyone wearing that.</>  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You decide to let the {yellow}armor{text} continue collecting mothballs.  Maybe if there was a {green}nuclear apocalypse{text}, you would consider it.  Doubtful, but maybe.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>穿着这玩意能干嘛？它又大又笨重，跟你的任何一套{rainbow}服装{text}都不搭。哪怕你成为冠军没人会为身着这种蠢玩意的家伙{wavingpink}写赞歌{text}的。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你决定让这套{yellow}外骨骼{text}继续集尘。要是哪天发生{green}核灾难{text}，你可能还会考虑一下。可能性不大，但也说不准。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonend}"

#. Key:	0B62F07F40CC8B7BCF6B658F02255297
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You rush down the hall to help those fleeing for their lives.  As you approach, the once</> <text s=\"colorgreen\">terrified</> <text>workers pause to look at you.  Even the machines stop their</> <text s=\"shakingred\">chaotic rampage</> <text>to admire your</> <text s=\"rainbow\">heroic</> <text>stature.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Realizing this, the employees resume </><text s=\"colorblue\">running</><text> for safety.  An overhead fan turns on,</> <text s=\"wavingyellow\">blowing your hair and cape</> <text>gently in the wind.  Though, you don't recall putting on a cape...</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In a nearby room, calls for help barely overcome the sounds of</> <text s=\"colororange\">whirring</> <text>and</> <text s=\"colororange\">grinding</><text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你冲向走廊，去帮助那些逃命的人们。当你靠近时，那些</><text s=\"colorgreen\">恐惧万分</><text>的工人们却停下脚步望着你。包括之前暴动的机器人也停下</><text s=\"shakingred\">破坏</><text>行为来欣赏你的</><text s=\"rainbow\">英勇姿态</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>注意到这点，员工们继续</><text s=\"colorblue\">奔跑</><text>寻求安全。顶部的风扇莫名其妙被打开，</><text s=\"wavingyellow\">轻轻吹动着你的头发和披风</><text>，虽然你不记得什么时候穿上了披风...</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>附近的一间房间里，呼救声几乎要被</><text s=\"colororange\">嗡嗡声</><text>和</><text s=\"colororange\">打磨声</><text>盖过。</>"

#. Key:	DA2F9D404D4546AEFA0072935CAEEA6A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As the </><text s=\"colorblue\">mob passes</><text> by, you find   yourself backed against a wall, </><text s=\"shakingred\">accosted</><text> by a robot who demands in the most</> <text s=\"colororange\">irritating</><text>, monotone voice to speak to your supervisor.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You don't even work there, yet promise fetch one immediately.  Anything to get out of its way.  Those</> <text s=\"wavingpink\">poor souls</><text> will have to fend for themselves.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>随着</><text s=\"colorblue\">人群经过</><text>，你发现自己被一台机器人逼到了墙边。它用最</><text s=\"colororange\">恼人</><text>、单调的声音要求与你的主管谈话。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你虽然不是这的员工，但还是假意答应对方的要求，只为了躲开它。那些</><text s=\"wavingpink\">可怜的人</><text>将不得不自己解决这个问题。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	CF631744459D0FE7BE7EADB4C6038004
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You soon discover the source of the {shakingpurple}terror{text}, and it truly is a frightening sight.  Chasing the personnel, armed with {blue}water guns{text} and {pink}pastries{text}, are clowns.  Crazed, robotic {rainbow}clowns{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You lure them into a tiny {brown}supply closet{text}, hiding along the ceiling until they have all piled in.  As you {cyan}escape{text}, you wonder how they all fit in such a {smalltext}small space{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>很快，你发现了引起{shakingpurple}恐慌{text}的源头，而那真是一个可怕的景象。追逐着员工的是穿着装备有{blue}水枪{text}和{pink}点心{text}的小丑。字面意义上疯狂的机械人{rainbow}小丑{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你把它们引诱到一个小{brown}储藏室{text}，自己躲在天花板上，直到它们都堆在里面。最后当你{cyan}逃脱{text}时，你想知道它们是如何挤在{smalltext}这么小的空间{text}里的。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	D706C2CF4AA4A3FF6184D1BC4EC4C0FC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You slide to a halt as a mob of men and machines head toward.  You stand there, </><text s=\"rainbow\">heroically</><text>, announcing you are here to</> <text s=\"colormagenta\">rescue</> <text>them.  However, no one seems to notice you...or</> <text s=\"shakingorange\">slow down</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Before you know it, you are face down on the ground, like</> <text s=\"wavingyellow\">{playerracearticle} speedbump</><text>. When it's over, your hair is a mess, your new clothes are </><text s=\"colorbrown\">covered in shoeprints</><text>, and you swear you can hear</> <text s=\"colorpink\">birds</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>当一群人和机器向你走来时，你一个滑歩停了下来。你站在那里，</><text s=\"rainbow\">英勇地</><text>宣布你来此</><text s=\"colormagenta\">拯救</><text>他们。然而，似乎没人注意到你...甚至没人</><text s=\"shakingorange\">放慢脚步</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在你反应过来之前，脸已经朝下摔倒在地，就像是一条</><text s=\"wavingyellow\">人形减速带</><text>。一切结束后，你的头发凌乱不堪，新衣服上都是</><text s=\"colorbrown\">脚踩印</><text>，还能听到头顶有</><text s=\"colorpink\">鸟叫音</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	B35EFFEC41F7380AE523468BA15342C2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The calls are coming from the main control room, where a haggard {yellow}engineer{text} is trying to shut down the main system.  He looks to your for {blue}help{text}, clearly in over his head.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Examining the master controls, you discover the cause of the {orange}riot{text}.  Someone flipped a switch from {cyan}pacifist{text} mode to {shakingred}global domination{text} mode.  How careless.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>呼救声来自主控室，那里一名疲惫不堪的{yellow}工程师{text}正在试图关闭主系统。他向你寻求{blue}帮助{text}，显然有些应接不暇。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>检查主控制台，你发现了这次{orange}骚乱{text}的原因。有人把开关从{cyan}和平{text}模式切换到了{shakingred}统治世界{text}模式。真是够粗心。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	4C6F7D064D39E8B0FD03D48F7313DD76
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A young engineer is pleading with a console, {shakingorange}begging{text} it to turn off.  As you come in, he bids you good luck and rushes out of the room, leaving you with the {brown}rogue network{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Rather than risk pushing the </><text s=\"colorred\">wrong button</><text>, you reach behind the console and unplug it.  Unfortunately, you snag a {cyan}bare wire{text} and give yourself </><text s=\"shakingyellow\">little jolt</><text> in the process.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>一个年轻的工程师正在{shakingorange}乞求{text}控制台停止运作。当你走进来后，他道了声好运，匆忙离开了房间，把这个{brown}失控网络{text}留给了你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>为了避免按下</><text s=\"colorred\">错误按钮</><text>，你伸手到控制台后部将电源拔掉。不幸的是，你卡住了一根{cyan}裸露的电线{text}，给了自己一点</><text s=\"shakingyellow\">小触电</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	E0E0AEFC47FA5DB53F4B40B376269F54
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You step inside the server room just as an {green}engineer{text} is heading out.  As he grabs your hand to plead for your help, you realize he forgot to {brown}ground{text} himself, giving you the biggest {shakingyellow}static shock{text} of your life.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Examining the main controls, you discover the cause of the {orange}riot{text}.  Someone flipped a switch from {cyan}pacifist{text} mode to {shakingred}global domination{text} mode.  How careless.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你走进服务器房，碰上一名{green}工程师{text}正要离开。他拉住你的手，请求你的帮助，你突然惊觉他忘记给自己{brown}接地{text}了，导致你受到了生平最大的{shakingyellow}静电冲击{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>检查主控制台，你发现了这次{orange}骚乱{text}的原因。有人把开关从{cyan}和平{text}模式切换到了{shakingred}统治世界{text}模式。真是够粗心。</>\n"
"\n"
"{factorydungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	F35297944D5D2D92E4AA47A41BA6BC79
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Factory.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Robots Gone Wild"
msgstr "失控机器人"

#. Key:	5D7B49C643CDF11BFE50B4B4B4B1BABC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Ethelfrith's last gift grants curses... at a price."
msgstr "埃瑟芙丝的终礼可提供诅咒...但有代价。"

#. Key:	130A234F4D99C4A460B164AF4CAC39C2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You find a {purple}crudely{text} written sign that just reads {wavingyellow}\"Boss wanted.  Apply within\"{text} along with an arrow {blue}pointing{text} to the largest {pink}mausoleum{text} you've ever seen.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Curious, you step inside to find a {gold}hammer-shaped{text} paperweight holding down what appears to be a contract.  However, as soon you pick it up, your {shakingorange}name{text} appears on the dotted line.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Soon, you are surrounded by a dozen {gray}skeletons{text}, one of which is wearing a hard hat.  {speech}\"You must be new boss.  Good.  Been bored.  Need work.  Give job.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现一块刻字{purple}缭乱{text}的标牌，上面写着{wavingyellow}“招聘老板，请入内申请”{text}。它的旁边还有一个箭头{blue}指向{text}你目及过的最大的{pink}墓室{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>为了一探究竟，你走了进去，发现一个{gold}锤形{text}的镇纸压着一份看起来像是契约的东西。然而，当你拿起它时，你的{shakingorange}名字{text}赫然出现在契约的虚线处。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>很快，你被一群{gray}骷髅{text}包围，其中一个戴着...安全帽。{speech}“你就是新老板吧。很好。我们无聊了。需要工作。给我们任务。”</>"

#. Key:	4B6F16D54806755B970BE4A659639FB6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(10).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Everyone needs to relax now and then, even the {purple}undead{text}.  Quickly the boys set to work building a brand new {brown}tavern{text}, and invite you inside to be their first customer.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You sample the house wine, which is thick and sweet, when the foreskull walks up.  {speech}\"What you think?  Very cozy, yeah?  Of course, no fruit grow in cemetary, so, uhh...boys had to improvise.  We no think they be missed, no worries.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>每个人都需要偶尔放松一下，即使是{purple}死灵{text}。很快，这些家伙开始建造一家崭新的{brown}酒馆{text}，并邀请你成为他们的首位客人。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你品尝了这里的特调葡萄酒，浓郁而甜美，就在你喝得津津有味时，领头的骷髅走了过来。{speech}“你觉得怎么样？非常舒适，对吧？当然，墓地里没有种植水果，所以，呃...这些家伙必须临时找材料。别担心，没人记得那些人。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	5EE09BE649073C25E7E8EE8F9C379F89
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(12).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>It takes no time at all for the crew to return, covered in {brown}dust{text} from a hard hours work.  Excited, they hurry you out to {gold}inspect{text} their work.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The {wavingpink}orphanage{text} seems to have transformed into a grand hotel for {cyan}children{text}.  There are {purple}werewolf{text} pups to play with, {blue}mummy{text} nursemaids, even a {red}vampire{text} chef.  You almost feel a little jealous you can't stay.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>队员们回来的速度非常快，被几小时的辛勤工作弄得浑身{brown}灰尘{text}。他们兴奋地催促你去{gold}检查{text}他们的成果。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>{wavingpink}福利院{text}似乎像是一个供{cyan}儿童{text}居住的豪华酒店。有{purple}小狼狗{text}可以玩，还有{blue}木乃伊{text}保姆，甚至有一位{red}吸血鬼{text}大厨。你甚至感到有点嫉妒，不能留下来。</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonend}"

#. Key:	B050796B4E20225A3D4BEC9FF146219B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(13).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>With {red}haste{text}, the crew {gray}shambles{text} off to complete the order.  As usual, within what seems like moments, they return, {purple}prompting{text} you to see what they've done.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"'ey Boss...why you want place for fans?\"  {text}Curious, you step inside to find the {brown}building{text} filled to the bring with {orange}ceiling{text} fans, desk fans, box and {cyan}upright{text} fans.  You had no idea there were so many variations.  No orphans here...just fans.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>队员们{red}加班加点{text}、{gray}拖着脚步{text}完成了任务。像之前一样，似乎只过了片刻，他们就回来了，急于向你{purple}展示{text}看看他们做了什么。</>\r\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“嘿，老板...你得了什么病？”{text}你对这个问题感到莫名其妙，于是走进去探探原因。你发现这座{brown}建筑物{text}摆满了各色药粒，天花板贴着，灯上吊着、桌上摆着、箱子里装着，还有一堆瓶瓶罐罐的药粒叠成各种形状。你完全没想到能有这么多花样，也不知道为什么室内会变成这样。过了许久你才猜出原因，可能他们是把你的请求听成了...服粒院。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonend}"

#. Key:	F380900642B88197AC84A295B3E53FA2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(14).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Off they go to fulfill your request.  As usual, they {green}return{text} in no time, all smiles and {pink}patting{text} each other on the backbone.  The foreman approaches you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Good news, boss.  Orphanage good as new, and full of orphans.\"  {text}You don't recall seeing any lost children, so you ask if he sure they are </><text s=\"bl\">-actually-{text} orphans.  He shrugs and says {speech}\"Are now.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonend}"
msgstr ""
"<text>他们迅速出发去履行你的要求，并依然{green}迅速返回{text}，面带微笑互相{pink}拍打{text}着背。工头走到你面前。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“好消息，老板。福利院大功告成，而且挤满了孤儿。”{text}你不记得路上看到任何迷路的孩子，所以再次确认他们是否真的是{red}孤儿{text}。他耸了耸肩，说：{speech}“现在确实是孤儿了。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonend}"

#. Key:	3932E9F34E9F31674F36068888FD3EB9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(15).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You remember seeing a run down {wavingpink}orphanage{text} and decide it would be nice to have you new {gray}workers{text} fix it up.  An hour passes, and the train of bones returns.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Job's done, but we have question.  Why you want fix up orphanage when there no more orphans?\"{text}  You give the foreskull a puzzled look.  {speech}\"What boss think we fill holes with?\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonend}\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>你记得曾看到一个破旧的{wavingpink}孤儿院{text}，决定让你的{gray}新工奴{text}们来修缮它。一个小时过去后骨架子们回来了。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“工作做完了，但我们有问题。为什么你想修复孤儿院呢，那里现在已经没有孤儿了。”{text}你困惑地看了看这名骷髅。{speech}“老板，你猜我们用的什么来修补那些漏洞和墙缝？”</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonend}"

#. Key:	28023379486CCF4E8FB34B92C2431DF5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(16).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You quickly apologize to the leader of the {gray}skeleton crew{text}, trying to explain that you tripped and just grabbed the {gold}hammer{text} for balance.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Slowly, you take a few steps back and place the {gold}hammer{text} back where you found it.  As soon as you do, they all {shakingred}collapse{text} in a heap, with bones scattering all along the floor.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You {blue}shiver{text} and quickly slip out of the mausoleum.  On the wind, you swear you hear a {wavingpink}sad, disappointed sigh{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你迅速向那位{gray}骷髅队长{text}道歉，辩解道你只是为了保持平衡而不得已拿起那把{gold}锤子{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你慢慢地退后几步，将{gold}锤子{text}放回了原处。你的动作完成时，它们突然都像{shakingred}崩溃{text}一般倒下，骨头散落在地板上。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你{blue}颤颤抖抖{text}地迅速溜出了墓室。逃离时你似乎听到了风中的一声{wavingpink}伤心又失望的叹息声{text}。</>"

#. Key:	92314E9F407D6D8F1363D7B01E19967E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(17).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You aren't sure exactly how the {gray}skeletons{text} are able to work so quickly, but you assume {curse}dark magic{text} is involved.  {curse}Dark magic{text} that you probably want nothing to do with.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You tell the {orange}foreman{text} that you need some time to think, and to have them mingle among themselves.  When they aren't looking, you quickly place the {gold}hammer{text} back on its pedastal.  In an instant, the crew {shakingyellow}rattles{text} and collapses to the ground.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you continue on your adventure, you hear the sound of a {pink}concert{text} in the distance.  If only you'd bought a ticket...</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你无从得知这些{gray}骷髅{text}究竟如何能够工作得如此迅速，但你猜测其中可能涉及到了{curse}黑魔法{text}，那是一种你根本不想被牵扯进去的概念。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你告诉{orange}工头{text}你需要一些时间来思考，让他们先互相交流交流。趁着他们不注意你迅速将{gold}锤子{text}放回原位。一瞬间，工髅们发出嘎吱作响的声音，散倒在地上。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在你返回冒险的途中，你听到远处传来一场{pink}音乐会{text}的声音，要是你现在还能买门票就好了...</>"

#. Key:	F6BDFEBC4287546AE446A58D48665EE5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(18).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You decide to quit while you are ahead.  There is a </>{tournament}<text> to win after all.  You don't have {purple}eternity{text} to send these hard working chaps on renovations.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You thank the {orange}foreman{text} for the opportunity, but inform him that the job really isn't working out.  {speech}\"No worries ex-boss.  We understand.  You'se a good boss, though.  We'll miss you.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You shake the {orange}foreman's{text} hand and place the {gold}hammer{text} where you found it.  Instantly, the {gray}crew{text} collapses, leaving you holding a detached arm.  Severence pay, you guess.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你决定趁好就收，毕竟还有一场</>{tournament}<text>要赢。时间不等人，不可能一直{purple}候着{text}这些辛勤工作的家伙做装修。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你感谢{orange}工头{text}给你这个机会，但告诉他工作成果实在不尽人意。{speech}“没关系，前老板。我们理解。你是个好老板，我们会想你的。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你和{orange}工头{text}握手，把{gold}锤子{text}放回原处。瞬间，{gray}工队{text}倒下，只留下你握着的一只断臂骨。这算是赔偿金，你想。</>"

#. Key:	99612D6143EA0317B3073CB44E7218E4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You decide to give the </><text s=\"graveyard\">undead city{text} a little class and culture.  Excited, the {gray}skeletons{text} rush off.  You can hear the sounds of banging and sawing, and soon they return.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Looking out, you see a gorgeous {purple}auditorium{text} to rival those of any bard college.  Beautiful pillars, gothic {cyan}cathedral{text} ceilings...everything one could want for a stage.  And done in record time, no less.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你决定给这个</><text s=\"graveyard\">亡灵之城{text}增添一些高雅和文化。兴奋不已的{gray}骷髅{text}们匆忙离去。你可以听到敲打和切割的声音，不久他们就回来了。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>向远望去，你看到一座华丽的{purple}礼堂{text}，可以与任何吟唱学院相媲美。华美的支柱，哥特式{cyan}穹顶{text}...这是任何一位演出者都会梦寐以求的舞台，更别提它是以惊人的速度建成的。</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	04D584434631D38FDD5989B1490E180F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>With glee, your newfound {gray}minions{text} rush off, eager to have a new task.  You expect to hear the sound of {orange}tools{text} clanging and banging, but it is oddly quiet.  Before long, then return with some sort of creature in tow.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It would seem that the boys have created a {shakingpurple}one-thrall{text} band with {cyan}instruments{text} jutting out of every orafice. It hurts just looking at it.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你新遇的{gray}随从{text}们兴高采烈地冲走，早就迫不及待干一项新任务了。你以为会听到{orange}工具{text}作业的声音，但意外地安静。不久之后，他们带着某种生物返回。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>看来这些伙计已经创造出了一个{shakingpurple}单奴{text}乐队，乐队长身体的每个地方都有{cyan}乐器{text}伸出，看着有点心疼。</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	A0F12B33442EBB111E2C158322575A77
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>With a level of {wavingpink}excitement{text} you aren't sure is healthy, the {gray}skeletons{text} rush out to completely the job.  You aren't sure how, but in only a few hours, they've constructed a beautiful {cyan}concert hall{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You go to examine the new building, and the {purple}magnificent{text} structure causes you to whistle your appreciation.  It's only when your ears start to {shakingred}bleed{text} that you realize how bad the acoustics are.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>带着一种你不确定是否健康的{wavingpink}兴奋劲{text}，{gray}骷髅{text}们纷纷赶去完成你指定的工作。不知如何，他们仅用了几个小时就建造了一座美丽的{cyan}音乐厅{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你前去视察这座新建筑，它的{purple}壮丽{text}让你不禁哼声赞叹不已。只不过当你的耳朵开始{shakingred}流血{text}时，你才意识到音响效果有多糟糕。</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	4B59A81E4CF6EFC392EC51AF3CCED631
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A cacophany of {gray}rattling bones{text} accompany the boys as they fulfill your {purple}request{text}.  In what seems like moments, the crew returns, eager to show you their {wavingturquoise}marvel{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It is...{shakingpurple}hideous{text}.  It appears to be made of various body parts, likely dug up from the {brown}murky{text} mire nearby.  Arms and legs just from the walls like tiles.  Oddly enough, the {pink}acoustics{text} are incredible.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor1}"
msgstr ""
"<text>一阵刺耳的{gray}骨头嘎嘎作响{text}伴随着队员们满足你的{purple}请求{text}。不出几刻，整队都回来了，渴望向你展示他们的{wavingturquoise}伟大之举{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>但它...十分{shakingpurple}丑陋{text}。它似乎由不同的身体部位构成，很可能是从附近的{brown}阴暗{text}泥沼中挖出来的。胳膊和腿像瓷砖一样贴在墙上。诡异的是，{pink}声响效果{text}好到难以置信。</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor1}"

#. Key:	02B6B2184C839F8F1D6EE48F286EC05C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(7).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Once again, the {gray}boney{text} builders rush out to build a new {brown}alehouse{text}.  In record time, they return and practically drag you across the </><text s=\"graveyard\">cemetary{text} streets to try a brew.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The {wavingpink}mead{text} is delicious, heady, earthy, and goes down smooth.  It's like {blue}utopia{text} on your tongue.  If you weren't destined for the </>{tournament}<text>, you might stay a bit longer.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>那些{gray}骨头{text}工匠再次跑散，开始建造一家新的{brown}酒馆{text}。以前所未有的速度，他们很快就跑了回来，把你拖过了</><text s=\"graveyard\">墓园{text}中的大片街道，想让你尝试一杯。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>{wavingpink}蜜酒{text}十分美味，令人陶醉，充满土壤的厚重味。它入口顺滑，就像口中有了一个{blue}极乐园{text}。若非你必须要参加</>{tournament}<text>，你多想再驻留一会。</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	6BFC6D374C05A06A2E4F3FA7645D41D5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(8).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Without question, the fellas rush off to make the greatest {brown}tavern{text} in the history of taverns.  True to their word, they bring you to the highest class of {cyan}inn{text} you have ever set foot in.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The food and drink is {shakingorange}incredible{text}.  Nothing has excited your {wavingpink}tastebuds{text} in a long time.  It's not until you get the bill that the {green}sour{text} feeling rises.  You don't have to pay, but just the thought makes you feel a little {curse}ill{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>伙计们二话不说纷纷赶去建造有史以来最伟大的{brown}酒馆{text}。如其所称，他们带你来到了你足迹所至的最高级的{cyan}客栈{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>食品与饮品都{shakingorange}美味无比{text}。很长时间以来，没有什么东西能如此激发你的{wavingpink}味蕾{text}。直到你拿到账单时，{green}苦涩{text}的感觉才又明显了起来。你并不需要付钱，但只是想到价格就让你有点{curse}不适{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	8533DC574A29EC8C547074A8270C434D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(9).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Once again, the sounds of sawing and grinding filled the air as the {gray}skeletons{text} do their work.  In no time at all, the {orange}foreman{text} returns, eager to show you the results of their labor.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The tavern is {pink}quaint{text}, but pleasant.  The {wavingyellow}beer{text} however, leaves something to be desired, tasting like watered down water.  Perhaps you shouldn't leave {yellow}brewing{text} to those without tongues.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor2}"
msgstr ""
"<text>{gray}骷髅{text}们开始工作后，锯木和研磨的声音又一次闹腾起来了。很快，{orange}工头{text}回来了，急切地想向你展示他们的劳动成果。</>\r\n"
"\n"
"<text>这个小酒馆{pink}古雅{text}又宜人。然而，{wavingyellow}啤酒{text}却稍有瑕疵，尝起来就像稀释了的水。看来酒水不该给那些没有舌头的家伙来{yellow}酿造{text}。</>\r\n"
"\n"
"{graveyarddungeonfloor2}"

#. Key:	4DCC06EC449F8E007DC2AD9E1F916498
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.NewDungeon_Graveyard.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "The Harrowed Hammer"
msgstr "尖齿之锤"

#. Key:	D26112544FBF2D932CF39CAAD8087456
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_Merchant.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_Merchant.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Encounter a rug merchant in the vast Oasis."
msgstr "在广袤的绿洲中遭遇一位地毯商人。"

#. Key:	E45D9C2644FAC26C6CD79499394C4861
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_Merchant.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_Merchant.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Is that a {wavingcyan}mirage{text}?  No?  No, that's just someone basking in the {colordesert}desert  sun{text}.  In front of him, a large carpet full of {pink}antiques{text} and {green}oddities{text} soak up the sunlight.  As you approach, he lifts up the brim of his sunhat to look at you, a {orange}beaming{text} smile across his face.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Beautiful day, friend.  I'm glad to see you stopped by.  Browse and peruse, ruminate and contemplate.  Everything has a price.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>那是不是{wavingcyan}海市蜃楼{text}？ 不，貌似只是一个人在{colordesert}沙漠烈日{text}下享受太阳浴。在他面前，一块铺满{pink}古董{text}与{green}奇物{text}的大地毯也在吸收着阳光。当你走近时，他抬起遮阳帽的边缘看着你，脸上露出{orange}灿烂{text}的笑容。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“日安，朋友。我很高兴你能来逛逛。仔细看看，好好挑选，我这什么都有，当然也包括价格。”</>"

#. Key:	B82AE5114E69848000C26989C493D088
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_Merchant.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_Merchant.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Merchant of the Sands"
msgstr "沙地商人"

#. Key:	C29B9FA641FF13C61D444E8A26350E49
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_TheGoldenSerpent.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_TheGoldenSerpent.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Stop at a bar to rest... with some shady patrons."
msgstr "在一家酒吧歇歇脚，这有不少见不得光的客人。"

#. Key:	D872269D425E3E57C0CEA2A021DB09C0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_TheGoldenSerpent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_TheGoldenSerpent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Wandering through the </>{desert}<text>, you stumble on a {blue}small{text} tent...seemingly in the middle of nowhere.  Stepping inside, you find yourself in a large tavern, somehow much bigger than the {wavingcyan}petite pavilion{text} let on.  Inside, a heavily shrouded individual greets you from behind a bar.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Welcome to the {wavingyellow}Golden Serpent{speech}.  You're just in time.  In honor of the </>{tournament}<text s=\"colorspeech\">, we are hosting a little competition of our own.  Think you're up for it?  The prize is a namesake of our lovely establishment.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>漫步穿过</>{desert}<text>时，你偶然发现了一个{blue}小帐篷{text}...它似乎位于茫茫荒野之中。进入之后，居然是一个大酒馆，不知何故显然比进入前那个{wavingcyan}小帐篷{text}大得多。在里面，一个身着厚重衣服的人在吧台后迎接你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“欢迎来到{wavingyellow}金蛇酒馆{speech}。你来的正是时候。为了庆祝</>{tournament}<text s=\"colorspeech\">，我们正在举办一场小竞赛。你想参加吗？奖品就是我们店名的出处哦。”</>"

#. Key:	6EC202F646185F4752039DA9BA6E0BC2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_TheGoldenSerpent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_TheGoldenSerpent.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You quickly agree to the friendly {blue}competition{text} and one by one, you {red}outclass{text}, {orange}outmatch{text}, and {pink}outdrink{text} your opponents until you are the last one standing.  With your prize in hand, you walk {wavingtextsmall}a bit wobbly{text} back out into the {wavingred}blistering sun{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you look at your {gold}trophy{text}, you notice something in its mouth.  You reach in and pluck the {cyan}object{text} from the serpent's maw, looking it over.  As you do, you {yellow_bi}swear{text} the statue moves a little.  Or perhaps it's just a {wavingyellow}side effect{text} of your victory.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你很快同意参加这场{blue}友谊赛{text}，然后一个接一个地{red}战胜{text}、{orange}压倒{text}，{pink}击败{text}所有对手，坚持到了最后。你手拿奖品，{wavingtext}摇摇晃晃{text}走回{wavingred}烈日下{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你迫不及待地看着你的{gold}奖杯{text}，却注意到它口中有什么东西。你伸手从蛇的嘴里掏出了一个{cyan}物体{text}，仔细查看。突然你{yellow_bi}感觉{text}雕像动了一下，或者也许这只是你比赢酒量的{wavingyellow}后遗症{text}。</>"

#. Key:	A08F6CD94B3C7C4FDEE6B3B38A44F3F4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_TheGoldenSerpent.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Oasis_TheGoldenSerpent.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "The Golden Serpent"
msgstr "黄金之蛇"

#. Key:	031A9F1E47B2D06990A6538216AF57F8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Discover the Cavern's greatest tactician... a rock?"
msgstr "探寻洞穴中最伟大的谋士... 一块石头？"

#. Key:	8CCCF3094A0A3020CA3C0787334FFAD8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Clapping their hands together,</> <text s=\"kiodini\">Ki O'Dini</> <text>beams broadly.</> <text s=\"kiodini\">\"I could tell that you are a well read individual.  Now, for someone as prestigious as you, I should bestow something prestigious upon you.  But what...?\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The djinn strokes his magnificent beard for a moment before snapping his fingers.  Wind and sand begin to swirl around him, and he grows a few feet in size.</>  <text s=\"kiodini\">\"As is the custom of my people, I shall grant you one wish.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一边鼓掌，</><text s=\"kiodini\">奇欧迪尼</><text>一边露出了笑容。</><text s=\"kiodini\">“我可以看出你是一个博学多才的人。现在，对于像你这样的威望人物，我应该赐予你一些威望的东西。但是什么呢...？”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在拍了拍他壮丽的胡须后，巨灵突然双指一弹。风沙开始围绕着他旋转，他的身形变得更高了几英尺。</><text s=\"kiodini\">“按照我们民族的习惯，我将满足你一个愿望。”</>"

#. Key:	1A25232F4D71774CE4B929B1326695B3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{otto} <text>offers you a seat across from him.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Friend not know game?  Is okay.  Otto teach.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>After explaining the rules of the game, you begin a</> <text s=\"colorred\">battle of strategy</><text>.  Despite his</> <text s=\"colorbrown\">dim-witted</> <text>appearance, he appears to be a strategic savant.  After besting you at every game, however,</> {otto} <text>still praises your improvements.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Afterwards, as he bids you farewell, he tells you he looks forward to seeing you in</> {tournament}<text>, saying he hopes you fare better than you did here.</>"
msgstr ""
"{otto}<text>示意你在他对面坐下。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“朋友不懂这个游戏？没关系。奥托教。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在解释了游戏规则后，你开始了一场</><text s=\"colorred\">战略对决</><text>。尽管对方看起来有些</><text s=\"colorbrown\">笨</><text>，但他其实是一个战略天才。虽说每次都击败了你，</>{otto}<text>还是赞扬了你的进步。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>在告别时，他表示期待在</>{tournament}<text>中再次与你相遇，并希望你可以表现得更好。</>"

#. Key:	45DAB43944DD2256AE8984A3FF0D867B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You tell the</> <text s=\"colorgray\">slate simpleton</> <text>that you are familiar enough with the rules to offer a challenge.  With a</> <text s=\"colorpink\">big, goofy grin</><text>, the two of you square off.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>It seems pretty even for a while, and you are impressed with how</> <text s=\"colormagenta\">tactically skilled</> <text>he is.  It's even more impressive when he makes a</> <text s=\"shakingyellow\">bold maneuver</> <text>that you hadn't seen before, gleefully grinning as he claims victory.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Despite your loss,</> {otto} <text>seems impressed enough to present you with a</> <text s=\"rainbow\">token</> <text>of his gratitude for entertaining him.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你告诉这位</><text s=\"colorgray\">朴实的石头人</><text>，你对规则足够熟悉，可以一战。两人面带</><text s=\"colorpink\">奸笑</><text>，开始对决。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>一开始，双方似乎旗鼓相当，你甚至暗自欣赏对手的</><text s=\"colormagenta\">战术布局</><text>。直到他突然走出一招意料之外的</><text s=\"shakingyellow\">险棋</><text>，带着胜券在握的笑容宣告胜利时。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>尽管你输了，但</>{otto}<text>对你的表现也很佩服，送给你一件</><text s=\"rainbow\">信物</><text>作为感谢。</>"

#. Key:	77905DB24AC1137E87B2348D566173C8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.OttoChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You are rather familiar with the game, and accept</> {otto}<text s=\"otto\">'s</> <text>challenge, sure to have an easy win.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Much to your surprise, this</> <text s=\"colorgray\">granite golem</> <text>appears quite skilled in</> <text s=\"colorgold\">strategy and tactics</><text>, far more than his facade would let on.  You have to pull out every trick in the book, but you finally come out the victor.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{otto} <text>seems more thrilled about losing the game than you do about winning, and he gives you a game piece to commemorate your</> <text s=\"rainbow\">newfound friendship.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你对这个游戏相当熟悉，确信能轻松获胜，于是接受了</>{otto}<text>的挑战。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>令你惊讶的是，这位</><text s=\"colorgray\">巨石偶</><text>在</><text s=\"colorgold\">策略</><text>方面表现得炉火纯青，远超他外展出的机颖度。你不得不动用所有的绝招，艰难获得了胜利。</>\n"
"\n"
"{otto}<text>似乎对输棋这件事比你对赢棋更感到兴奋。他给了你一枚游戏棋子以纪念你们的</><text s=\"rainbow\">新交情</><text>。</>"

