msgid "<text>But Otto Liked That!</>"
msgstr "<text>但是奥托喜欢！</>"

#. Key:	C8AB98D2423BFC13B48306A292FA3AAE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ProtoTextTable.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ProtoTextTable.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "The Champions"
msgstr "冠军"

#. Key:	187C52EC41D931485B1FA886555D4A32
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Redistrar Act 1"
msgstr "注册 第1幕"

#. Key:	989C823243D13754F1048AA170785413
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A studious </><text s=\"goblin\">goblin</><text> looks up from a large ledger, pushing up his </><text s=\"colordarkgrey\">wire-rimmed glasses</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Name, race, occupation.  The</> <text s=\"colortournament\">Tournament Council</> <text s=\"colorspeech\">is not responsible for injury from burning, maiming, decapitation, petrification, or polytransformation.  Sign here.</><text>\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you finish signing your name, a brilliant </><text s=\"coloryellow\">flash of light</><text> blinds you for a moment.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一位勤奋的</><text s=\"goblin\">地精</><text>从一本大型账本中抬起头来，推了推他的</><text s=\"colordarkgrey\">金丝眼镜</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“姓名，种族，职业。</><text s=\"colortournament\">大赛委员会</><text s=\"colorspeech\">不对烧伤、残废、斩首、石化或变形术造成的伤害负责。请在这里签名。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你完成签名时，一道耀眼的</><text s=\"coloryellow\">闪光</><text>让你目眩了一会。</>"

#. Key:	0926D46C40D5A37E67FCC49BFD9D32A3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>When you can finally see, you find yourself standing in some sort of shop.  A goblin behind the counter looks familiar.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>“</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Welcome to</> {store} <text s=\"colorspeech\">, the finest definitely-not-looted equipment around.  We have everything you could need to take on the</> {elitefour} <text>.  </><text s=\"colorspeech\">And good luck...judging by the look of you, you're gonna need a lot of it.</><text>”</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你恢复视力时，发现自己身处一家商店内，柜台后的地精看起来很眼熟。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“欢迎光临</>{store}<text s=\"colorspeech\">，这里有最好的绝非掠夺来的装备。你可以随意挑选来对付那些</>{elitefour}<text>们。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">祝你好运...看你的样子可能需要多消费一下。</><text>”</>"

#. Key:	7CDFB2F14C1F2C450EEA3B92FB6D4BBF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You feel your energy surge as the </><text s=\"colorpurple\">scroll</><text> vanishes.  A </><text s=\"coloryellow\">bright flash</><text> coming from behind you, and when you turn around, you see a various goods behind a large counter.  Standing there, a strangely familiar </><text s=\"colorgreen\">goblin</><text> greets you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Welcome to</><text s=\"goblin\">Mezzik's Magnificent Market</></><text s=\"colorspeech\">.  We have everything you need...for a price of course.</><text>\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>当</><text s=\"colorpurple\">卷轴</><text>消失时，你感到能量在体内涌动。从你身后传来一道</><text s=\"coloryellow\">闪光</><text>，当你转过身去时，你看到一个巨大柜台，上面摆满了各种商品。站在那里的是一个熟悉的</><text s=\"colorgreen\">地精</><text>，他向你打招呼。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“你好，欢迎光临</><text s=\"colormezzik\">梅兹克的奇幻店</><text s=\"colorspeech\">。只要你出的起价，这里应有尽有...”</>"

#. Key:	16A747B84600C2645EEEA3B7C98F5027
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct1.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Seeing nothing of interest, you turn around to spy a </><text s=\"colorgreen\">goblin</><text> quickly transforming the office into a quaint little shop.  While his back is turned, you manage to </><text s=\"colorcurse\">snag a few coins</><text> from the till before he spins around, looking a little surprised to see you already standing there.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>\"</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Oh, hello.  Welcome to</><text s=\"colormezzik\">Mezzik's Magnificent Market</></><text s=\"colorspeech\">.  We have everything you need...for a price of course...</></><text s=\"colorspeech_subscript\">You didn't see anything, right?</><text>\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你没看到什么感兴趣的东西，转身后你发现</><text s=\"colorgreen\">地精</><text>正在将办公室变成了一个古雅的小店。趁他背过身，你设法从钱柜中</><text s=\"colorcurse\">偷走了一些硬币</><text>，然后他转过身来，看到你已经站在那里，有些惊讶。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“你好，欢迎光临</><text s=\"colormezzik\">梅兹克的奇幻店</><text s=\"colorspeech\">。只要你出的起价，这里应有尽有...</><text s=\"colorspeech_subscript\">你什么都没看到吧？”</>"

#. Key:	435605A54DE38BFAC5965E9F0262953F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Registrar Act 2"
msgstr "注册 第2幕"

#. Key:	CB7DB4D4464B5A289ACABBA4C26C217F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You once again find yourself in the office of a </><text s=\"goblin\">goblin</><text> registrar.  He looks familiar, but the </><text s=\"colorblue\">nameplate</><text> on the desk is different.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>“</><text s=\"colorspeech\">Congratulations on not getting killed, future champion.  You may now summon combatants from our premium dimension.</><text>  </><text s=\"colorspeech\">Not that it will help against the</> {elitefour}<text s=\"colorspeech\">.</><text>  </><text s=\"colorspeech\">Please gaze into this crystal while I re-align your…umm..chakra.  Or something.</><text>”</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你再次发现自己身处一位</><text s=\"goblin\">地精</><text>登记员的办公室。他还是那么眼熟，但桌上的</><text s=\"colorblue\">名牌</><text>却不同。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“未来的冠军，恭喜你没被杀掉。你现在可以召唤更高阶的战士了，</><text></><text s=\"colorspeech\">虽然这对反抗</>{elitefour}<text s=\"colorspeech\">们没什么帮助。</><text></><text s=\"colorspeech\">请凝视面前这个水晶，让我重新调整你的...呃...命轮还是什么来着。”</>"

#. Key:	1FBAC419442BB526639020A7BE522ACE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(1).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You shrug and gaze into the crystal, watching the space inside swirl with </><text s=\"coloryellow\">lights</><text> and </><text s=\"colorgray\">smoke</><text>.  You don’t feel any different, and after a few moments you look about the room to once again find yourself in some sort of </><text s=\"goblin\">goblin-owned</><text> store.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Welcome to </>{store}<text s=\"colorspeech\">.  Everything you see here is almost certainly, probably brand new.\"</>\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<text>你耸了耸肩，凝视着水晶，看着里面随</><text s=\"coloryellow\">光芒</><text>和</><text s=\"colorgray\">烟雾</><text>旋转。你并没有感觉到任何不同，几秒钟后，你环顾四周，发现自己仍然在一个</><text s=\"goblin\">地精</><text>商店里。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“欢迎来到</>{store}<text s=\"colorspeech\">，这里的东西保证都是全新的。”</>\n"

#. Key:	E5D5CA7E4A9E319AC939C7B3D6590740
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid "<text>You say nothing, but instead snap your fingers. The quill in the man's hands takes life and moves on its own, writing '</><text s=\"colorlime\">Like this</><text>' and falling back lifeless.\"</><text s=\"coloryellow\">Wow! A </></><text s=\"coloryellow_bl\">thoughtful insight</></><text s=\"coloryellow\"> from our </></><text s=\"colorcyan\">contestant</></><text s=\"coloryellow\"> here. We'll be eagerly awaiting your display in </></><text s=\"colorcyan_bl\">The Tournament</></><text s=\"coloryellow\">!</><text> \"</>"
msgstr "<text>你什么都没说，而是用手指轻轻一弹。那个男人手中的羽毛笔突然有了生命，自行挥动着，写下了“</><text s=\"colorlime\">就像这样</><text>”，然后无力地掉落下来。</><text s=\"coloryellow\">哇！我们的</><text s=\"coloryellow_bl\">参赛者</><text s=\"coloryellow\">给出了一个</><text s=\"colorcyan\">深思熟虑的见解</><text s=\"coloryellow\">。我们将迫不及待地期待你在</><text s=\"colorcyan_bl\">大赛</><text s=\"coloryellow\">中的表现！”</>"

#. Key:	A9A38E2D4E118603BBA1FBAB5BC76366
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid "<text>You smile but say nothing, simply leaning forward and patting the man on the shoulder before walking away, whistling.\"</><text s=\"coloryellow\">Don't want to give away your secrets, huh? I understand. We'll be eagerly awaiting your display in </></><text s=\"colorcyan_bl\">The Tournament!</></><text s=\"coloryellow\">...</></><text s=\"coloryellow_i\">Hey, has anyone seen my coin purse?</><text> \"</>"
msgstr "<text>你微笑着却不说话，只是前倾身子，拍了拍那个人的肩膀，然后转身走开，吹起口哨。</><text s=\"coloryellow\">“看来你不想泄露你的秘密，对吧？我理解。我们将迫不及待地期待你在</><text s=\"colorcyan_bl\">大赛</><text s=\"coloryellow\">中的表现！...</><text s=\"coloryellow_i\">嘿，有人见到我的钱袋吗？</><text s=\"coloryellow\">”</>"

#. Key:	901393B94FE61C1780344F9D215844F9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarTournament.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#. Key:	CD6609E24984B604A88F888532A445ED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#. Key:	E9E427E647825E9C15196FA127A13026
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct3.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct2.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct3.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarTournament.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Registrar's Office"
msgstr "登记处"

#. Key:	93BD527D457DB7B2A83581B876F843A4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct3.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct3.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Meeting of the Rival"
msgstr "竞争者会议"

#. Key:	F52C158547EC3D3D936EF0A6B701278D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct3.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct3.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As you reach the entrance to the </>{tournament}<text>, a possibly familiar </><text s=\"goblin\">goblin</><text> explains the rules.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"There is no violence on the</> <text s=\"colortournament\">Tournament Grounds</><text s=\"colorspeech\">.  No littering.  Gambling is only permitted at registered betting booths.  Please report any solicitation to the nearest guard.  If you are participating in the Tournament, registration begins at noon.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{hasanyrivalblessing~RivalText}"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你到达</>{tournament}<text>入口时，一个看起来很眼熟的</><text s=\"goblin\">地精</><text>向你说明了规则。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“在</><text s=\"colortournament\">比赛场地</><text s=\"colorspeech\">内禁止使用暴力。不准乱扔垃圾。只能在注册的投注亭下注。如果你发现任何私人下注行为，请向最近的守卫举报。如果你打算参加比赛，记得中午开始报名。”</>\n"
"\n"
"{hasanyrivalblessing~RivalText}\""

#. Key:	A7F7AB3F479603DAF5E1B0971797BF7E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct3.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarAct3.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>As you turn around, you recognize another member of the </>{elitefour}<text>.  Hopefully they don't hold a grudge...</>"
msgstr "<text>转身时你发现了另一个</>{elitefour}<text>的成员。希望他不会记仇...</>"

#. Key:	00E8990C47D291FA2C0AE895A6AEFCF3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarTournament.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarTournament.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Meeting of the Ally"
msgstr "盟友会议"

#. Key:	F3F3B10E4936604FA472EBB6A7039009
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarTournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarTournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Yet another moderately recognizable </><text s=\"goblin\">goblin</><text> is checking the names of </><text s=\"colortournament\">Tournament</><text> contestants.  Next to him, you see a list of rules for the </><text s=\"colortournament\">Tournament</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">The</> <text s=\"colortournament\">Tournament</> <text s=\"colorspeech\">consists of eight competitors in a single elimination style qualifier.  All standard rules apply.  Cheating is</> <text s=\"colorcurse\">strictly forbidden</><text s=\"colorspeech\">.  Please register your team at the left before proceeding.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{hasanyallyblessing\\AllyText}"
msgstr ""
"<text>一个看上去很眼熟的</><text s=\"goblin\">地精</><text>正在检查</><text s=\"colortournament\">大赛</><text>参赛选手名单。在他旁边写着一系列</><text s=\"colortournament\">大赛的规则</><text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">本</><text s=\"colortournament\">大赛</><text s=\"colorspeech\">总共有八名参赛选手，采用单败淘汰制。所有标准规则均适用。</><text s=\"colorcurse\">严禁</><text s=\"colorspeech\">作弊行为。参赛注册请在左侧进行。</>\n"
"\n"
"{hasanyallyblessing\\AllyText}"

#. Key:	4CEF0A3947385DCD9300C5B4F1616EE1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarTournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.RegistrarTournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>A familiar voice behind you brings a </><text s=\"colorcyan_i\">smile to your face</><text>...</>"
msgstr "<text>你身后传来一个熟悉的声音，你</><text s=\"colorcyan_i\">面带笑容</><text>地回头...</>"

#. Key:	07A26E96454BE806DB05B2BADE5CBEEB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Stumble upon a Potion-dispensing machine."
msgstr "偶遇一台药水储配机。"

#. Key:	07466D234B68DAC2EA44799AD70FF13B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The sound of {green}gurgling{text} draws your attention to a small stand of various {red}liquids{text}.  Several containers of {rainbow}colorful concoctions{text} line a table, along with {yellow}bottles {text}and {orange}flasks{text} of various shapes and sizes.  Hanging from the vats, unrecognizable {bless}script{text} is written on a worn, {brown}wooden sign{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you approach, the {bless}runes{text} on the sign transform into your native language:</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">Take a drink to quench your thirst.</>\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">Overindulgence can be a curse.</><text>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一阵{green}咕噜声{text}引起了你的注意，你看到一个小摊位上摆放着各种{red}液体{text}。桌子上整齐地摆有{rainbow}各色混合物{text}的容器，以及各种奇形怪状的{yellow}瓶子{text}。下方液桶上悬挂着一块破旧的{brown}标牌{text}，上面写着无法辨认的{bless}文字{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你靠近时，标牌上的{bless}符文{text}转化成你的母语：</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">浅酌止渴</>\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">纵饮成灾</>"

#. Key:	3F727CE64995D874612C3EBE6F140C2B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
