#. Key:	DB55B1004887E0E014BF15A6457CDD2A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You look at the rows of {wavingrainbow}colorful liquids{text}, some {yellow}familiar{text} and others {silver}foreign{text}.  Your eyes dart from the {pink}selection{text} to the {brown}sign{text} and back again.  Carefully, you begin to fill {turquoise}bottles{text} one at a time, until you are satisfied.</>{br}{br}<text>As the sign {bless}warned{text}, you choose just the right amount of {wavinggreen}indulgement{text}.  Tucking your drinks in your satchel, you continue your way to the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你看着一排排的{wavingrainbow}彩色液体{text}，有些{yellow}熟悉{text}，有些却{silver}陌生{text}。你的目光从这些{pink}选项{text}移到{brown}标牌{text}上，然后又移回来。你小心翼翼地开始一瓶一瓶地灌满{turquoise}自己的瓶子{text}，直到心满意足。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>屈服于标牌的{bless}警告{text}，你选择了恰当的{wavinggreen}剂量{text}。你将饮料塞进背包，继续前往</>{tournament}<text>。</>"

#. Key:	E9A634924E3F5D09C1B39199FE220AE8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>As you draw near to the {orange}variety{text} of beverages, your mouth begins to {turquoise}water{text}.  Every {rainbow}gently-glowing{text} concoction looks delicious, and you {blue}eagerly{text} begin to fill bottles.</>{br}{br}<text>One after another, {brown}corked{text} and stowed for later.  You start to go for another and a {curse}strange feeling{text} begins to surround you.  Capping the last one, you opt to walk away rather than press your luck.  Hopefully, the feeling is all in your {pink}head{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你接近{orange}各种{text}饮料时，开始禁不住的{turquoise}流口水{text}。每种{rainbow}闪闪发光{text}的混合液看着都很芬芳，你{blue}急切{text}地开始装满你的瓶子。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>一个接着一个，塞上{brown}木塞{text}以供之后享用。正当你又开始装另一种时，一种{curse}奇怪的感觉{text}包围了你。最终，你选择离开而不是继续冒险。希望这种奇怪的感觉只是你的{pink}错觉{text}。</>"

#. Key:	D1CC21634A45ED76E00397911F287D48
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You stare at the {brown}sign{text} for a moment, {wavingcyan}pondering{text} what it could mean.  You rationalize that the sign is just some sort of {purple}deterrant{text}, not meant to be taken seriously.</>{br}{br}<text>As you fill the bottles with an assortment of {rainbow}colorful juices{text}, you begin to feel a little ill.  You ignore it for a while, but the feeling {signcurse}builds and builds{text}, and you soon realize that the sign was more than just an {curse}empty threat{text}.  Since whatever {red}damage{text} is already done, you take what you have and quickly rejoin the {silver}main road{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你盯着那块{brown}标牌{text}看了一会儿，{wavingcyan}思索{text}它意味着什么。你的结论是那只是用来{purple}唬人{text}的，无需当真。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你把各种{rainbow}彩色果汁{text}倒入瓶子时，开始感到不舒服。你选择了忽略，但这种感觉{signcurse}愈发强烈{text}。你意识到那块标牌不是一个{curse}无端的威胁{text}。既然对身体{red}伤害{text}已经无法挽回，你只好收拾好手头的东西，迅速回到{silver}主路{text}上。</>"

#. Key:	A74E31FC4AE6840AE3E995ADAA3AA642
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Your eyes and mouth go wide as you look at the many different {wavingrainbow}tonics{text} available.  Without hesitation, you begin to have your fill.  {cyan}Straight{text} from the tap, various {wavingpink}combinations{text}...anything you can think of goes into your pack.  The {bless}warning{text} on the sign temporarily becomes a distant memory.</>{br}{br}<text>You don't even notice the {signcurse}strange purple{text} vapor {orange_b}surrounding{text} you until it's too late. You quickly run back to the {silver}road{text}, wiping off an {signcurse}inky substance{text} and hoping the worst is behind you.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>各种{wavingrainbow}花花绿绿{text}的玩意尽收眼底，你不禁眼嘴都张大起来。你毫不犹豫地开始搜刮，拿起一瓶{cyan}直接{text}从喷口乱接，不管变成什么{wavingpink}组合{text}...最后所有能见物都一并进了你的包里，标牌上的{bless}警告{text}早已被你抛至九霄云外。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>然而为时已晚，你甚至没有注意到奇怪的{signcurse}紫色烟雾{text}开始{orange_b}围绕{text}着你。你迅速跑回{silver}主路{text}，奋力擦除那些{signcurse}墨色物质{text}，暗暗祈祷已经摆脱最糟糕的情况。</>"

#. Key:	5C7F06F1481096D3DEEED88BC5B67C0D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The space around the {blue}containers{text} is a cacopheny of {rainbow}exotic scents{text}, each one causing your mouth to water.  You examine the area, then take {bless}heed{text} of the sign's warning.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Plucking two {green}vials{text}, you fill them with what you believe to be the {gold}most valuable{text} on the road to the </>{tournament}<text> and stuff them in your satchel.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Before heading out, you pause to take in one more {pink}sweet{text}, {cyan}delicious{text} breath, then smile and continue onward.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>{blue}容器{text}周围的空间充满了{rainbow}异样{text}的刺鼻气味，每种都让你垂涎欲滴。你检查了一下四周，然后{bless}注意{text}到了标牌的警告。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你从包里拔出两{green}剂瓶{text}，用最有可能对</>{tournament}<text>之旅有用的{gold}液体{text}将它们装满，然后塞回包里。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>出发之前，你又停下来呼吸了一口{pink}甜{cyan}美{text}的空气，然后微笑着回到前进的路上。</>"

#. Key:	CE79D77A41625449599218AFF3155EA0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Surveying the {rainbow}buffet of beverages{text}, you note a single flask resting in something that resembles a {gold}birdcage{text}.  You aren't sure what slight a bottle can make, but no container should be {red}imprisoned{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The cage isn't locked, and you rescue the vial from {cyan}captivity{text}, filling it from one of the fountains.  It seems {orange}endless{text}, and you gleefully drain every vat without room for more.  Soon, the flask emits a {curse}purple smoke{text}, and the words on the {brown}sign{text} change.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{badshrinepotions}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你检查了一下这些{rainbow}自助饮品{text}，注意到一枚烧瓶是放在一个类似{gold}鸟笼{text}的东西里。你不确定单单一瓶药能有什么用，但它显然不该被{red}囚禁{text}于此。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>笼子没有锁，你从中救出了{cyan}“囚犯”{text}，并用其中一个喷口装满。它似乎是个{orange}无底洞{text}，你兴高采烈地装了个遍，直到附近一滴不剩。很快，烧瓶散发出一阵{curse}紫色烟雾{text}，{brown}标牌{text}上的文字也发生了变化。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badshrinepotions}"

#. Key:	B8746B5F4AA7EC5F23B9629CA3AA4302
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Consumable.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Potion Fountain"
msgstr "药水储源"

#. Key:	0546A52E415FB77145E7ABBFB871158E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Stumble upon a box of magic dice."
msgstr "偶遇一盒魔法骰子。"

#. Key:	3C7B860C4CED3269383D7A896167AE10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The {shakingyellow}ringing{text} of a bell catches your attention.  Following the {blue}sound{text}, you find a mostly empty table, consisting of a few {silver}dice{text} and an empty tray.  The dice seem to {rainbow}shimmer{text} as though calling out to you.  It looks like some kind of {green}game{text}.  A tattered, {brown}wooden sign{text} covered in strange {bless}symbols{text} catches your attention.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you approach, the {bless}runes{text} on the sign transform into your native language:</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">Roll the dice, and press your luck</>\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">Don't risk too much, lest misfortune be struck</><text>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一阵{shakingyellow}铃声{text}引起了你的注意。顺着{blue}声音{text}，你发现了一张几乎空无一物的桌子，桌子上放着零星几颗{silver}骰子{text}与一个空托盘。骰子似乎在{rainbow}闪烁{text}，仿佛呼唤着你。这看起来像某种{green}游戏{text}。一块破旧的{brown}标牌{text}上写着奇怪的{bless}符号{text}，惹人好奇。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你靠近时，标牌上的{bless}符文{text}转化成你的母语：</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">掷乾坤，试天运</>\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">适收手，防霉运</>"

#. Key:	2495F4EB47EFCB9A573824AEB1CCA7F3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You grab the {cyan}dice{text}, blow on them for {wavingpink}luck{text}, and toss them into the {gray}box{text}.  They clatter around for a bit, and when they finally settle, they runes begin to {turquoise}glow{text}.  A {wavingwhite}soothing energy{text} washes over you, making you feel just a bit stronger than before.</>{br}{br}<text>Not wanting to take your {green}chances{text}, you set the dice back in the {gray}tray{text}, give thanks to {wavingpink}Lady Luck{text}, and return on your journey to the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你抓起{cyan}骰子{text}，祈求着{wavingpink}好运{text}，然后将它们扔进{gray}托盘{text}里。它们四处晃动了一会儿，稳定下来，此时符文开始发出{turquoise}光芒{text}。一股{wavingwhite}舒缓的能量{text}涌上你的心头，你感觉比以前更强大了一些。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你不想{green}冒险{text}，于是将骰子放回{gray}盒子{text}，向{wavingpink}幸运女神{text}道谢，然后继续前往</>{tournament}的旅程。</>"

#. Key:	A3A691C347F089874831A7928CD67CA6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Curious, you pick up the {bless}dice{text} and look them over, give them a few {shakingorange}good shakes{text}, and toss them into the box.  With each roll, the {bless}runes{text} of the dice {rainbow}glow faintly{text}, and you feel a warm {pink}sensation{text} deep inside you.</>{br}{br}<text>One roll, however, gives you a {curse}tingling feeling{text} that is far less pleasant.  You decide that must be the {green}game's{text} way of telling you to walk away.  Placing the dice back, you make you way back to the path to the </>{tournament}<text> only a little worse for wear.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>出于好奇，你拿起了{bless}骰子{text}，仔细查看了它们，{shakingorange}摇了几下{text}，然后将它们扔进托盘。每掷一次，骰子上的{bless}符文{text}就{rainbow}发出微弱的光芒{text}，你从内心深处感到一股{pink}暖流{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>然而，其中一枚骰子却带来一种{curse}刺痛{text}的感觉，这种感觉远不那么令人愉快。你识趣地察觉到这肯定是{green}游戏{text}在提示你该离开了。 于是你将骰子放回原处，回到通往</>{tournament}<text>的道路，只是身体略有不适。</>"

#. Key:	24579E7F4FD1B3AD4C69F7B6337343BE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>A {wavinggreen}game of chance{text} would make for a nice distraction from facing would-be {colortournament}champions{text}, so you pause to play a few rounds.  You aren't sure of the rules, but you see some {blue}dice{text} and a {blue}box{text}, so you give them a few rolls.</>{br}{br}<text>You become so {gray}engrossed{text} in the game that you don't realize the {bless}runes{text} on the dice shift color, or the {signcurse}queasy feeling{text} in your stomach.  Despite all that, you still feel like you've {pink}won{text}, and resume your journey with a smile.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一场{wavinggreen}运气游戏{text}可以很好地消除挑战潜在{colortournament}冠军{text}带来的压力，所以你决定停下来玩几轮。你不太确定规则是什么，但面前有些{blue}骰子{text}和一个{blue}托盘{text}，于是便投了几次。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你逐渐{gray}全神贯注{text}于游戏之中，以至于没有意识到骰子上变色的{bless}符文{text}以及胃中的{signcurse}恶心感{text}。即便如此，你感觉自己{pink}大赢特赢{text}，短暂庆祝后微笑着继续你的旅程。</>"

#. Key:	6E2688864F5FB47C345205AD485AFC62
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>One would never have guessed that a humble {randomcolor}{playerProfession}{text} would have such an affinity for {cyan}gambling{text}.  Your eyes light up when you see the {rainbow}dice{text}, and you eagerly begin {wavingwhite}rolling those bones{text}.</>{br}{br}<text>It's not until the dice move to their holder of the own {orange}accord{text} and the box slams shut that you realize you feel different, like {signcurse}something isn't quite right{text}.  Whatever you may have won, you hope its worth the {curse}cost{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>很难想到，一位不起眼的{randomcolor}{playerProfession}{text}会对{cyan}赌博{text}如此痴迷。看到{rainbow}骰子{text}时，你的眼睛都亮了起来，并迫不及待地开始投掷这些{wavingwhite}骨制玩物{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>直到骰子{orange}自动{text}返回盒子里的容位，并砰地一声关上，你才意识到自己的感觉变了，好像有些{signcurse}不太对劲{text}。不管你赢得了什么，最好不要有太大的{curse}代价{text}。</>"

#. Key:	051D61AA497C51BF82E2F89C5609DD91
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Feeling a little {green}curious{text} and a little {yellow}lucky{text}, you step up to the simple {brown}wooden box{text}, take hold of the dice, and give them a toss.  They roll and clatter before landing on a set of {wavingcyan}strange runes{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You aren't sure what they mean, but they begin to glow a {rainbow}variety of colors{text}, and you soon find yourself filled with a sense of {cyan}cosmic energy{text}.  It appears that whatever the game was, you seem to have won.  {wavingpink}Congratulations{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你感到有点{green}好奇{text}，又自我感觉{yellow}运气不错{text}，于是走向那个简陋的{brown}木箱{text}，拿起骰子掷了出去。骰子滚动着，咔哒作响，然后落在一组{wavingcyan}奇怪的符文{text}上。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你不清楚是什么意思，但符文开始发出{rainbow}各种颜色{text}的光芒。你感到自己充满了{cyan}宇宙能量{text}。看来不管怎样，这局算你赢了。{wavingpink}恭喜{text}。</>"

#. Key:	5BB4D3B24C0EC3981101698CEDB39957
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As soon as you pick up the dice, you feel a {wavingblue}strange power{text} radiating from them.  Seeing so many {cyan}dice{text} in the box, you think that taking one for yourself couldn't hurt.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>That thought quickly fades as the runes begin to glow a {curse}deep violet{text} and seep a fog of the same color.  Though you can't tell how, you sense the {red}die{text} is somehow different.  Glancing at the {brown}sign{text}, you notice the words have changed.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{badshrinedice}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你一拿起骰子，就感觉到一股{wavingblue}奇怪的力量{text}从中散发出来。盒子里{cyan}骰子{text}众多，拿一个应该也没事。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当符文开始发出{curse}深紫色{text}的光芒，并渗出雾气时，你瞬间意识到这个想法错误。不知为何{red}骰子{text}产生了某种变化。你瞥了一眼{brown}标牌{text}，注意到上面的文字已经变了。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badshrinedice}"

#. Key:	40528409460275184FA095BE4F59C86B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Game of Chance"
msgstr "运气游戏"

#. Key:	6F25BA8F496B2A96C7DBB991076D073F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.OpeningBodyTextDeprecated_60_AAC9C7EF46C39C27A592AAA652C7E16C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Dice.OpeningBodyTextDeprecated_60_AAC9C7EF46C39C27A592AAA652C7E16C
msgid "The mysterious shrine sits on the ground near you, glowing a <colorred>gentle red</>. An inscription below reads: <colorcyan>Look, don't touch. Thanks so much!</>"
msgstr "你附近的地上放着一个神秘的神龛，散发着<colorred>柔和的红光</>。神龛下面刻着一句话：<colorcyan>请勿触摸，非常感谢！</>"

#. Key:	E6688C1143D3A3A951F649A68A4AB70F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Stumble upon a potentially cursed cache of weaponry."
msgstr "偶遇一处有点邪门的武器库。"

#. Key:	EC6A60D64BB283DA5F94B182E60187B5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A table covered in an assortment of {blue}weapons{text}, {orange}armor{text}, and {purple}trinkets{text} sits by the trail here. At first, you think they must be abandoned, but something {wavingpink}strange{text} nearby indicates otherwise.  Resting against the table, a plain {brown}wooden sign{text} rests, carved in unusual {bless}markings{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you approach, the {bless}runes{text} on the sign transform into your native language:</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">Pick a prize, but buyer beware</>\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">These gifts, like life, aren't always fair</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>这里的小路旁有一张桌子，上面摆满了各种{blue}武器{text}、{orange}盔甲{text}以及{purple}饰品{text}。起初，你以为这些都是遗弃物，但附近的一些{wavingpink}奇怪迹象{text}表明情况并非如此。桌子上有一枚朴实的{brown}标牌{text}，上面刻有不寻常的{bless}记号{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你靠近时，标牌上的{bless}符文{text}转化成你的母语：</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">有奖供选，入手无悔</>\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">赠物如命，公允难卜</>"

#. Key:	9E5832E2416FEEBD310710B78DFDE638
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You scan over the {red}table{text}, looking at each item before {wavingtext}one{text} catches your eye.  You take a {cyan}deep breath{text}, wincing as you {pink}pluck{text} the object from the table.  You wait, tentativly, but {bless}nothing{text} happens.</>{br}{br}<text>Rather than risk upsetting whoever left this, you {wavingwhite}slowly{text} back away, then turn and head back towards the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你扫视着{red}桌面{text}，端详每件物品，直到{wavingtext}其中一件{text}引起了你的注意。你{cyan}深吸一口气{text}，皱着眉从桌上{pink}扯起{text}它。你略有期待地静候着，但{bless}什么{text}也没发生。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>为了避免惹恼丢下它的人，你谨慎地{wavingwhite}慢慢后退{text}，然后转身继续前往</>{tournament}<text>的旅途。</>"

#. Key:	2885292448845E6E3CA3ADA2EE463A48
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Circling the {red}table{text}, you examine each {cyan}item{text}, thinking about what to take.  You decide to test the {wavingblue}waters{text}, plucking from the table until you have a {pink}reason{text} to stop.</>{br}{br}<text>It doesn't take long before a sense of {curse}dread{text} begins to wash over you.  You decide that is just enough {signcurse}bad luck{text}, and stop before the {orange}sensation{text} gets worse.  You stow what you've taken and return to the {gray}main road{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你环视{red}桌面{text}，端详每件{cyan}物品{text}，思考该拿走什么。一番思想准备后，你决定{wavingblue}以身试局{text}，尽之所能地带走这些宝物，除非有什么{pink}意外{text}发生。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>很快，一股{curse}惧意{text}开始席卷你。你决定不能放任今日的{signcurse}晦气{text}继续滋长下去，在{orange}感官{text}继续恶化前及时收手，拿起所获并返回{gray}主路{text}。</>"

#. Key:	ED4FB24748F4BB863A4586AC485BC15B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>With so many {pink}options{text}, its hard to choose.  And the {signbless}warning{text} on the sign is {purple}ambiguous{text} at best.  As you look around, you see no one about, so you decide that taking a {cyan_i}few things{text} can't hurt.</>{br}{br}<text>Something strange happens as you begin to {orange}loot{text} the table.  At first, you brush it off as your {silver}imagination{text}, but soon the sensation becomes {shakingtextbold}undeniable{text}.  You feel more than a little {curse}ill{text}, and decide it best to stop before too much trouble comes your way.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>面临这么多的{pink}选项{text}，确实让人很难抉择，且标牌上的{signbless}警告{text}也是{purple}含糊其辞{text}。你环顾四周，未发现任何人，所以{cyan_i}多拿几件{text}应该稳赚不亏。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>正当你{orange}大肆搜刮{text}之时，突然感觉浑身发毛。起初你还以为这只是{silver}臆想{text}，但这种感觉迅速变得{shakingtextbold}难再自欺{text}。实在消受不了这{curse}苦楚{text}，你决定最好在遇到更大的麻烦之前停手。</>"

#. Key:	DE83DC0F47367F3B1BFBB59AC60DA88C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>There is so much here that you can't decide.  As usual when you are faced with {orange}indecision{text}, you make all the choices.  In this case, taking {cyan}items{text} from the table, one by one.  Like a {playerrace} child in a {wavingpink}candy store{text}, you don't stop until it's too late.</>{br}{br}<text>A {signcurse}dark purple fog{text} begins to surround you, covering you in something {purple}indescribable{text}.  Just as quickly as it washes over you, however, it {turquoise}vanishes{text}.  You take that as a sign to be on your way.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>这的选项实在太丰富，让人眼花缭乱。如往常一般，每当{orange}犹豫不决{text}时你倾向于全都要。此场景的对应措施即为一件又一件地拿走桌上{cyan}物品{text}，正如老鼠掉进米缸。当你停手时，为时已晚。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>一团{signcurse}深紫雾{text}开始包围你，用某种{purple}难以言语{text}的东西将你笼罩其中。然而，来之迅速，去之亦快，雾{turquoise}瞬间消失{text}，像是在提醒你赶路。</>"

#. Key:	1F981EDF41F37E29E32B86BB1BD6E46F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You spot a {orange}small gem{text}, seemingly out of place among the {white}arms{text} and {white}equipment{text} scattered about.  Something about it catches your attention, however.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Among all the {gray}weapons{text} you could take, you opt for the unique {orange}gemstone{text}.  As you bring it closer to the other items, it begins to {wavingcyan}glow{text} and an {wavingblue}unseen force{text} tries to draw it closer.  That would explain why it was isolated.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You wrap the {orange}gem{text} in a bit of cloth and make your way back to the {brown}main road{text}.  It seems you made the right choice.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现了一颗{orange}宝石{text}，与周围散落一地的{white}武器{text}与{white}装备{text}格格不入。它莫名地十分吸引你的注意。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>于是在一地的{gray}武器{text}中，你最终选择了这颗的{orange}宝石{text}。将其靠近其他的物品时，宝石突然开始{wavingcyan}发光{text}，似乎有一股{wavingblue}无端的力量{text}吸引着其周围之物，估计这是为什么它被故意与其他物品分隔开。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你用一块布包住了这颗{orange}宝石{text}，然后回到{brown}主路{text}上。似乎你做了正确的选择。</>"

#. Key:	C50F6D00499999B0E72C21AB664F6D98
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Laying on the table, a {yellow}girdle{text} full of weapons calls out to you, as if {wavingpink}begging{text} for a new home.  Not being one to deny such a simple request, you decide to take the {yellow}belt{text} and everything that comes with it.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As soon as you {red}pluck{text} it from the table, it becomes lighter; the gear strapped to it fading into a {curse}purple smoke{text}.  The fog wraps around you for a moment, then fades.  That is when you notice the {brown}sign{text} has changed.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{badsignitems}"
msgstr ""
"<text>桌上放着一条绑满武器的{yellow}腰带{text}，它仿佛在呼唤着你，{wavingpink}乞求{text}你成为新的主人。无力拒绝如此简单的要求，你决定带上{yellow}腰带{text}以及附着的所有东西。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>当你从桌面{red}扯起{text}腰带时，它瞬间变轻，绑在上面的装备逐渐化为一团{curse}紫色烟雾{text}。雾气笼罩了你片刻，随后消散。此时你注意到{brown}标牌{text}已经生变。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{badsignitems}"

#. Key:	9F1F81D14A2AFD8FA2811599B73BFDD7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Unusual Armory"
msgstr "反常军械库"

#. Key:	8D979E2A408846805AA5CEA3CD2D8395
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.OpeningBodyTextDeprecated_60_AAC9C7EF46C39C27A592AAA652C7E16C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Equips.OpeningBodyTextDeprecated_60_AAC9C7EF46C39C27A592AAA652C7E16C
msgid ""
"A large basket of <colorturquoise>weapons</>, <colororange>armor</>, and <colorpurple>trinkets</> sits by the trail here. They must be abandoned, but something <bl>strange</> nearby indicates otherwise. A small note in front of the collection reads: \r\n"
"\r\n"
"<colorbless>Only take one from this humble store</>\r\n"
"<colorbless>Trouble will haunt you if you take more</>"
msgstr ""
"在这条小径上放着一个装满<colorturquoise>武器</>、<colororange>盔甲</>和<colorpurple>饰品</>的大篮子。它们似乎被遗弃了，但附近有一些<bl>奇怪的迹象</>表明情况并非如此。在这个收藏品前面放着一张小纸条，上面写着：\n"
"\n"
"<colorbless>只拿一样</>\n"
"<colorbless>如果你拿太多，麻烦将会困扰你</>"

#. Key:	4C3AB9B447BFA8F79606E39D218697CE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Stumble upon a slightly suspicious bundle of loot."
msgstr "偶遇一些战利品。"

#. Key:	DEFD7C0945FC4AD68E2E0BA1B92E138B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You stumble upon a {gold}pot of gold{text}, sitting plainly in a {gray}shaded spot{text}. You look around, as if expecting {orange}someone{text} to return and reclaim their {gold}lost treasure{text}, but there appears to be no trace of anyone.  An old {brown}wooden sign{text} juts out from the pot, catching your curiousity to get a better look.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you approach, the {bless}runes{text} on the sign transform into your native language:</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">Glittering gold is yours to take</>\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">To take too much would be a mistake</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你突然发现了一个{gold}金罐子{text}，它不起眼地落在一处{gray}阴影{text}中。你环顾四周，想着会{orange}有人{text}来取回这{gold}遗失的宝贝{text}，但没有任何人的迹象。一个古老的{brown}标牌{text}从金子里伸出，使你十分好奇。你凑近仔细查看。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你靠近时，标牌上的{bless}符文{text}转化成你的母语：</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">烁烁其金</>\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">噬利招侵</>"

#. Key:	6CA90DE740AA84718AE28AACAA0C828E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You decide to heed the signs {curse}warning{text}, taking just what you think you will {green}need{text}.  Free {gold}money{gold} is free {gold}money{text}, and your mother always taught you to never look a {rainbow}gift horse{text} in the mouth.</>{br}{br}<text>Stuffing your {wavingyellow}modest earnings{text} in your pocket, you continue on your way to the </>{tournament}<text>.  Looking back, however, the pot is back to {yellow_bi}overflowing{text}, as though you had taken nothing at all.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你决定听从{curse}警告{text}，{green}按需慎拿{text}。这已经是白给的，没必要继续得寸进尺。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你将{wavingyellow}一小笔财宝{text}装进口袋，继续准备前往</>{tournament}<text>。然而回头一看，金罐又变得{yellow_bi}满满当当{text}的，仿佛你什么也没拿一样。</>"

#. Key:	2289D5B448DD543D4D6D0C891C7011A3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You decide to see how {blue}serious{text} this {brown}wooden warning{text} can be.  You take what you think is {pink}fair{text}, then go back for just a {smalltext}little more{text}.  It doesn't take long, howevern, for a slight {curse}feeling of dread{text} to begin to creep in.</>{br}{br}<text>The feeling isn't {purple}strong{text}, but you decide not to {turquoise}press{text} any further.  You take what you've got and quickly return to the road to the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你决定试探一下这个{brown}标牌{text}上的警告到底能有多{blue}严重{text}。你拿走了{pink}适量{text}的一部分，然后又多贪了{smalltext}一点点{text}。然而，几乎是立刻，一丝{curse}恐惧{text}的感觉就开始蔓延。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>这种感觉并不{purple}强烈{text}，但你决定不该再{turquoise}冒险{text}了。你拿走了所得之物，迅速返回通往</>{tournament}<text>的道路。</>"

#. Key:	E6E6DB7C40E998FFEBEEFB93DBB88569
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>As you take from the {silver}pot{text}, a {curse}sick feeling{text} starts to invade your {blue}senses{text}.  You brush it off for a while, but the {pink}feeling{text} gets stronger.</>{br}{br}<text>You choose to stop before the {turquoise}sensation{text} gets too bad, but not before the sign in front of you changed from a {bless}warning{text} to a {curse}threat{text}.</>{br}{br}{badsigngold}"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你从{silver}罐子{text}中取出东西时，一种{curse}恶心的感觉{text}开始侵入你的{blue}感官{text}。你使劲擦擦脑门，但{pink}感觉{text}变得愈发强烈。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你选择在{turquoise}完全丧觉{text}之前停下来，但面前的标牌已经从{bless}警告{text}变为了{curse}威胁{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badsigngold}"

#. Key:	83FBBCD2478C6C1F291B5DA7D88BD323
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>The {brown}sign{text} does nothing to dissuade you from taking your fill.  As you fill your {gold}purse{text}, you don't even notice the {bless}runes{text} on the sign change.</>{br}{br}<text>{cyan_i}Laden{text} with coins, you finally notice the sign, which has taken a much {curse}darker{text} turn than you recall.</>{br}{br}{badsigngold}"
msgstr ""
"<text>这个{brown}标牌{text}根本无法遏制你的贪念。当你整鼓{gold}钱包{text}时，甚至没有注意到标牌上的{bless}符文{text}已经发生了变化。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你{cyan_i}满载金币{text}后，终于注意到标牌的变化，它比之前颜色变得更{curse}深{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badsigngold}"

#. Key:	BED9E06F4353150C1F9E839420E532D8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The {gold}gold{text} glitters, almost {wavingpink}hypnotically{text}, begging to fill your pockets.  It takes every ounce of {cyan}willpower{text} to restrain yourself, taking only a handful.  Perhaps the {brown}sign's{text} warning was more effective that you let on.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You wait a few moments, but {bless}nothing{text} seems to happen.  With a sigh of relief, you quickly pocket the {gold}gold{text} and journey onward towards the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>{gold}黄金{text}闪闪发光，如{wavingpink}蛊化{text}般涌满你的口袋。你竭尽{cyan}意志力{text}，才克制住自己，只拿走了一点。看来{brown}标牌{text}的警醒作用比你预想的稍微有效。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你等了一会，但貌似{bless}没什么{text}代价。松了一口气，你迅速将{gold}金子{text}装了起来，回到去往</>{tournament}<text>的路上。</>"

#. Key:	EF1FC64B4785A7CE1927758B841B9B11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You look around, finding yourself completely alone with a {gold}fool's fortune{text} which would surely serve you well.  Gripping both the handles, your {blue}hoist{text} the treasure and begin to make your exit.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you pass an {cyan}unseen barrier{text}, the gold begins to evaporate in a {curse}purple mist{text}, leaving just an empty pot.  It swirls back where it started, reforming into a {gray}brand-new{text} cask of {gold}coins{text}, changing the sign as it passes by.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{badsigngold}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你环顾四周，周遭只你一人，而{gold}不翼之财{text}挥手可得，定会对你大有裨益。你抓稳两个把手，{blue}高举{text}宝藏，踏步离开。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>但当你经过一道{cyan}目不可见{text}的屏障后，黄金开始在{curse}紫色雾气{text}中逐渐蒸发，只留下一个空罐子。它在空中盘旋，返回原处，重新变回一个{gray}崭新{text}的含金容器，而标牌之语亦有变化。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badsigngold}"

#. Key:	27261D104CD577414467F4BDFEC316AC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Gold.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
