#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ProcTable_Items.ProcTable_Items.PotOfGold_GainGoldOnSurvivingCombat.BonusRewardsList_34_116A04294A16658D9D2A41BB11C5164E(0).BonusRewardsList_34_116A04294A16658D9D2A41BB11C5164E.LootSummarySource_93_619753794C4AACA29062C3B53A389E86.SourceText_24_D92EB37240FD08475ED739AB7456B584
msgid "Pot of Gold"
msgstr "漫金之罐"

#. Key:	FB95AB054821028523F619849F53385A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Stumble upon an oddly inviting library."
msgstr "偶遇一架书柜，它仿佛有吸引力。"

#. Key:	9E15330F48D49E87E7AACFB410AE10CE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You come upon an {purple}odd {text}signpost slightly off the {green}beaten path{text}.  A small, house-like enclosure holding a variety of {cyan}books {text}to interest any adventurer fill its shelves.  Above it, strange {bless}symbols{text} are carved into a simple {brown}wooden sign{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you approach, the {bless}runes{text} on the sign transform into your native language:</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">Knowledge is power, so sayeth the wise</>\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">But too much knowledge will bring demise</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你偶然发现了一个位于{green}蹊径{text}旁的{purple}奇怪{text}标牌，上面刻有一些神秘{bless}符号{text}。下方一个像房子一样的小木框里，摆满了各色{cyan}书籍{text}，它们足以吸引任何前来的冒险家。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你靠近时，标牌上的{bless}符文{text}转化成你的母语：</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">贤者曾云，知即为力</>\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">然慧极伤，多智则殃</>"

#. Key:	17A50E96430B8114548D5C82F607FF3B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You pick out a {turquoise}couple books{text} from the library and settle down in the {wavinggreen}grass{text} to lose yourself in a {blue}story{text}.  An hour passes, and you still have one to read.</>{br}{br}<text>You think about stuffing the {wavingyellow}unread title{text} in your bag, but looking at the {brown}sign{text} again, you think better of it.  Instead, you put them back where you found them and continue onward to the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你从柜子里挑选了{turquoise}几本书{text}，然后坐在{wavinggreen}草地{text}上，沉浸于{blue}故事{text}之中。一个小时过去了，你却意犹未尽还想再读一本。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>正当你想把{wavingyellow}待读的书{text}塞进包里时，又看了一眼{brown}标牌{text}，放弃了这个想法。你将它们放回原处，继续准备参加</>{tournament}<text>。</>"

#. Key:	F75175644F552EAE2AB3BAA8B137C705
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You pick out a {turquoise}couple books{text} from the library and settle down in the {wavinggreen}grass{text} to lose yourself in a {blue}story{text}.  An hour passes, and you still have one to read.</>{br}{br}<text>You decide to stash the {blue}book{text} for later, but as you turn to leave, you get a slight {curse}sinking feeling{text} in the pit of your {pink}stomach{text}.  Maybe it was {green}something{text} you ate?</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你从柜子里挑选了{turquoise}几本书{text}，然后坐在{wavinggreen}草地{text}上，沉浸于{blue}故事{text}之中。一个小时过去了，你却意犹未尽还想再读一本。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你决定将{blue}书{text}带走在路上读，但当你转身离开时，感觉到{pink}胃{text}深处有种{curse}下坠{text}的感觉。也许是因为吃坏了什么{green}东西{text}？</>"

#. Key:	A0B6D71C40DA4829658FD2A40C8F9AE6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>As you look through the {blue}library{text}, a number of books {pink}pique{text} your interest.  You cram several into your satchel for later and begin to resume your {turquoise}journey{text}.</>{br}{br}<text>As you step away, you feel an {curse}odd sensation{text}, like a {green}sickness{text} deep inside your core.  As you look back, you notice the {blue}library{text} full once more.  You also notice the sign reads something {curse}different{text}.</>{br}{br}{badsignsp}"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你浏览{blue}书柜{text}时，有几本书{pink}挑起{text}了你的兴趣。你将它们塞进挎包中，准备稍后在{turquoise}旅程{text}中再读。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你离开时，你产生了一种{curse}奇怪感觉{text}，一种内心深处的{green}病态情绪{text}。你忍不住回头一看，发现{blue}书柜{text}又装满了，同时标牌也{curse}有所不同{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badsignsp}"

#. Key:	1D9CBDBA4CE8E73816D37CAFF347547C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorblue\">Books{text} and {orange}tomes{text} of all shapes and sizes fill the shelves of this {turquoise}archive{text}, all {wavingyellow}yearning{text} to be read.  You ignore the sign and begin to fill your bag with {yellow_bi}everything{text} remotely interesting.</>{br}{br}<text>The more you take, the {curse}worse{text} you feel, but you brush it off.  It's not until you've finished that you notice the {brown}sign{text} has changed.</>{br}{br}{badsignsp}</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorblue\">古今中外{text}的书籍与{orange}大作{text}都被塞满在这{turquoise}档案架{text}中，{wavingyellow}渴望{text}着被人过目。你无视了标牌，开始往包里{yellow_bi}狂塞{text}这些趣味品。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>越拿你感觉越{curse}不对经{text}，但你仅当是心理作用。直到你全拿完后，才注意到{brown}标牌{text}已经发生了变化。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badsignsp}</>"

#. Key:	AFB95E93429CF4EC07825D86F139767D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You pause for a moment to recall your {orange}childhood{text}, and picture your favorite bedtime story - {randomreplacement|4}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As if by {bless}providence{text}, your eyes fall on that very book, and you are transported back to a time of {wavingwhite}innocence and wonder{text}.  You spend some time reliving your youth, and find yourself {blue}refreshed{text} and ready to take on the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你停下了片刻，回忆起{orange}童年{text}最喜欢的睡前故事——{randomreplacement|4}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>如{bless}命中注定{text}一般，你的目光落在了某本书上，它把你带回了{wavingwhite}纯真好奇{text}的孩提时代。你花了一些时间重温青春，{blue}一扫颓态{text}，作好了继续前往</>{tournament}<text>的准备。</>"

#. Key:	29B8B3314A4638F43C9E798D2739B372
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
