#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{cyan}\"The Boy Who Cried Werewolf\"{text}"
msgstr "{cyan}《狼人来了》{text}"

#. Key:	4072E49F44241D20383876A41D2A4BA8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You peruse the selection of all the novels this {wavingblue}odd library{text} has to offer, settling on an all-time classic - {randomreplacement|2}{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Such a {yellow}masterpiece{text} deserves to be enjoyed, so you decide to take it with you.  As you cross a {cyan}hidden boundary{text}, however, the {green}book{text} seeps an eerie purple fog, transforming the tome to {curse}The Principia Mahemio{text}.  The {brown}sign{text} looks different too.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{badsignsp}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你仔细阅读了这间{wavingblue}奇怪书柜{text}藏有的所有小说，最终选中了一本传世经典——{randomreplacement|2}{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>这般{yellow}杰作{text}值得细细品味，所以你决定带上它。然而，当你越过一道{cyan}隐藏的界限{text}时，{green}书{text}中渗出一团诡异的紫色雾气，将这本书变成了{curse}《马赫米欧原理》{text}。{brown}标牌{text}看起来也发生了变化。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badsignsp}"

#. Key:	ECBBA1464B6DAC3BB9E9EEAB4B9F1D0C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
