msgstr "{blue}《七个小狱灵》"

#. Key:	7BB069AA477DF90593FEA6A10CDC41A3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
