#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "{green}The Great Goblin"
msgstr "{green}大丑地精"

#. Key:	02C3AA574DFF496D1353C996474660DF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Roadside Library"
msgstr "路沿书柜"

#. Key:	098D6FB1476319C48481A791D586FDB3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.OpeningBodyTextDeprecated_60_AAC9C7EF46C39C27A592AAA652C7E16C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_StarPoints.OpeningBodyTextDeprecated_60_AAC9C7EF46C39C27A592AAA652C7E16C
msgid ""
"A small <colororange>library</> appears to be situated here by the side of the path ahead. There are a variety of <colororange_bl>interesting books</> situated in the shelves... And apparently <b>no librarian.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Instead, a small note on the front door says\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<colorbless>A wealth of knowledge for all to share</>\r\n"
"<colorbless>To steal this knowledge will bring despair</>"
msgstr ""
"前面路边有一座小型<colororange>图书馆</>。书架内摆放着各种<colororange_bl>有趣的书籍</>... 但却没有<b>管理员</>。\n"
"\n"
"而是前门贴有一张小纸条，上面写着：\n"
"\n"
"<colorbless>分享给各位的知识宝藏</>\n"
"<colorbless>窃取者将面临绝望</>"

#. Key:	1EEA4FF842452903C831AF8C7DD6B2DA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Stumble upon a stone that promises new allies."
msgstr "偶遇一颗石头，它可以给你带来新的队友。"

#. Key:	C4FFDC324DCC783AA5D5F9AA89D37B55
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The faint {wavingrainbow}sound of music{text} draws you off the main path, leading to an odd stone tablet bearing a peculiar insignia. Surrounding it are {yellow_bi}footprints{text}, seemingly of many various types of creatures.  Nearby, a simple wooden sign is posted.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As you approach, the {bless}runes{text} on the sign transform into your native language:</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">The stars align above this stone</>\r\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">Use it wisely, or a curse be sown</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>微弱的{wavingrainbow}音乐声{text}将你引离主路，通向一块刻有奇特刻印的奇怪石碑。石碑周围都是{yellow_bi}脚印{text}，似乎来自各种生物。附近架着一个简单的木制标牌</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你靠近时，标牌上的{bless}符文{text}转化成你的母语：</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">辰宿于上，会石交映</>\n"
"<text s=\"signbless\">慎用其能，免召祸星</>"

#. Key:	B3201D8842823393DC32BDB1D72C461C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You place your hand upon the {gray}stone{text} and instantly feel a {wavingcyan}celestial energy{text} course through you.  Channeling that energy, you call upon the {wavingpurple}cosmos{text} to aid you in becoming the </>{tournament}<text> champion.</>{br}{br}<text>As you look upon the {brown}sign{text} again, you pull away out of fear of angering some {turquoise}cosmic entity{text}.  After all, it's better to be safe than sorry.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你将手放在{gray}石碑{text}上，立即感觉到一股{wavingcyan}天体能量{text}流经身体。通过引导这种能量，你呼唤{wavingpurple}万象{text}来协助你成为</>{tournament}<text>冠军。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>但你又看了一眼{brown}标牌{text}，忌惮这样可能会激怒某些{turquoise}高等存在{text}，选择了退缩。毕竟，谨慎总比后悔好。</>"

#. Key:	2953536B46EC387BFA8DE6A3D5D63B35
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You place your hand upon the {gray}stone{text} and instantly feel a {wavingcyan}celestial energy{text} course through you.  Channeling that energy, you call upon the {wavingpurple}cosmos{text} to aid you in becoming the </>{tournament}<text> champion.</>{br}{br}<text>Your fingers linger on the {gray}tablet{text} for a bit too long, however, and the energy takes a {curse}darker{text} turn.  You quickly pull your hand away, but it's {signcurse}too late{text}.  Even your newfound companions shake their head at you in {shakingpurple}shame.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你将手放在{gray}石碑{text}上，立即感觉到一股{wavingcyan}天体能量{text}流经身体。通过引导这种能量，你呼唤{wavingpurple}万象{text}来协助你成为</>{tournament}<text>冠军。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>然而，你的手指在{gray}石碑{text}上停留的时间过长，能量开始{curse}黑化{text}。你迅速将手抽回，但{signcurse}为时已晚{text}。甚至你新结识的同伴也对你摇头，{shakingpurple}以你为耻{text}。</>"

#. Key:	1FDADF714F3A0720F8FF129944F30B6E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You look to the {cyan}stars{text} as you reach out to the stone, drawing the {turquoise}energy{text} from it and calling new {yellow}companions{text}.  Your eyes close as you feel its power flow through your veins.</>{br}{br}<text>You kept them closed for too long, however, and didn't notice the {wavingred}comet{text} sail directly overhead.  A {signcurse}bad omen{text} to callers like yourself, which becomes immediately apparent as a {curse}darkness{text} surrounds you.  You quickly hurry away, looking back at the {gray}stone{text} and {shakingyellow}shivering{text}.  At least you have some new friends, though.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你望着上方{cyan}星辰{text}，一边向石碑伸出手，从中汲取{cyan}能量{text}，以召唤新的{yellow}同伴{text}。你闭上眼睛，感受力量在血管中流动。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>然而，你闭眼过久，未注意到头顶的{wavingred}彗星{text}轨迹。对于像你这样的策士来说，这是{signcurse}不祥之兆{text}。当{curse}黑暗{text}包围你时，你迅速抽身，回顾{gray}石碑{text}，止不住地{shakingyellow}颤抖{text}。不过，至少你交到了一些新朋友。</>"

#. Key:	9474027045881C4AA15B718DDFB52A27
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(3
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You look at the {gray}stone{text}, look at the {brown}sign{text}, then at the {gray}stone{text} again, shrug, and press your entire body against the carven boulder.  Practically {pink}hugging{text} the granite slab, you try to take all the {cyan}energy{text} it has to give.</>{br}{br}<text>You are so focused on the stone that you don't bother to look up at the {wavinggreen}pulsing green light{text} in the sky, a well known sign of {signcurse}bad times{text}.  All that bad energy drawn into your {randomcolor}{playerrace}{text} body.  It seems all that power came with a {curse}steep cost{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你对着{gray}石碑{text}与{brown}标牌{text}来回目顾，耸耸肩，将整个身体压这座在刻印的巨石上。几乎是{pink}紧紧抱住{text}花岗岩板，试图吸收它可提供的所有{cyan}能量{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你太过专注于石碑，未注意到天空中{wavinggreen}闪烁的绿光{text}，一种常见的{signcurse}恶兆{text}。邪恶能量尽被纳入你的{randomcolor}{playerrace}{text}身躯，但你能感觉到这些力量伴随着{curse}高昂的代价{text}。</>"

#. Key:	B84BF1C7471415A7AB310DB4544B3CF7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You recognize the {gray}stone{text} as one of {wavingblue}celestial power{text}, but it appears worn with pieces of it scattered on the ground.  {cyan}Energy{text} still radiates from the obelisk, and you pause to give your respects.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You decide to pick up one of the {pink}broken fragments{text}, which still emits a {wavingcyan}faint hum{text} even now.  Since there would be no way to {orange}fuse{text} it with the stone again, you conclude that there would be no harm in taking the {purple}shard{text} as a memento.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>With your {purple}relic{text} in tow, you resume your journey to the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你知晓这块{gray}石碑{text}含有{wavingblue}天体力量{text}，但它看起来有些破旧，碎片散落了一地。它仍然散发着{cyan}能量{text}，你停下对其表达敬意。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你决定捡起一块{pink}石碑碎片{text}，它仍在{wavingcyan}微鸣{text}。既然没有办法将它与石碑{orange}粘合{text}，不妨将{purple}碎片{text}当作纪念品带走。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你收拾好了这件{purple}宝贝{text}，继续前往</>{tournament}<text>的旅程。</>"

#. Key:	9895226C47DFAB71E5B81E9115FC4959
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As you draw nearer to the {cyan}sounds{text}, you realize it is coming from a pillar of {wavingblue}celestial energy{text}, worn and cracked.  On closer inspection, you notice a few {brown}loose pieces{text} of stone barely hanging onto the obelisk.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You decide that since the {brown}stone{text} is falling apart, taking a souvenier would be no issue.  With a {shakingred}straining groan{text}, you pull it free.  As soon as you do, however, a {curse}deep purple mist{text} surrounds you, changing the shard and the sign nearby.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{badshrineunits}"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你逐步靠近那个{cyan}声音{text}时，你发现声音来自一根磨损不堪且处处裂缝的{wavingblue}天体能量{text}之碑。仔细观察后，你注意到碑上松松垮垮地挂着一些{brown}石块{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>既然{brown}它们{text}快要落下，拿走当作纪念品应该不成问题。你{shakingred}费力地喘{text}了一声，将它拔了出来。然而，一拔出来，一团{curse}深紫色的雾气{text}就包围了你，改变了碎片与附近的标牌。</>\n"
"\n"
"{badshrineunits}"

#. Key:	D23293884A0F142BD92859AD97068BF2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Summoner's Stone"
msgstr "召唤师之石"

#. Key:	0D557C87487939E9EF54B3B23F3C549C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.OpeningBodyTextDeprecated_60_AAC9C7EF46C39C27A592AAA652C7E16C
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Shrine_Units.OpeningBodyTextDeprecated_60_AAC9C7EF46C39C27A592AAA652C7E16C
msgid ""
"You note a small side path and follow it out of curiosity. At the end is a stone tablet. Surrounding it are <colororange_bl>footprints</>, seemingly of many various types of creature. The tablet bears a <b>peculiar inscription...</>\r\n"
" \r\n"
"<coloebless>><colorturquoise>Speak softly now, and find a friend\r\n"
"\r\n"
"To call for more would bring offense</>"
msgstr ""
"你注意到一条小路，出于好奇你走了进去。在路的尽头，你看到一块石碑。周围有着各种不同生物的<colororange_bl>脚印</>。石碑上刻有<b>奇特的铭文...</>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"<coloebless>轻声说话结交朋友\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"大放厥词招致敌人</>"

#. Key:	108BB7D64A725AEBE7477C90D9B8F4EF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Meet a strange wizard, surrounded by familiar runes."
msgstr "遇见一个陌生的巫师，他身边布满着眼熟的符文。"

#. Key:	4E43B834428C5B45E3674B993340FCD3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As you wander through the crowd of spectators, one patron catches your attention.  A small individual with a long {white}white beard{text}, but the most striking feature is his {signbless}bright blue robe{text}, covered in arcane script that you recognize from many {brown}signposts{text} you've seen along your travels.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>He beckons you over, looking you up an down.  {speech}\"You're {playerracearticle}, huh?  Well, I like a good underdog story.  So, how would you like to play a game?  Of course there's no catch.  Honest.\"{text}  You take him up on his offer, but that grin of his makes you wonder.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>当你在观众群中漫步时，一位赞助者引起了你的注意。那是一个{white}长白胡子{text}的小个子，但最关键的还是他的{signbless}亮蓝色长袍{text}。那上面覆盖着神秘的文字，你在旅行中的许多{brown}标牌{text}上都已经见过。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>他向你招手，上下打量着你。{speech}“你是个{playerrace}，嗯？那正好，我就喜欢屌丝逆袭的故事。想来玩个游戏吗？绝对没什么阴招，真的。”{text}你接受了他的提议，但他的笑容让你感到渗人。</>"

#. Key:	4790878640B9F491B67F01B62F0EBF24
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#. Key:	56D3A28141C1E1164537C18A6FB260BD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
