#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>You play for a bit, but something about that {pink}smirk{text} seems almost sinister.  Something about him seems {curse}tricky{text}, and you decide to stop before you get in too deep.</>{br}{br}<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"That's all?  Are you sure?  Very well.  Can't say I'm not disappointed, though.  I was hoping you would be a bit more adventuous.\"</>{br}{br}<text>A noise catched your {orange}attention{text} for a moment, and when you look back, you find nothing but the sweet scent of {signbless}incense{text} and a tiny {brown}wooden sign{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你玩了一会儿，但那家伙的{pink}假笑{text}实在不祥。他绝对有什么{curse}不对劲{text}，你决定在陷入太深之前停下来。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“就这样了？你确定吗？很好。让人有点失望，我希望你能更大胆一点。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你突然听到一阵{orange}噪音{text}，当你回过神时，面前只剩一道{signbless}甜美{text}的香气与一枚小小的{brown}标牌{text}。</>"

#. Key:	2EBF10CB442CFF454CD5EAB88081478A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.ShrineGuardian_Tournament.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>The little man beams brightly, and a simple table appears before you along with two chairs.  You sit opposite him and begin to play, flipping cards over two by two.</>{br}{br}<text>With the last turn, he whispers something, and you soon feel a little out of sorts.  You look at him for a moment, but he casually brushes you off.  {speech}\"Oh, don't worry about that.  Just a little fun, nothing to be concerned with.  Consider it an experiment.  If you see the {colorgera}Director{speech}, though...don't say anything.\"</>"
msgstr "<text>小个子男人笑容满面，一张简单的桌子和两把椅子出现在你面前。你坐在他对面开始玩牌，两两翻牌。</>{br}{br}<text>最后一轮，他低声说了些什么，你感到有点不舒服。你看了他一会儿，但他漫不经心地扯开了话题。{speech}“哦，别担心。只是一点乐趣，没什么可担心的。把它当作一个实验。不过，如果你看到{colorgera}主管{speech}...请别提这事。”</>"

