msgid "<text>Travelling along the beaten path, you spy a {wavingturquoise}notice board{text} sitting there, rather out of place.  You are familiar with the {yellow_i}help wanted ads{text}, so you take a gander.  A number of ads catch your eye, but you can only take one.  Rules of the {goblin}Goblin Consortium{text}.</>"
msgstr "<text>沿着人脚踩出的小路前行，你突然发现前方有一块{wavingturquoise}布告牌{text}，显得与周围环境格格不入。你对{yellow_i}悬赏布告{text}很熟悉，于是看了一眼。很多布告吸引了你的注意，但你只能接取一个，这是{goblin}地精财团{text}的规矩。</>"

