#. Key:	C48DD6AD44289FFB9FD70A878B4F0DDA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheBannerSage.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheBannerSage.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Encounter the City's leading fighter, a Giant master craftsman."
msgstr "遭遇六边城的最顶级战士，他是一位巨人族宗师级工匠。"

#. Key:	552033064D2590D4239CF4BB51856A8A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheBannerSage.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheBannerSage.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(5).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>The wise elder smiles, offering you a place to sit and watch her work.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You spend the evening reading stories of </><text s=\"river\">River's</><text> past while she weaves. She shows you a tale of how she lost her arm in a </><text s=\"colorred_i\">great battle</><text> on a bridge, defending a fortress under siege.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>In the morning, the</> <text s=\"river\">Giant</> <text>presents you with a beautiful silk flag.  As you turn to leave, she clasps your hands in hers, a silent way of wishing you well on your journey.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>她笑着腾开了一个位置，好让你坐下来看她干活。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你度过了一个晚上，听</><text s=\"colorriver\">里弗</><text>讲她的经历。她讲述了一个关于自己为了保卫一座堡垒，而在</><text s=\"colorred_i\">战斗</><text>中失去胳膊的故事。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>第二天早上，这位</><text s=\"colorriver\">巨人</><text>送给你一面美丽的丝质战旗，并紧紧握着你的手祝你一切顺利。</>"

#. Key:	4A89ADCC46C967474F70E5A69B8D1F9F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheBannerSage.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(6).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheBannerSage.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(6).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You look over the</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">delicately crafted tapestries</><text>, admiring the intricate stichwork that make the banners so beautiful.  In awe, you ask</> {river} <text>to share with you the story of her people.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The saga of her tribe lie within the threads of the</> <text s=\"colorpink\">pennants</><text>, telling of war and peace, prosperity and hardship.  Thousands of years of history told in</> <text s=\"rainbow\">vibrant colors</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{river} <text>thanks you in her own silent way, and you sense that your kindness will be</> <text s=\"colorbless\">rewarded</> <text>in the future.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你看着</><text s=\"colorcyan\">精心制作的挂毯</><text>，欣赏着如此美丽的复杂拼接。怀着敬畏之心，你请求</>{river}<text>她向你讲述她族人的的故事。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>她部落的传奇故事就隐藏在</><text s=\"colorpink\">战旗</><text>的图案细节之中。上有战争与和平、繁荣与苦难。数千年的历史在</><text s=\"rainbow\">鲜艳的色彩</><text>中娓娓道来。</>\n"
"\n"
"{river}<text>以她无声的方式感谢了你，你预料到自己的善意会在未来得到</><text s=\"colorbless\">回报</><text>。</>"

#. Key:	760411C94321FA52F490E5BB16087B09
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheBannerSage.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheBannerSage.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "The Banner Sage"
msgstr "战旗学者"

#. Key:	F8F4E86D475984A3434352935702544C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Encounter the Oasis' generous Champion, a clever Genie."
msgstr "遭遇一个慷慨的冠军，他是一位聪明的灯魂。"

#. Key:	BF59B505475996FF594CFFA365BEC04F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>With a nod,</> {kiodini} <text> takes in a deep breath, then blows toward you.  You feel the</> <text s=\"desert\">desert heat</> <text>on your face, and the</> <text s=\"colorblue\">stinging winds</> <text>against your skin.  When it subsides, you don't feel any different, but the world around seems just a bit</> <text s=\"colorpurple\">slower</><text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Your wish is our command, young one.  But don't think this means we'll go easy on you in the</> {tournament}<text s=\"colorspeech\">.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Without another word, the</> <text s=\"kiodini\">Djinn</> <text>vanishes in a cloud of</> <text s=\"desert\">smoke and sand</><text>, leaving you alone with your thoughts.  And the taste of sand in your mouth.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>领会了你的意愿，</>{kiodini}<text>深吸了一口气，然后向你吹去。你的脸感受到</><text s=\"desert\">沙漠热浪</><text>，还有</><text s=\"colorblue\">刺痛的风</><text>。感觉平息之后，自己貌似没有发生什么变化，但周围的世界似乎变得稍微</><text s=\"colorpurple\">缓慢</><text>了一些。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“年轻人，你的愿望我们言听计从。但别以为这意味着在</>{tournament}<text s=\"colorspeech\">中我们会对你手下留情。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>说完，这位</><text s=\"kiodini\">灯魂</><text>消失在一片</><text s=\"desert\">烟雾和沙尘</><text>里，让你独自留在那沉浸于思绪中，还有口中回荡的沙粒味。</>"

#. Key:	F5A60A5D4920B4386FA71AA884E884F4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"{kiodini} <text>chuckles a little, placing a hand on your shoulder.</>  <text s=\"kiodini\">\"I think I have just the thing.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Suddenly you feel arcane energy coalesce from all around you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"kiodini\">\"As you requested...phenomenal cosmic power in an itty, bitty living space.  Put that to good use, and I may just have a new story to write...the chronicles of a new champion.  I'll have to start thinking of a catchy title.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"{kiodini}<text>轻笑着拍了拍你的肩膀。</><text s=\"kiodini\">“我正有你想要的。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你周围突然聚集了一些奥术能量。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"kiodini\">“你要的东西...寰宇伟力方寸囚笼。善加利用它，我现在有个新故事要写了...一位新冠军的生平编年史，得从吸引眼球的书名想起。”</>"

#. Key:	7F79D67E438A0DCB53E5E398CB955EB3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text s=\"kiodini\">\"A story!  How delightful.  They don't call us the fabulous fabler for nothing, you know.  All you have to do is stay a while and listen.\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>As </>{kiodini} <text>spins a wonderous yarn, the pages take on a life of their own.  Quite literally, in fact, as one of the genie's illusory creatures animates before your very eyes, bouncing around and rubbing against your leg.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"kiodini\">\"Looks like someone wants to join you.  I hope you don't mind.  Just don't feed him after midnight.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"kiodini\">“你想听一个故事！多悦耳的请求！我可不是无名的叙事者。你只需稍事休息，静心聆听就行。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text></>{kiodini}<text>开始编织一个美妙故事，纸页栩栩如生地展现在你耳旁。这并不只是一个比喻，灯魂召唤出的其中一个幻像在你眼前活生生地蹦来蹦去，还蹭着你的腿。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"kiodini\">“看样子有个家伙想和你在一起，希望你不介意。就是千万别在午夜后喂它，会出事的。”</>"

#. Key:	A1E4A9464FA25E735F07DE96551BF884
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TheStoryteller.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "The Storyteller"
msgstr "叙事师"

#. Key:	4FF52E7541E94C222F60D194B3686C06
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Meet popular local bard Rhapsody."
msgstr "会见当地知名的狂想吟奏师。"

#. Key:	604880374D03520DE877369D4234AA51
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You spot a small {green}gathering{text} of people of all races.  Standing in the clearing, an {purple}elegantly{text}, if not {rainbow}gaudily{text}, dressed individual is sitting on a {brown}barrel{text}, playing a lute and speaking to a captive audience.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Curious, you wedge your way into the group as they tell an {blue}epic tale{text} of love and war.  As they finish their story, they pause, looks over the {orange}crowd{text} and asks for requests.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你发现了一个小型{green}聚会{text}，人们来自各种族。在中央的开阔地，一位{purple}优雅{text}但有些{pink}俗气{text}的穿着华丽的男子坐在一个{brown}桶{text}上，弹着诗琴，正对着一群聚精会神的听众讲话。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>好奇心驱使着你挤进这群人，男子讲述了一段{blue}史诗般的故事{text}，涉及爱与战争。故事结束时，他停下来，环视着{orange}人群{text}，并询问大家的听感需求。</>"

#. Key:	3262ED2E40FF69E7E47DDDB289A992C1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Tossing a few {yellow}coins{text} into the hat placed face up in front of the {pink}Bard{text}, they nod and begin to play {replacement@LeftSide} {replacement@RightSide}</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{replacement@RightSideEnd}"
msgstr ""
"<text>你往面前的帽子里扔了几枚{yellow}金币{text}，这位{pink}吟客{text}点了点头，开始演奏{replacement@LeftSide} {replacement@RightSide}</>\n"
"\n"
"{replacement@RightSideEnd}"

#. Key:	47E34D6D444F79A99F56A5932F9B3F95
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(0
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colororange\">\"Paladins will gladly lay down their lives in the fight against evil, and Bran was no exception.  A dwarven priest, kneeling beside the lifeless body of his dear friend, prayed to the gods to bring him back, to continue the fight against darkness.  No one knew if his prayers would be heard.  All they could do is hope.\"</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colororange\">“圣骑士们愿意为了对抗邪恶而献出自己的生命，布兰也不例外。一名矮人牧师，跪在朋友的尸体旁，祈求众神将他复活，以继续对抗黑暗。无人知晓他的祈祷是否被听见，人们只能寄予希望。”</>"

#. Key:	AAE010BD413A70999D99E8B29AD29A60
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(1
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorgreen\">\"A humble farmer, his face scarred by flames.  A mute slave woman from a barbarian settlement.  It seems like only the gods could bring these two together.  He taught her that the world was not all cruel.  She taught him that beauty was more than skin deep.  Together, they had the strength to conquer the world.\"</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorgreen\">“一位朴实的农民，脸上留着火焰的烙印。一个哑巴奴隶女，来自蛮族居点。似乎只有上天才能使这两者相聚。他教会她世界并非只有残酷，她教会他美丽不仅是肤浅。联合使他们获得了征服世界的力量。”</>"

