#. Key:	AC2E98EA413E24198A9CDFA8E130A522
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(12 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(12
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>Soon, everyone is moving to the {shakingorange}rhythmic beat{text} as the bard plays on.  Several people toss {gold}coins{text} into their hat, and a {white}standing ovation{text} comes as the last note is played.  It's the kind of tune that you will {cyan}remember{text} for a long time to come.</>"
msgstr "<text>很快，大家都开始随着吟客的演奏{shakingorange}节奏{text}舞动起来。其中几人亦将{gold}金币{text}扔进了演奏者的帽子里。当最后一个音符完毕时，全场听众一齐{white}起立鼓掌{text}。这无疑是那种会在很长一段时间内都{cyan}忘不了{text}的曲调。</>"

#. Key:	79BFE05A4906DD470566DB98723135F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(13 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
