#. Key:	7BCE063B4DD5DBC9D632309E6DCED536
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(14 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(14
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text>The audience quiets as a {wavingturquoise}haunting melody{text} fill the air.  People begin {blue}swaying{text} to the music, and some begin to {purple}dance{text} just off from the stage.  {gold}Coins{text} flow into the bard's hat, and they thank everyone generously.  As you walk away, you find yourself {wavingwhite}whistling{text} the melody with a smile.</>"
msgstr "<text>随着{wavingturquoise}萦绕心弦的旋律{text}响起，观众安静下来。人们开始随着音乐{blue}晃动{text}，有些开始在舞台下{purple}跳舞{text}。{gold}金币{text}纷纷投进了吟客的帽子，他也礼貌地感谢每位观众。当你离开时，你发现自己不由自主地微笑着{wavingwhite}哼着{text}歌曲的旋律。</>"

#. Key:	0BC16E7041B2F5433D1578BB61D98CEA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2 - Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343(2
#: -
#: Value).TextPhaseDescriptionTagReplacements_39_61F94971479C35E7C71367A2CA76F343_Value
msgid "<text s=\"colorblue\">\"It seemed hopeless for the cobalt dragonkin, Tyrloch.  Bloody and beaten, he somehow found the strength of his ancestors.  Lightning coursed to his veins, surging through him and out through his fingers, turning the corrupted chieftain to a smoking husk.  And that was the day he became the King of the North.\"</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorblue\">“对于钴龙裔泰洛克来说，情况非常绝望。他浑身是血、遍体鳞伤，但这时却机缘巧合，发现了祖先的力量。雷电在他的血液中奔腾，从他的手指中涌现，把敌人轰碎成渣。从那天起，他成了北境之王。”</>"

