#. Key:	E07512D1416665CB222787BDC3120326
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid "<text>You mingle in with the crowd as several patrons toss a coin to the Bard.  He sings, dances, recites, and plays, and before you know it, its been hours.  </>"
msgstr "<text>你混迹在人群中，几位顾客向诗人投掷硬币。他唱歌、跳舞、背诗、演奏，转眼间就过去了几个小时。</>"

#. Key:	2F6A6CF94342706E294CBF9CB9050682
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_RetiredChampion.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(4).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>As the</> <text s=\"colorpink\">Bard</> <text> finishes enrapturing the crowd, you pull them to the side and ask to become a patron of the arts.  You begin to describe your adventures thus far, and their eyes light up with wonder.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Well...I tell you what.  You keep winning in the tournament and let me worry about telling your tales.  In fact, with you as my muse, I may just have an endless supply of material.  Here, you take this.  I have a feeling I won't be needing it anymore.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>当那位</><text s=\"colorpink\">吟游诗人</><text>吸引了观众后，你把他拉到一边并提出要赞助他。你开始描述自己的冒险经历，听得他眼中闪烁着惊奇的光芒。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“这样吧，你继续在大赛中参赛，让我来讲述你的故事。事实上，有了你的素材，我现在灵感源源不断。拿着，这是给你的礼物，我不再需要它了。”</>"

#. Key:	0C053BAF453D2B12B22AEC9598AADF15
