#. Key:	F0D8E1BB41F63522EEA38A87085284F2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_Sponsorship.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_Sponsorship.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>You spot a {red}Dragonkin{text} standing on a pedestal, speaking to a few people you recognize as other {colortournament}Tournament{text} contestants.  As you move closer, he seems to recognize you.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Hey!  I'd know that face anywhere.  You're that {playerrace} {playerclass} on the fast track to besting the </>{elitefour}<text s=\"colorspeech\">.  My name is {stitch}Stitch{speech}.  I represent the {goblin}Goblin Trade Commission{speech} and we would like to make you an offer.  Nothing too elaborate.  Just sign here and take advantage of our exclusive associate perks.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你看到一位{red}龙裔{text}站在一个高台上，正与你能认出的其他{colortournament}大赛{text}选手交谈。当你走近时，他似乎认出了你。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“嘿！我在哪都能认出这张脸。你是那个正快速奔赴成为</>{elitefour}<text s=\"colorspeech\">的最佳选手。我叫{stitch}斯蒂奇{speech}，是{goblin}地精贸易委员会{speech}的代表。我们想给你一个提议，一点都不复杂。你只要在这里签字，就能享受我们的独家会员特权。”</>"

#. Key:	F3C34AC640E2C39A14322EAF46B7805A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_Sponsorship.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_Sponsorship.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(2).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text s=\"stitch\">Stitch{text} clasps his together and smiles a wide, toothy grin. {speech}\"Great. You will not regret this, believe you me. Just sign here.\"</> \r\n"
" \r\n"
"<text>You {red}sign{text} your name on the dotted line, and {stitch}Stitch{text} puts an arm around you, leading you to a back room. {speech}\"Here, you will find all the perks that comes with being a {stitch}Stitch partner{speech}. T-Fuel, Mobster Energy. Whatever this thing is... Help yourself, and remember. And as a {stitch}Stitch partner{speech}, the first one's free.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"stitch\">斯蒂奇{text}双手合十，露出满口牙齿的笑容。{speech}“太好了。相信我，你不会后悔的。就签这就行了。”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你在虚线处{red}签下{text}名字，{stitch}斯蒂奇{text}搂着你，带你到一个后房。{speech}“这里有成为{stitch}斯蒂奇伙伴{speech}的所有福利。什么能量饮料之类的都是小儿科啦...随便用。作为{stitch}斯蒂奇伙伴{speech}，首次享用免费。”</>"

#. Key:	6B3ADDBB42A0FE762CEC57B1FF42C35E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_Sponsorship.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_Sponsorship.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(3).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>Thinking back, you realize that you have never seen a {goblin}non-Goblin{text} entrepreneur.  It seems the {goblin}greens-skins{text} have cornered the {gold}market{text} on {gold}markets{text}, and that {red}infuriates{text} you.  Having had enough of {goblin}goblin {blue}capitalists{text}, you decide to express your concern with good old physical violence.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>You seem to rouse some cheers from the {purple}spectators{text}, though you aren't sure if they share your concerns or just enjoy a good {shakingred}riot{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>回想起来，你发现从未见过一个{goblin}非地精{text}企业家。似乎那些{goblin}绿皮{text}已经垄断了{gold}市场{text}，这让你非常{red}不爽{text}。你受够了{goblin}地精{blue}资本家{text}，决定用传统拳法表达一下不满。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>这个行为引起了一些{purple}围观者{text}的欢呼，虽然你不确定他们是否也能体会你的担忧，还是说只是喜欢看{shakingred}打架{text}吃瓜。</>"

#. Key:	C107C5AE48C5D3E88D7A3FADD05C5E87
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_Sponsorship.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
