msgid "Sponsorship Deal"
msgstr "赞助协议"

#. Key:	433ED0C94A4FD6DAB9F991931E207949
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_SuspiciousFigure.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_SuspiciousFigure.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Someone pulls you aside with a nefarious deal..."
msgstr "有人把你拉到一边，鬼鬼祟祟地提了件事..."

#. Key:	0C1FD4EC4E2D4B63244ADAB4386F484F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_SuspiciousFigure.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_SuspiciousFigure.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Greetings, fellow {playerrace}\"  {text}An odd voice from behind you catches your attention.  A hooded figure in a simple {brown}wooden mask{text}, seemingly {purple}purple{text} skin, and...{signcurse}are those tentacles{text}?</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"I hear you are trying to take on </>{elitefour}<text s=\"colorspeech\">.  We have plenty to give you a little edge.  Go ahead, take one.  {smallspeech}It will only cost your soul.  {speech}Hmm?  I didn't say anything.  So, what would you like?\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“你好，亲爱的{playerrace}。”{text}一个古怪的声音从你背后传来，引起了你的注意。一个戴着兜帽和简易{brown}木制面具{text}、皮肤{purple}发紫{text}的人出现了。他身边那是...{signcurse}触手吗{text}？</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“我听说你想要击垮那些</>{elitefour}<text s=\"colorspeech\">。我们有很多东西可以帮你稍微积累一些优势。来吧，选一个。{smallspeech}只需要一小点灵魂作为代价。{speech}嗯？我什么也没说。所以说，想要哪个？”</>"

#. Key:	E2C9BABA46A9E4F5D753E9A6933E0733
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_SuspiciousFigure.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.Tournament_SuspiciousFigure.EventTitle_2_3B4827864EAC6B70C32FBF90A16455A2
msgid "Suspicious Figure"
msgstr "可疑人物"

#. Key:	947A63BB4155126D5008EEB24D81527E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TrainingYard.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TrainingYard.BriefDescriptionforTravel_67_3E670F504AE7139C11D467A429E03812
msgid "Learn from some of the Tournament's strongest trainers."
msgstr "向大赛里一些最强的训练师学习。"

#. Key:	6639D1604A607A475920408C8C7E06E5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TrainingYard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Events/EventTable.EventTable.TrainingYard.EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6(0).EventPhases_57_7FF6A1064470EE1925FAD39D4D57EFB6.TextPhaseDescription_9_F498DE9A42F9D995D49E87AAF6C04105
msgid ""
"<text>A bellowing female voice catches your attention.  {speech}\"Swing with your shoulders!  Watch your feet!  Breathe out when you release!\"</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>A large {green_b}Orc{text} woman smiles when you make your way into the {turquoise}training yard{text}.  She seems remarkably friendly despite her {shakingred}imposing{text} stature.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Haven't seen you before.  Need some practice?  Well, speak up.  If a {playerclass} like you wants to win the {colortournament}tournament{speech}, you are going to need all the help you can get.\"</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>一阵高亢的女声引起了你的注意。{speech}“摆动肩膀！注意你的脚！放下时呼气！”</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>当你走进{turquoise}训练场{text}时，一位身材高大的{green_b}兽女{text}微笑着。尽管她的{shakingred}雄健{text}的身材看起来有些吓人，但她实际上非常友好。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text s=\"colorspeech\">“以前没见过你。你也想要练习吗？有需要就说吧。如果像你这样的{playerclass}想要赢下{colortournament}大赛{speech}，任何能化为优势的机会你都不能放过。”</>"

#. Key:	40CB47AB4C0AEE1A5B55FBA159C19BA6
