msgid "Dance Fever Draught"
msgstr "热舞饮品"

#. Key:	802B2CF84713505F2553A0A2EE99EDA2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ConsumableTable.ConsumableTable.GeraPotion_Dance.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ConsumableTable.ConsumableTable.GeraPotion_Dance.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Drop this on an enemy Unit to turn their skill into 'Breakdance'. Breakdance causes the unit to attack all adjacent enemies with normal attack damage, then they regain their original skill.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If unused, this Potion is destroyed when combat starts."
msgstr ""
"对敌方单位使用，将其技能临时变为“霹雳舞”。霹雳舞使其对相邻的盟友进行一次攻击，随后该单位重获其原技能。\n"
"\n"
"未使用时自动销毁。"

#. Key:	9560A94D4429675A3C688792AEA03C9F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ConsumableTable.ConsumableTable.GeraPotion_Love.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
