msgstr "吉拉的爱情药水"

#. Key:	8E73A036403DB7B262ED3EBFF04F8B3A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ConsumableTable.ConsumableTable.GeraPotion_Love.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ConsumableTable.ConsumableTable.GeraPotion_Love.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Drop this on an enemy Unit to make it Infatuated this fight. When an Infatuated Unit is not adjacent to an ally but could be, they will move towards one instead of performing other actions.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If unused, this Potion is destroyed when combat starts."
msgstr ""
"对敌方单位使用，使其陷入依恋状态。该状态下的单位优先往盟友靠拢，而非执行其他操作。\n"
"\n"
"未使用时自动销毁。"

#. Key:	47AEC4564A14A593479883B513B829C1
