msgid ""
"Drop this on an enemy Unit to permanently transform it into a random Unit of one higher rarity and the same Tier.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If unused, this Potion is destroyed when combat starts."
msgstr ""
"对敌方单位使用，将其随机变为同星级但稀有度高 1 等的其他单位。\n"
"\n"
"未使用时自动销毁。"

