msgid ""
"Drop this on an enemy Unit to transform it into a harmless sheep for 5 seconds. Afterwards, the Unit instantly gains full mana.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If unused, this Potion is destroyed when combat starts."
msgstr ""
"对敌方单位使用，使其变羊 5 秒。但之后，该单位立即回满法力值。\n"
"\n"
"未使用时自动销毁。"

