msgid ""
"Drop this on an any Unit to either Shrink or Grow it for the fight. You don't know which until you use it.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If unused, this Potion is destroyed when combat starts."
msgstr ""
"对任意单位使用，随机使其增大或缩小。\n"
"\n"
"未使用时自动销毁。"

