#. Key:	6A53D9584CD6E65577239BB6943453ED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Shojin.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Shojin.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
