msgstr "可疑的板甲"

#. Key:	6BD46B5B49F35A11C940A4B82EF044F3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkeletonHammerArmor.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkeletonHammerArmor.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid "Whenever a foe dies, +10 Armor."
msgstr "每当一名敌方单位阵亡，+10 点护甲。"

#. Key:	1AB83CCC4D945E123EFD2E9318AF6CA3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkeletonPrincesSword.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkeletonPrincesSword.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skeleton Prince's Sword"
msgstr "骷髅王子之剑"

#. Key:	8CCD6A5A41A71F964BA315AC92E45B6B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkeletonPrincesSword.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkeletonPrincesSword.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid "Wearer's attacks deal an additional 15 Spell Damage and leech 2 *Mana/* from enemies on-hit."
msgstr "佩戴者攻击时会额外造成 15 点法术伤害，并且从目标身上吸取 2 点法力值。"

#. Key:	C830A1DC41212E577E38BCAE690DD7F1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkeletonPrincesSword_New.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkeletonPrincesSword_New.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid "After the wearer attacks, they lose 2% of their Max HP."
msgstr "佩戴者每次攻击时会失去 2% 生命值。"

#. Key:	DB83FE4C493D911A80FE6BAB8C424DC2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Bonk.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Bonk.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Shillelagh"
msgstr "技能书：橡棍术"

#. Key:	062220BF454F6801ED2CC3BF47C7DC67
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Bonk.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Bonk.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"The wearer has its Range reduced to 1.\r\n"
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Shillelagh (30/70 Mana):\r\n"
"Wearer enchants its next attack, causing it to deal a huge amount of extra Attack Damage, as well as knocking back and stunning."
msgstr ""
"佩戴者的射程降至 1 。\n"
"将佩戴者的技能替换为橡棍术(30/70法力)：\n"
"佩戴者为下一次攻击附魔，造成大量额外攻击伤害，击退并眩晕敌方。"

#. Key:	04061B414DB7A337D5FE9D970EB46456
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_DanceParty.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_DanceParty.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Dance Party"
msgstr "技能书：死亡舞会"

#. Key:	52862599470019C53AFA52959B221FC8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_DanceParty.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_DanceParty.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Wearer is immune to Crowd Control.\r\n"
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Dance Party (40/150 Mana):\r\n"
"Wearer enters Dance Fever. ALL other units dance for 3 seconds, during which the wearer deals Attack Damage to all enemies each second."
msgstr ""
"佩戴者免疫控制效果。\n"
"将佩戴者的技能替换为舞会(40/150法力)：\n"
"进入舞蹈狂热状态。所有其他单位会强制舞蹈 3 秒，期间每秒对所有敌方造成攻击伤害。"

#. Key:	7E39A5034AD0E5CBD3C046A892C427DF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Divebomb.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Divebomb.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Magic Meteor"
msgstr "技能书：魔法流星"

#. Key:	CB5C4DB34FA0F93A4A42D18B1F3401D2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Divebomb.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Divebomb.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"The wearer is immune to Ignite effects.\r\n"
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Magic Meteor (80/125 Mana):\r\n"
"The wearer soars into the air, becoming a deadly meteor that falls near as many foes as possible. The meteor deals Spell damage to all foes in a 1-hex radius and Stuns them. Upon landing, replace hexes adjacent to the landing zone with Embers."
msgstr ""
"佩戴者免疫点燃。\n"
"将佩戴者的技能替换为魔法流星(80/125法力)：\n"
"飞向空中，化作一颗致命的流星，落在尽可能多的敌方附近。流星在 1 格内造成法术伤害与 1 秒眩晕。被击中的地格将化为焰烬。"

#. Key:	DEF375C84EA8D222EA9737A5BCB89552
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Fling.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Fling.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Mage-hand Hurl"
msgstr "技能书：魔手投掷"

#. Key:	432EB9234D821C0462DCE09B9C5A60A3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Fling.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Fling.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Mage-hand Hurl (50/110 Mana):\r\n"
"Wearer launches the nearest ally to the farthest foe. The launched ally deals Spell damage and Stuns on arrival."
msgstr ""
"将佩戴者的技能替换为魔手投掷(50/110法力)：\n"
"将最近的友方单位投掷至最远的敌方单位，造成法术伤害与眩晕。"

#. Key:	E0BD5FC444188DCA4FEBB69E2155FC41
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_GoldenPickaxe.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_GoldenPickaxe.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Wicked Solo"
msgstr "技能书：邪恶独奏"

#. Key:	029C07224E143DCD97F110AF862F3C21
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_GoldenPickaxe.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_GoldenPickaxe.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Wicked Solo (0/80 Mana):\r\n"
"Wearer fires 3 damaging music notes at a random foe, plus 1 for each XP level. The first time this skill is used each combat, gain 1 Gold and 1 Star Point."
msgstr ""
"将佩戴者的技能替换为邪恶独奏(0/80法力)：\n"
"向随机敌人发射 3 枚破坏性音符，你每高一级，额外发射一枚。每场战斗首次使用时，你获得 1 金币与 1 星点。"

#. Key:	1665C6F94E06FA0DE028F6A79B9B51C5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Levitate.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Levitate.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Stormy Skies"
msgstr "技能书：惊天雷暴"

#. Key:	7775EF7845B42C455329EBBDDD24921E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Levitate.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Levitate.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Stormy Skies (20/100 Mana):\r\n"
"Lift off the ground for 3 seconds, becoming invulnerable. Each second, toss a Thunderbolt at a random foe that deals Spell damage and Stuns."
msgstr ""
"将佩戴者的技能替换为惊天雷暴(20/100法力)：\n"
"离开地面 3 秒，变得无敌。每秒向随机敌方释放一道雷电，造成法术伤害与眩晕。"

#. Key:	9B6EAB1D4B58D8EF6B9FBF9636EF94F2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_ManaShield.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_ManaShield.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Mana Shield"
msgstr "技能书：法力护盾"

#. Key:	A48E82C64BC9D56A5451CA919D2A9EDA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_ManaShield.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_ManaShield.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Wearer gains additional Mana when hit.\r\n"
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Mana Shield (0/200 Mana):\r\n"
"Wearer conjures a mystic shield, becoming completely Immune for 6 seconds. During this time, adjacent foes lose Mana each second."
msgstr ""
"受击时：佩戴者获得额外法力值。\n"
"将佩戴者的技能替换为法力护盾：\n"
"变幻一面神秘护盾，在 6 秒内无敌，期间相邻的敌方每秒失去法力值。"

#. Key:	354700AB43C361C2285E4CB17EF6531F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Smokebomb.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Smokebomb.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Natural Camouflage"
msgstr "技能书：自然伪装"

#. Key:	58A9C42F4870022F2E654AADEC637DF7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Smokebomb.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Smokebomb.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Natural Camouflage (50/110 Mana):\r\n"
"Wearer and adjacent allies become Invisible for 3 seconds. Adjacent foes are Disarmed for the same duration."
msgstr ""
"将佩戴者的技能替换为自然伪装(50/110法力)：\n"
"佩戴者与相邻友方单位隐形 3 秒，期间相邻的敌方单位被缴械。"

#. Key:	51ECA43844462277AF9AAC805C4200BC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Speech.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Speech.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Skillbook: Harmony"
msgstr "技能书：和谐"

#. Key:	85CE25724132883F37F0A187B982A5C9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Speech.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.Skillbook_Speech.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"Replaces the wearer's Skill with Harmony (15/70 Mana):\r\n"
"Wearer sings a harmonious chord, granting all allies bonus Spell Power and Attack Speed for the rest of combat."
msgstr ""
"将佩戴者的技能替换为和谐(15/70法力)：\n"
"唱出和弦，为所有友方单位在整场战斗提供法术强度与攻击速度。"

#. Key:	60DB342C488DC85B327F8BB6EE2836CC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkirmishersSword.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkirmishersSword.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Fighter's Sword"
msgstr "战士之剑"

#. Key:	C7FEE8DC4074C17D96E2F98B8EF2EA4B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkirmishersSword.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SkirmishersSword.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid "Can only be equipped to Fighters."
msgstr "只能佩戴给战士单位。"

#. Key:	D193C15A44AFCFBA3F5B9CAA07F8E07C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SoulAegis.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SoulAegis.DisplayName_2_EF1B2F3C4A886DBFF02065A9F441727D
msgid "Crown of Lel'Thas"
msgstr "莱尔萨斯的王冠"

#. Key:	E3579E02438B8C10144CEDAE0C5232B0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SoulAegis.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SoulAegis.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid "When the wearer first would die, they become Immune for 6 seconds, dying afterwards."
msgstr "当佩戴者濒死时会进入无敌 6 秒，时间结束后阵亡。"

#. Key:	67D0DD7D4CB7823F2E88D3A5564E052B
