#. Key:	8717BD41407BD70B636FC5ADEF4C34B9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Leader.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#. Key:	B5A046824B57935166EEDD94C12A5166
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SpatulaElite.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
