msgid ""
"The Leader gains 50% total Max HP, +25 Spell Power, and +20% Attack Damage.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"In Act 2, the Leader will give other Units in its Army 2 Runes. In Act 3, it gives 4 Runes."
msgstr ""
"【队长】单位获得 +50% 总最大生命、+25 点法术强度，与 +20% 攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"第二幕队长将为其手下共提供 2 枚符文，第三幕提供 4 枚。"

#. Key:	78836E8646FD3B3A39C5D89F1B086E6D
