msgstr "骷髅领袖"

#. Key:	ABAA746B45D67FA844F4A08AB6839126
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SpatulaElite_Lelthas.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Items/ItemTable.ItemTable.SpatulaElite_Lelthas.EffectDescription_15_FA6310A443299813539ED98A81444743
msgid ""
"The wearer grants 2 of it's allies a Rune.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"The Leader gains 50% total Max HP, +3 Mana Regen, and +30% Attack Damage.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When revived, the Leader does not lose health over time, and instead gains Regeneration for 10 seconds."
msgstr ""
"佩戴者为其 2 名手下各提供 1 枚符文。\n"
"\n"
"【队长】获得 +50% 总最大生命、+3 点法力恢复与 +30% 攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"复活后，【队长】不会随著时间的推移失去生命值，而是获得 10 秒的再生。"

