#. Key:	0C93754147714174F19AD9A607AFDB58
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/KeywordDictionary.KeywordDictionary.XP.DescriptionText_11_10F776F34FA3476774ED6CBCFAE9CF14
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/KeywordDictionary.KeywordDictionary.XP.DescriptionText_11_10F776F34FA3476774ED6CBCFAE9CF14
msgid "Gain XP to increase your level. Next level, you will choose from three available perks."
msgstr "获得经验值来提升自身等级。下次升级时你将获得 3 个加成效果选项。"

#. Key:	BC45751E42D61CC4B3C92887B0065CD7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.AllVanguards.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.AllVanguards.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "Your army is only Tank units. You may want some Attacker or Caster units who can focus on dealing damage."
msgstr "你的队伍里只有肉盾，试试上阵一些战士或者法师等输出单位来打伤害吧。"

#. Key:	E212D9AE4726AF9B256F679C788BFBF2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.AllVanguards.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.AllVanguards.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
msgid "All Vanguards"
msgstr "缺乏输出"

#. Key:	0D308B7D458110372F4875A2237ED98D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.CarryDiedFast.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.CarryDiedFast.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "Your {unitname}is one of your strongest damage dealers, but died quickly. They may have performed better in a position where they were more protected."
msgstr "{unitname}是队伍里的重要输出，但是却过早阵亡了，你应该考虑把它放到更安全的位置。"

#. Key:	05E4750C492454110BBB02B8563F5262
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.CarryDiedFast.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.CarryDiedFast.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
msgid "Carry Died Quickly"
msgstr "输出阵亡过早"

#. Key:	1F83B3594F7CD32C8892CB9C14CE90DE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.DevilsDeal.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.DevilsDeal.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "Sometimes it's best to pass on a Devil's Deal if it hurts your composition enough. The rewards might not be worth the Hearts lost. Lifelines (offered by Bounty Tales and the Merchant) can also prevent a run from ending due to a lost Devil's Deal."
msgstr "有时候如果恶魔交易负面危害太大的话，最好还是放弃吧，不然损失的红心可能会得不偿失。从悬赏和商人那里得到的命之脉可以避免因战斗失败而导致的游戏失败。"

#. Key:	6248F96348056067D3D0B3B36E77487A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.DevilsDeal.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.DevilsDeal.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
msgid "Tough Deal"
msgstr "过度贪图奖励"

#. Key:	9B21631C42C7F55A4C26F8A83FC6074D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.EnemyJumper.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.EnemyJumper.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "The enemy managed to leap to your {unitname} early in the fight. Enemy units that can reposition like this can bypass your front line, but you can try to plan around it by positioning a Unit less critical to your team such that they are the target instead."
msgstr "有一名敌方单位在战斗一开始就移动到{unitname}旁边了，此类敌人可以轻松越过你的前排。也许你可以试试让一个不怎么重要的单位来替{unitname}吸引火力。"

#. Key:	DF9FEEE54C1B4B87D542B881E42B844B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.EnemyJumper.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.EnemyJumper.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
msgid "Enemy Jumper"
msgstr "敌方刺客"

#. Key:	BE846857423C4B0F218BE79CD5B4C415
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.FocusedDown.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.FocusedDown.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "At the start of combat, a majority of enemies were targeting your {unitname}. It could be more beneficial to position such that the incoming damage is dispersed between multiple of your Units."
msgstr "战斗开始时，大部分敌方都在集火{unitname}，你可以调整友方单位的位置，让敌人的火力分散一点。"

#. Key:	0977697A40A27E4AEC2B80B2EEE64FB1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.FocusedDown.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.FocusedDown.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
msgid "Focused Down"
msgstr "友方单位被集火"

#. Key:	90D0B51642BB37E474805191C7779C65
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.FocusFire.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.FocusFire.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "At the start of combat, your units were fairly split in who they were targeting. You may want to try to position such that more of your team is focusing one target first."
msgstr "战斗开始时，你的队伍的攻击目标太分散了，你可以尝试调整一下单位的位置，尽量让它们集火同一个目标。"

#. Key:	6550C09D4BEC765397F8FE815125E848
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.FocusFire.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.FocusFire.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
msgid "Focus Fire"
msgstr "火力分散"

#. Key:	D0ECE8CF4050518D95FD63BD8A6768A6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.HadItems.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.HadItems.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "You had unused Equipment in your Bag that could have been equipped. Equipping and merging Items is key to making sure your team is strong."
msgstr "你的背包里还有闲置的装备，将其佩戴给单位们，或是合成出一件成品装会让你的队伍更强力。"

#. Key:	62C0AA5A448ABC0E62A861B1C9E57C5A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.HadItems.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.HadItems.Title_24_87A097D7445AE7E34A2E4893AC24FBF8
msgid "Using Items"
msgstr "未用的装备"

#. Key:	9DD07E704748303EBFDB1D8406BBFAAF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.HadPotions.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.HadPotions.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "You had Potions still available for use this combat.  Using some may have turned the tide in your favor."
msgstr "你还有一些药水可以使用，用掉它们应该会让你的单位打得更轻松一些。"

