#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/PostCombatBarks/BarksForDefeatTable.BarksForDefeatTable.HadSP.Text_2_D8CDF1A74B305BE7AE03DB87F5386390
msgid "You had over 10 Star Points available for use. Rolling the Unit Store may have helped you find duplicates of your Units to increase their Tier."
