#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Anti.NameShort_19_3E2853974563327311FAA68254551D2B
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Anti.NameShort_19_3E2853974563327311FAA68254551D2B
msgid "Anti"
msgstr "Anti"

#. Key:	3875545642BA00215737C09718EF8748
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Celestial.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Celestial.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colorcyan\">Ohooho.{text} So you want to know my backstory? Well - let's start with my name. I'm {cyan}Raine{text}!  And I'm a storyteller.  Clashes of good and evil, tales of ruins lost to time... I tell 'em all. And I've even seen some.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Only thing is - going from tavern to tavern isn't cutting it anymore. I've told enough stories of heroes, Daiya and champions retiring to luxury. Now it's my turn to claim fame - and, more importantly, that solid-gold Tournament trophy.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorcyan\">哦吼吼。{text}所以说你想了解我吗？行，就从我的名字开始吧。我叫做{cyan}蕾妮{text}，是个叙事师。无论是善恶冲突，还是沧海桑田，我都不在话下。有些故事甚至甚至是我亲历的。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>只不过，我现在厌倦了这种穿梭于各酒馆，重复阐述那些英雄、神祇，以及荣冠们退隐江湖、享尽荣华等故事的生活了。是时候我自己出去闯荡闯荡了！大赛那金光闪闪的奖杯也是够吸引人的。</>"

#. Key:	A0741E104887AF22EEBD029B157577BD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.CustomChar.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.CustomChar.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text>What an incredible honor.  Growing up {professionBackstory0}, I always knew I wasn't your average {raceBackstory0}, but I never imagined I'd get to fight in the</> {tournament}<text>.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Now, here I am, with little more than {classbackstory0} and a yearning {aspirationBackstory0}.  But I know that soon, everyone will know the name {randomcolor}{playername}{text}!</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>多么令人难以置信的荣誉。在{professionBackstory0}的成长过程中，我一直都知道我不是一般的{raceBackstory0}，但我从未想过我会参加</>{tournament}<text>。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>现在，我在这里，除了{classbackstory0}和渴望的{aspirationBackstory0}之外什么也没有。但我知道很快，每个人都会知道这个名字，{randomcolor}{playername}{text}！</>"

#. Key:	2D1A190645B0F03F8768428B53DFCB07
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Dragonkin.Name_12_59CB699F4530FE39021A549F228FFD34
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Dragonkin.Name_12_59CB699F4530FE39021A549F228FFD34
msgid "Inquisitor Thokor"
msgstr "审判官索科尔"

#. Key:	2E4FC3114AB0A394C71AE68CCD558B48
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Dragonkin.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Dragonkin.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text>I am {red}Captain Thokor{text}, High Inquisitor of the {crimson}Order of Hedra{text}.  I command the {gray}Tyr-anny{text}, a mighty galleon that strikes fear across the {cyan}six seas{text}.  Now, having conquered the nautical landscape, I have set my sights on something {orange}greater{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Being a {cyan}caller{text}, I feel it only fitting that I take on the </>{elitefour}<text> and spread the seeds of {curse}chaos{text} in the </>{tournament}<text>.  It is as the {crimson}order{text} decrees.  Once I claim my {gold}victory{text}, all creatures of land and sea will fear and tremble the name {red}Thokor{text}.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>我是</><text s=\"colorred\">索科尔</><text>，</><text s=\"colorred\">海德拉教团</><text>的大审判官。那艘威震{cyan}六海{text}的大帆船{gray}暴虐号{text}，是我的私人座驾。现在既已征服大海，我将目光投向{orange}更宏伟{text}的彼岸。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>作为一名{cyan}策士{text}，我对自身的使命定位就是将</>{elitefour}<text>们悉数击败，并在</>{tournament}<text>里散下{curse}混乱{text}的种子。这也正是{crimson}教团{text}所期盼之事。取得我非我莫属的{gold}胜利{text}后，陆海所有生物都将在{red}索科尔{text}这威名下恐惧而颤抖！</>"

#. Key:	2217A5054DE095B18C652495454B1187
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/UnlockTreeTable.UnlockTreeTable.Dwarf.DisplayName_2_35E2F0B140F22CED3017798BF19FC4F6
#. Key:	9CA893144E89BF7F29A43ABD05F7A36B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Dwarf.Name_12_59CB699F4530FE39021A549F228FFD34
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Dwarf.Name_12_59CB699F4530FE39021A549F228FFD34
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/UnlockTreeTable.UnlockTreeTable.Dwarf.DisplayName_2_35E2F0B140F22CED3017798BF19FC4F6
msgid "Thet Pahud"
msgstr "特·帕胡德"

#. Key:	75E3D6EE490F05F05ADDE5B5D8B95919
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Dwarf.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Dwarf.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colorcyan\">Thet's{text} me name.  {cyan}Thet Pahud{text}.  Finest craftsman from here to </>{city}<text>.  At least, I used to be.  Word of advice...never try to cheat a {goblin}goblin{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>See, I tried to pull one over on one of them {goblin}greenskins{text} and got meself {gray}blacklisted{text}.  That's why I joined the </>{tournament}<text>.  Figured if I win, the {pink}customers{text} will be lining up for miles.  That'll show ol' </>{randomgoblin}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colorcyan\">特{text}，这是咱的名号。{cyan}特·帕胡德{text}，从这儿到</>{city}<text>最牛逼的工匠，至少曾经如此。悄悄给你个建议，千万别想着去糊弄{goblin}地精{text}。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>是这样，老子当初想坑个{goblin}绿皮佬{text}血赚一笔，结果被他们{gray}全员拉黑{text}。所以我才来参加这个</>{tournament}<text>。琢磨着要是赢了，{pink}顾客姥爷{text}们还不得排队到城外？到时候看那个杂碎</>{randomgoblin}<text>还怎么嘚瑟！</>"

