#. Key:	5ADEA0854BF477F7999BE7B12B11347E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Gnome.Name_12_59CB699F4530FE39021A549F228FFD34
#. Key:	CB7E0B0D49EBB015D4743583345E9E0C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/UnlockTreeTable.UnlockTreeTable.Gnome.DisplayName_2_35E2F0B140F22CED3017798BF19FC4F6
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Gnome.Name_12_59CB699F4530FE39021A549F228FFD34
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/UnlockTreeTable.UnlockTreeTable.Gnome.DisplayName_2_35E2F0B140F22CED3017798BF19FC4F6
msgid "Singrim Boldpebble"
msgstr "辛格瑞姆·波尔德佩"

#. Key:	F8B0B80847E14105CD278DA5F8B9C81D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Gnome.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Gnome.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text>Hi.  My name's</> <text s=\"colorpink\">Singrim</><text>.  </><text s=\"colorpink\">Singrim Boldpebble</><text>, but everyone calls me</> <text s=\"colorpink\">Sing</><text>.  I've been a student of the</> <text s=\"colorblue\">arcane</> <text>ever since I can remember.  Graduated top of my class, and went from being a student to a professor.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Why did I want to enroll in the </>{tournament}<text>?  Well, I thought it might be a chance to do something different.  It's one thing to read about all the</> <text s=\"rainbow\">wonders of the world</><text>, but it's something else to see them for yourself.  I thought it would be a good way to meet</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">new people</><text>...maybe even that</> <text s=\"colorpink\">special someone</><text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>嗨，我的名字是</><text s=\"colorpink\">辛格瑞姆·博尔德佩</><text>，但大家都叫我</><text s=\"colorpink\">辛格</><text>。我从记事起就一直在学习</><text s=\"colorblue\">奥术</><text>，以优异成绩从学校毕业，一路从学生成为了一名教授。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>我为什么想参加</>{tournament}<text>呢？我觉得这是一个尝试不同体验的机会。俗话说读万卷书不如行万里路。参赛同时也是一个认识</><text s=\"colorcyan\">新朋友</><text>的好机会，也许还包括那位</><text s=\"colorpink\">特别的人</><text>。</>"

#. Key:	E4E038B44CF106F4B5B992BE1D14BBB9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.HalfOrc.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.HalfOrc.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text s=\"colororange\">Brax</> <text>the</> <text s=\"colororange\">Breaker</><text>.  That's what they call me.  Because I tend to</> <text s=\"shakingorange\">break things</><text>.  Not on purpose, mind you.  I'm just</> <text s=\"colorblue\">very big</><text>...and most things are less big.  And let me tell you something.  It's hard to sell {orange}pumpkins{text} when you keep {shakingyellow}smashing{text} them.</>  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>I decided to join the</> {tournament}<text> because I want to do more than just hit things.  {brown}Punching{text} is great, but it gets lonely sometimes..  The</> <text s=\"tournament\">fairgrounds</><text> brings in all kinds of {purple}people{text} from all over, including {cyan}callers{text} like me.  I wonder if they like {orange}pumpkin bread{text}...</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"colororange\">碎骨者布莱克斯</><text>，这是众人给我的称号，因为我经常</><text s=\"shakingorange\">打碎东西</><text>。也不是故意要这么干，只是我的身段单纯</><text s=\"colorblue\">庞大</><text>到能碾压大多数日常事物而已...正因为如此，老是{shakingyellow}碾碎{text}我们农场出产的{orange}南瓜{text}让我很难办。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>我决定参加</>{tournament}<text>，至少这期间弄碎东西合规。{brown}打拳{text}虽然有意思，有时候也让我挺落寞的...在</><text s=\"tournament\">赛场</><text>可以结交各式各样像我一般的</><text s=\"colorpurple\">挑战者</><text>。这样那些{orange}南瓜饼{text}至少能作为礼物发挥点作用...</>"

#. Key:	BEC96E284C07DE4BC60004B6448E2016
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Hellborn.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Hellborn.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text>You can call me</> <text s=\"colorcrimson\">Ifreyes</><text>.  I always knew that I was destined for bigger and better things than being a simple farmhand.</>  <text s=\"colorgreen\">Money</><text>.  </><text s=\"darkred_shake\">Power</><text>.  </><text s=\"colorpurple\">Fame</><text>.  Did I mention money?  And what better way to get all those things than to join the</> {tournament}<text>?</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>What am I going to do if I win?  I think you mean</> <text s=\"bi\">when</><text> I win.  Well...I'm not sure, really.  I'm thinking a statue.  A</> <text s=\"colorgold\">big golden statue</> <text>in my honor.  And a new</> <text s=\"colorgold\">golden horn</><text>.  Maybe even a</> <text s=\"colorpink\">big vault</> <text>filled with</> <text s=\"colorgold\">gold</> <text>to swim in.  Now that's an idea.  I wonder why no one's thought of it before...</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>吾名</><text s=\"colorcrimson\">艾弗睿思</><text>。我天生就知道我比那些普通农民拥有更大的机遇。</><text s=\"colorgreen\">金钱</><text>、</><text s=\"darkred_shake\">权力</><text>、</><text s=\"colorpurple\">名望</><text>，还有金钱。没什么比加参加</>{tournament}<text>更好的方法来得到这一切了。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>如果赢了我打算做什么？纠正一下，是</><text s=\"bi\">当</><text>我赢了。嗯...其实我不太确定。可能给自己弄一个雕像？一个</><text s=\"colorgold\">巨大的金雕像</><text>以彰显荣耀。再加一个</><text s=\"colorgold\">金角饰</><text>，再来一个足以畅泳金海的</><text s=\"colorpink\">大宝库</><text>。真不错，为什么没有别人有类似想法呢...</>"

#. Key:	6C5F52494221ADC59F78D8A012BCACC2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.HighElf.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.HighElf.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text>Name's</> <text s=\"colorpurple\">Ali</><text>.  Grew up in a little fishing village where nothing</> <text s=\"shakingyellow\">crazy</> <text>ever happens.  Learned to hunt, learned to sew...pretty boring really.  Even the</> <text s=\"colorbless\">callers</> <text>were pretty mundane, using their gifts to help in the farms and fields.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>But me...I wanted more than catching fish and trapping rabbits.  I wanted to see the world and share my</> <text s=\"colormagenta\">experiences</> <text>with it.  I thought if I could win the tournament, my book would sell like</> <text s=\"colorsalmon\">salmon cakes</><text>.  I could even be the next</> {kiodini}<text>.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>叫我</><text s=\"colorpurple\">阿莉</><text>就好。我成长于一个小渔村，那里生活平淡，从不发生什么</><text s=\"shakingyellow\">反常</><text>的事情。打猎也学了，缝补也学了...可是真的很无聊。</><text s=\"colorbless\">策士</><text>，也只是平庸地用他们的能力来帮忙打理农田与茂野。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>但是我...我渴望的不仅仅是捕鱼和捉兔子。我想看看世界，并与之分享我的</><text s=\"colormagenta\">经历</><text>。我想如果我能赢得大赛，我的书就会像</><text s=\"colorsalmon\">三文鱼蛋糕</><text>一样畅销。我甚至可能成为下一个</>{kiodini}<text>。</>"

#. Key:	462A54804E60ECF40DC568B79FAA2DA0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/UnlockTreeTable.UnlockTreeTable.Human.DisplayName_2_35E2F0B140F22CED3017798BF19FC4F6
#. Key:	D33F28374E54540BBFDF1793D181EDF2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Human.Name_12_59CB699F4530FE39021A549F228FFD34
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Human.Name_12_59CB699F4530FE39021A549F228FFD34
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/UnlockTreeTable.UnlockTreeTable.Human.DisplayName_2_35E2F0B140F22CED3017798BF19FC4F6
msgid "Cedric Dawnhorn"
msgstr "塞德里克·道恩霍恩"

#. Key:	FAD8F8A14394CBCD85FDBC8EB1000A67
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Human.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Human.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text>Allow me to introduce myself.  I am</> <text s=\"colorbrown\">Father Cedric</><text>, of the</> <text s=\"colorred\">Order of Hedra</><text>.  Just a simple human, really.  I've always said that calling is my true calling, and participating in the</> {tournament} <text>is a perfect way to spread the message of Hedra.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>If I should be fortunate enough to win, what would I do?  Oh, nothing extravegant.  Just</> <text s=\"shakingcrimsonsmall\">try to take over the world</><text>.  I mean...say, did you hear about the musician who got</> <text s=\"colorgreen\">kicked</> <text>out of the tavern?  Sad tale...he's</> <text s=\"colorpink\">Bard</> <text>for life.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>容我自我介绍一下。我是</><text s=\"colorbrown\">塞德里克神父</><text>，隶属于</><text s=\"colorred\">海德拉教团</><text>，只是一个随处可见的普通人。我一直坚信教义就是我的信义，参加</>{tournament}<text>是传播海德拉教义的绝佳方式。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>你问我如果有幸获胜，我会做些什么？我也没什么宏大的志向，就是想</><text s=\"shakingcrimsonsmall\">统治一下整个世界</><text>。说起来，你听说过那个被</><text s=\"colorgreen\">赶出</><text>酒馆的曲师吗？真是个悲伤的故事...他是个只能靠吟颂谋生的</><text s=\"colorpink\">吟客</><text>啊。</>"

