#. Key:	16284C414A6A3A5C939DE8A6C266E9B3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Satyr.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Progression/PresetTable.PresetTable.Satyr.OpeningIntroText_25_AE214BEF47808E05FC80309261D8DEE2
msgid ""
"<text>I'm {purple}Zamfir{text}, but most people call me {purple}Z{text}.  I'm a {pink}Satyr{text}...you can probably tell by the horns.  Nothing {cyan}fascinates{text} me more than the occult.  My favorite book is {curse}\"On, Tentacles\"{text}.  Every night, before I go to sleep, I stare at the {gray}abyss{text} hanging above the mirror.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Of course, {blue}reading{text} about it is one thing, but now its time I go out and {gold}experience{text} it for myself.  That's why I joined the </>{tournament}<text>...first hand knowledge of the weird and wonderful.  Surely even {curse}otherworldly{text} entities can't resist a {wavingyellow}delicious funnel cake{text}, right?</>  "
msgstr ""
"<text>我是{purple}詹菲尔{text}，一个半羊人，这一点从我的角就能看出。没有什么事比玄学更让人{cyan}着迷{text}了。我最喜欢的一本书就是{curse}《触手学解析》{text}。每天晚上入睡之前我都会一直盯着挂在天花板的镜子，与{gray}深渊{text}互相凝视。</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>当然，学必致用，{blue}死读书{text}读不出什么大成就，我必须{gold}实际掌握{text}。这就是我参加</>{tournament}<text>的原因...为了拿到美好奇异品的一手信息。相信那些来自{curse}异世界{text}的存在也无法拒绝我的{wavingyellow}漏斗蛋糕{text}。</>"

