#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.ChargingStoneAttacks.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
msgid ""
"Gain the Attack Lodestone when you acquire this contract.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Contract can be turned in when the Lodestone has been charged 30 times.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 5 XP, 1 Prismatic Sword"
msgstr ""
"接下本悬赏时，获得攻击磁石。\n"
"\n"
"磁石充能 30 次后，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：5 点经验值、1 个百变组件。"

