"Gain the Skill Lodestone when you acquire this contract.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Contract can be turned in when the Lodestone has been charged 10 times.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 6 XP, 1 Prismatic Staff"
msgstr ""
"接下本悬赏时，获得技能磁石。\n"
"\n"
"磁石充能 10 次后，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：6 点经验值、1 个百变组件"

