#. Key:	133EDA0440C93184E8942D86779C10C6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.SellT2Rare.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
