msgid ""
"This contract can be turned in when you sell an Rare Unit that is at least Tier 2.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 6 XP, 1 Rare Duplicator"
msgstr ""
"出售 2 星及以上的稀有单位时，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：6 点经验值，1 个稀有复制器"

#. Key:	FDBAA3604A1EA847C893E8A1E9FA3992
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.SellT2Uncommon.Name_34_71999A224724A45F02969B9F71AAAF2F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.SellT2Uncommon.Name_34_71999A224724A45F02969B9F71AAAF2F
