msgstr "2 级罕见+"

#. Key:	87AAFB7841C3B67303BB63B1BCA7F8C6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.SellT2Uncommon.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.SellT2Uncommon.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
msgid ""
"This contract can be turned in when you sell an Uncommon or higher Unit that is at least Tier 2.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 4 XP, 1 Uncommon Duplicator"
msgstr ""
"出售 2 星及以上的罕见或更稀有的单位时，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：4 点经验值，1 个罕见复制器"

#. Key:	5A1BFBD246345607F5194DBC66ADD818
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Spend14SPOnRolls.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Spend14SPOnRolls.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
msgid ""
"This contract can be turned in when you spend Star Points on a Unit Store reroll 10 times.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 5 XP, 8 Gold"
msgstr ""
"消耗星点刷新 10 次单位后，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：5 点经验值，8 金币"

#. Key:	BEE9CE744A8149ADCB3879A70D5E2584
