#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.UnitGets3KillsInOneCombat.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.UnitGets3KillsInOneCombat.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
msgid ""
"This contract can be turned in when one of your Units kills 3 enemies in a single combat.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 4 XP, 1 Lifeline, Slayer"
msgstr ""
"某名友方单位在单场战斗中击杀 3 名敌方单位时，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：4 点经验值，1 个命之脉，杀戮者效果"

#. Key:	843D7F5248E86F9F271B1E8BCD84AAD8
