#. Key:	0A7A4FB84803A3A09D19009C8288EF25
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win2CombatswithSpecificUncommon.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win2CombatswithSpecificUncommon.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
