"\r\n"
"Rewards: 4 XP, 4 Star Points, 1 Divination Dust"
msgstr ""
"让{contractunitname}参与战斗并胜利 2 次后，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：4 点经验值，4 星点，1 个占卜之尘"

#. Key:	BE63FF714A8FA74C200DDAB32FFB357F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win3CombatsInARow.Name_34_71999A224724A45F02969B9F71AAAF2F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win3CombatsInARow.Name_34_71999A224724A45F02969B9F71AAAF2F
