msgstr "不可撼动"

#. Key:	1312DA28404FD156DA685A98379CAFCB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win3CombatsInARow.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win3CombatsInARow.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
msgid ""
"This contract can be turned in when you win 3 combats in a row.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 3 XP, 1 Lifeline, Win Streak"
msgstr ""
"连续赢得 3 场战斗后，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：3 点经验值，1 个命之脉，屡战屡胜效果"

#. Key:	05D377BB4A1A69E29C82818F1DBB851E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win3CombatsWithTrait.Name_34_71999A224724A45F02969B9F71AAAF2F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win3CombatsWithTrait.Name_34_71999A224724A45F02969B9F71AAAF2F
msgid "{contracttraitname} Hero"
msgstr "{contracttraitname}英雄"

#. Key:	F1B25FB64E256C293CAC118A06467BE5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win3CombatsWithTrait.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.Win3CombatsWithTrait.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
msgid ""
"This contract can be turned in when you win 2 combats with the {contracttraitname} trait active.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 3 XP, 1 Starcaller Shard"
msgstr ""
"在激活【{contracttraitname}】阵营的情况下赢得 2 场战斗后，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：3 点经验值，1 个唤星者碎片"

#. Key:	2B2A5BC54BDCE401419AAAA207EF9C94
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.WinCombatWithoutLosingUnit.Name_34_71999A224724A45F02969B9F71AAAF2F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.WinCombatWithoutLosingUnit.Name_34_71999A224724A45F02969B9F71AAAF2F
msgid "Perfect Fight"
msgstr "完胜"

#. Key:	6DD3CDE5496CF7994C09F3BECDFBC701
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.WinCombatWithoutLosingUnit.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTable.SideQuestTable.WinCombatWithoutLosingUnit.Text_35_A6C8C6CE4DC3E31D2B6C93B82CC50BDA
msgid ""
"This contract can be turned in when you win a combat without any of your Units dying.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Rewards: 5 XP, 1 Lifeline, Guardian Angel"
msgstr ""
"在未阵亡任何友方单位的情况下赢得一场战斗时，即可完成悬赏。\n"
"\n"
"奖励：5 点经验值，1 个命之脉，守护天使效果"

#. Key:	527C72394CF49E818E03A5B365156E79
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Archaeology.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Archaeology.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
msgid ""
"A bright-eyed <colorbrown>gnome</> is looking for brave <colorpink>adventurers</> to escort her into some <colorpurple>ruins</> said to contain <colorgold>wealth</> and wonder.  She did leave out the part about the <colorpurple>curse</>.  Or being full of all manner of <colorgray>undead things</>.  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"You manage to clear out the <colorpurple>ruin-warming</> party, she promptly grabs a <colorgold>jewel-crusted sceptre</>, advising you to make a hasty exit.  It seems that stealing <colorblue>artifacts</> is more <colorgold>lucrative</> than studying them."
msgstr ""
"一位目光炯炯的<colorbrown>侏儒</>正在寻找勇敢的<colorpink>冒险者</>，护送她前往一些传说中含有<colorgold>财富</>和奇迹的<colorpurple>废墟</>。她没有提及关于<colorpurple>诅咒</>的部分。或者里面到处都是各种<colorgray>亡灵生物</>。\n"
"\n"
"你成功清理了<colorpurple>废墟守卫</>，她立刻抓起一枚<colorgold>镶有宝石的权杖</>，建议你快速撤离。看来偷取<colorblue>文物</>比研究它们更为<colorgold>有利可图</>。"

#. Key:	491FF36F496596E2303C17A7AD9D2E83
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Archaeology.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Archaeology.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
msgid "Archaeology Research"
msgstr "考古学研究"

#. Key:	C791F81D48AAEAB41877C18E3DC86C73
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Larl.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Larl.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
msgid ""
"An <colorgreen>emerald Draco</> in a white lab coat welcomes you, eager to have a new test <colorpink>subject</>.  Though he usually works with <colorgray>trolls</>, he seems happy to experiment on {playerracearticle}.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"For what seems like an hour, you are poked, prodded, given an assortment of <colorblue>concotions</>, and subjected to just about every sort of test you can think of...and a few you couldn't.  He <colorpurple>assures</> you that there are probably no long term side effects, "
msgstr ""
"一位穿着白色实验室外套的<colorgreen>翡翠龙人</>欢迎你，渴望有一个新的测试<colorpink>对象</>。虽然他通常与<colorgray>巨魔</>一起工作，但他似乎很高兴对{playerracearticle}进行实验。\n"
"\n"
"接下来的一个小时里，你被戳来戳去，被喂了各种<colorblue>混合物</>，并接受了几乎所有你能想到的测试...还有一些你想象不到的。他<colorpurple>保证</>你可能没有长期副作用，"

#. Key:	2D2EE20845C56D6F54BE11A29996532D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Larl.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Larl.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
msgid "Research Assistant"
msgstr "研究助理"

#. Key:	88E0DED042C2CF6CD688E0B3C720B7AD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.MissingHusband.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.MissingHusband.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
msgid ""
"You find a <colorgreen>small cabin</> in the woods near where you were told was the last place the <colorpink>missing</> man was seen.  Inside, you are greeting by several people in <colorgray>dark robes</>, led by a man matching the description you were given.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"It seems that he was not missing, but rather you were volunteered to be a <colorcurse>sacrifice</> to a <colorred>lesser demon</>.  Now, there is one less <colorpurple>cult</> in the world and you are free to <colorgold>loot</> the cabin at your leisure."
msgstr ""
"你在被告知失踪者上次被看到的附近的树林里找到一个<colorgreen>小木屋</>。里面有几个身穿<colorgray>黑袍</>的人向你打招呼，他们的领袖正好和你得到的描述相符。\n"
"\n"
"原来他并没有失踪，而是你被自愿作为<colorcurse>牺牲品</>献给一个<colorred>次级恶魔</>。现在，世界上少了一个<colorpurple>邪教</>，而你可以自由地<colorgold>搜刮</>这个小木屋。"

#. Key:	58C5A7B74F6AEAE7F093B2A756AD2566
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.MissingHusband.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.MissingHusband.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
msgid "Missing Husband"
msgstr "失踪的丈夫"

#. Key:	949214354B8D75BE61328583438A4464
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Scorpions.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Scorpions.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
msgid ""
"A young chef needs a dozen giant scorpion tails for a brand new <colorblue>recipe</>. You travel to where these <coloryellow>scorpions</> are said to burrow, and sure enough it doesn’t take long for them to find you.  Four <colorgold>creatures</> the size of <colorpurple>horses</> spring from the ground, each with three <colorgreen>venomous</> tails.  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"The <colorpink>good news</>, at least, is that you don’t have to hunt so many.  The <colorred_i>bad news</>, though...it's going to hurt."
msgstr ""
"一个年轻的厨师需要一打巨型蝎尾巴，用于一道全新的<colorblue>食谱</>。你前往据说这些<coloryellow>蝎子</>栖息的地方，很快它们就找到了你。四只像<colorpurple>马一样</>大小的<colorgold>生物</>从地下窜出，每只有三条<colorgreen>有毒</>的尾巴。\n"
"\n"
"<colorpink>好消息</>是，至少你不需要捕猎太多。然而...<colorred_i>坏消息</>是，这可能会痛苦不堪。"

#. Key:	B689C62F46396807FD6F2094C3FDEECD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Scorpions.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.Scorpions.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
msgid "Scorpion Tails"
msgstr "蝎子的尾巴"

#. Key:	D3A09BF8445044F46764F49C8324D2E0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.SnakeHydra.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.SnakeHydra.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
msgid ""
"It doesn’t take long for you to find your <colorbrown>quarry</>...a dozen <colorophid>serpentine</> eyes rising from an <colorgreen>overgrown</> section of the wood.  Soon, you are confronted by six bulbous <colorphid>snakes</>, only each one stems from a single lizard-like body.  \r\n"
"\r\n"
"The snakes, it turns out, are in fact a juvenile <colorpurple>hydra</>, eager to make you its next meal.  It takes some effort, but you manage to <colorred>slay</> the beast, and take the heads as proof of <colorblue>completion</>."
msgstr ""
"很快，你就找到了你的<colorbrown>猎物</>...十几只<colorophid>蛇一样的</>眼睛从过度生长的树林中升起。不久，你面对着六只球状的<colorphid>蛇</>，但它们每一只都与一个蜥蜴般的身体相连。\n"
"\n"
"事实证明，这些蛇实际上是一只幼年的<colorpurple>三头蛇</>，渴望把你当作下一顿餐。经过一番努力，你成功<colorred>击败</>了这只怪物，并带走了它的头颅作为<colorblue>证明</>。"

#. Key:	E8BBB5EE4DCCDC33A96F46929FD3AFC6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.SnakeHydra.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.SnakeHydra.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
msgid "Snakes in the Field"
msgstr "田野中的蛇"

#. Key:	4FD550E941D3F304B2BF17A8D7B8A127
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.TrollTrouble.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.TrollTrouble.Description_4_F9027F064C309B35A86873A4B152931E
msgid ""
"A peaceful <colorgreen>troll</> farmer is being harassed by a local <colorpurple>militia</>, demanding she leave their lands.  As if on cue, a group of poorly-armed <colorpurple>peasants</> wielding <colororange>torches</> and pitchforks storm the pasture.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"They don't leave any time for talk before they <colorred>attack</>.  Unfortunately for them, a group of hapless <colorgold>\"heroes\"</> are no match for you.  She indicates that while she doesn't like violence, at least now the <colorpink>pigs</> will be well fed."
msgstr ""
"一位和平的<colorgreen>巨魔</>农民正在遭到当地<colorpurple>民兵</>的骚扰，他们要求她离开他们的土地。就像按照预定的剧本一样，一群手持<colororange>火把</>和长叉的<colorpurple>农民</>们冲进了牧场。\n"
"\n"
"他们根本没有留时间进行交谈，就开始<colorred>攻击</>了。不幸的是，这些笨拙的<colorgold>“英雄”</>对你来说根本不是对手。她表示虽然她不喜欢暴力，但至少现在<colorpink>猪</>们会得到充分的食物。"

#. Key:	EFECD75743EF5EF1687FE9972F832591
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.TrollTrouble.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/SideQuestTextTable.SideQuestTextTable.TrollTrouble.Name_3_5B4678194CAE34F684F8BFA5195979CB
msgid "Troll Trouble"
msgstr "巨魔的困境"

#. Key:	CEE408AF437814CF695DCA86CCF59685
