#. Key:	F3EF8885432577553E33E88BE0E54FC6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/StatTable.StatTable.FlatMitigation.DisplayName_13_EF6D0F5A431980CA3E9CCB97A7ADF12F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/StatTable.StatTable.FlatMitigation.DisplayName_13_EF6D0F5A431980CA3E9CCB97A7ADF12F
