#. Key:	CCA35E7C4592867447507EB10E44AFE2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Aquatic.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Aquatic.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Gain the Aqua Bubble. At the start of combat, hexes in the Bubbles' column become Spring hexes, which grant Regeneration. Aquatic units in Spring hexes gain 5 Mana Regen."
msgstr "获得特殊单位“水泡”。战斗开始时，水泡所处列变为温泉，泉内单位拥有再生。【水生】单位额外在泉内获得 +5 点法力恢复。"

#. Key:	B6D4809347E9F5AEDBD3E8BA964A3A38
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Aquatic.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Aquatic.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "The Bubble also creates a column of Spring hexes on the enemy's side of the field. Enemies in Spring hexes are Ignited instead of gaining Regeneration."
msgstr "水泡同时在敌方战场镜像地生成一列温泉，但泉内的敌方单位被点燃而非拥有再生。"

#. Key:	60E40B1343C4CEB0B5681F93851175BF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Arcane.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Arcane.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Gain a 'Power Confluence' hex in combats, which enchants the Skill of an Arcane unit on it. (Units that gain the Arcane trait instead get +50 Spell Power.)"
msgstr "某格获得效果“聚能”，此处的【奥术】单位技能被启迪(非原生【奥术】单位则获得 +50 点法术强度)。"

#. Key:	E8080BAE4B8F8BF8253ED187B66411B9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Arcane.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Arcane.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Arcane units in the Power Confluence also gain +50% Maximum HP, +50% Attack Damage, and +5 Mana Regen."
msgstr "“聚能”格处的【奥术】单位额外获得以下加成：+50% 最大生命，+50% 攻击力，+5 点法力恢复。"

#. Key:	F5CC040542B182852DAE56981E2287A2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Beast.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Beast.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Beast"
msgstr "野兽"

#. Key:	97196AE54A48C6AAB1266484AC6E1BD5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Beast.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Beast.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "At the start of combat and when any non-temporary enemy dies, your units Frenzy, gaining +15 Attack Speed for 6 seconds. Beasts gain double benefit from Frenzy."
msgstr "战斗开始以及任何敌方非临时单位阵亡时，友方单位狂暴 6 秒，期间拥有 15 点攻击速度。【野兽】单位期间拥有双倍攻速。"

#. Key:	D9D36FD74F29540DBE821CA0EF0152F0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Beast.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Beast.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When Beasts Frenzy, their next attack is a ferocious Bite. Bite deals 250% Attack Damage and heals for 10% Max HP."
msgstr "【野兽】单位狂暴时，其下次攻击变为猛烈撕咬，造成 250% 攻击伤害并恢复 10% 生命值。"

#. Key:	F6CE1FBB421CB087A704CCAAAFBF715B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Blood.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Blood.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Gain the 'Ritual Dagger'. Use it on any allied unit to Prepare them. After combat starts, the prepared Unit is sacrificed, granting one of its Merged items, 25% Damage Amp, and 25% Damage Resistance to Blood units."
msgstr ""
"获得“仪式匕首”，可标记一名友方单位。\n"
"\n"
"战斗开始时，标记的单位直接被献祭，【血祭】单位可临时获得其一件成品装，并获得 25% 伤害增幅与伤害减免。"

#. Key:	3FCC3EC143AA15FD4904B990565F1619
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Blood.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Blood.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Enemy units lose 1% HP for each Star Point the sacrificed unit is worth."
msgstr "被献祭的单位每价值 1 星点，所有敌方单位失去 1% 生命值。"

#. Key:	BAC2CAF7429BAFD8EE13C1BAB67C5077
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.BookMonster.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.BookMonster.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Tome"
msgstr "书怪"

#. Key:	A0C8510F46125B5CAC5AC1A72270A9EE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.BookMonster.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.BookMonster.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Your units gain 10 Spell Power. Frisky and The Darkness' skills gain special effects."
msgstr "友方单位获得 10 点法术强度。狂乱之书与黑暗之书的技能造成额外效果。"

#. Key:	7301971D444B0E56506EE4A6D6B72194
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Boss.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Boss.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Bosses gain an additional health bar, 40% Attack Damage, 40 Spell Power, 20 Armor, and 4 Mana Regen, and spawn with special Minion units. Crowd Control effects are 50% shorter on Bosses."
msgstr "Boss单位会获得以下加成：额外一条生命，+40%攻击力，+40 点法术强度，+20 点护甲，+4 点法力恢复，-50%控制时长，且生成特殊的小兵单位。"

#. Key:	8DADB4BB4C885F36EE33458B15D85132
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Brawler.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Brawler.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Brawler"
msgstr "肉搏"

#. Key:	773888FF4B1C9B4ACBE7C7A96CBCB571
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Brawler.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Brawler.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Your units gain 150 Maximum Health.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Brawlers gain an extra +25% Maximum Health."
msgstr ""
"友方单位获得 150 点最大生命。\n"
"\n"
"【肉搏】单位额外获得 +25% 最大生命。"

#. Key:	F8E570754C415563B327A5A32FAA5F9E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Brawler.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Brawler.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Every 500 Health lost, Brawlers Stomp, dealing 3% of their Maximum Health as Spell Damage to adjacent foes and interrupting them."
msgstr "每失去 500 点生命值，【肉搏】单位对相邻敌方单位造成自身 3% 最大生命的法术伤害，附带打断施法效果。"

#. Key:	818B8C4B423644DE11020991AB76F292
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Bug.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Bug.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Bug"
msgstr "昆虫"

#. Key:	8E0A33364148FD24197F4589E8A19C5A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Bug.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Bug.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "At the start of combat, the frontmost Bug summons the Swarm, which grants 300 Shield, +40 Attack Speed and 20% Damage Resistance. When that Bug dies, the Swarm moves to the nearest other Bug."
msgstr ""
"战斗开始时，最前方的【昆虫】单位召唤虫群，其提供 300 点护盾、+40 点攻击速度以及 20% 伤害减免。\n"
"\n"
"该单位阵亡时，虫群转移至最近的【昆虫】单位。"

#. Key:	C9B3E5B14360B3F1CE2941A0EC1D1337
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Bug.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Bug.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "The Swarm grants an extra 50 Spell Power, and enemies adjacent to the Swarm host take 3% max HP Spell Damage per second."
msgstr "虫群额外提供 50 点法术强度，且其相邻的敌方单位每秒受到 3% 最大生命的法术伤害。"

#. Key:	F70879EB43B71973827896A6541D587E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Corrupted.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Corrupted.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "At the end of combat, gain 2 random Corrupted Units and 1 Curse."
msgstr "战斗结束时，获得 2 名随机【腐朽】单位以及 1 点诅咒。"

#. Key:	355F52C244DA803B6C6B3082CAD4A13B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Corrupted.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Corrupted.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "At the start of combat, your Tier 4+ Units gain 40% Max HP and 4 Mana Regen."
msgstr "战斗开始时，4 星及以上单位获得 +40% 最大生命与 +4 点法力恢复。"

#. Key:	C72A7631484719D80BE787993B2CC9E6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Demon.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Demon.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Demon"
msgstr "恶魔"

#. Key:	6A2432A24B3C94DCC2FF50973154B61E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Demon.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Demon.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Demons gain +10% Damage Amp.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When all other Demons die, the last Demon standing becomes the Demonlord, gaining an 85% Max Health Shield, +40% Lifesteal, +40 Attack Speed and +50 Spell Power for the rest of combat."
msgstr ""
"【恶魔】单位获得 +10% 伤害增幅。\n"
"\n"
"当其他恶魔均阵亡时，最后一名恶魔进化为大恶魔，获得 85% 最大生命的护盾，以及以下加成：+40% 全能吸血，+40 点攻击速度，+50 点法术强度。"

#. Key:	2BF3B7DC4212FE554BDF11B7B54DAA34
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Demon.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Demon.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When two Demons remain, BOTH become Demonlords."
msgstr "剩余两名【恶魔】时，两者均进化成大恶魔。"

#. Key:	9B231E7743E1CC0CFC53ED82E598D782
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dragon.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dragon.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Dragon"
msgstr "龙族"

#. Key:	70F566094B4DD6A7EE137C90A3CD30F2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dragon.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dragon.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "When a Dragon first casts, they summon a firebreathing Wyrm that flies across the board, dealing 100 Spell damage to enemies it strikes and Igniting them for 5 seconds."
msgstr "每名【龙族】单位首次施法时，召唤一条喷火巨龙横跨整个战场，对敌方单位造成 150 - 350 点法术伤害(基于星级)，并将其点燃 5 秒。"

#. Key:	DC0041124BE205D20C754B83B03641F1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dragon.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dragon.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When the Wyrm's firebreath strikes a friendly Dragon, they temporarily Tier Up (once per combat). This can make units Tier 5!"
msgstr "所有【龙族】单位均施法后，龙族单位全员临时提升 1 星级。"

#. Key:	837E15DE44C6939C5C28FDA02FE5767C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dummy.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dummy.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Training"
msgstr "训练"

#. Key:	D144CFC64E0AF9F5E875E19C4E75FF2A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dummy.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dummy.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Training Units grant their attacker full mana when killed.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"You cannot earn bonus rewards from items, traits, or other mechanics when fighting Training Units."
msgstr ""
"训练用单位阵亡时为击杀者恢复所有法力值。\n"
"\n"
"与训练用单位战斗时，无法从装备、阵营或其他机制中获得额外奖励。"

#. Key:	82A91C094C30F4988E66639DCD2F6845
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dummy_ContractTrait.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dummy_ContractTrait.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Report Me"
msgstr "举报我"

#. Key:	C2DE318B473BB4B7320354B051FA06DB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dweller.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dweller.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Dweller"
msgstr "蛰居"

#. Key:	784314ED4639761CD98CE199A7AEC5F3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dweller.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dweller.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"At the start of combat, Dwellers channel for 3 seconds to summon Geogukk, who slams onto the most dangerous opposing unit and Taunts adjacent foes.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Geogukk's Tier is based on the total Tier of your Dwellers."
msgstr "战斗开始时，【蛰居】单位专注 3 秒以召唤土大块。土大块出现时直接冲向伤害最高的敌方单位，并嘲讽相邻的单位。土大块的星级受到【蛰居者】单位的总星级加成。"

#. Key:	B9B9663D44AC66C0492B799DC56441E3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dweller.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Dweller.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Geogukk gains +150% Maximum HP, 40 Cost Reduction, and 20% Damage Amp."
msgstr "土大块的最大生命提高 150% ，并获得 40 点施法减免与 20% 伤害增幅。"

#. Key:	1B77456142433DA3661AEB8813AB1680
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Earth.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Earth.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Gain the Royal's Crown, a special Equipment that tiers up a Royal unit and grants Gold if it survives combat."
msgstr "获得特殊装备皇冠，其可临时提高【贵族】单位的星级，若佩戴者在战斗中存活还额外提供金币。"

#. Key:	36F65BFD42A1C219CB1881B2F1118273
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Earth.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Earth.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "At the start of combat, the Crownbearer issues a royal decree, Tiering Down the nearest and furthest foes."
msgstr "战斗开始时，持冠者下令将最近与最远的敌方单位星级降低 1 级。"

#. Key:	90B6769747220733ED68EBB40F391EF1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Elemental.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Elemental.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Elemental"
msgstr "元素"

#. Key:	E8C643B64B6E9894424B3A9D70DB1C55
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Elemental.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Elemental.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Elementals gain 200 Max Health.\r\n"
"Increase the RED value on Elementals' Skills by 100%. (Units without red values gain +50 Spell Power.) "
msgstr ""
"【元素】单位获得 200 点最大生命。\n"
"\n"
"【元素】单位技能的红色值增加 100% ，无红色值的单位则获得 +50 点法术强度。"

#. Key:	4211648749F2096B982E64BB80646BB9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Elemental.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Elemental.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid ""
"Elementals gain 500 Max Health.\r\n"
"Increase the RED value on Elementals' Skills by 200%.\r\n"
"(Units without red values gain +100 Spell Power.)"
msgstr "I 阶段的效果翻倍，【元素】单位再额外获得 100 点最大生命。"

#. Key:	BC9B1ADB4EB0B400E2A62D910F19F1CC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Engineer.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Engineer.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Gain a Turret with 40 Attack Damage and 5 Ammo.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"At the start of combat, each Engineer gains a 20% max Health Shield, then grants the Turret 4 Attack Damage for each Tier above 1.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When Engineers cast, they grant the Turret 5 Ammo."
msgstr ""
"召唤一座炮塔，其攻击可造成 40 点伤害并初始拥有 5 发炮弹。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"战斗开始时，所有【工程师】单位获得 20% 最大生命的护盾，且每名工程师单位的每个星级使炮塔伤害 +4 。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"每当工程师单位施法时，为炮塔补充 5 发炮弹。"

#. Key:	021FABDF4E3C6293EE3D50831226AF7A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Engineer.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Engineer.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "The Turret gains +20 Ammo, attacks faster, and every third shot also hits adjacent foes."
msgstr "炮塔获得 +20 发炮弹，发射间隔缩短，且每第 3 发攻击造成 1 格范围伤害。"

#. Key:	CEA33C704F0E36C27D3B4D90604ADBE0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fae.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fae.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Fae"
msgstr "仙灵"

#. Key:	57F50AFF401C6FA807631CB0B86579F3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fae.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fae.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"At the start of combat, Magic Fairies help a random Fae and random other unit.\r\n"
"Faeries grant 15 Cost Reduction, 3 Mana Regen, and 30 Spell Power."
msgstr "战斗开始时，魔法仙子随机支援一名【仙灵】单位以及另一名单位，为其提供 15 点施法减免、3 点法力恢复以及 30 点法术强度。"

#. Key:	C900CC4B478AC39E779106949319C8BA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fae.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fae.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "At the start of combat, ALL your Units get a Magic Fairy!"
msgstr "战斗开始时，全队均获得支援。"

#. Key:	57D7A56A4B6E07C54CD7AFBD02E00983
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fighter.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fighter.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Duelist"
msgstr "决斗"

#. Key:	58F249864ED3787AA23D4281EE4B35E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fighter.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fighter.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Duelists start combat Readied, which grants +30% Attack Damage.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When attacked at melee range while Readied, Duelists ignore the attack, stun the attacker for 1 second, and lose Readied. They re-Ready 3 seconds later."
msgstr ""
"战斗开始时，【决斗】单位进入招架状态，期间额外拥有 30% 攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"受到近战攻击时，退出招架状态以无视该次伤害并眩晕攻击者 1 秒，退出 3 秒后重新进入。"

#. Key:	B5A38D3C4C61B665D8ED319ECAEF35D7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fighter.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Fighter.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid ""
"Duelists now deal 250% Attack Damage to all adjacent foes when they lose Readied.\r\n"
"Readied also grants +20% more Attack Damage."
msgstr "招架时，额外对相邻敌方单位造成 250% 攻击伤害，且招架状态额外提供 20% 攻击力。"

#. Key:	EAC96B2A4C7942CF1BAF85BEBEC5C885
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Flame.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Flame.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Gain the Flamemark.\r\n"
"The Marked target is Shredded, and when it dies, Flame units gain 80 Spell Power."
msgstr ""
"获得火焰标记。\n"
"被标记的目标陷入易伤，当其死亡时，【火焰】单位获得 80 点法术强度。"

#. Key:	B5ACE2424366F2681EB1F7A832357E08
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Flame.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Flame.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "You may now Flamemark an additional target."
msgstr "火焰标记可额外标记一名单位。"

#. Key:	0DE27F3645F78CEEE33CDDBD91A130EC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Ghoul.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Ghoul.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Ghoul"
msgstr "食尸鬼"

#. Key:	F9AE81AE461AEE0A6181819BC667E26C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Ghoul.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Ghoul.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "At 50% health, Ghouls heal 75% of their Max Health over 5 seconds."
msgstr "当生命值降至 50% 时，【食尸鬼】单位在 5 秒内恢复其最大生命的 75% 。"

#. Key:	F236F74D42C6BD95B01026A7E9A5C069
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Ghoul.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Ghoul.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Ghouls have 30% Lifesteal and convert 50% of overhealing to bonus Spell damage on their next attack."
msgstr "【食尸鬼】单位获得 30% 全能吸血，并将 50% 过量生命恢复转化为在下次攻击时造成等量额外法术伤害。"

#. Key:	8067CC2242530C2F34125F98C0D9CB7C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Healer.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Healer.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Healer"
msgstr "愈使"

#. Key:	17DC472A4C398F268E9CC29AF2454B51
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Healer.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Healer.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "When your Units are healed, 25% of that Healing is added as Shield."
msgstr "友方单位恢复生命时，额外获得 25% 恢复量的护盾。"

#. Key:	3E180921495CC84BEBD7B48D452F7548
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Healer.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Healer.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid ""
"Gain the Healer Shrine, which gains Charge equal to 70% of health restored by your Healers.\r\n"
"Every 5 seconds, the Shrine zaps the lowest health foe, spending all its Charge to deal that much Spell damage."
msgstr ""
"获得愈战圣像，每当友方【愈使】单位进行治疗时，其获得治疗量 70% 的层数。\n"
"\n"
"每 5 秒，圣像消耗所有层数，对生命值最低的敌方单位造成等量法术伤害。"

#. Key:	3915A7E343D0FA5364B71AB6225DFD91
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Horror.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Horror.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Horror"
msgstr "恐怖"

#. Key:	C98FF7B04CACD5067CC6A1B7204E19E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Horror.PlayerPassiveEffect_43_422BE08A4B5E944DACDDAC9E1A2F3204(0).PlayerPassiveEffect_43_422BE08A4B5E944DACDDAC9E1A2F3204.Player-LevelProcEffects_31_6ADBE0424B4BB79F99E6478BD0A5A3FE(0).Player-LevelProcEffects_31_6ADBE0424B4BB79F99E6478BD0A5A3FE.RecapTimelineEntriestoAdd_145_25639F5D46CF8CE77C51FF8FC6A3D376(0).RecapTimelineEntriestoAdd_145_25639F5D46CF8CE77C51FF8FC6A3D376.Description_17_7BED1AB8419D207BA74042AE752DC4F7
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Horror.PlayerPassiveEffect_43_422BE08A4B5E944DACDDAC9E1A2F3204(0).PlayerPassiveEffect_43_422BE08A4B5E944DACDDAC9E1A2F3204.Player-LevelProcEffects_31_6ADBE0424B4BB79F99E6478BD0A5A3FE(0).Player-LevelProcEffects_31_6ADBE0424B4BB79F99E6478BD0A5A3FE.RecapTimelineEntriestoAdd_145_25639F5D46CF8CE77C51FF8FC6A3D376(0).RecapTimelineEntriestoAdd_145_25639F5D46CF8CE77C51FF8FC6A3D376.Description_17_7BED1AB8419D207BA74042AE752DC4F7
msgid "Horror stun activated."
msgstr "嚣世低语"

#. Key:	1115C20A4C5D68D6E2AC4A95B03EA86E
