msgid "The Horror"
msgstr "恐怖"

#. Key:	01D903D2487D9239F536EEA06EB0D934
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Horror.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Horror.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"7 seconds into combat, the Cosmic Whispers drive everyone mad, Stunning and Stifling for 4 seconds!\r\n"
"Your Horrors are immune to the madness and instead gain +20% Damage Amp for the rest of combat."
msgstr ""
"战斗开始 7 秒后，嚣世低语沉默并眩晕所有单位 4 秒。\n"
"\n"
"【恐怖】单位无视该效果，反而获得 20% 伤害增幅。"

#. Key:	B16F6AF04E5BE1244495AEAF17985152
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Horror.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Horror.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When Cosmic Whispers descend, summon two Horrifying Tentacles near random foes, which Shred on hit."
msgstr "嚣世低语触发后，在随机敌方单位附近召唤两条恐怖触手，触手的攻击可施加易伤。"

#. Key:	A7F017814E06A711B174569025C4260D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraCosmic.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraCosmic.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Hydra (C)"
msgstr "三头蛇 (宇宙)"

#. Key:	09643D3340E540277889459FAED3618C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraCosmic.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraCosmic.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Hydra's attacks have different effects depending on which head is attacking. You can use the Hydra Snack item in the inventory to change which Head is active each combat.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Current Head: Cosmic - Gain 40 Spell Power. Attacks grant an additional 10 mana on hit."
msgstr ""
"三头蛇的每个头有不同的攻击效果，可在背包内切换头部。\n"
"\n"
"当前头颅：宇宙( +40 点法术强度，命中时恢复 10 点法力值。)"

#. Key:	9F31611B41DF96CA375DFCA4A4D18CC3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraFiery.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraFiery.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Hydra (F)"
msgstr "三头蛇 (火焰)"

#. Key:	09A0D551442F338526BCC2A1B2B4AE8F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraFiery.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraFiery.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Hydra's attacks have different effects depending on which head is attacking. You can use the Hydra Snack item in the inventory to change which Head is active each combat.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Current Head: Fiery - Gain 30 Attack Speed. Deal 20% of Attack Damage as bonus Spell Damage on hit."
msgstr ""
"三头蛇的每个头有不同的攻击效果，可在背包内切换头部。\n"
"\n"
"当前头颅：火焰( +30 点攻击速度，命中时额外造成 20% 攻击力的法术伤害。)"

#. Key:	E80811F14D25186E377BF78A407C27C0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraSpiked.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraSpiked.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Hydra (S)"
msgstr "三头蛇 (尖刺)"

#. Key:	FB99658F4612B74F3E002A9CD5826D8D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraSpiked.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.HydraSpiked.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Hydra's attacks have different effects depending on which head is attacking. You can use the Hydra Snack item in the inventory to change which Head is active each combat.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Current Head: Spiked - Gain 20 Armor. Heal 5% of missing health on hit."
msgstr ""
"三头蛇的每个头有不同的攻击效果，可在背包内切换头部。\n"
"\n"
"当前头颅：尖刺( +20 点护甲，命中时恢复 5% 已损生命值。)"

#. Key:	06C37904426C2BFAD8D8238E00880730
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Leader.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Leader.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Leader"
msgstr "队长"

#. Key:	1DB071994FA36925485B20B3B2F5F323
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Legend.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Legend.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Mythic"
msgstr "传说"

#. Key:	A444F466406A4FBEEA3CD7A79811F01A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Legend.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Legend.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Mythics gain Valor, which grants +12% Damage Amp and Damage Resistance. Mythics also grant Valor to a random adjacent ally at the start of combat."
msgstr "【传说】单位获得“英勇之气”，其提供 +12% 伤害增幅与伤害减免，战斗开始时与【传说】单位相邻的随机另一名单位亦受到该加成。"

#. Key:	041EBF68457D35B58B29EDB0CF22798B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Legend.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Legend.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Mythics who receive Valor from another Mythic also gain +6 Mana Regen. You can only have two Mythics."
msgstr ""
"从另一名【传说】单位获得“英勇之气”的【传说】单位额外获得 +6 点法力恢复。\n"
"\n"
"最多只能同时上阵两名传说单位。"

#. Key:	D1B037924F1A03A8088130B6670ED1D3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Lunar.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Lunar.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Obtain a powerful Tricky item, which can only be equipped to Tricksters."
msgstr "获得一件强力的“诡术装备”，只能佩戴给【诡计】单位。"

#. Key:	BDCADEC14E1D858A674151857D0394C4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mage.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mage.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Mage"
msgstr "术士"

#. Key:	9ED4677F4E98419AFECD5DB7B4AFB0BB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mage.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mage.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Mages Twincast, using their skill twice per cast. Their total Spell Power is reduced by 25%."
msgstr "【术士】单位重复念咒，每次施法技能会施放两次，其总法术强度降低 25% 。"

#. Key:	F5207A0B436EF1B5BECFE0886B30EAF6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mage.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mage.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "12 seconds into combat, a Manabomb grants your Units full Mana and Stifles enemy units for 5 seconds."
msgstr "战斗开始 12 秒后，一枚法力炸弹爆炸，使友方单位回满法力值并沉默所有敌方单位 5 秒。"

#. Key:	0BB0840C4C814BD06D1733A34F273063
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Marksman.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Marksman.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Marksman"
msgstr "射手"

#. Key:	8B459628495B3119BF9AE59636FF2E0D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Marksman.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Marksman.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Marksmen deal 10% more damage to enemies at least 2 hexes away.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Summon a Training Dummy that gains 30% of your Marksmen's total Health."
msgstr ""
"【射手】 单位对 2 格外的敌方单位额外造成 10% 伤害。\n"
"\n"
"召唤一名受击假人，假人拥有射手单位总生命值的 30%。"

#. Key:	AF5039E744BF9FA5989D8C8C3DF105A2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Marksman.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Marksman.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid ""
"Marksmen gain +1 Attack Range.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Every 3 seconds, all Marksmen target the foe that dealt the most damage and fire a shot that deals 80% Attack Damage, modified by Spell Power."
msgstr ""
"【射手】单位获得 +1 射程。\n"
"\n"
"每 3 秒，所有射手单位向造成最高伤害的敌方单位发射一箭，造成 80% 攻击伤害，伤害还受法术强度加成。"

#. Key:	534F69194A7B106F94C95D9E6CAF061C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mimic.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mimic.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Mimic"
msgstr "拟态"

#. Key:	F4929EEE4A0FF63DA5A06B8D5C247599
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mimic.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mimic.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Use Chester's Magic Coin to change its secondary Trait to any Trait, with no limit."
msgstr "可用魔法金币将宝箱怪的次要阵营变更为任意阵营。"

#. Key:	D33CE6604E211236493DA58CE598479F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Morph.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Morph.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Morph"
msgstr "形变"

#. Key:	2C38D3B145401FF1D42D3692D4ABC160
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Morph.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Morph.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Morph Units must be placed adjacent to another friendly Unit.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When it does, it becomes a duplicate of that unit and counts for Traits."
msgstr ""
"【形变】单位必须与友方单位相邻。\n"
"\n"
"其变为该友方单位，且激活阵营时被视为不同单位。"

#. Key:	1B3D4E6A47A1113E75882287F2C06676
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mushroom.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mushroom.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Mushroom"
msgstr "蘑菇"

#. Key:	D50AC0824C74589FB340E9BE636E060D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mushroom.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mushroom.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Your units get +40 Starting Mana.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When Mushrooms cast, they gain a Spore that grants 10 Spell Power (up to 5). When Mushrooms die, they share Spores with other Mushrooms."
msgstr ""
"友方单位获得 +40 点初始法力值。\n"
"\n"
"当【蘑菇】单位施法时，其获得一枚孢子，每枚提供 10 点法术强度(每名单位最多 5 枚)。当【蘑菇】单位阵亡时，会将其孢子传递给其他【蘑菇】单位。"

#. Key:	F95774CF40000F3D9C0E8EA316540D61
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mushroom.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Mushroom.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When each Mushroom casts for the first time each combat, they gain 20 Cost Reduction for the rest of combat."
msgstr "【蘑菇】单位首次施法时，其获得 20 点施法减免。"

#. Key:	96AF954C4400D22627313382F240C52A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Orc.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Orc.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Orc"
msgstr "兽人"

#. Key:	369627714B6D9C51DEF4F7816DC73124
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Orc.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Orc.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"When Orcs first fall below 50% HP each combat, they Rage, gaining 50% Damage Resistance for 5 seconds. \r\n"
"\r\n"
"Each time an Orc Rages, ALL your units gain 10% Damage Amp for the rest of combat."
msgstr ""
"【兽人】单位首次生命值低于 50% 时，其进入暴怒状态 5 秒，期间拥有 50% 伤害减免。\n"
"\n"
"每当一名兽人单位暴怒时，友方单位获得 10% 伤害增幅。"

#. Key:	84F6FB0A405A5DA50F7B51AA184982DC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Orc.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Orc.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When Orcs Rage, they gain a bonus 35% Damage Resistance for the rest of combat."
msgstr "暴怒时额外获得持续整场战斗的 35% 伤害减免。"

#. Key:	087D1513449F9CE5539DE290C37FEADE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Pack.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#. Key:	ADF1A5D24FA8BE0FA252B7AA5736D113
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Pack.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Pack.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Pack.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "+1 Army Size."
msgstr "+1 人口。"

#. Key:	D22891B24864CD16911AB389C0D115B1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Patchwork.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Patchwork.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Patchwork"
msgstr "拼布"

#. Key:	9946E41F4D9E83691DFD81A991D999B1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Patchwork.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Patchwork.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Patchwork units benefit from all active Traits, but don't contribute to any."
msgstr "佩戴拼布战旗的单位可受到所有已激活阵营的加成效果(除传说)，但不参与激活阵营。"

#. Key:	C3E173EA4EF4D817D45B27B764B9C4D1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Poisoner.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Poisoner.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Defiler"
msgstr "玷污"

#. Key:	D6CF048E412BFA8F9D4F11943ED63F9D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Poisoner.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Poisoner.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Defilers instantly kill enemies below 20% max HP."
msgstr "【玷污】单位秒杀生命值低于 20% 的敌方单位。"

#. Key:	A1A2EE6D4382AA89C98C4E96F87D06CF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Poisoner.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Poisoner.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When a Defiler executes a foe, they explode, dealing 400 Spell Damage to adjacent foes. The slaying Defiler gains 30% Damage Amp for the rest of combat."
msgstr "【玷污】单位秒杀目标时，使其爆炸，对相邻的敌方单位造成 400 点法术伤害，并在整场战斗获得 30% 伤害增幅。"

#. Key:	37249E07473B54D4552F2F89439F59A0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Reptile.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Reptile.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Reptile"
msgstr "爬行"

#. Key:	CF35944A4E052111BE4F5DAE499FCD20
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Reptile.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Reptile.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Reptiles provide unique team-wide bonuses:\r\n"
"Monty: +12% Attack Damage.\r\n"
"Shelly: +8 Armor.\r\n"
"Spiritfang: +15% Max HP.\r\n"
"Jabbar: +15 Spell Power.\r\n"
"Prince Harming: +10 Attack Speed.\r\n"
"Elder Reto: +20 Starting Mana.\r\n"
"Other: +10% Lifesteal."
msgstr ""
"【爬行】单位提供独特的全队适用加成：\n"
"长毒蟒：+12% 攻击力\n"
"厚壳龟：+8 点护甲\n"
"灵牙：+15% 最大生命\n"
"栖海喋：+15 点法术强度\n"
"蛙王子：+10 点攻击速度\n"
"古巫蜥：+20 点初始法力值\n"
"其他：+10% 全能吸血"

#. Key:	6DC5CD524D6D1755A80A11B0C6AC5BBE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Reptile.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Reptile.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Reptiles gain 500% of their own Bonus Value."
msgstr "【爬行】单位各自获得 +500% 其自身加成值。"

#. Key:	6897D3A84718F050B604DA8964AC2E49
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Scrapper.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Scrapper.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Scrapper"
msgstr "莽夫"

#. Key:	B3E78F664BC07EE4A1BD7F92CE8797C9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Scrapper.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Scrapper.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Every 5 hits, Scrappers' next attack becomes a Combo. Combos deal double Attack Damage and 8% of the target's max health as Spell damage."
msgstr "每攻击 5 次，【莽夫】单位发动一次连击，造成双倍攻击伤害，附加目标 8% 最大生命的法术伤害。"

#. Key:	0DA9DF7A457C2F4ECCCE158678FA2DF4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Scrapper.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Scrapper.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Combo attacks have 100% Lifesteal. When Scrappers combo, they gain 10 Attack Speed for the rest of combat."
msgstr "连击时窃取等量生命值，且在整场战斗获得 +10 点攻击速度。"

#. Key:	03F7C4F94E65564928D558AE118ED339
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Shaman.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Shaman.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Shaman"
msgstr "萨满"

#. Key:	7BC2517D454B9F6E47E87CA63B4B0EA8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Shaman.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Shaman.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Gain the Shaman Totem, which spends its Charge to heal allies. The Totem starts with 300 Charge and gains 20% of Shaman's dealt Spell damage as Charge."
msgstr "获得萨满图腾，其可消耗自身层数来治疗友方单位。图腾初始拥有 300 层，【萨满】单位造成法术伤害时，补充伤害量 20% 的层数。"

#. Key:	53A09E284A1A03BE42961FAD60DE07CE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Shaman.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Shaman.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Shamans gain 50 Spell Power. Your Shaman's Stun and Sheep durations are increased by 50%."
msgstr "【萨满】单位获得 50 点法术强度。【萨满】单位造成的控制持续时间增加 50% 。"

#. Key:	02F090CC4725F9F52E4D2BAD6534367B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Skeleton.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Skeleton.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Skeleton"
msgstr "骷髅"

#. Key:	D8948686459EB7B81F8A27AA6630323B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Skeleton.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Skeleton.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Skeletons gain +2 Mana Regen.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When all your units are slain, unique Skeletons return with 100% Health for a last stand, during which they lose 2% of their max HP per second."
msgstr ""
"【骷髅】单位获得 +2 点法力恢复。\n"
"当所有友方单位阵亡时，【骷髅】单位满血复活，复活后每秒失去 2% 生命值。"

#. Key:	4323BF594A1548D74BAC9AA55B141982
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Skeleton.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Skeleton.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Skeletons return with full Mana."
msgstr "【骷髅】单位复活时回满法力值。"

#. Key:	B7290FBD44C2AF3F3DD186BC4E33927D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Solar.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Solar.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Divine units gain 15% Lifesteal.\r\n"
"After each combat, gain a Divine Blessing you can apply to a unit."
msgstr ""
"【神圣】单位获得 15% 全能吸血。\n"
"\n"
"战斗后获得随机一种神圣祝福消耗品。"

#. Key:	79A5685D458BA7A69F7712A1E40D8B1D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Solar.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Solar.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Units who have Blessings applied also gain 20 Attack Speed, Attack Damage and Spell Power that combat."
msgstr "单位在被祝福期间额外拥有 20 点攻击速度、攻击力与法术强度。"

#. Key:	539958BF486EBAE64F3DF483D1DD2F8A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Spirit.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Spirit.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid ""
"Gain a Grave hex on the far right of your Bench.\r\n"
"At the start of combat, an invulnerable Ghost of the unit in the hex enters combat.\r\n"
"The Ghost has halved Mana Regen and Attack Speed, and it dies when all Spirits die."
msgstr ""
"备战区的最右侧变为墓地格。\n"
"\n"
"战斗开始时，此处的单位将以无敌的幽灵形态加入战斗。\n"
"\n"
"幽灵的法力恢复速度与攻击速度减半，且伴随所有【灵魂】单位阵亡而阵亡。"

#. Key:	B03F2CF14C55084265FA71AC2DC93882
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Spirit.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Spirit.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "The Ghost now has normal Mana Regen and Attack Speed."
msgstr "幽灵可享有正常的法力恢复与攻击速度。"

#. Key:	8B6604404228C3B2F3AAF1ADDF87E8EF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Stalker.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Stalker.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Stalker"
msgstr "刺客"

#. Key:	4E76E0174FECE426784BA9AA23823943
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Stalker.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Stalker.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Stalkers gain +15% Attack Damage. At the start of combat, they vanish and appear in the enemy backline 1.5 seconds later."
msgstr "【刺客】单位获得 +15% 攻击力。战斗开始时，其从战场消失，在 1.5 秒后突袭至敌方后排。"

#. Key:	8F4312DD4B6668FEFEB84DB0259931E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Stalker.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Stalker.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "For the first 8 seconds after they appear, Stalkers gain 40% Damage Amp."
msgstr "【刺客】单位在突袭后的 8 秒内获得 50% 伤害增幅。"

#. Key:	0CFAA46847BF678C1FF958A64933C674
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Statue.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Statue.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Statue"
msgstr "雕像"

#. Key:	AD53A2164EEC6B9A8E06F7B45F7DEB87
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Statue.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Statue.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "For the first 10 seconds of combat, Statues cannot move but gain 30% Damage Resistance."
msgstr "战斗开始 10 秒内，【雕像】单位无法移动，且期间拥有 30% 伤害减免。"

#. Key:	F6779EE942CFADAADFC01090B5F5FC0A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Statue.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Statue.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When the effect wears off, Statues gain +50% Attack Damage."
msgstr "I 阶段效果结束后，【雕像】单位获得 50% 攻击力。"

#. Key:	111888AE4DF426AEAD76FC84103F6EEE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Storm.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Storm.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Storm units gain +15 Attack Speed. When they kill a non-temporary enemy, all Storm Units quickly dash to the lowest HP foe, dealing 100 Spell damage along the way."
msgstr ""
"【风暴】单位获得 15 点攻击速度。\n"
"\n"
"每当其造成击杀时，所有【风暴】单位冲向生命值最低的敌方单位，同时对沿途的敌方单位造成 100 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	2CDA36E549013F90F2BB5F8D7A4E5F15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Storm.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Storm.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "When Storm units dash, the target is Shredded for 5 seconds and interrupted."
msgstr "【风暴】单位冲刺时，打断目标并施加 5 秒的易伤。"

#. Key:	5579971F4619076BB6DAC78B264B2C86
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Tank.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Tank.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Vanguard"
msgstr "先锋"

#. Key:	4A0A6365432B092019517A836DAF1530
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Tank.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Tank.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "Your Units in the front two columns gain 10 Armor and a 15% max health Shield at the start of combat. Other units gain 20 Spell Power. Vanguards gain both."
msgstr "战斗开始时，友方战场最前方两列的单位获得 10 点护甲与 15% 最大生命的护盾，其他单位获得 20 点法术强度。【先锋】单位同时获得两项加成。"

#. Key:	50AEE373466F2258E2440194313895FB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Tank.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Tank.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Vanguards take 30 less damage from all sources."
msgstr "【先锋】单位受到的所有伤害减少 30 点。"

#. Key:	5A9DF31146ADE3C02FC78896AC0B3041
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Treefolk.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Treefolk.DisplayName_2_FF04680745C5B28EEA400DA35D89FCAF
msgid "Treefolk"
msgstr "树妖"

#. Key:	51161EB34009AAEE8D18589254E3D549
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Treefolk.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Treefolk.TraitEffectDescription_19_4043F8884DE7636CD55FADABBBB3523F
msgid "At the start of combat and every 8 seconds afterwards, Treefolk Sprout, gaining +12% Maximum HP and Attack Damage (up to 5 stacks)."
msgstr "每 8 秒，【树妖】单位生长，提高自身 12% 最大生命与攻击力，最高叠加 5 层。"

#. Key:	05C906994549EBC052BD88B1D1BCD9A9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Treefolk.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Traits/TraitTable.TraitTable.Treefolk.TraitEffectDescriptionSecondStage_62_2F6CE5B44754C9F4C2E4D58833E809CA
msgid "Treefolk start combat with two bonus stacks of Sprout and have permanent Regeneration."
msgstr "【树妖】单位获得再生效果，且战斗开始时额外生长 2 次。"

#. Key:	489ADD2E4F05B79528F49796C808DCB8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/AssignTagsToUnits.AssignTagsToUnits_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_44.Text
