msgstr "骷髅炸弹"

#. Key:	A6722BF64AEBE23F056127A3DE380D52
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Arise.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Arise.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Summons skulls that damage ALL foes and increase his max HP."
msgstr "召唤骷髅大军对所有敌方造成伤害并提高自身最大生命。"

#. Key:	59A1713F4B687CC4AD4D46932AA751D8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ArmorTotem.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ArmorTotem.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Passive: While Protection Totem lives, Master Trollgar has +20 Armor. When it dies, Trollgar loses {value0} HP."
msgstr "被动：当保护图腾存在时，巨魔主获得 20 点护甲。当保护图腾消失时，巨魔主失去{value0}生命值。"

#. Key:	12CE73B141734266DCA33998B9989562
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ArmorTotem.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ArmorTotem.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Armor Up!"
msgstr "护甲提升"

#. Key:	BCCC0D074B8DF534A2BF08A70EE82F5F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BagOfGhouls.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BagOfGhouls.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} channels unholy energy into the ground in a massive cone area directed towards his target, then rips the ground up from under them. Foes in the area are Pushed and Stunned for 1 second by a conjured gravestone, and take {value0.pct} of his Attack Damage {adpct} as Spell Damage."
msgstr "{name}向目标的大锥形范围内召唤邪恶能量，能量幻化为墓碑击飞范围内的敌方单位并造成 {value0.pct} 攻击力的法术伤害{adpct}。"

#. Key:	B2615FB34D08E708CC91CC917FC47FC9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BagOfGhouls.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BagOfGhouls.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Sunder"
msgstr "大地碎裂"

#. Key:	B16029BD4B5A2C76163D7094D9B1DDBD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BagOfGhouls.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BagOfGhouls.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Rips up the earth, dealing huge damage and launching foes in a cone."
msgstr "撕裂大地，在超大锥形范围内造成高额伤害并将目标击飞。"

#. Key:	0716BC904D73D830E321C1B7BB1405A1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BatBite.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BatBite.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} drains its target, dealing {value0} Spell damage. The target becomes Tasty for 5 seconds, healing anyone who attacks them for {value1}."
msgstr "{name}吸取目标，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。目标进入佳肴状态 5 秒，期间攻击目标的友方单位会恢复 {value1} 点生命值。"

#. Key:	05ACC1FE497D48627FEA2F97448005ED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BatBite.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BatBite.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Sample the Feast"
msgstr "大肆款待"

#. Key:	34E083294C8321D4A59766801BF6E6CB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BatBite.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BatBite.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Drains an enemy, dealing damage and causing attackers to be healed."
msgstr "造成伤害，短时间友方对目标攻击可恢复生命。"

#. Key:	4BFCD77E401C84B37EE1C381C463E161
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BearMaul.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BearMaul.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} deals an additional 0.5% of her Max HP as bonus Spell damage on hit.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} violently strikes, dealing 100% Attack Damage and healing for {value0.pct} of her Max HP. If the target has less HP than {name} afterwards, she repeats this strike once."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}命中时，额外造成自身最大生命 0.5% 的法术伤害。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}发动一次普通攻击，恢复 {value0.pct} 生命值。若随后目标的生命值低于{name}，再攻击一次。"

#. Key:	D868318A4E1527BD4F761CB34DEAFF15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BearMaul.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BearMaul.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Rip and Tear"
msgstr "凶猛撕扯"

#. Key:	29701ACF4E762917496FBFBE76C414E6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BearMaul.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BearMaul.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Passively deals bonus damage. Bites a foe to heal."
msgstr "被动造成额外伤害。主动噬咬敌方以恢复生命，生命值高于目标可再咬一次。"

#. Key:	7FAE83A04E972874DF9F469B25A6913B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BerserkBlobSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BerserkBlobSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} bounces to the foe with the highest Attack Damage, stealing {value1} of it, then dealing {value0.pct} of {name}'s Attack Damage {adpct}.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{name} then bounces to a random ally, granting them half the stolen Attack Damage for the rest of combat, plus an additional 20 Attack Speed."
msgstr "{name}跳向攻击力最高的敌方单位，窃取其 {value1} 点攻击力，并造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}。随后跳向随机一名友方单位，为其提供一半窃取的攻击力，外加 20 点攻击速度。"

#. Key:	95F2D5504C1F9ADF7FF9F09969078925
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BerserkBlobSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BerserkBlobSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Flame Tackle"
msgstr "烈焰冲撞"

#. Key:	F5B1A7124645CBF5F125439D6F2066D3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BerserkBlobSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BerserkBlobSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Steals Attack Damage from a foe and gives it to a friend, then gets buffed."
msgstr "窃取一名敌方的攻击力并将其转移给友方，并附加攻速加成。"

#. Key:	ED75222D4E8C2CD3F04121A865DFED67
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BishopHeal.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BishopHeal.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} casts healing energy bolts in four diagonal directions, restoring {value0} HP to allies hit."
msgstr "{name}向四个对角方向发射治愈弹，击中友方单位时可以恢复其 {value0} 点生命值。"

#. Key:	D320B2C24426D7F5CB2BCC983D8AFD03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BishopHeal.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BishopHeal.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Fianchetto"
msgstr "远攻防线"

#. Key:	B80F1729406F2A83A1C891833E1F0697
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BishopHeal.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BishopHeal.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Casts healing energy in four diagonal directions."
msgstr "向四角方向发射治愈能量波。"

#. Key:	4E2F4AD6484A3CD58D564096EAF7BF3D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlinkStab.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlinkStab.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} teleports behind her target, then stabs to deal {value0.pct} of her Attack Damage {adpct}, Disarming for {value1.time} and leaving behind two knives. The next two attacks disintegrate a knife, dealing {value2} Spell damage. Any existing knives disintegrate on next cast."
msgstr "{name}传送至目标身后进行刺杀，造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}，并施加缴械 {value1.time}。之后留下两把刀。接下来的两次攻击会各分解一把刀，额外造成 {value2} 点法术伤害。若有残余的刀则一并造成伤害。"

#. Key:	4B8A43C9455BEA43B30FB0950D7DF85F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlinkStab.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlinkStab.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Warp Dagger"
msgstr "奇跃匕首"

#. Key:	3E87820E4B7C733EFC045AA1FEC8C4DA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlinkStab.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlinkStab.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Blinks to a foe and then stabs them, disabling for a duration."
msgstr "闪至敌方身后，刺击造成额外伤害与缴械。"

#. Key:	17DD1D1C4BA27CFD441A429C557C6BF4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlokkTanks.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlokkTanks.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "If {name} survives combat, gain a Star Point."
msgstr "若{name}战斗结束后存活，获得 1 星点。"

#. Key:	30A28688452D0D26DFE91089FE540E2A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlokkTanks.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlokkTanks.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Blokk Tanks"
msgstr "挡路石来抗"

#. Key:	A733E629429F4967D55B168C0E062902
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BloomShield.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BloomShield.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: At the start of combat, summon Stumpy! Stumpy is a Common Fighter and inherits {name}'s Traits and Tier.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} blooms, sending protective flower petals to every ally and itself, granting them {value0} Shield for 5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"被动：战斗开始时，召唤墩墩树。墩墩树为 1 星常见战士，继承{name}的阵营与星级。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}绽放，向每名友方单位与自身放出守护花瓣，花瓣可提供 {value0} 点护盾 5 秒。"

#. Key:	3D2B4B05468B20BA7EC7D2A6B67E26D6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BloomShield.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BloomShield.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Comes with a friend. Shields your entire team."
msgstr "带着一名手下，为整个队伍提供护盾。"

#. Key:	F53F438F4FB47B443FF99786F6AB3BA4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlorgiBounce.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlorgiBounce.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} empowers its attacks for {value1.time}, making them deal {value0.pct} of its Attack Damage as Spell Damage {adpct} and bounce to 2 additional targets."
msgstr "{name}强化自身攻击 {value1.time}。期间，攻击造成 {value0.pct} 攻击力的法术伤害{adpct}，并弹跳至另外两名目标。"

#. Key:	6E7E54DA4C9D9C0EA3D7A9A4375208F3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlorgiBounce.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlorgiBounce.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Bouncing Blobs"
msgstr "魄力弹跳"

#. Key:	2BBD37CF438CE7428E66C99AFE218A7A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlorgiBounce.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BlorgiBounce.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Amplifies attacks, causing them to deal [red]bonus damage[/] and bounce for a duration."
msgstr "短时间强化自身，攻击化为法术伤害并弹射 2 名敌方。"

#. Key:	566F9E8F412A63605C1B89A213A6AA8F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BONK.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BONK.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} has its Range reduced to 1.\r\n"
"Active: {name} enchants its next attack to be a Mega Crit, gaining {value0.pct.plus1} base Attack Damage. That attack will knock back the target hit 3 hexes and Stun them for 3 seconds."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}的射程降至 1 。</>\n"
"\n"
"\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>主动：{name}将其下一次攻击加强为超级暴击，造成 {value0.pct.plus1} 攻击伤害，击退目标 3 格并将其眩晕 3 秒。"

#. Key:	D625803D40656E008CF9C9A5753E1241
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BrambleDash.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BrambleDash.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} grants himself and the ally nearest to the most foes cloak of brambles, granting {value1} Shield for 3 seconds. When the Shield breaks or expires, all enemies adjacent to the shielded Unit take {value0.pct} of {name}'s Attack Damage {adpct}."
msgstr "{name}为自身与临近最多敌方单位的一名友方单位提供 {value1} 点护盾 3 秒。护盾消失后，与护盾相邻的敌方单位受到{name} {value0.pct} 的攻击伤害{adpct}。"

#. Key:	9950DFFC413C5A5E4CFC7CA629FE8810
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BrambleDash.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BrambleDash.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Bramblebur"
msgstr "灌木斗篷"

#. Key:	BB3DDB2F4668F274A4FBFCBC6E7559E6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BrambleDash.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BrambleDash.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Shields himself and an ally. Shield explodes when finished."
msgstr "为自身及一名友方提供护盾，护盾消失时在 1 格内爆炸。"

#. Key:	991D7F21413F5E46BEEFEC887E1C2CE8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BugMageBuff.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BugMageBuff.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} enchants a random other ally, granting a {value0} health Shield for 5 seconds, and {value1} Attack Speed and Spell Power for the rest of combat. If no allies are available, {name} will enchant itself."
msgstr "{name}为一名随机友方单位提供 {value0} 点护盾 5 秒，以及持续整场战斗的 {value1} 点攻击速度与法术强度。"

#. Key:	FFF8A91343595A748932BDA357D0CC0D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BugMageBuff.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BugMageBuff.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Fire Up"
msgstr "蓄势地焰"

#. Key:	CCE2624B4D9336B672BB5C90CA7862BC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BugMageBuff.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.BugMageBuff.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Enchants an ally, granting a small Shield and increased stats."
msgstr "強化一名友方，提供少量护盾并疊加属性。"

#. Key:	B2EA0E4B411F10E199414B9BA553075D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ChargeTotem.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ChargeTotem.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: Shred-o-Matic remains in Stasis while this Unit lives.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: Increase Shred-o-Matic's Attack Damage by 10 for the rest of combat. Give it 20 Mana and a 3% Max HP Shield."
msgstr ""
"被动：碎肢机器人在该单位存活期间保持静止状态。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：提高碎肢机器人的攻击力 10 点，并为其提供 20 点法力值与 3% 最大生命的护盾。"

#. Key:	DC8D3D6E41A3E8C601E89685AC40169F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ChargeTotem.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ChargeTotem.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Charge-Up"
msgstr "充能"

#. Key:	22179906476A563259F005A50D3BECE8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CiscoBloodrage.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CiscoBloodrage.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} loses {value0} HP and gains 10 Mana each second.\r\n"
"Active: {name} gains {value1} Attack Speed for 5 seconds, doubled if {name} is below 50% HP."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}每秒损失 {value0} 点生命值，以获得 10 点法力值。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}在 5 秒内获得 {value1} 点攻击速度，若其生命值低于 50% ，则获得量翻倍。"

#. Key:	ADEC8C56432F7CBD20EAC3AEA6D6C8EF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CiscoBloodrage.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CiscoBloodrage.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Redcap Bloodlust"
msgstr "嗜血红冠"

#. Key:	FCA1A5CB4052763A64CA54B262457217
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CiscoBloodrage.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CiscoBloodrage.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Buffs Attack Speed (moreso when injured)."
msgstr "获得攻击速度加成，低血量时增加获得量。"

#. Key:	055BEE2F450656F538FF94B6C2953BB7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ColumnBlaster.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ColumnBlaster.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} conjurs a portal above the column containing the most enemies, then conjures a massive fireball from it that sweeps through the column. Enemies hit by the fireball take {value0} Spell Damage and are Disarmed for 3 seconds."
msgstr "{name}在敌方单位最密集的一列上方召唤出一道传送门，然后从中释放一枚巨大的火球，席卷整列目标。被击中的敌方单位受到 {value0} 点法术伤害并被缴械 3 秒。"

#. Key:	CEBC2EC34615A68281F9528FE91D6319
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ColumnBlaster.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ColumnBlaster.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Portal Surprise"
msgstr "出奇传送"

#. Key:	459130604A4A6546F6954DA8C3A28983
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ColumnBlaster.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ColumnBlaster.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Disarms and significantly harms a column of enemies."
msgstr "缴械一列敌方并造成高额伤害。"

#. Key:	83BA55124D962D3FD913DAA6FC724D3C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Consume.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Consume.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} conjures and eats a tasty snack, gaining {value0} Max HP for the rest of combat. After eating, {name}'s next attack pierces all enemies and deals triple damage."
msgstr "{name}吃下一块点心，在整场战斗获得 {value0} 点最大生命，且下次普通攻击穿透目标背后所有敌方单位并造成 3 倍伤害。"

#. Key:	B4A689DA4F93B9A591CCE6B91313B81F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Consume.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Consume.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Consume"
msgstr "大快朵颐"

#. Key:	7E9653CA47BD117E533F49ADE89DB81A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Consume.EnlightenedDescription_81_638DE95F453D5698DC6D709C069412E2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Consume.EnlightenedDescription_81_638DE95F453D5698DC6D709C069412E2
msgid "Enlightened: After eating the snack, Gourmand gains an extra 50 Max HP... for the rest of the run! (as long as he's Enlightened)"
msgstr "启迪：吃下零食后，暴食魔本局获得 50 点最大生命！(只要处于启迪状态)"

#. Key:	FB45541D444988138243AAAACCA6553B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Consume.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Consume.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Eats a snack, increasing its Max HP and enchanting its next attack."
msgstr "提高自身最大生命且下次普通攻击穿透目标身后。"

#. Key:	EF5606244B9873AF3C0F19862603986D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CyclopsShockwave.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CyclopsShockwave.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} unleashes eye beams at 3 random foes. Beams deal {value0} Spell damage, Stun for 1 second, then Shred, Stifle, Ignite or Hobble at random for {value1.time}."
msgstr "{name}向 3 个目标发射巨大的光波，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，并使其眩晕 1 秒，然后再随机造成易伤、沉默、点燃，或虚弱中的其中一种 {value1.time}。"

#. Key:	0FBE658B4B0B5E18B468EFA6C9A268F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CyclopsShockwave.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CyclopsShockwave.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Prismatic Beams"
msgstr "电眼逼人"

#. Key:	FD2D1C3A4AD20C34BC4FDC8381AB2854
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CyclopsShockwave.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.CyclopsShockwave.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Damages, petrifies, and debuffs several foes at once."
msgstr "攻击并眩晕多名敌方，同时施加随机负面效果。"

#. Key:	3748F5044B4F624A6E44F5B1F46C795B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DanceParty.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DanceParty.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} is immune to Crowd Control.\r\n"
"Active: {name} enters Dance Fever. ALL other units dance for 3 seconds, during which {name} deals {value0.pct} of its Attack Damage to all enemies each second."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}免疫控制效果。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}进入舞蹈狂热状态。让所有其他单位跳舞 3 秒，期间{name}每秒对所有敌方单位造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害。"

#. Key:	9D9E863A42ACA812932D34B9670121BC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DazzlingKick.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DazzlingKick.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} kicks a unit, dealing {value0.pct} of Attack Damage {adpct} and Pushing it 3 hexes.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If the target hits the edge of the battlefield or another foe, it and the struck foe take {value1} Spell damage and are stunned for 1 second."
msgstr ""
"{name}踢飞目标，造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}并将其击退 3 格。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>若目标被击退时碰到战场边缘或其他敌方单位，一并造成 {value1} 点法术伤害与 1 秒眩晕。"

#. Key:	F66ED81C4E74625B58F627BD3F72D1DE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DazzlingKick.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DazzlingKick.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Dazzling Kick"
msgstr "耀人踢击"

#. Key:	39A376914A73CF66FCD375A43CCC373B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DazzlingKick.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DazzlingKick.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Damages and knocks back an enemy. Very low Mana cost."
msgstr "低法力消耗，攻击并击退敌方。"

#. Key:	E0AF55D8433EB23757918EB3EE5878C4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeadlyPounce.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeadlyPounce.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} summons dark forces within the earth, cursing the ground around as many foes as possible. One second later, it erupts, dealing {value0} Spell damage to foes and healing allies struck for {value1} HP."
msgstr "{name}召唤大地中的黑暗力量，倾注敌方单位密集处周遭 1 格的大地。1 秒后，在范围内对敌方单位造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，对友方单位恢复 {value1} 点生命值。"

#. Key:	7972BECF4314682E44E4D584617C0DE4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeadlyPounce.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeadlyPounce.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Dark Ritual"
msgstr "黑暗祭祀"

#. Key:	B26D145E4BDF59F71A46C09C459B1EB1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeadlyPounce.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeadlyPounce.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Erupts an area, dealing massive damage."
msgstr "造成 1 格宽范围伤害。"

#. Key:	87E9616E42BE5DF2491EAD990D912546
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeathHex.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeathHex.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} hexes the highest Spell Power foe. Hexes stun for 1 second, then Stifle, dealing {value0} Spell Damage per second for 4 seconds. If the foe dies while hexed, the hex moves to the nearest foe."
msgstr "{name}对法术强度最高的敌方单位施放巫咒。巫咒会将其眩晕 1 秒，然后沉默 4 秒，沉默期间每秒造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。若目标在被咒期间阵亡，巫咒转移至最近的敌方单位。"

#. Key:	650F89E8443A04F74C48D1B8633C38B2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeathHex.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeathHex.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Death Hex"
msgstr "死亡诅咒"

#. Key:	7808934E445243A38AF79EBFFFC84A57
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeathHex.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeathHex.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Stifles a foe, then deals damage over time that can move between foes."
msgstr "眩晕再沉默敌方，随后造成持续伤害，该伤害可在目标阵亡时蔓延。"

#. Key:	CD553A0A4CE5B497F0B4E8B1DE1DEF6D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeepSeaToss.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeepSeaToss.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} launches a ball of magic at a foe, dealing {value0} Spell damage. The ball then bounces back. When {name} catches it, she gains {value1} Mana."
msgstr "{name}向目标发射一颗魔法球，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，随后球弹回自身，恢复 {value1} 点法力值。"

#. Key:	AC653A22440BB9147C7222BCC9F40018
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeepSeaToss.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeepSeaToss.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Deep Sea Sport"
msgstr "深海运动"

#. Key:	0CAEC4B9459E3C0B88A3BDBAB3A104D0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeepSeaToss.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DeepSeaToss.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Tosses a damaging ball, then catches it to gain bonus Mana."
msgstr "抛出一颗球造成伤害，弹回恢复法力。"

#. Key:	84535A57433065B1A7A486B70B7E803D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DemonicRage.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DemonicRage.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} tears open a portal near as many foes as possible, stunning them for 2 seconds.  A random Common Unit emerges from the portal with {value0} Shield. It dies after 10 seconds."
msgstr "{name}在敌方单位密集处开启一道地狱之门，眩晕 1 格内的目标 2 秒。一名持续 10 秒的随机常见单位从门内出现，并附带 {value0} 点护盾。"

#. Key:	9C52A65F4DBC0FD612D149A396898DAD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DemonicRage.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DemonicRage.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Infernal Portal"
msgstr "地狱之门"

#. Key:	A9C2C51D4E0E2CB3408A8187D5B54DEB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DemonicRage.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DemonicRage.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Creates a portal, stunning foes and summoning a unit."
msgstr "开启一道传送门，范围眩晕敌方并召唤一名短时存在的常见单位。"

#. Key:	3FB9EA1C469D9546FDA50A81DE1981F0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DinoBeam.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DinoBeam.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} unearths a fossil and launches it at its target, dealing {value0.pct} of its Attack Damage {adpct}. The bone then splits into shrapnel, dealing half as much damage to the target and 2 other foes."
msgstr "{name}挖出一块化石并将其扔向目标，造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}。化石随后裂成碎片，对目标与另外 2 名敌人造成一半法术伤害。"

#. Key:	62D9617745F26733AC5BA1996CE4722B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DinoBeam.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DinoBeam.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Blast from the Past"
msgstr "时流骨爆"

#. Key:	6E90AAF84181BE413F5BE68C31AA4AEA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DinoBeam.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DinoBeam.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Launches a fossil that splits into shrapnel on contact."
msgstr "发射一块化石，撞击后分裂成碎片。"

#. Key:	F98FA02642F096D7A327888857273A00
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonCannonInfo.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonCannonInfo.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "At the start of combat, {name} fires three Flame Blasts that deal 10% max health Spell damage."
msgstr "战斗开始时，{name}发射三道火焰冲击，造成10%最大生命的法术伤害。"

#. Key:	7FA0FF1145A8387FC50A5084DB476B79
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonCannonInfo.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonCannonInfo.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Dragon Cannon!"
msgstr "龙息炮！"

#. Key:	623BD49E48CEFAA0763DFD9EA349556F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEggHatch.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEggHatch.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "This Dragon Egg gains 1 Mana when entering a combat room. When the Egg has full Mana, it will hatch into a variety of powerful rewards for Dragons."
msgstr "这枚龙蛋在准备战斗时恢复 1 点法力，回满时将孵化出各种强大的龙族相关奖励。"

#. Key:	84B6C356498E24950A6713AFE5395E64
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEggHatch.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEggHatch.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Hatch"
msgstr "孵化"

#. Key:	C812FDC944DE817CF2D7759981AE71E7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEggHatch.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEggHatch.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Hatches over time into powerful Dragon rewards!"
msgstr "随着时间的推移，孵化出强大的【龙族】相关奖励！"

#. Key:	41BD702E460D1AF95322599D89C4EE14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEngineerUpgrade.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEngineerUpgrade.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} upgrades her hammers for the rest of combat. 1st cast: {value0} bonus Spell Damage on hit. 2nd cast: Spell damage is dealt to adjacent targets. 3+: The next three attacks throw two hammers."
msgstr ""
"{name}强化自身的普通攻击。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>第一次：造成 {value0} 点额外法术伤害。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>第二次：对目标相邻单位亦造成法术伤害。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>之后： 3 次攻击内投掷两把锤子。"

#. Key:	5DF60993417A83A8010F07B9022F2DFF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEngineerUpgrade.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEngineerUpgrade.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Hammer Time"
msgstr "大锤时刻"

#. Key:	4DF50DB042E11428D3CE04AE06DE2F6E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEngineerUpgrade.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonEngineerUpgrade.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Upgrades her basic attacks with new abilities over three casts."
msgstr "施放三次技能以渐进式强化普通攻击。"

#. Key:	4D9FF25D4B1D08E1275593802BC9D219
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonsTail.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonsTail.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} taunts the nearest foe for 5 seconds. The next 3 times she is attacked, she heals {value0.pct} of her Max HP and instantly attacks back."
msgstr "{name}嘲讽最近敌方单位 5 秒。之后的 3 次受击中，恢复 {value0.pct} 生命值并且立刻进行近战反击。"

#. Key:	DF3ABEC5446208282BEA3A903C78465A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonsTail.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonsTail.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Tri-Counter"
msgstr "龙鳞盾"

#. Key:	D02329DB48C641BDCC5D0E9C26904C8D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonsTail.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.DragonsTail.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Taunts a foe, then heals and counterattacks the next 3 melee attacks."
msgstr "嘲讽一名敌方，对之后 3 次近战攻击进行反击并恢复生命。"

#. Key:	C0B958264CAE38D9C7CA0A8B5AF012B8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EmergencyChicken.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EmergencyChicken.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Passive: Upon spawning, the Chicken taunts all foes within 2 hexes."
msgstr "被动：生成后，小鸡会嘲讽 2 格内的所有敌方单位。"

#. Key:	6EDD170F4EBA98A81B6642A28ACDD06D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EmergencyChicken.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EmergencyChicken.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Surprise!"
msgstr "惊喜！"

#. Key:	6028E84448F075DFFC4E6BA230A78D0D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EmergencyChicken_OnSpawn.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EmergencyChicken_OnSpawn.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Chicken Taunt"
msgstr "嘲讽小鸡"

#. Key:	87916261417C214DC4227EB66E0FE9BF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EngineerTurretPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EngineerTurretPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} has a stock of Ammo it consumes to attack. It always attacks the unit with the lowest Health."
msgstr "{name}需要消耗自身炮弹库发动攻击，优先攻击生命值最低的单位。"

#. Key:	6AD0FE99416D0C5CBBAB398E1080B39E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EngineerTurretPassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.EngineerTurretPassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Auto-Turret"
msgstr "自动炮塔"

#. Key:	E9B6B10D472941F1EF8662B2EA137BED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ExplodingShroom.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ExplodingShroom.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Passive: When {name} dies, it explodes, dealing {value0} Spell damage to adjacent foes."
msgstr "被动：当{name}阵亡时，自爆以对周围敌方单位造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	8E6ABE2B4A2E30123FCA3E9D3C6F6DD4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ExplodingShroom.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ExplodingShroom.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "MushBOOM"
msgstr "蘑菇炸弹"

#. Key:	98449ECE42DCF6CBC9AB05A0F8C3E4E6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ExplodingShroom.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ExplodingShroom.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Explodes when killed."
msgstr "阵亡时自爆。"

#. Key:	4172A06C4875B80085DB3F84E65A2EEB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FireWave.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FireWave.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} attacks adjacent foes for {value0.pct} damage {adpct}. For the next {value1.time}, he repeats this twice a second. These attacks have {value2.pct} Lifesteal."
msgstr "{name}对相邻敌方单位造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}。随后在 {value1.time}内每秒重复 2 次，每次攻击带有 {value2.pct} 的吸血效果。"

#. Key:	145A7F134ABCB85FD2E697B9ECA5181C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FireWave.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FireWave.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Whirling Flame"
msgstr "回环之火"

#. Key:	BFE9CDEC43D63D82928D13AB5801F08A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FireWave.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FireWave.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Attacks adjacent foes for a [red]duration[/] with bonus Lifesteal."
msgstr "[red]短时间[/]攻击相邻敌方，附带吸血效果。"

#. Key:	805474674167EC5D6546A0853157D522
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameBurst.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameBurst.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} fires three piercing fireballs that deal {value0.pct} of its Attack Damage {adpct}. Enemies struck are Ignited for {value1.time}."
msgstr "{name}发射 3 枚穿透火球，造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}，同时对击中的敌方单位施加点燃 {value1.time}。"

#. Key:	3051888443EA12BEC3CD3A98E6EB6E27
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameBurst.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameBurst.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Flame Burst"
msgstr "火焰爆裂"

#. Key:	A8BDD03544C45CCFB54FB390350E09AB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameBurst.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameBurst.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Shoots three fireballs, dealing bonus damage, Igniting."
msgstr "射出 3 枚穿透火球，造成额外伤害与点燃。"

#. Key:	2EF1DF604A2DC68C8278A588FBFED922
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameCone.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameCone.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} breathes ice, dealing {value0} Spell Damage to enemies in a wide line and Hobbling for {value1.time}."
msgstr "{name}呼出冰气，对前方一条宽直线内的敌方单位造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，并使其虚弱 {value1.time}。"

#. Key:	5FC1F99647F568A2CC6E48997E08841F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameCone.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameCone.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Ice Beam"
msgstr "冰冻之息"

#. Key:	5CC4D22E4C419B81627144A0F208D994
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameCone.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlameCone.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Damages enemies in a line, Hobbling them for 4 seconds."
msgstr "伤害一条线上的敌方，使其虚弱 4 秒。"

#. Key:	5E3A7E1A414FCB072BB8008111E013E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlamingoDummy.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlamingoDummy.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} does not take up an army slot, cannot be equipped, and does not fight in battles. When placed adjacent to only a single ally, {name} gains one of their traits at random."
msgstr "{name}不占用人口位，无法佩戴装备或参加战斗。若{name}仅与一名友方单位相邻，临时获得其随机一种阵营。"

#. Key:	C0C6727C4DF3E22E88A00F994E73D995
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlamingoDummy.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FlamingoDummy.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Friends With Everyone"
msgstr "众人之友"

#. Key:	C72A3CF24D0FECE47AAA5FBBF7B83921
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Frighten.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Frighten.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: When {name} casts or attacks a Hobbled foe, his next attack hits another time for 40% damage.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} vanishes, then reappears in front of the furthest enemy Unit, Hobbling them with a fright for {value0} seconds."
msgstr ""
"被动：当{name}对一名被虚弱的敌方单位攻击或施法时，其下次攻击额外命中一次，造成 40% 攻击伤害。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}消失，然后出现在最远的敌方单位面前，对其惊吓，使其陷入虚弱 {value0} 秒。"

#. Key:	9CFA71DC4FE81CB7616A1AA05F30A3B5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Frighten.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Frighten.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Jump Scare"
msgstr "一惊一乍"

#. Key:	82E6AB9A46A2972E70ECA38642BDAFC6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Frighten.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Frighten.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Vanishes and appears near a foe, Hobbling. Has buffed attacks vs Hobbled."
msgstr "消失并出现在敌人附近，造成虚弱。攻击被虚弱的敌人时有优势。"

#. Key:	D21C57114ABCBD8D6E214EADA3D0F812
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FriskySummon.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FriskySummon.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} has {value0.pct} Lifesteal.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} sharpens its teeth, losing {value2} Health to gain {value1.pct} Attack Damage.\r\n"
"If Tome is activated, {name} then instantly attacks all adjacent foes."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}拥有 {value0.pct} 全能吸血。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}失去 {value2} 点生命值并获得 {value1.pct} 攻击力。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>若【书怪】效果已激活，{name}还会立即攻击相邻敌方单位一次。"

#. Key:	53CDCFEC407E7B155464969F8F68246C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FriskySummon.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FriskySummon.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Mimic Chomp"
msgstr "开合自如"

#. Key:	A561D2DB4811D2CC2109368A921EEF2F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FriskySummon.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FriskySummon.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Has bonus Lifesteal. Trades health for more Attack Damage."
msgstr "自带全能吸血，施放技能牺牲生命值来换取攻击力。"

#. Key:	AE912F994C1504D0A7D7B49B6C230814
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousFlapping.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousFlapping.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} flaps up a whirlwind, dealing {value0} Spell Damage to its target. Allies adjacent to the struck foe gain {value1} Shield for 5 seconds."
msgstr "{name}扬起旋风，对目标造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，与目标相邻的友方单位获得 {value1} 点护盾 5 秒。"

#. Key:	DD318910453FCCDEB2EEECBFBFBDB3F1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousFlapping.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousFlapping.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Whirlwind"
msgstr "佑护旋风"

#. Key:	40FC1E464BA5A9F2D2D7BEBED8C7E917
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousFlapping.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousFlapping.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Damages an enemy, Shielding allies near it."
msgstr "伤害敌方，保护附近的友方。"

#. Key:	57CA649C435DA195866F05827F25884B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousSwiping.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousSwiping.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} summons four ghostly swords. They slice the enemy, dealing {value0} Spell damage and healing {name} for {value1} HP. Each time {name} casts, he gains 10% Lifesteal for the rest of combat."
msgstr "{name}召唤 4 支幽灵剑砍向目标，各造成 {value0} 点法术伤害恢复自身 {value1} 点生命值。每次施法时在整场战斗获得 10% 全能吸血。"

#. Key:	0DA7EC014D71274AEEC20F9D70A015C2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousSwiping.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousSwiping.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Blades of the Ancestors"
msgstr "先祖刀刃"

#. Key:	241B2CCD42EAD2B9E98D7DA96291F64C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousSwiping.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuriousSwiping.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Damages a foe and heals himself, then gains Lifesteal."
msgstr "召唤幽灵剑伤害敌方并恢复生命，同时获得叠加全能吸血。"

#. Key:	54D45FDD45AAF7369E060B8D0BBF83D5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuzzyTinkererOrbs.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuzzyTinkererOrbs.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} constructs a Lightning Orb on the ally with the highest Attack Damage and a Frost Orb on himself. After 5 seconds, each Orb 'Evokes'.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Lightning: +{value1} Attack Speed. Evoke: Deal {value0} Spell Damage to a random enemy.\r\n"
"Frost: +{value2} Armor. Evoke: {name} heals {value3} Health."
msgstr ""
"{name}在攻击力最高的友方单位身上生成一个闪电球，同时为自身生成一个冰霜球。5 秒后两球均被激发。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>闪电球：+{value1} 点攻击速度。激发：对随机敌方单位造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>冰霜球：+{value2} 点护甲。激发：恢复 {value3} 点生命值。"

#. Key:	057F3463435F4D2667B74BB4B89E84CF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuzzyTinkererOrbs.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuzzyTinkererOrbs.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Defective Spheres"
msgstr "故障充能球"

#. Key:	C1315CF84D87EDC438DDFF9212EA450F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuzzyTinkererOrbs.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.FuzzyTinkererOrbs.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Constructs a temporary buffing Orb for himself and an Ally."
msgstr "为自身与一名友方提供临时增益球。"

#. Key:	B833C10B4384DFBC6CB8FFB8F47062EA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleBossSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleBossSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: Eerie Statues start combat by leaping into your backline, taunting and stunning adjacent enemies.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: Taunts all adjacent foes then turns to stone, gaining {value0} Armor, and healing {value1} HP each second. Lasts 3 seconds."
msgstr ""
"被动：神秘雕像在战斗开始后跃至友方战场后排，嘲讽并眩晕相邻的单位。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：嘲讽相邻的单位后石化 3 秒，期间拥有 {value0} 点护甲并每秒恢复 {value1} 点生命值。"

#. Key:	F9DF7C7347DEF374B0515A8A9D505642
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleBossSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleBossSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Turn to Stone"
msgstr "顽石化"

#. Key:	B215A8F5441F434D67F3EEAAB06CFFE2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleHarden.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleHarden.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} takes to the sky before turning to stone and crashing to the ground, healing itself for {value1} HP, then dealing {value2} Spell Damage to enemies up to 2 hexes away and Stunning them briefly.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"For 3 seconds afterwards, taunts all foes within 2 hexes, gains {value0} Armor, and heals {value1} HP each second."
msgstr ""
"{name}飞向空中，变成石头砸向地面，恢复自身 {value1} 点生命值并击飞 2 格内的敌方单位，造成 {value2} 点法术伤害。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>接下来的 3 秒内，嘲讽 2 格内的敌方单位，获得 {value0} 点护甲并且每秒恢复 {value1} 点生命值。"

#. Key:	A1048B7B4B7AA28C4B10C9B14E5A8C86
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleHarden.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleHarden.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Stone Slam"
msgstr "石像冲击"

#. Key:	B7CF9EA64F5F95FC1B9A42A95190CA8F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleHarden.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GargoyleHarden.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Slams adjacent foes, then gains Armor and heals while taunting."
msgstr "攻击并嘲讽 2 格内敌方，短时间获得护甲并恢复生命。"

#. Key:	143C199C40B54415AC3D66BE21A13159
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GeogukkPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#. Key:	84ECB09E4DB73D7C88D1F19D4C5AA6CF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GeogukkPassive_OnSpawn.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GeogukkPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GeogukkPassive_OnSpawn.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Passive: Geogukk enters combat with Star Tier equal to the lowest of your Dwellers."
msgstr "被动：土大块进入战斗时的星级与友方星级最低的【蛰居】单位一致。"

#. Key:	C394BABC4C9FDDCEAE20CB84DE17D008
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GeogukkPassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GeogukkPassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Geogukk's Domain"
msgstr "土大块领域"

#. Key:	995B793147DB73AC363FBE97B37FE6DD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GeraPotionReplacementSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GeraPotionReplacementSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} breakdances, attacking all adjacent enemies for {value0.pct} of its Attack Damage. Then, it gains back its original skill."
msgstr "{name}施展霹雳舞，攻击所有相邻的敌方单位，造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害，然后重获原技能。"

#. Key:	EE3792E44C7E30ED64ACA38270FAD9BF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhostSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhostSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} possesses the highest Attack Damage foe for 5 seconds, during which it attacks its allies and cannot cast. It gains {value0} Attack Speed for the duration.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If there is only one enemy alive, the target takes {value1} Spell Damage instead."
msgstr ""
"{name}附身敌方攻击力最高的单位 5 秒，期间目标获得 {value0} 点攻击速度加成，但攻击队友且无法施法。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>若仅剩一名敌方单位存活，不进行附身而是直接造成 {value1} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	13EE4D864C8564D93C7590A850023B3D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhostSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhostSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Possesses the strongest foe, making it attack its allies."
msgstr "短时间控制最强的敌方，使其攻击原队友。"

#. Key:	0D25AC3545C01F12D4ECC79A088B1879
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhoulishDefense.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhoulishDefense.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} holds up his larger arm to gain 75% Damage Resistance for 3 seconds, healing {value0.pct} of his Max HP per second for the duration. Afterwards, he emits a blast that deals {value1} Spell damage to adjacent foes."
msgstr "{name}用壮臂进行格挡，获得 75% 伤害减免 3 秒，每秒恢复 {value0.pct} 生命值。之后，对相邻敌方单位冲击造成 {value1} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	D8A6ACA94B499391F0D027B3F3D66544
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhoulishDefense.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhoulishDefense.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Ghoulish Defense"
msgstr "无双护臂"

#. Key:	C3D52836401D545D6114A08E529C16BD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhoulishDefense.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GhoulishDefense.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Braces to reduce incoming damage, then counters with a blast."
msgstr "短时间降低受伤并恢复生命，然后进行爆破反击。"

#. Key:	1A0BEEBF44950DD836F6BFA4238C23DE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GoldenStare.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GoldenStare.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} glares at the foe with the least HP, Stunning them for {value0.time} and dealing {value1} Spell Damage. Allies with the target in range will prefer to attack them. If they die while Stunned, gain 1 Gold."
msgstr "{name}瞄准生命值最低的敌方单位，造成 {value1} 点法术伤害并使其眩晕 {value0.time}。若目标在友方的射程内则优先遭到攻击。若目标在眩晕时阵亡，获得 1 金币。"

#. Key:	07D1B6FB42BB7681C5DEAFB3AF91D1BE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GoldenStare.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GoldenStare.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Golden Stare"
msgstr "黄金凝视"

#. Key:	612561A146B59D39442E86974AAFAD2F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GoldenStare.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GoldenStare.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Stuns an enemy and redirects allies. Can turn enemies into gold."
msgstr "眩晕敌方，使友方对其集火，若在眩晕期间将其击杀可获得金币。"

#. Key:	D6C0513D48DB9BED73FB349020F15044
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Goodbye!.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Goodbye!.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} dashes to the furthest foe, dropping two explosive charges as he does. Foes in the vicinity take {value0} Spell Damage."
msgstr "{name}跳向最远的敌方单位，在原处及目标处各留下一枚炸弹，在 1 格内造成  {value0} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	B8D3ED7543D8071A2D6104BDD333624D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Goodbye!.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Goodbye!.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Demolition Charge"
msgstr "爆破震跃"

#. Key:	8B7FDA4044811DF137D298BF9C3582F3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Goodbye!.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Goodbye!.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Tosses bombs that deal Spell damage, then runs away."
msgstr "跳向最远的敌方，在位移前后出各扔出一枚炸弹，造成法术伤害。"

#. Key:	2C892DE8455533F583BB7C9AF5ADA63E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GremlinSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GremlinSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} throws a devastating boomeraxe, which deals {value0.pct} of his Attack Damage {adpct} to all foes struck and Shreds for {value1.time}."
msgstr "{name}投掷一把摧毁一切的回旋斧，对所有被击中的敌方单位造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}与 {value1.time}易伤。"

#. Key:	774B683148E433A9590E30892456E022
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GremlinSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GremlinSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Boomeraxe"
msgstr "回旋斧"

#. Key:	57C7AE754A01DDC3B844CA9AE9E588AC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GremlinSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.GremlinSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Throws a boomerang axe, dealing heavy physical damage and Shredding."
msgstr "投掷回旋战斧，造成高额伤害与易伤。"

#. Key:	99BA30344EAF5CE58AD1148FDA62B20F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Harmony.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Harmony.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} sings a harmonious chord, granting all other allies {value0} Spell Power and Attack Speed for the rest of combat."
msgstr "{name}唱出和絃，在之后的整场战斗中使所有友方单位获得 {value0} 点法术强度与攻击速度。"

#. Key:	26E250234A84FCA4684DC1924918B296
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealerShrinePassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealerShrinePassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} deals damage equal to the total healing of your Healers."
msgstr "{name}造成等同于队伍里治疗单位总治疗量的伤害。"

#. Key:	EE0CF449444602627E3044992EAAD9CC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealerShrinePassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealerShrinePassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "HealerShrinePassive"
msgstr "神医被动"

#. Key:	288FC47D4E079860D8F83CB28195B060
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealthBlobSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealthBlobSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} bounces to the foe with the highest Max HP, stealing {value0} of it.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{name} then bounces to a random ally, granting them half the stolen Max HP for the rest of combat, plus an additional 10 Armor."
msgstr "{name}跳向最大生命最高的敌方单位，窃取其 {value0} 点最大生命。随后跳向随机一名友方单位，为其提供一半窃取的最大生命，外加 10 点护甲。"

#. Key:	51BBCA574D46EC4B0FF4D0BD3C73E9D9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealthBlobSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealthBlobSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Equalize"
msgstr "均富化"

#. Key:	ADAAC0A14A0318E35F4397A3CFF743C4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealthBlobSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HealthBlobSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Steals Max HP from a foe and gives it to a friend, then slows a group."
msgstr "窃取一名敌方的最大生命并将其转移给友方。"

#. Key:	33BE60204284C0FA3A8A9190A65C4856
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HeroicLeap.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HeroicLeap.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} leaps behind the furthest enemy and gains {value1} Shield for 5 seconds. For the same duration, its attacks deal {value0} bonus Spell damage."
msgstr "{name}跳至最远的敌方单位并获得 {value1} 点护盾 5 秒，期间攻击额外造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	AEDAF6464B6147DDC706CEAB84982D75
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HeroicLeap.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HeroicLeap.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Bug Off!"
msgstr "虫虫突击"

#. Key:	7233C1254D69739AADB3DD9403C7A1FA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HeroicLeap.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HeroicLeap.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Leaps to an enemy, then deals bonus damage and gains a Shield."
msgstr "跳向最远敌方，获得护盾且攻击造成额外法术伤害。"

#. Key:	2E608F6C4019BF5AFA3779AAFF876C4A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HolyHealing.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HolyHealing.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} prays, healing the {value1} lowest Health ally for {value0}."
msgstr "{name}进行祈祷，恢复生命最低的 {value1} 名友方单位 {value0} 点生命值。"

#. Key:	FBEC3D764028E6DDE4F4DE8EC123FAB8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HolyHealing.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HolyHealing.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Holy Healing"
msgstr "神圣治愈"

#. Key:	0F1DC04A4BE0BD87259654AC9FC40AD0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HolyHealing.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HolyHealing.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Heals [red]1[/] ally with the lowest health."
msgstr "治疗生命值最低的[red]1[/]名友方。"

#. Key:	C2A76DE84B10A0D08198C5BE7305FAE5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HumanoidInsectSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HumanoidInsectSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} fires a piercing eye beam, dealing {value0} Spell damage and gaining 10 Cost Reduction for the rest of combat (up to 5 times)."
msgstr "{name}发射一道光束，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害并获得 10 点施法减免，最多叠加 5 次。"

#. Key:	4A23E4C8484A27BA17B1A693CF680545
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HumanoidInsectSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HumanoidInsectSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Bugbeam"
msgstr "虫族光束"

#. Key:	B4D0C97846C1B6417D23758B3C99F147
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HumanoidInsectSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HumanoidInsectSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Fires a piercing, damaging blast. Each cast costs less Mana."
msgstr "发射一道穿透冲击，发射频率不断变快。"

#. Key:	8549075F435E9ACE29D7D2A330F6ED70
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HydraSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HydraSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} lashes with three heads, dealing {value0} Spell damage three times. Each hit triggers the Hydra Trait's on-hit effects of all three types: 10 mana gained, 5% missing HP restored, and 20% of Attack Damage dealt as bonus damage."
msgstr "{name}用三个头猛击敌人，每次造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。每次攻击都会触发三个头部各自的附加效果：获得 10 点法力值、恢复 5% 已损生命值、额外造成 20% 攻击力的法术伤害。"

#. Key:	2D66B2C144DD214473CA8E921756AF82
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HydraSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HydraSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Triple Threat"
msgstr "三重威胁"

#. Key:	B380B4E142C711E7A619CB9719C9BBCB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HydraSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.HydraSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Strikes three times in quick succession, activating all three of its Heads."
msgstr "迅速攻击 3 次并附带 3 重特效。"

#. Key:	7F1403CE4385F7C57EFD83BBE056E4F2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KingAnticheck.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KingAnticheck.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} wildly swings his sword, dealing {value0.pct} of Attack Damage {adpct} to all adjacent enemies and knocking them back. {name} gains {value1} Shield for each enemy hit."
msgstr "{name}挥舞大剑，击退相邻敌方单位并造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，每击中一名单位获得 {value1} 点护盾。"

#. Key:	541C07994134D63BDF9BCB9B6CD162A5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KingAnticheck.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KingAnticheck.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Checkmate"
msgstr "将军"

#. Key:	0C92047849437BEFA92C63895FCDD956
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KingAnticheck.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KingAnticheck.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Cleaves adjacent enemies, knocking them back and shielding itself."
msgstr "横扫相邻敌方，将其击退并为自身提供护盾。"

#. Key:	7E61CCC24009FD8A60D289B52382CD71
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KnightProtection.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KnightProtection.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} swears a Bond of Protection upon the nearest ally, granting them a {value0} HP Shield. While {name} lives, all Bonded units gain {value1.pct} Damage Resistance."
msgstr "{name}为最近的友方单位许下佑护之誓，为其提供 {value0} 点护盾。只要{name}还存活，所有被佑护过的友方单位都拥有 {value1.pct} 伤害减免。"

#. Key:	14B55EBD4931027BEE2873BCEAD10341
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KnightProtection.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KnightProtection.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Knight's Vow"
msgstr "骑士之誓"

#. Key:	F46E24FC4BB1F5CAFA19139700F84C42
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KnightProtection.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.KnightProtection.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Bonds an ally with a protective shield, reducing incoming damage."
msgstr "为一名友方提供佑护，在自身存活期间为所有佑护单位提供伤害减免。"

#. Key:	5F9C6CFB4EF5871E8C3AD5A0B1AA5503
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.LeechLife.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.LeechLife.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} channels 5 draining pulses over 2 seconds, dealing {value0} Spell damage to foes up to 2 hexes away and healing {value1} per enemy hit. After channeling, the drained energy is expelled in a final burst dealing {value2} Spell Damage."
msgstr "{name}在 2 秒内触发 5 次能量脉冲，对 2 格内的敌方单位造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。每击中一名单位，恢复自身 {value1} 点生命值。能量脉冲结束后再最后触发一次爆炸，造成 {value2} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	E03BD2A24A30A4D6BC79809464CD569B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.LeechLife.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.LeechLife.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Leech Life"
msgstr "生命虹吸"

#. Key:	0F63451244C62F0C44D8DABB2D5F1009
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.LeechLife.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.LeechLife.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Saps nearby foes' health, then bursts negative energy outward."
msgstr "汲取 2 格内敌方的生命，然后释放负能量脉冲。"

#. Key:	CDF7BBC044EA8CA907D5F2BC32AB60CD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.LelthasReplacementSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.LelthasReplacementSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} ignores the next incoming attack and deals {value0.pct} of its Attack Damage {adpct} back to the attacker."
msgstr "{name}闪避下一次攻击，同时对攻击者造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}。"

#. Key:	B5568A3F4674B99A5435DABE7C2AAA96
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MageHandHurl.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MageHandHurl.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} launches the nearest ally towards the large group of enemies. {name} deals {value0} Spell damage and Stun for 2 seconds to enemies near the launched ally on arrival."
msgstr "{name}将最近的友方单位投射至一群敌方单位，以对被砸的敌方单位造成 {value0} 点法术伤害与 2 秒眩晕。"

#. Key:	6C82D06E4EF485BD174E03ACD4A408BC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MagicMeteor.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MagicMeteor.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} is immune to Ignite effects.\r\n"
"Active: {name} soars into the air, becoming a deadly meteor that falls near as many foes as possible. The meteor deals {value0} Spell damage to all foes in a 1-hex radius and Stunning them for 1 second. Upon landing, replace hexes adjacent to the landing zone with Embers."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}免疫点燃效果。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}飞向空中，化作一颗致命的流星，落向尽可能多的敌方单位。流星在 1 格内造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，并使目标眩晕 1 秒。撞击后，被撞格化为焰烬。"

#. Key:	7F7CC25E466D761CED4CF6A12E5F149E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MagicTricks_Fairy.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MagicTricks_Fairy.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} hexes the highest Attack Damage foe, transforming them into a harmless Sheep for {value0.time}. When they turn back, they take {value1} Spell Damage."
msgstr "{name}发动魔法将攻击力最高的敌方单位变羊 {value0.time}。变形结束时，其受到 {value1} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	28723AD34CC0A7358CF27EABAE3E52E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MagicTricks_Fairy.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MagicTricks_Fairy.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Pacify"
msgstr "奇妙把戏"

#. Key:	FF3F048F44F6D4AE4FB32BB8734416FE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MagicTricks_Fairy.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MagicTricks_Fairy.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Polymorphs a foe for a time, dealing heavy damage afterwards."
msgstr "将敌方短暂变羊，然后造成大高额伤害。"

#. Key:	7996C72B43F1EE1A20C999BA703AF1DA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaBattery.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaBattery.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} grants {value0.pct} of its Mana split among all other allies."
msgstr "{name}将自身{value0.pct}的法力值平分给所有友方单位。"

#. Key:	F035C78B416E48EDF59195852F23E0E0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaBlobSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaBlobSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} bounces to the foe with the highest Spell Power, stealing {value0} of it, then dealing {value3} Spell Damage.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{name} then bounces to a random ally, granting them half the stolen Spell Power for the rest of combat, plus an additional 2 Mana Regen."
msgstr "{name}跳向法术强度最高的敌方单位，窃取其 {value0} 点法术强度，并造成 {value3} 点法术伤害。随后跳向随机一名友方单位，为其提供一半窃取的法术强度，外加 2 点法力恢复。"

#. Key:	DBC279914564C38CC9BD0B99D2E02B3C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaBlobSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaBlobSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Goop Spray"
msgstr "粘性喷雾"

#. Key:	6BD4612C43777E6B54D4F09E34816186
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaBlobSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaBlobSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Steals Spell Power from a foe and gives it to a friend, then stifles a group."
msgstr "窃取一名敌方单位的法术强度并将其转移给友方单位，并附加法力恢复。"

#. Key:	00CEF7EF46A7314CB2092E94DE64DFB9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManadrainTotem.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManadrainTotem.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: Every second, {name} steals 4 Mana from ALL of your Units.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} deals {value0} Spell damage to adjacent foes and Stuns them for 1 second."
msgstr ""
"被动：每秒{name}从所有友方单位窃取 4 点法力值。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}对相邻敌方单位造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，并使其眩晕 1 秒。"

#. Key:	4764EDC64BFFD43621BBB391F223D766
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManadrainTotem.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManadrainTotem.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Frozen Fear"
msgstr "冰霜恐惧"

#. Key:	D4A4568948DE314EB1FE219E29C4455E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaShield.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaShield.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} gains 3 Mana when struck.\r\n"
"Active: {name} conjures a mystic shield, becoming completely Invulnerable for 6 seconds. During this time, adjacent foes lose {value0} Mana each second."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}受击时恢复 3 点法力值。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}变幻一个神秘护盾，6 秒内无敌。期间，相邻敌方单位每秒损失 {value0} 点法力值。"

#. Key:	F1767E8C41AD3DCFB4F6DA952A46E2B5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaShield.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ManaShield.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Mana Shield"
msgstr "法力护盾"

#. Key:	500C36A64D0ED847D8B8018B9DC62338
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MarksmanTrainingDummy.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MarksmanTrainingDummy.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Passive: At the start of combat, Target Dummy gains 30% of your Marksman's total Health."
msgstr "被动：受击假人无法攻击。战斗开始时，获得友方【射手】单位总生命值 30% 的最大生命。"

#. Key:	E74BB4E742870287FE1BCE8247A564AC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MarksmanTrainingDummy.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MarksmanTrainingDummy.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Training Dummy"
msgstr "训练假人"

#. Key:	04261AEF4BAA391F05CAAB979906EB59
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MarksmanTrainingDummy_Alive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.MarksmanTrainingDummy_Alive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: At the start of combat, Du-Mi gains 60% of your Marksman's total Health.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: Du-Mi stuns ALL adjacent foes for 1.5 seconds, then grants your Marksmen +{value0} Attack Speed for the rest of combat."
msgstr ""
"被动：战斗开始时，受击假人获得友方【射手】单位总生命值 60% 的最大生命。</>\n"
