msgid ""
"Passive: Combat cannot begin if there is more than one copy of {name} in play, and {name} is not placed adjacent to another friendly Unit.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When {name} is placed adjacent to a Unit, it becomes a duplicate of that Unit and counts towards Traits."
msgstr ""
"被动：必须将{name}放置在一名友方单位旁边才能开始战斗。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>{name}变为相邻单位的复制品，且参与激活阵营效果时被视为不同单位。"

