msgstr "冥途飞跃"

#. Key:	4CA1C38B44154EB36ED6E6BCA616B502
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewGravediggerSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewGravediggerSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Leaps to a foe, dealing heavy Spell damage. Kills grant full mana."
msgstr "跳向敌方造成高额法术伤害，若击杀则回满法力。"

#. Key:	1343BB0A496C83FF6F237AA6491794C4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewImpBeam.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewImpBeam.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} fires a beam of magic at the two nearest foes, dealing {value0.pct} of his Attack Damage {adpct} and Hobbling them for 3 seconds. {name} also gains {value1.pct} Attack Damage for the rest of combat."
msgstr "{name}向最近的两名敌方单位发射光束，造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}并使其虚弱 3 秒，随后获得 {value1.pct} 攻击力。"

#. Key:	764140854B447B4DA6C66BA6D7A5FE3C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewImpBeam.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewImpBeam.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Nightmare Bolt"
msgstr "梦魇光束"

#. Key:	F7C746774F80C527FEF0859C3594D70E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewImpBeam.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewImpBeam.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Damages nearby foes, then increases his Attack Damage."
msgstr "攻击并虚弱两名敌方，同时提高自身攻击力。"

#. Key:	64784F1A4909857FC74FC4829EB04C8E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewInsectMonsterSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewInsectMonsterSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: When {name} attacks, it stores a Thorn.\r\n"
"Active: {name} gains 5 Thorns, then unleashes them on random enemies. Each Thorn deals {value0} Spell damage and Hobbles for 0.5 seconds (stacking)."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}攻击时会储存 1 根荆棘。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}获得 5 根荆棘，然后随机将其释放至敌方单位身上。每根荆棘造成 {value0} 点法术伤害与 0.5 秒虚弱。"

#. Key:	1350733F402AC678D453A38E0875FE89
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewInsectMonsterSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewInsectMonsterSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Thorn Barrage"
msgstr "荆棘轰炸"

#. Key:	316896CC46FF972FFFA2F88B729D50CC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewInsectMonsterSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewInsectMonsterSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Each attack adds an additional Thorn. Skill unleashes all Thorns."
msgstr "攻击时累加 1 根荆棘，技能释放所有荆棘造成伤害与虚弱。"

#. Key:	01D1507A423CDD77AC72569C4A4509EC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewLizardShamanSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewLizardShamanSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} calls down an immense Meteor upon a random foe. The Meteor deals {value0} Spell damage and Stuns for 1 second. It hits the target and foes within 2 hexes."
msgstr "{name}召唤一颗巨大的陨石落向随机敌方单位，在 2 格内造成 {value0} 点法术伤害并眩晕所有目标 1 秒。"

#. Key:	474D76E843B5D594437EA69E8B05EC1B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewLizardShamanSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewLizardShamanSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Termina"
msgstr "世界终结"

#. Key:	F64016BE43096A49BC52AC9F33B5ECD4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewLizardShamanSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewLizardShamanSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Calls down an extremely deadly, Stunning Meteor."
msgstr "召唤一颗致命陨石，造成大范围伤害与眩晕。"

#. Key:	F7A80FD24F36B5FCAD47D8B62107CD67
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewMushroomWizardSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewMushroomWizardSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} summons a Mush-Turret nearby, which copies 30% of his Health, 100% of his Attack Speed, and loses 12.5% of its Max HP per second. Its attacks deal {value0} Spell damage."
msgstr "{name}在相邻格召唤一座蘑菇炮塔。其继承自身攻击速度与 30% 生命值，每次攻击造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，但每秒损失 12.5% 的生命。"

#. Key:	1CFDF6344E6EFFE9E092E39DD449BE08
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewMushroomWizardSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#. Key:	2999144D45F8B56E22A55AB56839B1B8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShadowSummonPassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#. Key:	7BD250DD43B2D4809453AF80D9B919E8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitsTable.UnitsTable.MushTurret.DisplayName_144_FD62B2564762EBCB4DEB19BAFB54A7A1
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewMushroomWizardSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShadowSummonPassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitsTable.UnitsTable.MushTurret.DisplayName_144_FD62B2564762EBCB4DEB19BAFB54A7A1
msgid "Mush-Turret"
msgstr "蘑菇炮塔"

#. Key:	B36801DD45A53DE56C70899892C693D5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewMushroomWizardSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewMushroomWizardSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Summons a turret that copies his stats."
msgstr "召唤一座继承自身属性的炮塔。"

#. Key:	E35EE87B40BE233038A0D9982D6A641D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewShadowElementalSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewShadowElementalSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} vanishes and unleashes {value0} hits upon random enemies that deal {value1.pct} of its Attack Damage {adpct} and {value2} bonus Spell damage. Each enemy struck is also Stifled for 3 seconds."
msgstr "{name}消失于战场，随机对敌方单位发动 {value0} 次攻击，每击造成 {value1.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}，附加 {value2} 点法术伤害。受击的目标被沉默 3 秒。"

#. Key:	4DD6C3C1442D6153BF88179C4674C3C0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewShadowElementalSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewShadowElementalSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Assassinate"
msgstr "瞬影刺袭"

#. Key:	6CE21C9F47B38EFFE3D03692C2A853D5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewShadowElementalSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewShadowElementalSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Vanishes, sending [red]clones[/] that attack and Silence foes."
msgstr "从战场消失，攻击并沉默[red]多名[/]敌方。"

#. Key:	FC4871204A89FDDC64D688A7BA4E3FFE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewSpiderSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewSpiderSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: After attacking a Stunned or Hobbled enemy, {name} gains {value1} Attack Speed for the rest of combat.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} fires webbing at its target, Stunning them for 3 seconds and dealing {value0.pct} Attack Damage as Physical damage {adpct}. Foes within 2 hexes of the target are Rooted and Hobbled for 3 seconds."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}攻击眩晕或虚弱中的目标时，获得 {value1} 点攻击速度。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}向目标发射蛛网，使其眩晕 3 秒，期间每秒造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}。目标 1 格内的敌方单位将被虚弱并禁锢 3 秒。"

#. Key:	584AF4284F90E6B15EB38280E5F972AB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewSpiderSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewSpiderSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "World Wide Web"
msgstr "层层维网"

#. Key:	74BBCCF24E3EBB7E8B2114A45FF7CAD0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewSpiderSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewSpiderSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Stuns and damages a target, then Roots and Hobbles foes nearby them."
msgstr "攻击并眩晕目标，使其相邻敌方虚弱并禁锢。攻击眩晕与虚弱目标时获得叠加攻速。"

#. Key:	3D7863294440D5CE0F546AAFA9BD68E5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewToadSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewToadSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} takes {value3.pct} less Spell Damage.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} heals for {value0} HP and gains the Crown for 6 seconds. The Crown grants Regeneration and adds {value1} Spell damage to {name}'s attacks."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}受到的法术伤害降低 {value3.pct} 。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}恢复 {value0} 点生命值并戴上王冠 6 秒。王冠提供再生，并为{name}的攻击附加 {value1} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	4585950D477442E343B00A9F4A629072
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewToadSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewToadSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Claim the Crown"
msgstr "自立为王"

#. Key:	4914BBB841DEB9A0033DC9B3BE1E49FC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewToadSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewToadSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Heals over time, during which attacks deal massive damage."
msgstr "恢复生命，期间攻击造成额外伤害。"

#. Key:	12FA6DD948C23DD758B056808471A301
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewUroSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewUroSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} Taunts the furthest foe for 5 seconds. Each second, the victim takes {value0.pct} of their Max HP as Spell Damage and Uro heals for {value0.pct} of his Max HP."
msgstr "{name}嘲讽最远的敌方单位 5 秒。期间目标每秒受到自身 {value0.pct} 最大生命的法术伤害，同时噬命魔恢复自身 {value0.pct} 生命值。"

#. Key:	4AC7BC2F4A8C5ABBE3E217A1BB6FF238
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewUroSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewUroSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Runic Bane"
msgstr "符文之咒"

#. Key:	E3201C7341A212958DF6C6BA73290D91
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewUroSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NewUroSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Taunts and curses the furthest foe, healing while draining their Health."
msgstr "嘲讽最远的敌方，吸取其生命值。"

#. Key:	4F268E3E4FC9ABF05173A995D4816BF2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NoSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NoSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} has no skill."
msgstr "{name}没有技能。"

#. Key:	83E88AAE4D0BCE55285B23A059B4A6C1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NoSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#. Key:	9D1D0F384DD4960946A72EAE402080E3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TutorialGoblinSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.NoSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TutorialGoblinSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "No Skill"
msgstr "无技能"

#. Key:	A543DB414F84F9FC299DB2809DC5FE15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OgreSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OgreSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} conjurs a magical star, which will bounce to both friends and foes 7 times. Star deals {value0} Spell Damage when it strikes enemies, and heals {value1} HP when it strikes allies. Each bounce reduces damage and healing by 10%."
msgstr "{name}发射一颗魔法之星，它会在敌友不同单位间弹跳 7 次。当击中敌方时造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，击中友方时恢复其 {value1} 点生命值，伤害和治疗量会随著每次弹跳衰减 10% 。"

#. Key:	6A10171D4C3CA308C7C403A95BEA44E8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OgreSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OgreSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Bouncing Star"
msgstr "跃动星辰"

#. Key:	DE78B52042B5C27EB0A5079955411F35
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OgreSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OgreSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Send forth a bouncing star that injures enemies and heals allies."
msgstr "发射一颗跃动星，不断弹至敌方造成伤害并弹至友方恢复生命。"

#. Key:	FCB46EA14E91EB97237A0BAE3FD63A7B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OogooAttach.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OogooAttach.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} attaches to the nearest ally. While attached, the host gains {value0}% Damage Resistance, and 30% of mana gained by {name} is instead transferred to the host.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"{name} can still attack while attached."
msgstr ""
"{name}附着在最近的友方单位上。被附着期间附主拥有 {value0}% 伤害减免。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>{name}附着后仍能发动攻击，并将获得的 30% 法力值转移给附主。"

#. Key:	E69E750940C526C77D30998DCE5F0697
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OogooAttach.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.OogooAttach.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Attaches to a nearby ally, granting them Mana and damage reduction."
msgstr "依附至一名友方，并为其提供法力与伤害减免。"

#. Key:	34C22825460BFBB6876B11942F9BBBB8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Overcharge.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.Overcharge.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} enters a rage mode, increasing Attack Speed by {value0} and become immune to Crowd Control for 6 seconds. While enraged, {name}'s attacks cleave, damaging all foes in front of it."
msgstr "{name}进入过载模式，在 6 秒内获得 {value0} 点攻击速度并免疫控制效果。过载模式下的攻击会对相邻的所有敌方单位造成伤害。"

#. Key:	B4B8C4FA4907B551413B5BBA53706E7F
