#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.RootMageDecoyPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Passive: Upon spawning, {name} taunts nearby foes. Can't attack or move."
msgstr "被动：生成后，{name}会嘲讽相邻的敌方单位，但无法攻击或移动。"

#. Key:	4D115E464BFD376AA89C05A11992BD34
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.RootMageDecoyPassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.RootMageDecoyPassive.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Unstable"
msgstr "不稳幻像"

#. Key:	CAA656CB4C747B1B18A6B9BAF3AED915
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SandGolemSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SandGolemSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} enters a Fighting Stance for 5 seconds, gaining {value1.pct} Damage Resistance. While in a Fighting Stance, attacks become devastating claps that deal an additional {value0} Spell damage to the target and foes adjacent to them."
msgstr "{name}进入战斗姿态 5 秒，期间拥有 {value1.pct} 伤害减免。战斗姿态下的攻击变为毁灭性扫击，对目标及其相邻的敌方单位额外造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	61E2440F4DEF560B0381CF909C1BF032
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SandGolemSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SandGolemSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Combat Protocol"
msgstr "战斗协议"

#. Key:	4AAF9D90475AF027F1EAF586A920AD1E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SandGolemSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SandGolemSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Enters a fighting stance, during which attacks deal devastating damage."
msgstr "进入战斗姿态，期间攻击造成大量伤害。"

#. Key:	BD6CDEA64BACC02BE576A699358BFC47
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarabBossSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarabBossSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} roars, gaining a {value0} HP Shield for 5 seconds, then dashes through foes towards the furthest target. Enemies struck take {value1} Spell damage and are Stunned for 1.5 seconds."
msgstr "{name}获得 {value0} 点护盾 5 秒，然后冲向最远的敌方单位，对冲击路径上的所有敌方单位造成 {value1} 点伤害与 1.5 秒眩晕。"

#. Key:	236805194D7E1A6ACCA8D8A924CEA2DF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarabBossSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarabBossSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Roaring Rush"
msgstr "咆哮冲刺"

#. Key:	5607C107421871E86583C896E608F46F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarabBossSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarabBossSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Dashes through foes, stunning them."
msgstr "获得护盾、冲掠敌方，造成直线范围伤害与眩晕。"

#. Key:	3C868815425B48343FCFF6881E8F6CB8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarecrowSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarecrowSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {name} is Rooted, Disarmed, and gains 30 Armor, until it first casts.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} teleports to the most enemies within 2 hexes and summons a Murder of Crows for 3 seconds. The Crows deal {value0} Spell damage to foes within 2 hexes each second."
msgstr ""
"被动：在首次施放技能前，{name}处于禁锢与缴械状态，期间拥有 30 点额外护甲。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：传送至敌方单位最密集的地格，并召唤持续 3 秒的鸦群。鸦群每秒在 2 格内造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	69DB163A414A57D8DAEB0E800D301AD1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarecrowSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarecrowSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "The Harvestman"
msgstr "收获之季"

#. Key:	CF6749FD4C25408E693B7B8875FFC5D7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarecrowSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ScarecrowSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Cannot act until casting. Warps to and decimates foes."
msgstr "施放技能前减伤且无法行动。传送并造成毁灭性范围伤害。"

#. Key:	3F212AFB4A2199CADFF7ACB79C220A33
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SeaDragonSpin.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SeaDragonSpin.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} flings an icicle at its target, dealing {value0} Spell Damage and Stunning them for {value1.time}. The icicle also Stuns foes directly behind the target."
msgstr "{name}向目标发射一根冰柱，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害并眩晕目标及其后方锥形内的敌方单位 {value1.time}。"

#. Key:	08F678DF40CE55CCC7E409B7E4239616
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SeaDragonSpin.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SeaDragonSpin.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Deep Freeze"
msgstr "深度冰冻"

#. Key:	906D87C74F71120EE7583CBDD9F8B9DA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SeaDragonSpin.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SeaDragonSpin.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Flings a damaging and stunning icicle that impacts enemies in a cone."
msgstr "发射一枚冰柱，造成伤害并眩晕目标及其身后锥形范围敌方。"

#. Key:	3D772E1B4FB6516F5ED8E68453621212
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShadowSummonPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShadowSummonPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Mush-Turrets have a limited duration and inherit their stats from the Champigno which created it."
msgstr "蘑菇炮塔的存在时间有限，属性继承自蔓生菇。"

#. Key:	03152ADB4ABFA2C9B64C9AA40F2AEF18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShamanTotemSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShamanTotemSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Passive: {name} heals the lowest health unit instead of attacking."
msgstr "被动：{name}治疗生命值最低的单位，而不是进行攻击。"

#. Key:	7DE3697E41541BD4D445FF8655866F3D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShamanTotemSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShamanTotemSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Totemic Power"
msgstr "图腾之力"

#. Key:	C444A62C4A7D6A1EBB374FB6E89FCAB1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShamanTurretPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShamanTurretPassive.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} spends Charge to heal the lowest percentage health ally for the same amount."
msgstr "消耗充能，为生命值百分比最低的友方单位恢复等量生命值。"

#. Key:	B7889BEF4B0F5FE1EA1A2B846D79DD6A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShieldWarcry.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShieldWarcry.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} roars, gaining {value0} Max HP and ignoring the next attack."
msgstr "{name}咆哮，获得 {value0} 点最大生命并无视接下来受到的一次普通攻击。"

#. Key:	F1F9242344D211FFFFDD0DB01BE776F1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShieldWarcry.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShieldWarcry.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Face Me!"
msgstr "正面对决"

#. Key:	20FD7CFE42360E5EB12543A7D83D7179
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShieldWarcry.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ShieldWarcry.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Increases Max HP and ignores the next attack."
msgstr "提高最大生命并格挡下次敌方普通攻击。"

#. Key:	D6B3CF404B6F141ACFA41C9E960C6274
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeleMageBlast.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeleMageBlast.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} fires a magical orb, dealing {value0} Spell Damage on impact. Subsequent casts fire an additional orb, up to a maximum of 5."
msgstr "{name}发射一个魔法球，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。再次施放会额外发射一个魔法球，最多累积至 5 个。"

#. Key:	521BA0C74F6514C8E915E68533A0AD57
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeleMageBlast.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeleMageBlast.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Cascading Orbs"
msgstr "倾泻之球"

#. Key:	5728ABED4224F9A123A9779261545A0C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeleMageBlast.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeleMageBlast.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Fires an orb for each cast this combat."
msgstr "发射一个魔法球，发射量不断增加。"

#. Key:	F11B273D49969E75DD0FF8822264E84E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletalHoundSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletalHoundSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} launches a bone spike at a random target, dealing {value0} Spell damage and Hobbling for 2 seconds. Every cast hits one additional target."
msgstr "{name}向随机敌方单位发射骨刺，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害与 2 秒虚弱。每次施法后整场战斗发射的骨刺数 +1 。"

#. Key:	F561F63B4A7B71B599E87AB7E957A2E0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletalHoundSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletalHoundSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Bone Spike"
msgstr "不息骨刺"

#. Key:	AFB4597A4246922580F9A79D6ABCF3B2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletalHoundSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletalHoundSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Launches a Hobbling spike. Successive casts increases target count."
msgstr "发射造成伤害与虚弱的骨刺，不断提高发射量。"

#. Key:	E368FD044D2B6162DA4D7A85BE30EAAE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletonShieldBash.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletonShieldBash.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} gains a 5 second Shield for {value1.pct} of his Max HP. He then bashes his target, dealing {value0} Spell Damage and Stunning for 1 second."
msgstr "{name}获得 {value1.pct} 最大生命的护盾 5 秒。随后重击目标，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害并使其眩晕 1 秒。"

#. Key:	F7E2371040358643653D47A91EB2C377
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletonShieldBash.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletonShieldBash.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Shield Bash"
msgstr "重盾击"

#. Key:	937E36A84FD9017CB96A4C9D99BDC9BE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletonShieldBash.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SkeletonShieldBash.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Shields itself, then bashes a foe to damage and Stun it."
msgstr "自身获得护盾并猛击敌方，造成伤害与眩晕。"

#. Key:	B44BEF7440FFC85A7CEF429895E873FD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSlam.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSlam.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} pulls the most distant enemy directly to itself. After being pulled, the enemy takes {value0} Spell Damage and is Rooted for 3 seconds."
msgstr "{name}将最远的敌方单位直接拉向自身。被拉动后，目标受到 {value0} 点法术伤害并被禁锢 3 秒。"

#. Key:	C1703325476AC04993302E952F2DD1BD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSlam.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSlam.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Slime Grab"
msgstr "粘液抓取"

#. Key:	E8F7785B493EBB8477A575A19DA1B86A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSlam.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSlam.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Pulls the most distant enemy, then damages and Roots it."
msgstr "抓取最远的敌方，造成伤害与禁锢。"

#. Key:	53CB80844AA2695EA9F2C5A7BDD6598E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSword.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSword.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {slogurkpassive}.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} spawns a Living Weapon nearby, which inherits 75% of its owners Attack Damage and Attack Speed, cannot be attacked or targeted, and lasts for {value0} seconds. The Weapon deals Spell Damage with its attacks."
msgstr ""
"被动：{slogurkpassive}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}在附近生成一件活体武器 6 秒。武器继承主体 75% 的攻击力与攻击速度，攻击时造成法术伤害，且无法被敌方单位攻击。"

#. Key:	F8AD16AE4FA37703EE74AABCD0976FF3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSword.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSword.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Animate Weapon"
msgstr "魔化武器"

#. Key:	FE124F034D1E9AE1DF2100A7BFC32E22
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSword.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlimeSword.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Summons a damaging Living Weapon."
msgstr "召唤一件破坏性的活体武器。"

#. Key:	F7E57B6A42C32E66EA6477884E70C640
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugClone.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugClone.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {slogurkpassive}, and can only equip one item.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} violently splits in two, launching a duplicate near the furthest enemy dealing {value0} Spell Damage to adjacent enemies upon landing. The duplicate takes 50% of {name}'s Health and copies its item, but cannot use Duplication."
msgstr ""
"被动：{slogurkpassive}，并且只能佩戴一件装备。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}分裂成两个，向最远的敌方单位发射一个分身，以对相邻敌方单位造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。分身继承{name} 50% 的最大生命并复制其装备，但一直处于沉默。"

#. Key:	6202F67342050C8A9C8C99953BFBFC37
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugClone.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugClone.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Duplication"
msgstr "复制"

#. Key:	A8DA839E417D14B13836BEB052EAC7BB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugClone.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugClone.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Creates a duplicate of itself, but is limted on equipment."
msgstr "复制自身，复制品继承装备但无法施法。"

#. Key:	896FE1F24E419F5D129C2B8C1CB14B39
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugTeleport.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugTeleport.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: {slogurkpassive}.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} transports to the enemy that dealt the most damage, taunting it for 5 seconds, then gains {value0.pct} Max HP and Attack Damage for the rest of combat."
msgstr ""
"被动：{slogurkpassive}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}传送至伤害最高的敌方单位，嘲讽其 5 秒，然后获得 {value0.pct} 最大生命与攻击力。"

#. Key:	E0BCB4F645F4B63AB2598DB727542E7B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugTeleport.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugTeleport.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Scare Tactics"
msgstr "恐惧战术"

#. Key:	1E72AA5E4BF4B710756045BF133CC9E9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugTeleport.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SlugTeleport.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Buffs itself after moving to and taunting a foe."
msgstr "移动至伤害最高的敌方，将其嘲讽，然后增强自身。"

#. Key:	14058BD3475B042C7B0C15A722F98DA8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SmithingHammer.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SmithingHammer.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} tinkers with the Engineer Turret, granting it +{value0} Attack Damage and +15 Ammo."
msgstr "{name}修补工程师炮塔，使其获得 +{value0} 点攻击力与 +15 发炮弹。"

#. Key:	97351D684CE97EAE3458539BE35C5840
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SmithingHammer.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SmithingHammer.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "UPGRADES!"
msgstr "强化炮塔"

#. Key:	D320A2D643D59EAFB0A1CEB97F725A6A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SmithingHammer.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SmithingHammer.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Empowers the Engineer Turret for increased Ammo and damage."
msgstr "增加工程师炮塔的炮弹与伤害。"

#. Key:	6E0DC49B49E7D3BF3ACC21BD55B64486
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnekBite.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnekBite.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Special Stats: {name} has unlimited Range and -10 Attack Speed.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} sends forth three spectral snakes at his target. Snakes strike foes they hit, dealing {value0.pct} of {name}'s Attack Damage {adpct} and draining {value1} Mana."
msgstr ""
"被动：{name}射程无限(不会移动)且基础攻击速度 -10 点。本效果不会被技能书替换。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}向目标发出三条幽灵蛇。被触碰的敌方单位受到 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}，并失去 {value1} 点法力值。"

#. Key:	B287986B492E3F10922D9595F1309B7B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnekBite.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnekBite.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Sapping Sneks"
msgstr "流蛇侵咬"

#. Key:	3267837540A3AB79EFC661913EE148B4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnekBite.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnekBite.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Sends snakes that deal attack damage and sap Mana."
msgstr "射程无限。施放技能射出飞蛇对敌方造成攻击伤害并流失法力。"

#. Key:	52D6795C4CF032988E35559F02B4190A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnowmanSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnowmanSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: When foes are Stunned, knocked into the air, or interrupted, {name} throws an icicle at them for {value0} Spell damage.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} throws a big snowball at their target, Stunning for 1 second."
msgstr ""
"被动：每当敌方单位被眩晕、击飞或被打断时，{name}向其投掷一根冰柱，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}向目标投掷一个大雪球，造成 1 秒眩晕。"

#. Key:	DCDEE2B34C5E7D39FE8D688B11000C80
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnowmanSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnowmanSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Frosty Fate"
msgstr "霜冻命运"

#. Key:	F3AF312F423F41397BB5F4B8F546CEDC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnowmanSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SnowmanSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Passively damages Stunned enemies. Skill Stuns one foe."
msgstr "被动对眩晕的敌方即时造成伤害，施放技能可眩晕敌方。"

#. Key:	BBC593AD4898BE463C3D428080D8F220
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SpinedShell.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SpinedShell.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} taunts all enemies within 2 hexes, then enters its shell for 4 seconds, gaining 50% Damage Resistance. While in its shell, foes that attack {name} take {value0} Spell damage."
msgstr "{name}嘲讽 2 格内所有敌方单位，然后缩壳 4 秒，期间拥有 50% 伤害减免，且受到攻击会反弹 {value0} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	B5A564FC4BE62D8BC3F54FAE06A20F34
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SpinedShell.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SpinedShell.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Spiny Shock"
msgstr "荆棘刺甲"

#. Key:	6BF72EFE4CA5CC98826921B30DB3EB94
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SpinedShell.EnlightenedDescription_81_638DE95F453D5698DC6D709C069412E2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SpinedShell.EnlightenedDescription_81_638DE95F453D5698DC6D709C069412E2
msgid "Enlightened: While in its shell, {name} is IMMUNE to damage and fires 5 extra spines at ALL enemies."
msgstr "启迪：当处于壳中时，{name}免疫伤害并额外向所有敌方单位发射 5 根刺。"

#. Key:	4857D3924BF4B17BA5CF0091760BB447
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SpinedShell.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SpinedShell.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Passively retaliates when struck. Taunts nearby enemies and reduces damage."
msgstr "短时间嘲讽 2 格内敌方并降低受伤，且期间受击时造成反伤。"

#. Key:	F4F69A3C456583B083060A83E87DD340
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SporeSpawns_MushroomGuardian.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SporeSpawns_MushroomGuardian.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Passive: At the start of combat, {name} gains {value2} empty Max HP.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Active: {name} spawns three spores that seek random enemies, briefly stunning them, dealing {value0} Spell Damage, and reducing their Max HP by the same amount."
msgstr ""
"被动：战斗开始时，{name}获得 {value2} 点最大生命。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>主动：{name}释放三枚随机寻敌的孢子，打断目标以造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，并降低其等量的最大生命。"

#. Key:	3776A5824DB74B427070B9B5DD0AA7BC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SporeSpawns_MushroomGuardian.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SporeSpawns_MushroomGuardian.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Sap Strength"
msgstr "竭力孢子"

#. Key:	8945F9FA413A9FF5791C93B76D24908D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SporeSpawns_MushroomGuardian.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SporeSpawns_MushroomGuardian.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Spawns spores that reduce enemy's Health."
msgstr "释放降低敌方最大生命的孢子。"

#. Key:	960B22D54E71621A53212CB1E7E7CE28
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StagSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StagSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} stylishly backflips, taunting ALL foes for 5 seconds. He gains {value0} Shield and is immune to Spell Damage for the duration."
msgstr "{name}嘲讽所有敌方单位 5 秒，期间免疫法术伤害，并获得 {value0} 点护盾。"

#. Key:	DE208F1E4D6E48F1F63D5085A47791AE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StagSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StagSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Showoff"
msgstr "八方招摇"

#. Key:	2A2818EE41A59A3AEC6E2DA84C90B09F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StagSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StagSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Taunts ALL foes, gaining Spell Damage immunity."
msgstr "短时间嘲讽所有敌方，期间获得护盾并免疫法术伤害。"

#. Key:	91D5C353418A82D04D6D02B632AC23D2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StoneShrapnel.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StoneShrapnel.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} gains a Shield for {value0.pct} of his Max HP {hppct} and {value1} Armor for 8 seconds. His next attack deals {value2} bonus Spell damage, modified by Armor ({valuewitharmor2} total)."
msgstr "{name}获得 {value0.pct} 最大生命{hppct}的护盾与 {value1} 点护甲，持续 8 秒。下次普通攻击额外造成 {valuewitharmor2} 点法术伤害(受护甲加成)。"

#. Key:	041EFCE543A24CB4F16A16BB0C041827
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StoneShrapnel.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StoneShrapnel.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Stone Strength"
msgstr "坚石护体"

#. Key:	0619C3F04F67DE5E4C94A7B0460ECCF2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StoneShrapnel.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StoneShrapnel.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Gains a large Shield and [red]Armor[/] for a duration."
msgstr "获得短时间高额护盾与[red]护甲[/]。"

#. Key:	F37AD66545C3990383C250B441AD341B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StormySkies.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StormySkies.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Lift off the ground for 3 seconds, becoming invulnerable. Each second, toss a Thunderbolt at a random foe that deals {value0} Spell damage and Stuns for 1 second."
msgstr "升空 3 秒并进入无敌状态。每秒向随机敌人投掷一道雷电，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害并使其眩晕 1 秒。"

#. Key:	StylizedMimicSkill
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StylizedMimicSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StylizedMimicSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} takes a massive bite out of its target, dealing {value0} Spell Damage and completely devouring one of the target's equipped items - destroying it instantly! {name} digests the item over 4 seconds, healing {value1.pct} of its Max HP per second.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Boss Heart and Leader Heart items cannot be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"{name}大口啃噬目标，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，并吞噬(摧毁)目标的一件佩戴品。随后在 4 秒内将其消化，每秒恢复 {value1.pct} 的生命值。\n"
"\n"
"领袖雄心与队长徽章无法被摧毁。"

#. Key:	64A7901C49032FC3334B06BCAFD79E94
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StylizedMimicSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StylizedMimicSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Devour"
msgstr "吞噬"

#. Key:	5D7F6DB64D8127C4D63FC4935A7DD640
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StylizedMimicSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.StylizedMimicSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Chomps an enemy, dealing damage, healing itself, and destroying an item."
msgstr "啃噬敌方造成伤害以恢复生命，并摧毁其一件装备。"

#. Key:	8BA81E7141B7FE86E47E1D95AA28728A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SuperStumpySkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SuperStumpySkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} slams the target, dealing {value0.pct} of its Max HP as Spell damage {hppct} to its target."
msgstr "{name}猛击目标，对目标造成相当于其最大生命的 {value0.pct} 的法术伤害 {hppct}。"

#. Key:	3A25E61C4E3FAFD7767AB593D03A6577
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SuperStumpySkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SuperStumpySkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Super Stumpy Slam"
msgstr "超级墩墩树重击"

#. Key:	85A5D7B8438FC2E120056D96E4565044
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SuperStumpySkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SuperStumpySkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Slams a foe, dealing damage based on max HP."
msgstr "猛击敌方，造成基于最大生命的伤害。"

#. Key:	0AC9A49843212FF32A444E82AF4C8FC1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SwappingGolem.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SwappingGolem.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} warps away, gains {value1} Attack Speed, and swaps into Beam Form for the rest of combat, which grants +6 Range.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Once in Beam Form, attacks become devastating laser beams that deal {value0} Spell damage, modified by {name}'s Armor ({valuewitharmor0} total)."
msgstr ""
"{name}折跃位面，获得 {value1} 点攻击速度以及 6 射程，进入光束形态。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>处于光束形态时，普通攻击变为毁灭光束，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，且该伤害受护甲加成({valuewitharmor0})。"

#. Key:	2714A346462C451F3A53BDB674F72BED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SwappingGolem.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.SwappingGolem.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Prime"
msgstr "霜之暴"

#. Key:	7A0342754841DCE8AA03C3BD5DDC20F2
