msgstr "被动：触手的攻击命中时，目标陷入易伤 2 秒。"

#. Key:	9E4C49C543032F7712384189B3C7180C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TentacleOnHitVuln.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TentacleOnHitVuln.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Horrifying"
msgstr "恐惧"

#. Key:	5FB5D5F5465796612BA5F29EFD924580
