msgstr "攻击敌方时使其陷入易伤。"

#. Key:	697593D043D5D091B3EBD88BF8F7A13B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheDarknessBlast.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheDarknessBlast.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} fires an eldritch blast at the furthest enemy that deals {value0} Spell damage to foes struck and Hobbles for {value1.time}.\r\n"
"If Tome is active, the beam Stuns instead of Hobbling."
msgstr ""
"{name}向最远的敌方单位发射一道冲击波，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，并虚弱 {value1.time}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>若【书怪】效果已激活，则直接眩晕目标。"

#. Key:	854E709944E927C3C5606EB254D7F3E3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheDarknessBlast.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheDarknessBlast.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Eldritch Blast"
msgstr "怪异冲击"

#. Key:	3365FDD84416606152E9D9AD7B5A214D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheDarknessBlast.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheDarknessBlast.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Fires a beam that Slows enemies."
msgstr "对最远敌方造成伤害，施加虚弱或眩晕。"

#. Key:	1C94119C4BBC577730B6198E2CFDE31A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheReaping.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheReaping.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} takes to the air and marks the furthest foe, removing them from combat for two seconds. After a brief delay, {name} slams its scythe down onto the marked target, striking for {value0} Spell Damage. {name} regains {value1} Mana if this kills the target."
msgstr "{name}升空，眩晕最远的敌方单位 2 秒。随后用镰刀猛击目标，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。若击杀目标，恢复 {value1} 点法力值。"

#. Key:	C284309D45D542E85DE0D88289EAA004
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheReaping.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheReaping.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "The Reaping"
msgstr "大收割"

#. Key:	2477751049C495F70E0C59A2C13D8727
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheReaping.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TheReaping.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Imprisons the furthest enemy, then teleports behind them and deals immense Spell damage."
msgstr "眩晕最远的敌方，传送至其身后造成高额法术伤害。"

#. Key:	C3ADE46642C6B2AA91E053B104449567
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TidalWave.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TidalWave.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} launches a piercing tidal wave that deals {value0} Spell Damage and Pushes (2 hexes). Afterwards, {name} launches {value1} mini-wave that deals {value2} Spell Damage."
msgstr "{name}掀起海潮，一道主波造成 {value0} 点法术伤害并击退目标 2 格，{value1} 道次波造成 {value2} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	421ECC6040C8ACEB45961BBAD983CE1F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TidalWave.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TidalWave.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Tidal Wave"
msgstr "汹涌海潮"

#. Key:	ACFCE1904540E1988C3C69804FB12853
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TidalWave.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TidalWave.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Summons a tidal wave that damages and knocks back, then [red]1[/] mini-wave."
msgstr "召唤海潮，主波造成伤害并击退，附加[red]1[/]道次波。"

#. Key:	3D9C00224C1B16E96D766E98B171975D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TornadoPulse.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TornadoPulse.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} spins at a high speed, dealing {value0.pct} of Attack Damage {adpct} to adjacent Units and Pushing them. This includes allies!"
msgstr "{name}发动旋风斩，对相邻的双方单位造成 {value0} 点伤害并将其击退 1 格。"

#. Key:	127E0CF142B166D7647A37B94B56CB4A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TornadoPulse.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TornadoPulse.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Tornado Pulse"
msgstr "龙卷脉冲"

#. Key:	998524A4472C345FA054A88C9838A085
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TornadoPulse.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TornadoPulse.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Damages, stuns, and pushes adjacent units - including allies!"
msgstr "伤害、眩晕并击退相邻的双方单位。"

#. Key:	95E79AC74BDB31CC9089B1904597BF5D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ToyKnightBuff.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ToyKnightBuff.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} raises its sword to the sky, enchanting and the lowest Health ally. They gain 10 Armor and heal {value0} HP per second for 4 seconds."
msgstr "{name}高举圣剑 4 秒，期间为自身与生命值最低的友方单位提供 10 点护甲并每秒恢复 {value0} 点生命值。"

#. Key:	C3F92192446FCBF4192D04A2FFB0F47E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ToyKnightBuff.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ToyKnightBuff.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Sparkle Shield"
msgstr "闪光盾牌"

#. Key:	3E2988CD43ADE97F828C148BDB343E23
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ToyKnightBuff.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.ToyKnightBuff.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Heals itself and the lowest health ally over time."
msgstr "短时间持续治疗自身与生命最低的友方。"

#. Key:	3189D5A7466648F4B286F196FCE42C1D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TreasureChestHatch.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TreasureChestHatch.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "This Loot Chest gains 1 Mana when entering a combat room. When you sell the Loot Chest, gain rewards based on the stored Mana!"
msgstr "本战利品箱在进入战斗时会恢復 1 点法力值。出售战利品箱时，可基于已有法力值的获得对应奖励。"

#. Key:	A4906C844EB9A9408D10C09EB3B2D647
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TreasureChestHatch.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TreasureChestHatch.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Loot Storage"
msgstr "战利品箱"

#. Key:	BE956B4A4333B70EF9B514A59457BCC3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TreasureChestHatch.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TreasureChestHatch.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Sell to receive powerful rewards."
msgstr "出售以获得丰厚的奖励。"

#. Key:	29F132C346656CA1179F718FAE595716
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TripleShroomShot.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TripleShroomShot.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} fires a charged shot at the closest foe, dealing {value0} Spell Damage, interrupting, and Rooting for 2 seconds. Afterwards, {name} teleports far away from its current position and gains 1 Attack Range for the rest of combat."
msgstr "{name}向最近的敌方单位发射一发蓄力射击，造成 {value0} 点法术伤害，将其打断并禁锢 2 秒。之后，{name}闪现逃离当前位置并在该场战斗获得 1 射程。"

#. Key:	9D81D983434DF1AD5EDEBE9FE3E61EB7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TripleShroomShot.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TripleShroomShot.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Spore Shot"
msgstr "孢子射击"

#. Key:	ADB95B2C47B53DE132EA8DA09716BB57
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TripleShroomShot.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TripleShroomShot.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Fires an interrupting arrow that Roots, then teleports away."
msgstr "发射一支造成打断与禁锢的箭，之后传送至另一位置。"

#. Key:	6B3D77E14FF6B063788B978E2872E0E5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TrollSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TrollSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} spins, dealing {value0.pct} of its Attack Damage {adpct} and briefly stunning its target.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Every third cast, {name} instead slams the ground, dealing {value1} Spell Damage to all foes within 2 hexes and Pushing them."
msgstr ""
"{name}旋转一击，造成 {value0.pct} 攻击伤害{adpct}并打断目标。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>每三次施法，{name}都会猛击地面，对 2 格内的所有敌方单位造成 {value1} 点法术伤害，并将其击退。"

#. Key:	AF8E609C4CB8ECEF5EDEFD9A35FFBFC6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TrollSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TrollSkill.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Master's Tricks"
msgstr "妖魁威压"

#. Key:	54CEE6D7473FF05E900913892A39BE98
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TrollSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TrollSkill.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Spins forward, damaging target. Slams every third spin."
msgstr "向前旋击，造成伤害并与目标交换位置。每第三次施放猛击相邻敌方并造成击退。"

#. Key:	53900ACB419CD555618788A29C7B6560
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TurtleShell.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TurtleShell.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} gains {value1} Shield and reduces all damage taken by {value0} for the next 6 seconds."
msgstr "{name}获得 {value1} 点护盾，并使 6 秒内受到的所有伤害降低 {value0} 点。"

#. Key:	D9A3758A4FB80E96139AD19901211080
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TurtleShell.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TurtleShell.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Shellshield"
msgstr "厚实外壳"

#. Key:	01F67B694B53B18792F36EA4533CF672
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TurtleShell.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TurtleShell.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Gains a Shield and reduces incoming damage."
msgstr "获得护盾，短时间固定降低受伤。"

#. Key:	7A826547497FB09C9523C7AC14160468
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TutorialGoblinSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.TutorialGoblinSkill.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "Training Goblins have no skill."
msgstr "地精训练手没有技能。"

#. Key:	ECAB2DC94E02B15A9CC9FFB9A76AFEDD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfRush.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfRush.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid "{name} rushes to the target who has dealt the most damage, then shreds them with three rapid attacks. {name} and the target become Taunted against each other, entering a deadly combat."
msgstr "{name}冲向伤害最高的敌方，快速攻击 3 次，然后与目标相互嘲讽，进入死斗。"

#. Key:	4945D6C147C4A97C4A4D06A086DDC75A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfsRoar.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#. Key:	B68AB7BB4DFEBCE072D35983C51FDA7B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfRush.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfRush.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfsRoar.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
msgid "Full Moon"
msgstr "圆月狼形"

#. Key:	BC02742140995016A348038D1472BE12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfRush.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfRush.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Transforms to a melee fighter. Can shred a foe with multiple attacks."
msgstr "变身成近战战士，可以对敌人进行多次攻击。"

#. Key:	A911F5F847A13E28F4711BAA027D016D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfsRoar.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfsRoar.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} roars and enrages, getting -3 Attack Range,, {value0.pct} bonus Attack Damage, {value1} bonus Max HP and +10 Armor. While transformed, attacks heal {name} for {value2} HP.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"He then rushes to the foe who dealt the most damage, attacking 3 times in quick succession. Wolfgang and that foe both Taunt each other, engaging in a duel!"
msgstr ""
"{name}咆哮并狂暴，基础射程降低 2 ，并获得 {value0.pct} 攻击力、{value1} 点最大生命，以及 10 点护甲，且每次攻击恢复 {value2} 点生命值。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>变身完成后，冲向伤害最高的敌方单位，快速连续攻击 3 次，与目标互相嘲讽，进入死斗状态。"

#. Key:	03C5EDF04FDE35D92F38EAAFD9BC112B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfsRoar.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WerewolfsRoar.ShortDescriptionforStore_61_DC0E3B4047BE9B5D3D0D6289B88B10BE
msgid "Transforms to a melee fighter, then Taunts and attacks a foe."
msgstr "变为近战并获得相关属性，与目标死斗。"

#. Key:	E8B52AD946B9988425B4218DB0952FFB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WickedSolo.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WickedSolo.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"Fire 3 damaging music notes at a random foe, plus another for each XP level. Each note deals {value0} Spell Damage.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"The first time this skill is used each combat, gain 1 Gold and 1 Star Point."
msgstr ""
"向随机敌方单位发射 3 枚破坏性音符，你每高 1 级，额外发射 1 枚。每枚造成 {value0} 点法术伤害。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>每场战斗首次使用时，你获得 1 金币与 1 星点。"

#. Key:	73B516C84779F6623D4C8FBC26511246
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.WickedSolo.DisplayName_19_BECADCCA4C834A1D925201A939B5FFF2
