msgstr "邪恶独奏"

#. Key:	C18D79EA4B23CF01020168AF5C416F87
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.YetiFreeze.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitSkillsTable.UnitSkillsTable.YetiFreeze.Description_23_DD14D88C4B0C12D29B05F4893716C415
msgid ""
"{name} conjures a frost-storm, Hobbling adjacent foes for {value3.time} and dealing {value1} Spell damage. {name} gains a shield for {value0.pct} of its Max HP {hppct} for 4 seconds. \r\n"
"\r\n"
"Foes that were already Hobbled are instead Stunned for 3 seconds and take {value2} Spell damage."
msgstr ""
"{name}唤起冰霜风暴，虚弱相邻的敌方单位 {value3.time}并造成 {value1} 点法术伤害，同时获得 {value0.pct} 最大生命的护盾{hppct} 4 秒。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>若目标已被虚弱，则改为眩晕目标 3 秒并造成 {value2} 点法术伤害。"

#. Key:	E67760044A5A1926A92FF1B2CB3AAED8
