#. Key:	F305FA29477095340650DF9F3B5DB514
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitStats/NewStatArchetypesTable.NewStatArchetypesTable.Attacker.Description_13_2FFD4BDE438DEF7BC7CA3C9EAEA8C242
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitStats/NewStatArchetypesTable.NewStatArchetypesTable.Attacker.Description_13_2FFD4BDE438DEF7BC7CA3C9EAEA8C242
msgid ""
"This unit is exceptional at attacking. It has more Attack Speed and Damage than other units and gains 2 additional mana when it attacks.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When this unit gains a Tier, it gains additional Attack Damage and Maximum Health.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Preferred Item Stats: Attack Damage, Attack Speed."
msgstr ""
"该单位擅长普通攻击，拥有更高的攻击速度与攻击力，并在命中时额外获得 2 点法力值。\n"
"\n"
"该单位升级时会提高攻击力与最大生命。\n"
"\n"
"推荐装备属性：攻击力、攻击速度。"

#. Key:	B7C26C764F4865D23A20F19FEB00EA0D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitStats/NewStatArchetypesTable.NewStatArchetypesTable.Caster.Description_13_2FFD4BDE438DEF7BC7CA3C9EAEA8C242
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitStats/NewStatArchetypesTable.NewStatArchetypesTable.Caster.Description_13_2FFD4BDE438DEF7BC7CA3C9EAEA8C242
msgid ""
"This unit is exceptional at casting its spell. It has 65% increased effectiveness of Mana Regen than other units, but lower Maximum Health.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When this unit gains a Tier, it gains additional Spell Power and Maximum Health.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Preferred Item Stats: Mana Regen, Spell Power."
msgstr ""
"该单位擅长施放技能，获得法力恢复时比其他单位额外获得 65% ，但最大生命较低。\n"
"\n"
"该单位升级时将获得额外的法术强度与最大生命。\n"
"\n"
"推荐装备属性：法力恢复，法术强度。"

#. Key:	F970145F4469A546C11A3FB36DB6DD32
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitStats/NewStatArchetypesTable.NewStatArchetypesTable.Manual.Description_13_2FFD4BDE438DEF7BC7CA3C9EAEA8C242
