#. Key:	16C8AC8A423CD5CA8199AF956FF4AC5C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitStats/NewStatArchetypesTable.NewStatArchetypesTable.Tank.Description_13_2FFD4BDE438DEF7BC7CA3C9EAEA8C242
#: /Game/ToyBattler/Data/Units/UnitStats/NewStatArchetypesTable.NewStatArchetypesTable.Tank.Description_13_2FFD4BDE438DEF7BC7CA3C9EAEA8C242
msgid ""
"This unit is exceptional at taking damage. It has more Maximum Health than other units and gains 3 additional mana when hit, but has lower Attack Speed.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When this unit gains a Tier, it gains additional Armor and Maximum Health.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Preferred Item Stats: Armor, Maximum Health."
msgstr ""
"该单位擅长承受伤害，拥有更高的生命值，并在受击时额外获得 3 点法力值，但攻击速度较低。\n"
"\n"
"该单位升级时会提升护甲与最大生命。\n"
"\n"
"推荐装备属性：护甲、最大生命。"

