#. Key:	Arbiter
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"I am the law.  Judge Thelaw.  Good to meet you.\""
msgstr "“我就是法律。我叫法官西劳。很高兴见到你。”"

#. Key:	ArenaFighter
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Are you not entertained?!\""
msgstr "“你玩得尽兴吗？”"

#. Key:	Assistotron
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Good sir.  Allow us to engage in fisticuffs.\""
msgstr "“你好先生，让我们从事互殴行为吧。”"

#. Key:	BadNecromancer
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Of course I know what I'm doing.  Oops...that one shouldn't be moving.\""
msgstr "“我当然知道自己在做什么啦，等等，别动那个！”"

#. Key:	BoredBrawler
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Lucky Lass has gotten good rolls and has a solid Army now!"
msgstr "幸运的小女孩掷到了好点数，她的队伍变强了！"

#. Key:	BossAlchemistLab
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Has the Unique Mythic  'The S.B.G'. This fight deals double damage on a loss."
msgstr "本场战斗出现特殊【传说】单位“S.B.G”，若失败会承受双倍伤害。"

#. Key:	BossCavern
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Has the Unique Mythic 'Monock Sr.'. This fight deals double damage on a loss."
msgstr "本场战斗出现特殊【传说】单位“大眼尊者”，若失败会承受双倍伤害。"

#. Key:	BossCity
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Has the Unique Mythic 'Trollgar'. This fight deals double damage on a loss."
msgstr "本场战斗出现特殊【传说】单位“巨魔主”，若失败会承受双倍伤害。 "

#. Key:	BossFactory
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Has the Unique Mythic 'Shred-o-matic'. This fight deals double damage on a loss."
msgstr "本场战斗出现特殊【传说】单位“碎肢机器人”，若失败会承受双倍伤害。"

#. Key:	BossForest
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Has the Unique Unit 'Shred-o-matic'. This fight deals double damage on a loss."
msgstr "本场战斗出现特殊【传说】单位“碎肢机器人”，若失败会承受双倍伤害。"

#. Key:	BossGraveyard
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Has the Unique Mythic 'Xanatos'. This fight deals double damage on a loss."
msgstr "本场战斗出现特殊【传说】单位“翼死神”，若失败会承受双倍伤害。"

#. Key:	BossOasis
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Has the Unique Mythic 'Adalon'. This fight deals double damage on a loss."
msgstr "本场战斗出现特殊【传说】单位“凛冬龙”，若失败会承受双倍伤害。"

#. Key:	Brightmage
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Time to watch the world burn.  Did you bring marshmallows?\""
msgstr "“是时候看世界燃烧了！你带棉花糖了吗？”"

#. Key:	BunkerBoy
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Momma said knock you out.  Or was it eat your veggies?\""
msgstr "“妈妈说的是去揍一顿还是去搓一顿？”"

#. Key:	CactusNymph
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Is it hot in here, or is it just you?\""
msgstr "“是这个地方炎热还是你太热辣了？”"

#. Key:	ChaoticKobold
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Hey, bro.  You totally look like someone I'm about to beat.\""
msgstr "“哥们，你长得很像马上就要被我打败的那个人。”"

#. Key:	CircusPerformer
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"From what I've tasted of desire, I hold with those who favor fire.\""
msgstr "“从我品尝过的欲望来看，我支持那些喜欢火焰的人。”"

#. Key:	ConstructionWorker
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"If we don't get no tolls, then we don't eat no rolls.\""
msgstr "“搞不到米我们就没米吃。”"

#. Key:	CoolKid
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Send reinforcements everywhere.  Then everywhere, we will be strong.\""
msgstr "“几处增援几处强。”"

#. Key:	CultistLad
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"I got chills, and they're multiplyin'.\""
msgstr "“哥很酷，内酷那种酷。”"

#. Key:	Daredevil
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Come one, come all, come see \"The Kobold without Fear\"!\""
msgstr "“快来瞧，快来看！大戏‘无畏哥’惊险上演！”"

#. Key:	DeathwingDisciple
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"In the words of Mazaloth...Caw CAW!\""
msgstr "“用塔语来说就是，咔咔！”"

#. Key:	DebonairScientist
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Behold!  My finest creation.\""
msgstr "“来看看，这是我最喜欢的作品！”"

#. Key:	DiscipleOfTrollgar
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Forgiveness is divine, but never pay full price for a late pizza.\""
msgstr "“宽恕对于卑鄙之人无异于垫脚石。”"

#. Key:	DisguisedVillain
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Why, yes.  It does take effort to look this good.\""
msgstr "“要打扮得如此标致确实有点费力。”"

#. Key:	Doomsayer
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"I knew it!\""
msgstr "“我就知道！”"

#. Key:	DruidOfHarmony
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"There is no judgement.  We are all equals here.\""
msgstr "“这里不分高低贵贱，所有人都是平等的。”"

#. Key:	EagerNewbie
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "The Newbie skipped the tutorial and insists on not using Units that share Traits."
msgstr "新手跳过了教程，并且坚持不使用相同阵营的单位。"

#. Key:	Geomancer
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Looks like someone's caught between a rock and a hard place.\""
msgstr "“看来有人左右为难啊。”"

#. Key:	Gigantomancer
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"I will hug him.  And squeeze him.  And call him George.\""
msgstr "“我会抱抱他，碾死他，然后赐名小扁。”"

#. Key:	GobBarker
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Let's get ready to rumble!\""
msgstr "“准备大干一场吧！”"

#. Key:	GolemGuardian
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"*overly excited rumbling*\""
msgstr "“发出了兴奋地隆隆声”"

#. Key:	Gorgon
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"'Hey, put that down!  You don't know where that's been.\""
msgstr "“把那个放下，不然你的下场我不好说。”"

#. Key:	GraveKeeper
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Not one now, to mock your own grinning?\""
msgstr "“愚世者亦终成枯骨。”"

#. Key:	GuardCaptain
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Honestly, I can't see anything out of this thing.\""
msgstr "“老实说，我什么都看不出来。”"

#. Key:	Hothead
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Here comes the boom.\""
msgstr "“爆炸就是艺术！”"

#. Key:	ImpatientMonk
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Can we make this quick?  I have to get back to being zen.\""
msgstr "“我们能搞快点么？我得回去打坐了。”"

#. Key:	LaneBully
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Boom!  Time for some tough actin'.\""
msgstr "“哈！是时候来点狠的了！”"

#. Key:	MagneticMage
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"A good diet is high in iron.\""
msgstr "“良好的饮食应含有丰富的铁元素。”"

#. Key:	MasterMirror
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Y'all wanna try slime milk?  I don't know how they get it out either.\""
msgstr "“你想试试史莱姆奶吗？我都不知道他们怎么搞出来的这玩意。”"

#. Key:	MuseumCurator
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"What a magnificent specimen.  I'm just going to borrow it for a minute.\""
msgstr "“多壮观的标本啊，我想借来看看。”"

#. Key:	MysteriousHero
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "A new challenger to the Tournament. Their identity remains a secret, for now..."
msgstr "一位神秘的大赛选手，他的身份暂时还是个谜..."

#. Key:	OrderTemplar
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Shhh....\""
msgstr "“嘘...”"

#. Key:	PaladinOfWinmor
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"It's just ketchup.  Trust me.\""
msgstr "“信我，这只是番茄酱。”"

#. Key:	ProfessorPots
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"This sure beats doing housework.\""
msgstr "“这可比做家务强多了。”"

#. Key:	PVPOpponent
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Your Opponent will be revealed when you press Fight, and combat will immediately start."
msgstr "点击战斗后，对手的阵容才会出现，随后战斗立即开始。"

#. Key:	PVPOpponent_Loading
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Finding an Opponent at the same Floor for your Army to face."
msgstr "正在寻找与你进度相同的对手..."

#. Key:	RainDancer
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Fighting in the rain.  What a glorious feeling.\""
msgstr "“在雨中战斗，多么令人心潮澎湃！”"

#. Key:	RiftTraveller
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"This doesn't look right.  I think I was supposed to take that left turn...\""
msgstr "“怎么回事？好像之前该向左转...”"

#. Key:	RogueTinkerer
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Hey there, Captain Tightpants!\""
msgstr "“嘿，你好啊，紧身裤船长！”"

#. Key:	Shapeshifter
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"I am the amalgamantion of destruction.  And tentacles.\""
msgstr "“我是毁灭...以及触手的融合体。”"

#. Key:	Shrinkomancer
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Aww...look at them.  They're so cute.\""
msgstr "“哦~~~看看它，小小的真可爱。”"

#. Key:	SlimyConductor
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"A pinch of this, a bit of that, and...uh-oh.  That wasn't supposed to happen.\""
msgstr "“加点这个，再加点那个，再加点...啊，不应该这样啊！”"

#. Key:	SnakeOilSalesman
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"I got the thrills to cure your ills.\""
msgstr "“我有治疗你顽疾的丸剂。”"

#. Key:	Stormchaser
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"I shall swat you like an insect.\""
msgstr "“我要碾死你个小虫子。”"

#. Key:	Taskmaster
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Today's Lesson: Old Ones - How old are they?\""
msgstr "“同学们，今天我们学习——母猪的....拿错书了。”"

