msgid "Get some warmup fights in before the real combatants. You have 1 Army Size."
msgstr "在正式战斗前先热热身吧！本轮可以上阵一名单位。"

#. Key:	TrainingGoblin_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Get some warmup fights in before the real combatants. You have 2 Army Size."
msgstr "在正式战斗前先热热身吧！本轮可以上阵两名单位。"

#. Key:	TrainingGoblin_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Get some warmup fights in before the real combatants. You have 3 Army Size."
msgstr "在正式战斗前先热热身吧！本轮可以上阵三名单位。"

#. Key:	Tutorial1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Just another student in training. An easy matchup."
msgstr "他只是另一个初学者，这场战斗会很简单的。"

#. Key:	Tutorial2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "This lesson will teach you about the first of three pillars of army power - Merging Units."
msgstr "首先来学习一下合并单位吧，这是提升力量的第一种途径。"

#. Key:	Tutorial3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "This lesson will teach you about the second pillar of power - Trait Bonuses."
msgstr "接下来请了解一下阵营效果吧，这也是影响队伍强度的重要因素。"

#. Key:	Tutorial4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "This lesson will teach you about the final pillar of power - Equipping Items."
msgstr "最后来看一下如何给你的单位佩戴装备吧。"

#. Key:	UnluckyLass
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "Unlucky Lass hasn't been able to find a good army yet and is stuck with just one active Trait."
msgstr "霉运女孩还没有组建好完整的队伍，只激活了一种阵营效果。"

#. Key:	WanderingWizard
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"Stay a while and listen.  What was I talking about?\""
msgstr "“等等，听我说！我要说什么来着？”"

#. Key:	WizenedWizard
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
#: /Game/ToyBattler/StringTables/CombatModifierSpeech.CombatModifierSpeech
msgctxt "NewStringTable"
msgid "\"I wonder if there is anything higher than valedictorian.\""
msgstr "“还有比毕业学生代表更高级的头衔吗？”"

