#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventContent_CentaurBet.EventContent_CentaurBet_C:GetToolTipWidget
#: [Script Bytecode]
msgid ""
"Place your bets on who will win! You have some Free Tokens to spend without dipping into your Gold reserves, but can spend as much of your own Gold as you like on the bet. You can bet on multiple racers, or just one, but must spend all of your Free Tokens to proceed.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Each winner has a different payout rate. The higher the payout rate, the less likely they are to win, but the more you earn if they do.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Additionally, whichever racer you bet the MOST on will award you with a unique souvenir reward!"
msgstr ""
"押注谁是胜利者！你有一些免费代币供押注，后续可自行选择是否使用金币加码。可以押注任意位选手，但必须至少花掉所有免费代币才能继续。\n"
"\n"
"每位选手都有不同的获胜赔率。赔率高者胜率低，风险与收益并存。\n"
"\n"
"此外，你最看好的选手会在赛后赠予你独特的纪念品奖励。"

