msgid ""
"When the event begins, all cards are turned face down and shuffled. You must reveal one to continue but can reveal as many as you want before leaving.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Each card you reveal will add its displayed rewards to your payout, and increase your Risk Score. The higher your Risk Score, the more Curse you will gain when you take your rewards. If your Risk Score reaches 22 or more, you may not reveal more cards and the event is concluded."
msgstr ""
"点击洗牌后，所有牌都会变为背面朝上并被打乱顺序。至少需要翻开其中一张才能接着进行游戏，在风险值满之前能够翻开任意张。\n"
"\n"
"每张翻开的牌都有可能带有一定的奖励，并同时提供一定的风险值。累计风险值越高，离开时受到的诅咒就越多。风险值达到 22 点之后，就无法继续再翻牌。"

