#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Misc [Script Bytecode]
msgid ""
"<text>You grab the slip of {pink}parchment{text} from the notice board and slip in into your {green}pocket{text}.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Hopefully, you can complete it before the </>{tournament}<text> begins.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>你从布告栏上抓起那张{pink}纸片{text}，塞进你的{green}口袋{text}。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>希望你能在</>{tournament}<text>开始之前完成它。</>"

#. Key:	F4D1258D4690F70D8B37B4813548411F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Misc [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Misc [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>You can feel great power coming from the sign...a kind of power that you can harness.  Performing an </><text s=\"colorcyan\">arcane ritual</><text>, you draw in the </><text s=\"colorpurple\">magical energies</><text> infused with the sign, causing the lights of the </><text s=\"colorcyan\">runes</><text> to fade into nothing.</>"
msgstr "<text>你能感受到里面有一股强大的力量...也许你可以利用它。你进行了一次</><text s=\"colorcyan\">奥术仪式</><text>，吸纳了其中的</><text s=\"colorpurple\">魔法能量</><text>，上面的</><text s=\"colorcyan\">符文</><text>也渐渐变得暗淡了。</>"

