#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Beginnings [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>The sound of voices draws you to a side tunnel, leading into a what seems to be a game room, where two</> {elitefour} <text>are in deep discussion. </>"
msgstr "<text>一条通道中传来了声音，通向的似乎是一间游戏室。两位</>{elitefour}<text>正在里面深度讨论着些什么。</>"

#. Key:	D3A85BB9440AD53847F6C0AD4F156D28
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion Event Beginnings [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Beginnings [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>In one of the many disused workshops, you spy a couple of</> {elitefour} <text>debating with one another about something.</>"
msgstr "<text>在一个弃用的工坊里，你看到两位</>{elitefour}<text>正在争论着什么。</>"

#. Key:	DAC654804DD5693F1F75D9BF9F347EBE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion Event Beginnings [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Beginnings [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>In a small clearing, beneath an ancient yew tree, two </>{elitefour}<text> are conversing quietly.</>"
msgstr "<text>在一片小空地，一棵古老的紫杉树下，有两位</>{elitefour}<text>正在悄悄交谈。</>"

#. Key:	52B59EF049EFEA45E84F7BA0F1A3DF28
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Now that that's settled, I have a gift for you.  Whatever wish your heart desires, I shall grant.  Within reason, of course.  Just...no tentacles.\"</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“现在事情都解决了，你有什么愿望我都会满足的。当然，得在合理范围内。就是说...别太离谱。”</>"

#. Key:	5C11BB7B4781FAC260DFE98D6AA4A9C3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"A {playerrace}, huh?  Not my first choice, but...come along.  I need a new assistant and...well...you're here.  So, I suppose you'll do.\"</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“哦？{playerrace}？不是最理想的人选，但...还是过来吧。我需要一个新助手，而且...嗯...也只有你在这，所以人选只能是你了。”</>"

#. Key:	704672514DF03E4784D9AB9E7F190922
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Allow me to give thee some advice.  Always be prepared, for combat may come at any moment.  En garde!\"</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"colorspeech\">“容吾进一言：常备不懈，战端瞬启。严阵以待！”</>"

#. Key:	B384B24D47EB99E34FFB518C7D4DBF1D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>Smiling at the thought of showing up one of her</> <text s=\"shakingorange\">friendly rivals</><text>, </>{river}<text> presents a variety of</> <text s=\"rainbow\">beautifully crafted banners</> <text>for you to pick from.</>"
msgstr "<text></>{river}<text>很满足于你帮她盖过了她那</><text s=\"shakingorange\">相爱相杀{text}的老朋友一个风头。她微笑着为你提供了各种</><text s=\"rainbow\">精美的战旗</><text>供挑选。</>"

#. Key:	E0CBEAB448BE67E61466A391D8FA3176
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "{otto} <text>looks a bit confused, apparently unaware that he's won the arguement.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"Otto just want to play favorite game.  New friend know how to play?  Otto teach.\"</>"
msgstr "{otto}<text>看起来有点困惑，貌似没意识到自己辩赢了。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“奥托只想玩最喜欢的游戏。新朋友知道怎么玩吗？奥托来教你。”</>"

#. Key:	ED5EF67C480D8138C97DF58BCD71C69D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Champion
#: Event Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>The sound of chimes ring out from</> {skye}<text s=\"skye\">'s</> <text>suit as she sticks out her tongue at the</> {elitefour}<text>.</>  <text s=\"colorspeech\">\"You know...you ain't too bad, kiddo.  Follow me...I wanna show ya somethin'.\"</>"
msgstr "{skye}<text>的战斗服中传出叮当声，她冲着</>{elitefour}<text>吐了吐舌头。</><text s=\"colorspeech\">“小家伙...你人还不错。跟我来吧...给你展示些东西。”</>"

#. Key:	036C69234F8988A034CDE29700DBED52
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>With the crisis averted, you notice a broken down {wavingyellow}power suit{text}, and move to get a closer look.  No one would notice it's {pink}missing{text}...if you can repair it.</>"
msgstr "<text>危机已经解除，你注意到一套损坏的{wavingyellow}动力外骨骼{text}，于是走近查看。要是你能修好它...应该没人会注意到它{pink}不见了{text}...</>"

#. Key:	3F3BE13546588B6DCF80E1888AA236CA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>Once again, the {gray}skeletons{text} gather around you, waiting for their next assignment.</>"
msgstr "<text>{gray}骷髅们{text}又一次聚集在你周围，等待他们的下一个任务。</>"

#. Key:	40C1EA0349F940C739C31E8A74E7616E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>The</> <text s=\"colorblue\">pulsing blue light</> <text>that drew you here is now accompanied by a slow, steady</> <text s=\"colorpurple\">thump</><text>.  You soon realize that they both come from some sort of stony...</><text s=\"colorred\">heart?</>"
msgstr "<text>之前吸引你到来的</><text s=\"colorblue\">蓝色闪光</><text>现在伴有缓慢、稳定的</><text s=\"colorpurple\">簇闪</><text>。很快你意识到它们的来源都是某种石质的...</><text s=\"colorred\">心脏</><text>？</>"

#. Key:	4E37343A46122DBB508DF5A5F6182FFB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>Returning to the main floor, you press on.  One more {wavingpink}challenge{text} and you are off to the </>{tournament}<text>.</>"
msgstr "<text>回到主楼层后，你继续前行。本区域还剩一项{wavingpink}挑战{text} ，结束后即可前往</>{tournament}<text>。</>"

#. Key:	51D33FF84F09E1A154675A9B6CDC23D7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>The {rainbow}prismatic ooze{text} begins to {shakinggreen}shake{text}, shifting into a vaguely humanoid form.  Arms, legs...{smalltext}something {smallblue}possibly{smalltext} head-shaped. {text} It holds out an {purple}appendage{text} to you.</>"
msgstr "<text>{rainbow}彩黏液{text}开始{shakinggreen}晃动{text}，逐渐变成模糊的人形。你看到了胳膊、腿...{smalltext}还有{smallblue}疑似{smalltext}头形状的东西。{text}它对你伸出了其中一条{purple}肢体{text}。</>"

#. Key:	7B565EAC453F090FBD3151839FEB2A13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>You decide it best to put the hammer back where you found it and continue on your way.</>"
msgstr "<text>你决定最好将锤子放回原来的地方并继续前进。</>"

#. Key:	8E19EB434A84E154927D8191AEBB1494
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>It reverts back to its original {rainbow}amorphous form{text}, rubbing up against your leg.  Looking around, you find a {blue}small jar{text} to keep your new pet in.  Now, time to be on your way.</>"
msgstr "<text>之后它恢复到了原来的{rainbow}可塑形态{text}，摩擦着你的腿。环顾四周，你发现了一个{blue}小罐子{text}，正好可以存放你的新宠物。现在，该上路了。</>"

#. Key:	ADB89BD14E3B5592E9150DB2C1895FFD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>With</> <text s=\"colororange\">haste</><text>, you slip down a </><text s=\"wavingpink\">corridor of impecable convience</> <text>and back to the main tunnel to prepare for your next</> <text s=\"colorcyan\">encounter</><text>.</>"
msgstr "<text>你{orange}毫不犹豫{text}地滑下一条预设好的</><text s=\"wavingpink\">便捷通道</><text>，回到主道，准备迎接你的下一个</><text s=\"colorcyan\">对手</><text>。</>"

#. Key:	E0A201214683F6B7D895018871F4E0AB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>The crew line up as the foreman addresses you.  {speech}\"Boys do good work, eh?  Feels good workin' again.  What next, boss?\"</>"
msgstr "<text>工髅们排队站好，工头向你发表讲话。{speech}“伙计们干得不错，对吧？再次工作真好。老板，接下来做什么？”</>"

#. Key:	E1F34EB5433195131108ABB1BD6F18C6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>Up ahead, the walls narrow, the ground covered in</> <text s=\"colorbrown\">sharp, stony spikes</><text>.  A</> <text s=\"colorblue\">strange blue glow</> <text>seems to hum in the room beyond, daring you to investigate.</>"
msgstr "<text>前方，墙壁间的空间变窄，地面覆盖着</><text s=\"colorbrown\">石质尖刺</><text>。一个奇怪的</><text s=\"colorblue\">蓝色光芒</><text>似乎在远处的空间中发出嗡嗡声，诱使你去探查。</>"

#. Key:	F09EBE5F4CF859CBE927889FFBEF3D87
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>In a nearby room, calls for help barely overcome the sounds of</> <text s=\"colororange\">whirring</> <text>and</> <text s=\"colororange\">grinding</><text>.</>"
msgstr "<text>在一旁的房间里，呼救声几乎被</><text s=\"colororange\">呼呼声</><text>和</><text s=\"colororange\">吱呀声</><text>完全盖过去了。</>"

#. Key:	FF8DD55646562B170526FCA90185D4BE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon Ends [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/Events/EventPanel.EventPanel_C:Text Replacement Dungeon
#: Ends [Script Bytecode]
msgid "<text>The doors slide open and you step inside.  The lift {pink}automatically{text} begins descending, playing {wavingcyan}smooth jazz{text} for your jouney.  As the elevator slows to a stop, you hear the sound of {shakinggreen}gurgling{text} on the other side.</>"
msgstr "<text>梯门打开，你走了进去。它{pink}自动{text}开始下降，同时播放着{wavingcyan}丝滑的爵士乐{text}。当电梯慢慢停下来时，你听到门外传来{shakinggreen}咕噜咕噜{text}的声音。</>"

#. Key:	2AFB42C64CF8ADC3E4C06791103780C3
