#. Key:	A0082B90441D65E3A4939D91160964C5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.111.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.111.Text
msgid "<text>This is a </><text s=\"Bold\">Unit</><text>. Both you and your opponents will make up an </><text s=\"Bold\">Army</><text> comprised of many Units.</>"
msgstr "<text>这是一名</><text s=\"Bold\">单位</><text>。你与你的对手都将使用一些单位来组建一个</><text s=\"Bold\">队伍</><text>。</>"

#. Key:	8CB009C04C045BA25C3CFD91CC2508C2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.112.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.112.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">Health</><text> - Reduced when the Unit takes damage.  When this bar reaches 0, the Unit is out of the fight for this combat (and will return at full health when the combat is finished).</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">生命值</><text>：单位受到伤害时生命值会减少，归零时，单位就会阵亡。(战斗结束后复活)</>"

#. Key:	6BA32CA44121C54B0CA51D9F28400114
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.113.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.113.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">Mana</><text> - Increases every second.  When the bar is full, the Unit will activate their special skill. Some Units gain mana faster than others, and some will start combat with part of the Mana bar already filled.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">法力值</><text>：每秒自动增长。当蓝条回满时，单位就会施放技能。有些单位的法力恢复速度更快，还有一些单位拥有初始法力值。</>"

#. Key:	C4D9336946EF9D7F3A70CCB62AEBF808
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.121.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.121.Text
msgid "<text>This is the Unit Store, where you buy new Units using </><img id=\"starpoint\"/><text s=\"Bold\">Star Points</><text>. Your available SP are shown at the bottom of the Store.</>"
msgstr "<text>这是单位商店，可以使用</><img id=\"starpoint\"/><text s=\"Bold\">星点</><text>购买新单位。左上角及单位商店底部显示有当前拥有的星点数。</>"

#. Key:	944F225D498CE278DC918EADFDBCD17D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.122.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.122.Text
msgid ""
"<text s=\"Bold\">Archetype</><text> - Shows whether this unit is a:</>\r\n"
"<img id=\"vanguard\"/><text>Tank (good at taking damage)</>\r\n"
"<img id=\"magician\"/><text>Caster (good at casting spells), or </>\r\n"
"<img id=\"skirmisher\"/><text>Fighter (good at attacking).</>"
msgstr ""
"<text s=\"Bold\">单位类型</><text>：表示该单位属于</>\n"
"<img id=\"vanguard\"/><text>肉盾(擅长承受伤害)</>\n"
"<img id=\"magician\"/><text>法师(擅长施放技能)</>\n"
"<img id=\"skirmisher\"/><text>战士(擅长普通攻击)</>"

#. Key:	E972C50F481482B9F4CB9384B6618539
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.123.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.123.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">SP Cost</><text> - Displays how many Star Points this Unit costs to buy.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">单位价格</><text>：购买单位所需的星点数。</>"

#. Key:	B76851124E19128E2A01B5A3F6FC55E0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.124.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.124.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">Traits</><text> - Displays which Traits this Unit belongs to. You'll learn more about Traits later.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">阵营</><text>：单位所属的阵营。稍后会有更详细的解释。</>"

#. Key:	885F6FC64ED8779A8B69AB98BF07D617
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.125.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.125.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">Skill</><text> - Describes the Skill this Unit casts when they fill their mana bar.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">技能简介</><text>：简要描述单位法力值回满时会施放什么技能。</>"

#. Key:	750A55B3405FC90611B858A2B938B184
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.131.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.131.Text
msgid "<text>It's time to start learning how to form your army, and how to make it better.  First, we need to place a unit onto the field to combat the enemy's Unit.</>"
msgstr "<text>现在来学学如何组建并升级队伍。首先，我们需要在战场上放置一名单位来进行战斗。</>"

#. Key:	EA94905A4E26D485A5173B80567F2CE8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.132.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.132.Text
msgid "<text>Click on the Mikki card to purchase that Unit, which will teleport it onto your </><text s=\"Bold\">Bench</><text>, where it will remain until you place it onto the field.</>"
msgstr "<text>点击购买刺麟龙，购买后它会出现在</><text s=\"Bold\">备战区</><text>，之后可以选择将其上阵。</>"

#. Key:	4BA5CE864F4B2CCE4C46889149BAE20A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.133.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.133.Text
msgid "<text>Then, click and hold on the Mikki unit, and drag it into one of the empty hexes on your field.  Then release to drop Mikki onto that space.</>"
msgstr "<text>将刺鳞龙拖动至友方战场的任意处。</>"

#. Key:	8A2ACF0047F76233976176B257A2E2DA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.134.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.134.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">Tutorial Objectives</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">教学指引</>"

#. Key:	7985DAC74470E98FC91B2282838FF596
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.13TutorialStep1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.13TutorialStep1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Purchase a Mikki from the Unit Store.</>"
msgstr "<text>从单位商店购买一名刺鳞龙。</>"

#. Key:	4897FDA9421078FD05416A880A84A079
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.13TutorialStep2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.13TutorialStep2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Place Mikki into the field.</>"
msgstr "<text>上阵刺鳞龙。</>"

#. Key:	54E11BBC4078651CDEA55BB4D835AA3E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.141.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.141.Text
msgid "<text>Now, the battle can begin! The Fight button at the top of the screen will start the combat when clicked.</>"
msgstr "<text>现在可以开始战斗了！点击屏幕上方的按钮即可开始战斗。</>"

#. Key:	D494E2814FA202CD29B5548599D3DE0B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.142.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.142.Text
msgid "<text>All Units on the board will come alive and automatically fight each other, until only one team is left standing.</>"
msgstr "<text>战场上所有单位会自动战斗，直至一方取得胜利。</>"

#. Key:	F34ED2454B41EDE68AA25D8C22157C2C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.14Tutorial1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.14Tutorial1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Press the Fight Button!</>"
msgstr "<text>按下战斗按钮！</>"

#. Key:	FC08DA89491759FE4F2E3698AE643985
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.151.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.151.Text
msgid "<text>The sweet taste of victory! After every combat, you'll earn some important rewards:</>"
msgstr "<text>可不能让你白赢一场！每次战斗结束后，都会获得一些奖励：</>"

#. Key:	DA79AC3746BA9718EA40A58ADEFE812A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.152.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.152.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">XP</><text> - Allows you to select a new passive power to enhance your power, once you have collected enough to Level Up.  You can track how much more XP you need to gain another level in the bar at the top of the screen.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">经验值</><text>：经验值满后会升级，能选择一项特殊效果。可在屏幕左上方查看升级进度。</>"

#. Key:	4FD2B05045D6F35703E4B5B88974E537
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.153.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.153.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">Gold</><text> - Used for purchasing new Equipment and other goodies in Merchant Rooms. You'll learn more about Equipment later.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">金币</><text>：用于在物品商店购买装备等物件。装备系统稍后会进行解释。</>"

#. Key:	83DB93B549E623A7FA650688C12381B3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.154.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.154.Text
msgid "<text s=\"Bold\">Star Points</><text> - Used for purchasing Units and rerolling the Unit Store.</>"
msgstr "<text s=\"Bold\">星点</><text>：使用星点可以购买单位及刷新商店。</>"

#. Key:	45AD3D364068C70F7B989CA203FDD802
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.211.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.211.Text
msgid "<text>The enemy has two Units now! You'll need to match them first, and to do so, you will need to Refresh the Unit Store.</>"
msgstr "<text>敌人上阵了两名单位！你也得扩充一下队伍了，先刷新下单位商店吧！</>"

#. Key:	6E76FCC8416DA5FB9967D3A25AC3E186
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.212.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.212.Text
msgid ""
"<text>Click this button to Refresh the Unit Store with a new set of five random Units.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>The first Refresh after every combat is free, and each one after the first will cost you two Star Points.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>点击左下角的这个按钮刷新单位商店。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>每场战斗后的首次刷新免费，之后每次消耗 2 星点。</>"

#. Key:	E8CC32F242F45750DA6D3D9F4B51DCE6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.213.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.213.Text
msgid "<text>After Refreshing, choose a new Unit to purchase and place to add to your Army.</>"
msgstr "<text>刷新单位商店后，购买一名新单位将其上阵。</>"

#. Key:	DD7450DD412643339E239CAF1A85B067
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.21Tutorial1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.21Tutorial1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Refresh the Unit Store.</>"
msgstr "<text>刷新商店。</>"

#. Key:	FD8568B4406CA4E639941FA3E48260DE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.21Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.21Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Purchase any available Unit.</>"
msgstr "<text>购买一名新单位。</>"

#. Key:	B17891BC40D5BB3D4CB29B9A05BE0693
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.21Tutorial2_1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.21Tutorial2_1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Place a 2nd Unit onto the field.</>"
msgstr "<text>上阵新单位。</>"

#. Key:	31342CEC4243E4ADE9370681A2B1A55D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.221.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.221.Text
msgid "<text>While your army is now similar in strength to the enemy's, you can amplify your power further by </><text s=\"Bold\">Merging</><text>, which increases a Unit's </><text s=\"Bold\">Tier</><text>. Higher Tier Units have increased stats and are a key component to having a successful army.</>"
msgstr "<text>虽然你的队伍现在已经和敌人不相上下，你仍然可以通过</><text s=\"Bold\">合并单位</><text>继续提升力量。合并会提高</><text s=\"Bold\">单位的星级</><text>，更高星级的单位属性更强。</>"

#. Key:	5780AF9741B4BA9EEE66B1B12975C400
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.222.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.222.Text
msgid "<text>Merging occurs whenever you have three Tier 1 copies of a Unit, and can increase a Unit to a maximum of Tier 4.</>"
msgstr "<text>三名相同的 1 星单位可以合并一名 2 星单位，最高通过合并升至 4 星。</>"

#. Key:	3A2EEA5F44954FB5FB41B884F88F6BBD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.224.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.224.Text
msgid "<text>Units in the Store that have a glowing card border are duplicates of ones you already have in play, which are recommended purchases in most cases - increasing Tier power is never a bad idea.</>"
msgstr "<text>单位商店里边框发光的单位是你已经拥有的单位，推荐优先购买，因为成功合并后的单位一般都会更强。</>"

#. Key:	EBFEE7C64F079B4CF1DE279002C2723A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.22Tutorial1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.22Tutorial1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Purchase two more Mikkis to trigger a Merge.</>"
msgstr "<text>再购买两名刺鳞龙，合并为一名 2 星刺鳞龙。</>"

#. Key:	6BDBCE9F4C68D8AE8663A78BD21DD65C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.231.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.231.Text
msgid "<text>You are now much stronger than your foe due to the presence of a Tier 2 Unit. This fight will be no challenge for your Army now, so press the Fight button when you are ready to begin. But, before you do...</>"
msgstr "<text>合并了一名 2 星单位后，你的队伍变得更强了。这场战斗现在已经毫无悬念，准备好后就可以点击战斗按钮开始战斗了。但在此之前...</>"

#. Key:	8077E6CA486681880741579E5C2CEBEB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.232.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.232.Text
msgid ""
"<text>... this is called the Battle Bar, which you may have seen last fight.  Here, you can track the total remaining Health of each team, and may use the the speed control buttons to speed up, pause, or slow down the pace of combat.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>Try out changing the speed of combat during this next battle!</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>此处为战斗栏，可以查看双方队伍现存单位的总生命值，还能暂停或更改战斗速度。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>试试在本场战斗改变一下速度吧。</>"

#. Key:	9B7B0A0C42D13789BE28B89349FAE35E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.23Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.23Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>(Optional) After the fight begins, change combat speed.</>"
msgstr "<text>(可选)战斗开始后更改战斗速度。</>"

#. Key:	5C849DBE44BC046FD731938EA9873CC9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.311.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.311.Text
msgid ""
"<text>Three enemy Units this time! Your army will once again need to match them first by placing a third unit.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text>However, rather than choosing a random Unit, it's time to learn about Traits. On the left of the screen, you will find a list of Traits in your current army, but none are active yet. Hovering over the Dragon Trait on the left will show it requires 2 Dragons to become active.  Let's activate the Dragon Trait by purchasing and placing Rime.</>"
msgstr ""
"<text>这次敌方上阵了三名单位，你也需要三名来与之匹敌。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text>但是这次最好不要那麽随意，现在是了解阵营羁绊的好时机。你可以在屏幕左侧查看当前队伍可激活的阵营，目前暂未有任何阵营效果激活。鼠标悬停在【龙族】的阵营图标，会显示需要两名不同的龙单位才能激活该阵营效果。请购买一名冻霜龙来激活这个效果。</>"

#. Key:	12D0002F4E334C445B6A02A645274C62
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.312.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.312.Text
msgid "<text>The green up arrow over the Dragon icon indicates this Trait matches one of the Traits of the Units in your current Army.</>"
msgstr "<text>龙图标上方的绿色箭头表示该单位与队伍内已有的某些单位共阵营。</>"

#. Key:	56F0762947002B0635E92496F80D5D0F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.31Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.31Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Purchase Rime.</>"
msgstr "<text>购买冻霜龙。</>"

#. Key:	D9CDBFA94CEBF9115BEAE18167576557
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.31Tutorial3.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.31Tutorial3.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Place Rime.</>"
msgstr "<text>上阵冻霜龙。</>"

#. Key:	EB5CAE7C4DE9274227E6C9991DC1DA45
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.31Tutorial4.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.31Tutorial4.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Right-click the Dragon trait on the left of the screen.</>"
msgstr "<text>右键点击屏幕左侧的龙族图标。</>"

#. Key:	1FE00A21445A17963A81AD89AEE4407C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.321.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.321.Text
msgid "<text>Excellent, the Dragon Trait is now active. But, your Army isn't quite fully optimized - the Unit you added last round doesn't match either of Rime or Mikki's traits, but a Unit in the shop does. You can make your Army stronger by selling that Unit and replacing it with one that matches Rime and Mikki's traits better.</>"
msgstr "<text>不错，现在【龙族】阵营效果已经被激活，但其实队伍还有调整空间。上轮上阵的另一名单位与冻霜龙、刺鳞龙的阵营不匹配，将它换掉有可能使你的队伍更强。正好单位商店里有一名合适的单位，试试换成它吧。</>"

#. Key:	2F9E2A6945E89B9D7771199BC142CF51
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.322.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.322.Text
msgid "<text>Drag the non-Dragon into the Sell Portal, located to the right of your Bench. You will be fully refunded for the Star Points spent on that Unit.</>"
msgstr "<text>将不属于【龙族】阵营的那名单位拖至备战区最右侧以出售。出售单位时星点将全数归还。</>"

#. Key:	785AB7A74B1A714EE9DF169F7C094C32
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.32Tutorial1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.32Tutorial1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Sell a non-Dragon Unit.</>"
msgstr "<text>出售一个非【龙族】单位。</>"

#. Key:	91EE6BD645373C606771CC9A9DC97D0C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.32Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.32Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Purchase Button.</>"
msgstr "<text>购买孢云菇。</>"

#. Key:	BFBE801D4A5CE9C0086E6FBDEEBF1111
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.32Tutorial3.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.32Tutorial3.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Place Button.</>"
msgstr "<text>上阵孢云菇。</>"

#. Key:	26A68133461ADCF7433401BAEB77810B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.32Tutorial4.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.32Tutorial4.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Right-click the Shaman trait on the left of the screen.</>"
msgstr "<text>右键点击屏幕左侧的萨满图标。</>"

#. Key:	93CA69084CD4BE9012296CA6AE434973
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.331.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.331.Text
msgid "<text>Armies that utilize Trait power will be superior to those that do not, so this next fight will be an easy win for your Dragon Shamans. Rime in particular will be extra potent, benefitting from both the Dragon bonus and the Shaman bonus.</>"
msgstr "<text>享受阵营效果加成的队伍自然更厉害，所以这场战斗肯定能轻松取胜。其中特别是你的刺鳞龙因同时受到【龙族】与【萨满】两项阵营效果加成会变得异常强大。</>"

#. Key:	47B98D094F74493F66D33D96B92F453C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.332.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.332.Text
msgid "<text> Any Keywords (shown in orange-colored text) that are ever on screen can be reviewed by pressing the Dictionary button in the bottom left. You can also use the Arrow Keys to call, dismiss, or navigate the Dictionary.</>"
msgstr "<text>屏幕上显示的任何关键词(橙色文字)都可以点击左下角的按钮详细了解，默认使用上下方向键调出</>"

#. Key:	03E4D0944ABE5488258E28ACB949E549
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.332_1.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.332_1.Text
msgid "<text>Before you start the next combat, try right-clicking on a Unit. This brings up the Stats View, which provides info about the Unit's attack range, Skill, equipped Items and stats. You can also right click Units in the Unit Store to view the same information, and watch a video of the Unit's skill in action.</>\r\n"
msgstr "<text>右键随机点击一名单位可以打开属性面板，会显示一名单位的技能、属性、装备等信息。技能名右侧的深蓝色按钮将以视频的形式预览单位的技能效果。将鼠标悬停在属性图标上，会显示该属性的详细说明。</>"

#. Key:	093BD38647BCCB357A5593859D56699A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.33Tutorial1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.33Tutorial1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>(Optional) Right-click a Unit to bring up the Stats View.</>"
msgstr "<text>(可选)右键点击单位打开属性面板。</>"

#. Key:	0EC324FC4B1EC8350CA61796A1C92AFF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.33Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.33Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>(Optional) Press Up to view the Keyword Dictionary.</>"
msgstr "<text>(可选)按上键打开关键词详解</>"

#. Key:	0CF6BDE84ECE319E5DC6FFB4F802DCEA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.411.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.411.Text
msgid "<text>This will be the final combat room of the tutorial, this time against four units, all of whom share Traits to some degree.  They form up a very respectable force, like the ones you will be facing in a real run. </>"
msgstr "<text>最后一轮教程。在正式游戏中，敌人会至少使用四名在一定程度上共阵营的单位们来激活阵营效果。这样的队伍会是不小的挑战。</>"

#. Key:	C273AC0F413457FD20EFF8AFC5CD71FE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.412.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.412.Text
msgid "<text>First, you should keep up with the enemy's Army growth and find a 4th Unit to place.  Refresh the store, and then choose any Unit you like to add to your Army. When deciding which Unit to use, consider both:</>"
msgstr "<text>你应该像对手一样上阵四名单位。刷新单位商店，购买一名合意的单位吧。在决定哪名单位时，请仔细考虑：</>"

#. Key:	B5F5159D4C0CE51EA7D93C9C8AA5D3D8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.414.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.414.Text
msgid "<text>1) Does this Unit go with the Traits of your current Units? Will it get you closer to activating another Trait bonus?</>"
msgstr "<text>一、这名单位与当前的队伍的阵营匹配吗？能使你向激活另一项阵营效果更进一步吗？</>"

#. Key:	CFB04FCE4C02F8540CDEA386E8F15F24
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.415.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.415.Text
msgid "<text>2) Does this Unit fill a gap in the Archetypes of your Army? A good Army has a mix of Tanks, Casters, and Fighters if possible.</>"
msgstr "<text>二、这名单位可以弥补阵容构成的不足吗？一个可靠的队伍往往需要有肉盾，法师与战士单位。</>"

#. Key:	B48461D641AC731BBA150791C757D71B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.41Tutorial1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.41Tutorial1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Refresh the Store.</>"
msgstr "<text>刷新商店。</>"

#. Key:	2FBF5E9D44B466B14E7C3EB35F528110
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.41Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.41Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Purchase any Unit.</>"
msgstr "<text>购买任意单位。</>"

#. Key:	8A1D17AD40BDDDBF7DE69097B5DA4914
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.41Tutorial3.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.41Tutorial3.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Place the new Unit onto the field.</>"
msgstr "<text>上阵新单位。</>"

#. Key:	209331054810912CACA795B8A52B9037
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.421.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.421.Text
msgid "<text>Just like how Traits can amplify your power to give you the edge, carefully placed </><text s=\"Bold\">Equipment</><text> on your Units can amplify your Army's effectiveness. The right items on the right Unit can cause it to </><text s=\"Bold\">carry</><text> your team to victory.</>"
msgstr "<text>正如阵营效果可以向队伍提供优势一般，合理配置</><text s=\"Bold\">装备</><text>亦可提高队伍整体的效率。将对的装备佩戴在对的单位上可以</><text s=\"Bold\">带领</><text>队伍走向胜利。</>"

#. Key:	8EBA06EB4DABBDBE25CC3E96AEC68609
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.422.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.422.Text
msgid "<text>Equipment is held in your Inventory Bag, to the left of your Bench. I'll give you a Buckler to start with.  Click the Inventory Bag to open it, then drag the Buckler from your Inventory onto Mikki to equip it.</>"
msgstr "<text>装备存放在备战区左侧的背包内，里面已经有一件圆盾。可以点击打开背包，将圆盾拖拽至刺鳞龙身上来佩戴它。</>"

#. Key:	0235FC56474F3DE993F7008B2481357C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.42Tutorial1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.42Tutorial1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Open your Inventory Bag.</>"
msgstr "<text>打开背包。</>"

#. Key:	43BBB3ED4810371E0551CEADFB6D82E7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.42Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.42Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Equip Buckler to Mikki.</>"
msgstr "<text>将圆盾佩戴给刺鳞龙。</>"

#. Key:	765A58554CBC13A4BA060DB89EA775B8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.431.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.431.Text
msgid "<text>Most Items you acquire during a run can be </><text s=\"Bold\">Combined</><text> with another item to create a more powerful one!  I'll give you a Staff to combine with your existing Buckler to create a Burndanna, an excellent item particularly for Tank units, allowing the Unit to damage nearby enemies.</>"
msgstr "<text>一局中获得的组件装备能与另一件组件装备</><text s=\"Bold\">合成</><text>为更强力的成品装备。例如背包内新获得的法杖就能与圆盾合成为燃烧头巾，一件非常适合肉盾的装备，可以对相邻的敌方单位造成持续伤害。</>"

#. Key:	B6826ACE4705820F42AF42A0D0610F51
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.432.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.432.Text
msgid "<text>You can right-click any Component Item to open the Merge Book, showing the results of what happens when any item is combined with any other (including itself!).</>"
msgstr "<text>可以右键点击任何组件装备来打开合成表，查看该组件的合成方案。</>"

#. Key:	D9C180A94636B8B49CF869A26F84CF0F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.433.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.433.Text
msgid "<text>You can also open this Merge Book at any time by pressing the Merge Book button in the top bar.</>"
msgstr "<text>合成表也能在任何时候从右上角打开。</>"

#. Key:	C9FE279E452273373AA51EA5BDC1CBB4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.43Tutorial1.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.43Tutorial1.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Open the Merge Book. (Button in Top Right of Screen)</>"
msgstr "<text>点击右上角的合成表。</>"

#. Key:	D838100148F2BDE9EC80218ADE6F9152
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.43Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.43Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Equip the Staff to the Unit who has the Buckler.</>"
msgstr "<text>将法杖佩戴给拥有圆盾的单位。</>"

#. Key:	FBC566F44EEFD1508BF954BA6DB9DD30
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.441.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.441.Text
msgid "<text>Equipment is often best served on specific Units, based on their Archetype.  Certain Archetypes can often make slightly better use of some stats than others.</>"
msgstr "<text>每件装备都有最适合它的佩戴者，这些单位可以最大程度地发挥装备的威力。</>"

#. Key:	D29F0D9C45F35580E73B63A353565B4E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.4410.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.4410.Text
msgid "<text>Spell Power</>"
msgstr "<text>法术强度</>"

#. Key:	1228E182404ADBE0BD4C63922B7DC747
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.4411.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.4411.Text
msgid "<text>Health</>"
msgstr "<text>生命值</>"

#. Key:	1E100DF1442127E30B60F3BAE625B1CF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.442.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.442.Text
msgid "<text>Best for Tanks - allows them to take more damage before being slain.</>"
msgstr "<text>最适合给肉盾，可以帮队友承受更多伤害。</>"

#. Key:	5E87980846AFA05E75152EB62785D6A9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.443.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.443.Text
msgid "<text>Best for Casters - allows them to use Skills more often and amplifies those Skills.</>"
msgstr "<text>最适合给法师，可以强化技能并且提高施放频率。</>"

#. Key:	710FB9AD49F08742BD2B7EB8C74D51C3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.444.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.444.Text
msgid "<text>Best for Fighters - allows them to hit harder and attack more frequently.</>"
msgstr "<text>最适合给战士，可以提高其攻击力与攻击速度。</>"

#. Key:	453511FE47A040417199AB830BFD90E2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.446.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.446.Text
msgid "<text>Armor</>"
msgstr "<text>护甲</>"

#. Key:	62B6D88741C05FE2872BB0960748CA2C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.447.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.447.Text
msgid "<text>Mana Regen</>"
msgstr "<text>法力恢复</>"

#. Key:	22965AF6436B5B314EA494A01CC50CC4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.448.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.448.Text
msgid "<text>Attack Damage</>"
msgstr "<text>攻击力</>"

#. Key:	D0D2A14748F3BBC53559A4B74910C0AC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.449.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.449.Text
msgid "<text>Attack Speed</>"
msgstr "<text>攻击速度</>"

#. Key:	AE0E1CB548E0F96E1472538665A24773
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.451.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.451.Text
msgid "<text>This concludes the basics of what you need to know to get started in Tales & Tactics, though much more awaits you in a real run. Press the Fight button one last time when you are ready, but first, a tip - make use of the Recap Screen.</>"
msgstr "<text>以上就是本游戏的基本操作与玩法了，更多丰富精彩的内容等待着你在正式对局中体验。准备好了的话，就开始教程的最后一次战斗吧，记得好好利用右上角的战斗统计功能哦。</>"

#. Key:	F93FBC744941DD5F8AC3C7B398622ECC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.454.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.454.Text
msgid "<text>The Recap Screen displays to you a final tally of how each Unit performed. You can review the damage output, healing, and mitigation of every Unit, for both you and your opponent. Each category can be toggled on and off at will, and each bar's sections can be hovered over for a further breakdown on what was contributing to that bar.</>"
msgstr "<text>战斗统计界面展示每名单位在战斗中的总体表现。你可以在其中查看敌我双方所有单位的造成或承担的伤害、提供的治疗等数据。将鼠标悬停至数据条可显示其详细构成。</>"

#. Key:	760ADC75419A24612A5B4082670C4BDD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.45Tutorial2.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.45Tutorial2.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>Click the Combat Recap (Button in Top Right of Screen)</>"
msgstr "<text>点击右上角的战斗统计按钮。</>"

#. Key:	AB545B1045BCD43AE3E380BC5D6CD3E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.511_1.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.511_1.Text
msgid "<text>Congratulations! You are now ready to start a full run. Before you go, here are a few extra tips and advice:</>"
msgstr "<text>恭喜，你已经可以正式开始游戏了！在开始游戏前，还有一些小提示：</>"

#. Key:	4E20DB0F41EF767DBB48F78165C9229F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.512_1.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.512_1.Text
msgid "<text>Star Points carry over from fight to fight, and while there isn't any economic advantage to storing them, one strategy may be to save a little just before a Shop room, where you unlock the next rarity of Units.</>"
msgstr "<text>囤积星点一般没什么好处，尽量及时用来购买单位提升队伍的战斗力，但攒一波星点在解锁更高稀有度的单位时集中购买也是不错的策略。</>"

#. Key:	054F10A645FF1AAFBE3999A808EEA070
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.513_1.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.513_1.Text
msgid "<text>During a run, you may become Cursed, which randomly makes Units cost 1 Life to purchase. Fear not though! As long as you win a fight, you heal 1 Life, so it can be harmless to spend a life on a Cursed Unit if you are strong enough to immediately heal it back next fight.</>"
msgstr "<text>游戏中你可能会被诅咒，被诅咒时某些单位需要消耗一颗心才能购买。但是别太担心，因为胜利时会恢复一颗心，只要一直保持队伍的战斗力，红心一样是可以极限利用的资源。</>"

#. Key:	D58F35044DBF2D3C71C3B79EA40B5D94
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.514_1.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.514_1.Text
msgid "<text>At the end of any run, win or lose, you'll earn Mastery to unlock more features for future runs! New characters, areas, modifiers, and more await.</>"
msgstr "<text>无论游戏最终是否胜利，你都可以获得熟练度，使用熟练度可以解锁更多功能，比如新角色、区域、游戏功能等等。</>"

#. Key:	522F2A7A46FD0C2D63C60798C35BF6E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.515_1.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray.TutorialTray_C:WidgetTree.515_1.Text
msgid "<text>Losses in a normal combat room cause 2 Lives to be lost. Boss rooms deal double damage!</>"
msgstr "<text>在普通战斗中失败会损失 2 颗心，在领袖战斗失败则会损失 4 颗心！</>"

#. Key:	E3F1BD344619AEC912D95B98A9109C4B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray_QuestLine.Default__TutorialTray_QuestLine_C.In Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray_QuestLine.Default__TutorialTray_QuestLine_C.In
#: Text
msgid "<text>This is a sample quest</>"
msgstr "<text>这是一个教程任务</>"

#. Key:	158144EB43442C4685EA83B3FB44A1B6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray_QuestLine.TutorialTray_QuestLine_C:WidgetTree.Text.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/TutorialTray_QuestLine.TutorialTray_QuestLine_C:WidgetTree.Text.Text
msgid "<text>It's time to start learning how to form your army, and how to make it better.  First, we need to place a unit onto the field to combat the enemy's.</>"
msgstr "<text>现在来学学如何组建并升级队伍。首先，我们需要在战场上放置一名单位来进行战斗。</>"

