#. Key:	791E1B904DEEA2DD5B4C1A8181E18DD5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksPanel.UnlocksPanel_C:WidgetTree.ThanksForPlayingTextBox.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksPanel.UnlocksPanel_C:WidgetTree.ThanksForPlayingTextBox.Text
msgid ""
"<text style=\"Default32\">Thank you for playing the Tales & Tactics Demo! The full game includes the final 3rd Act - the Grand Tournament - along with the Unlocks system, where you can add new features, content, characters, items, cosmetics, difficulty, and endless replayability.</>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<text style=\"Default32\">Join us on Discord for updates, bug tracking, view our Roadmap, and to chat with other players about the game!</>"
msgstr ""
"<text style=\"Default32\">感谢游玩《传说战争自走棋》的试玩版！完整版将包含最终的第三幕(大赛)以及解锁系统，您可以在此解锁新功能、内容、角色、物品、装饰品、难度来获取反复游玩的乐趣。</>\n"
"\n"
"<text style=\"Default32\">加入官方QQ群，和其他玩家一起交流分享吧！</>"

#. Key:	F385030249537E3692ACACB39A725F19
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksPanel.UnlocksPanel_C:WidgetTree.UnlockAllWarningText.Text
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksPanel.UnlocksPanel_C:WidgetTree.UnlockAllWarningText.Text
msgid ""
"This will unlock all available features, bypassing the Mastery system entirely for game mechanics. You can still earn and spend Mastery for cosmetic Unlocks, such as Hats.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"This can be overwhelming with the number of new features and systems added to the game! It will also jump up the Recommended difficulty accordingly, instead of pacing it up slowly. Only activate this if you are certain the recommended unlock speed (where you add a couple of new things at a time and increase difficulty a little) is not right for you.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Press the Unlock All button again to confirm."
msgstr ""
"该操作将解锁所有游戏功能，完全跳过解锁阶段。解锁后仍然可以获得并消耗熟练度来解锁帽子。\n"
"\n"
"一次性解锁这么一大批新功能可能会令新玩家眼花缭乱！游戏难度将被直接设为可选推荐难度，而不是正常地循序渐进地提升。因此本操作仅推荐给认为游戏解锁速度过慢的玩家。\n"
"\n"
"再次按下按钮以确认进行该操作。"

#. Key:	59EAF3BA41CE6D18B8239DB76B533629
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksV3/Unlockv3Layout.Unlockv3Layout_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Unlockv3Layout [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksV3/Unlockv3Layout.Unlockv3Layout_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Unlockv3Layout
#: [Script Bytecode]
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to load this backup save? This is irreversible and is only recommended if something has corrupted or otherwise damaged your main save file.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"The game will exit as a result of this process. Relaunching will reload the backup save file."
msgstr ""
"确定加载该备份存档吗？本操作不可逆，仅建议在主存档损坏时使用。\n"
"\n"
"游戏将退出以执行此过程，重启后将该加载备份存档。"

#. Key:	625036EC47C369FF8F01FEABA253D439
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksV3/Unlockv3Layout.Unlockv3Layout_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Unlockv3Layout [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksV3/Unlockv3Layout.Unlockv3Layout_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Unlockv3Layout
#: [Script Bytecode]
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset all Unlocks and set your Mastery to 0? (This effectively resets your Save File.)\r\n"
"WARNING: This cannot be reversed, you will have to earn Mastery as if playing the game for the first time."
msgstr ""
"确定要将所有解锁项目重置，同时将熟练度清零？(这将重置你的存档)\n"
"警告！此操作无法逆转，你必须重新获得熟练度，就像第一次玩一样。"

