#. Key:	D3228D234AF2CA46894D23BB5F79CFCA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksV3/Unlockv3Layout.Unlockv3Layout_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Unlockv3Layout [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/ToyBattler/UI/UnlocksV3/Unlockv3Layout.Unlockv3Layout_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Unlockv3Layout
#: [Script Bytecode]
msgid ""
"WARNING: The unlock system is meant to ease players into new systems and features and mechanics. Skipping it may overwhelm you with too many new things at once. This will also unlock all Difficulty levels, which also are structured to introduce a few mechanics at a time and can be overwhelming when skipped.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"This is recommended only for players who have lost their save file, or have seen a lot of the game, or are extremely familiar with the Autobattler genre.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Are you sure you want to Unlock everything? This includes unlocked Challenge Climb levels."
msgstr ""
"提示：解锁系统旨在帮助玩家逐步了解新系统、功能和机制。跳过它可能会让你一次性面对太多新内容。本操作同时会解锁所有天梯难度，其中部分难度项通过递进式设计，引导玩家逐步掌握机制，一次性将其跳过可能导致新开一局游戏让你感到无从下手。\n"
"\n"
"因此本操作仅推荐给那些丢失了存档文件、已经大致了解本游戏内容，或对自走棋游戏已经非常熟悉的玩家。\n"
"\n"
"确定要解锁所有内容吗？"

